            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can pin a bubble to your screen for easy access to a chat anytime, even when you’re using another app.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can pin a bubble to your screen for easy access to a chat anytime, even when you’re using another app.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏱᏯᎸᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ YᎠᎵᏆᎷᎲᏍᎬ ᎾᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᎯᏓ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏗ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏊ ᎢᏴ , ᎥᏍᏊ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯᏃ ᎲᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᏄᏓᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
