                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏏᏓᏁᎸᎯ  ᏚᏂᏢᏔᏅᏒᎢ ᏗᏣᎵᏍᎪᏛᏓᏁᎯ ᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ ᏱᏕᎭᏠᎯᏍᏓ ᏤᏥ ᎠᏲᏟ\’s ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When parents put the latest technologies in the children\’s hands, they want to make sure they\’re developing healthy digital habits.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When parents put the latest technologies in the children\’s hands, they want to make sure they\’re developing healthy digital habits.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏧᎾᏓᎦᏴᎵᎨᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏱᏚᏂᏠᎾ ᎩᎳ ᏣᎾᏄᎪᏨᎯ ᎢᏤ ᏗᎦᏙᎲᏒᎩ ᏗᏂᏲᏟ\’s ᏧᏃᏰᏂ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᏚᎵᏍᎬ ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏂᎯᏊ ᎠᏙᎷᏩᏘᏍᎬ ᏙᎯᏊ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᎳᏅᏔᏅ ᎢᏳᎾᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗᎢ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Emergency callback mode">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Emergency callback mode</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
