            <termEntry id="You can also rest easy knowing that Android is providing faster security updates to send fixes as soon as they\’re available.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can also rest easy knowing that Android is providing faster security updates to send fixes as soon as they\’re available.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎠᎯᏓ ᏯᏣᏪᏐᎸᏍᏗ ᏣᏅᏘᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ Android ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎬ ᎦᏣᏄᎳ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏫᎦᏅᏗ ᏧᏍᏓ ᏱᏗᎬᏁᎸᎯ ᏄᎵᏍᏛᏉ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᏃ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
