                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏒᏂᎦ ᎠᎴ ᎯᎾᎯᏍᏓ ᏥᎩ ᎣᏪᏅᏒ ᎦᏛᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏛᏅ "ᎭᏩ Google" ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏰᏍᏙᏗᎢ ᏥᎩ Google Assistant.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If your device has an SD card or USB storage, you can't mount it on your computer when USB tethered">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If your device has an SD card or USB storage, you can't mount it on your computer when USB tethered</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ SD ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ USB ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᏝᏰᎵ ᎤᏌᎯᎸ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ USB ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
