            <termEntry id="Audio effects delivers a premium listening experience through your phone\’s loudspeaker and connected devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Audio effects delivers a premium listening experience through your phone\’s loudspeaker and connected devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ ᏂᏕᎬᏁᎰᎢ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᏣᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎶᎯᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ\’s ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Each time you connect a device, Audio effects will remember the last settings you used.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Each time you connect a device, Audio effects will remember the last settings you used.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏓᏟᏱᎵᏒᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎱᏓᎸᎥᏍᎬ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᎢ ᏛᏅᏓᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎣᏂ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏕᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Audio effects is always on when you’re listening through the loudspeaker.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Audio effects is always on when you’re listening through the loudspeaker.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎤᎵᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏕᏍᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎤᎶᎯᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
