            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Each time you connect a device, Audio effects will remember the last settings you used.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Each time you connect a device, Audio effects will remember the last settings you used.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏓᏟᏱᎵᏒᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎱᏓᎸᎥᏍᎬ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᎢ ᏛᏅᏓᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎣᏂ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏕᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
