            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Audio effects has a refreshed design and a new Meeting profile that enhances VoIP calls by filtering unexpected noise for better voice quality.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Audio effects has a refreshed design and a new Meeting profile that enhances VoIP calls by filtering unexpected noise for better voice quality.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᏓᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᎪᏢᏔᏅᎯ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎢᏤ ᏗᏠᎯᏍᏗ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎤᎧᏛ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏓᏤᏢᎩ VoIP ᏫᏗᎬᏓᏁᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎬᎫᏍᏗᏍᎨᏍᏗ ᏅᎦᏖᎾᏍᏛᎾ ᎤᏃᏴᎵᏛ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎢᎦᎣᏏ ᏓᏤᏢ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can create custom profiles for each audio device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can create custom profiles for each audio device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏲᏢᎾ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏱᏗᎬᏁᎸᎯ ᏧᎾᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎤᎧᏛ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏌᏊᎭ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Put the same finger on the fingerprint sensor and lift it after you feel a vibration.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Put the same finger on the fingerprint sensor and lift it after you feel a vibration.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏫᎲᎦ ᎤᏠᏱ ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᏩᏘᏍᎩ ᎠᏌᎳᏙᏗ ᎪᎯᏴᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏒᎾᏍᏗ ᎠᎵᏖᎸᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
