                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎦᎵᏙᏥᏙᎸᎯᏃ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ PUK ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow  to have full control of your device?">
