            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Predict and add a country code when you call while traveling abroad">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Predict and add a country code when you call while traveling abroad</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏴ ᏩᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ Ꭰ ᎠᏰᎵ ᎤᏙᏢᏒ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏁᏙᎵᏙᎲ ᎢᏍᎪᏂᏱ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="View and delete attachments shared during this call in Messages.">
