            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have incorrectly drawn your unlock pattern  times.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have incorrectly drawn your unlock pattern  times.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎤᎭ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ  ᎢᏳᏓᎵ ᎠᎵᏱᎵᏒ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="After  more unsuccessful attempts, you will be asked to unlock your phone using your Google signin.">
