            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allows the app to configure the local Bluetooth tablet, and to discover and pair with remote devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allows the app to configure the local Bluetooth tablet, and to discover and pair with remote devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎲ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎡᏍᎦᏂ Bluetooth ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᎷᏩᏛᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎢᏴᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
