            <termEntry id="Calls from these numbers will be blocked, but they may still be able to leave you voicemails.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Calls from these numbers will be blocked, but they may still be able to leave you voicemails.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᏯᏂ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᏓ, ᎠᎭᏃ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏰᎵᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏏᏉ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏅᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎧᏁᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Install Software Update and Repair tool for your device on a Mac or Windows computer">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Install Software Update and Repair tool for your device on a Mac or Windows computer</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏘᏅᏛᎦ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎪᏢᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎣᏍᏓ ᏱᎬᏅᏘ ᎬᏅᏘᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏛᏂᏓᏍᏗ Mac ᎠᎴ ᏗᏦᎸᏂ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
