            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Warning: Your device will be locked after  incorrect attempts. If locked, you must contact your carrier to unlock your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Warning: Your device will be locked after  incorrect attempts. If locked, you must contact your carrier to unlock your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏔᎲᏍᎩ: ᏍᏓᏯ ᏛᎵᏍᏚᏂ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᏅ  ᏂᏚᏳᎬᏛᎾ ᎤᏁᎸᏙᏗ. ᏍᏓ ᏯᏍᏚᎭ, ᎠᏎ ᏫᏃᏎᏗ ᏧᏛᎴᏅᎲ ᎤᏂᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᏅ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allows the app to prevent the phone from going to sleep.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allows the app to prevent the phone from going to sleep.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎲ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏲᏍᏙᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏓᏰᏏ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏟᏔᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Calling number restricted">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Calling number restricted</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎦᏅᏍᏙᏒᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The stylus button can help you take action inside an app, like pausing music or taking a picture.You can even use the stylus as an air mouse when connected to an external display.Check out these features in  settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The stylus button can help you take action inside an app, like pausing music or taking a picture.You can even use the stylus as an air mouse when connected to an external display.Check out these features in  settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏍᏕᎸᏗᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᏛᏁᎵᏓ ᎭᏫᎾᏗᏢ ᎬᏙᏗ, ᎯᏲᎯᏍᏓ ᏗᎧᏃᎩᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎩᏍᎬᎢ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ.ᏰᎵᏇ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᎤᏃᎴ ᏥᏍᏕᏥ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ.ᏥᏁᏏᎦᏩ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ  ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Face Unlock isn\u2019t supported on this device">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Face Unlock isn\u2019t supported on this device</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏛᏁᎭ ᎾᎿ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To place a call, turn on the Phone permission.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To place a call, turn on the Phone permission.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏂᏙᎸ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᏚᏙᏍᏛᎢ, ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To start recording tap the red icon on the main screen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To start recording tap the red icon on the main screen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎭᎴᎾ ᎦᏂᏴᎲᎢ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᏥᎩ ᎩᎦᎨ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To try to fix this issue, you can stop  and prevent it from running in the background.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To try to fix this issue, you can stop  and prevent it from running in the background.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>TᎣ try tᎣ fᎢx tᎯᏍ ᎢᏍᏑᎡ, ᏲᎤ cᎠn ᏍtᎣp  Ꭰnd prᎡᎥᎡnt Ꭲt frᎣm rᎤnᏂng Ꭲn tᎮ bᎠckgrᎣᎤnd.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
