            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A SIM card is required to connect to . You may not have inserted your sim card yet or it may be inserted incorrectly.Please turn Off your phone and make sure your SIM card is properly inserted, then turn your phone back on, and try connecting again">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A SIM card is required to connect to . You may not have inserted your sim card yet or it may be inserted incorrectly.Please turn Off your phone and make sure your SIM card is properly inserted, then turn your phone back on, and try connecting again</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꭰ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ . ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎥᏝ ᎤᎭ ᏫᎪᏣᎸᏅᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ sim ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎩᎳ ᏃᎴ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏫᎪᏣᎸᏅᎢ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ.ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏗᏙᎳᏤᎩ ᏫᎪᏣᎸᏅᎢ, ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᏣᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᏓᎾᎵᎪᏗᏍᎬ ᏏᏊ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
