            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="With Open security, devices will be able to use your Mobile Hotspot without entering a password.Select WPA2 security instead if you want to require a password.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>With Open security, devices will be able to use your Mobile Hotspot without entering a password.Select WPA2 security instead if you want to require a password.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᏱᎩ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ, ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏂ ᎠᎢ ᏱᎩᏓ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎤᏗᏞᎩᎫᏛᎸᎢ ᏂᏦᏪᎳᏅᎾ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ.ᎯᏑᏰᎩ WPA2 ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᏱᏣᏚᎵ ᏱᏨᏁᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
