            <termEntry id="If your device has mobile data, you can set it up to share its Internet connection with other devices through Bluetooth. 1. Pair your phone or tablet with the device that you want to have share your Internet connection.2. Set up the other device to get its network connection by Bluetooth. You may need to see the instructions that came with that device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If your device has mobile data, you can set it up to share its Internet connection with other devices through Bluetooth. 1. Pair your phone or tablet with the device that you want to have share your Internet connection.2. Set up the other device to get its network connection by Bluetooth. You may need to see the instructions that came with that device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎦᏛᎴᏍᎩ Bluetooth. 1. ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᎭ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ.2. ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏗ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎬᏗ Bluetooth. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎾᏓᏕᏲᎲᏍᎦ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᎷᏨᎩ ᎬᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Reset All">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Reset All</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᏂᎦᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Note: You can always change the greeting type later in Settings.">
