            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Mobile Hotspot shares your mobile data with other Wi-Fi capable devices.To connect to your Mobile Hotspot:1.Turn on Wi-Fi on the other devices.2.Select  in the list of available Wi-Fi networks.3.If a password is required, enter the password.To save battery, keep your phone plugged in when using Mobile Hotspot.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Mobile Hotspot shares your mobile data with other Wi-Fi capable devices.To connect to your Mobile Hotspot:1.Turn on Wi-Fi on the other devices.2.Select  in the list of available Wi-Fi networks.3.If a password is required, enter the password.To save battery, keep your phone plugged in when using Mobile Hotspot.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Mobile Hotspot ᏗᏣᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗ ᏐᎢ Wi-Fi ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᎱᏓᎸᎥᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Mobile Hotspot:1.ᎯᏍᏚᎢ Wi-Fi ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.2.ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ  ᎤᎿ ᏕᎦᏅᏛᎢ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ Wi-Fi ᏚᎾᏚᏓᎵ.3.ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ, ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏍᏆᏂᎪᏓ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ, ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎫᏓᎸᏙᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎬᏗᎭ Mobile Hotspot.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We could not use your Google email address, stored in Contacts, to create a Motorola ID. You may grant permission at any time from Settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We could not use your Google email address, stored in Contacts, to create a Motorola ID. You may grant permission at any time from Settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Google ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ, ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎾᎿ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ, ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ Ꭰ Motorola ID. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
