                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Icons from gentle notifications aren't shown in the status bar</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏱᎧᏂ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎥᏝ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᎸ ᏱᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎦᎾᎸᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
