            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Show recent and snoozed notifications">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Show recent and snoozed notifications</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᏞᎬ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏢᏔᏅ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="view notification settings">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>view notification settings</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎪᎶᏛᏗ ᎠᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can tether your Android device to your computer with a USB cable, to share your device's Internet connection with your computer. 1. USB tethering works with Windows Vista, Windows 7, and Linux, the USB drivers for tethering may be needed.2. If your device has an SD card or USB storage, you can't mount it on your computer when USB tethered">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can tether your Android device to your computer with a USB cable, to share your device's Internet connection with your computer. 1. USB tethering works with Windows Vista, Windows 7, and Linux, the USB drivers for tethering may be needed.2. If your device has an SD card or USB storage, you can't mount it on your computer when USB tethered</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Android ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏗ Ꭰ USB ᏔᎷᎩᏍᎩ ᏍᏕᏱᏛ, ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎬᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ. 1. USB ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎬᏗ Windows Vista, Windows 7, ᏃᎴ Linux, ᏥᎩ USB ᎠᏱᎴᎦ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᎡᎵᏊ ᎤᏚᎸᏛ.2. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ SD ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ USB ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎤᏌᎯᎸ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ USB ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Camera">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Camera</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="With Open security, any device can connect to your Mobile HotSpot and use your mobile data connection.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>With Open security, any device can connect to your Mobile HotSpot and use your mobile data connection.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᏱᎩ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ, ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᎾ ᏱᏕᎫᏓᎸᎦ ᏂᎯ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏳᏛᎸᎥᎦ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎤᏗᏞᎩᎫᏛᎸ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏟᏌᏍᎩ ᎫᏛᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
