                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ, ᏙᎡᎵ ᏂᎯ ᏣᏚᎵ ᎤᎧᏛ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can install certificates from a PKCS#12 file with a  or a  extension located in external storage.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can install certificates from a PKCS#12 file with a  or a  extension located in external storage.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᏘᏅᏛᎦ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ Ꭰ PKCS#12 ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ Ꭰ  ᎠᎴ Ꭰ  ᎪᏯᏅᎯᏗᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᏅ ᎾᎿ ᏙᏯᏗᏢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
