            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Ongoing communication from apps in use, navigation, phone calls, and more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Ongoing communication from apps in use, navigation, phone calls, and more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎬᏯᎢᏒ ᎠᏓᏛᎪᏔᏅ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏙᏓ, ᎠᏓᏘᏂᏙᎯ, ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏫᏗᎬᏔᏅᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Device admin settings">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Device admin settings</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tap to get the app">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tap to get the app</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You will lose your space and data on this tablet. You can\u2019t undo this action.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You will lose your space and data on this tablet. You can\u2019t undo this action.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᏓᏣᏲᎱᏎᎵ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ. ᏂᎯ ᏱᏂᎨᎲᏕᎩᎯᎠ ᎠᎵᏖᎸᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎬᏩᎦᏘ ᎠᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dreamy">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dreamy</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᎩᏒᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Liquid or debris is detected in USB port. Charging now may damage your device.Check the USB port for dust or debris and disconnect any device. If you see or feel moisture, shake it out or point a fan or dryer(cold air) at the port.Don\u2019t plug anything into the port until you\u2019re notified that it\u2019s safe to use again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Liquid or debris is detected in USB port. Charging now may damage your device.Check the USB port for dust or debris and disconnect any device. If you see or feel moisture, shake it out or point a fan or dryer(cold air) at the port.Don\u2019t plug anything into the port until you\u2019re notified that it\u2019s safe to use again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᏁᎩᏯᎫᎵ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏲ ᏩᏗᏅᏓ ᎪᎷᏩᏛᏓ ᎾᎿ USB ᎫᏓᎸᏗ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬ Ꭷ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎤᏲᏨᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅ ᏥᎩ USB ᎫᏓᎸᏗ for ᏥᏁᎩᏯᎫᎵ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏲ ᏩᏗᏅᏓ ᏃᎴ ᎱᏓᎳᎩ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏒᎾᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᎸ ᎦᏅᎵᏰᏗ, ᎲᏣᎬᎥᎦ ᎦᏅᎪᏫᏛ ᏃᎴ ᏩᏎᎯᎯ Ꭰ ᎠᏔᏃᏰ ᏃᎴ ᏗᎧᏲᏗᏍᎩᎢ(ᎤᏴᏟ ᎤᏃᎴ) ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎫᏓᎸᏗ.ᏝᏍᏗ\u2019 ᎫᏓᎸᏙᏗ ᏂᎦᎥᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎫᏓᎸᏗ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ\u2019 ᎤᏓᏃᎯᏎᎸ ᎾᏍᎩ\u2019 ᏂᎦᎾᏰᎬᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏏᏊ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="I/O error">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>I/O error</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>I/O ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tap to share contacts.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tap to share contacts.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Loading apps\u2026">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Loading apps\u2026</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏢᏍᎦ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ\u2026</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎬᏩᎦᏘ ᎠᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="At your request, Android is blocking this group of notifications from appearing on this device">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>At your request, Android is blocking this group of notifications from appearing on this device</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎥᎿᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏔᏲᎯᎭ, Android ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎤᎾᏓᏟᏌᎲ ᎤᏤᎵ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎦᎾᏄᎪᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ  </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="No video apps">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>No video apps</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꮭ ᏱᏄᏍᏓ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Emergency alert (operator)">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Emergency alert (operator)</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏃᏎᎯ (ᎠᎯᎵᏙᎯ)</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tap to sync now">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tap to sync now</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏃᏊ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The encryption operation is irreversible and if you interrupt it, you\u2019ll lose data. Encryption takes an hour or more, during which the phone will restart several times.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The encryption operation is irreversible and if you interrupt it, you\u2019ll lose data. Encryption takes an hour or more, during which the phone will restart several times.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎢᏒᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎪᎯᏓ ᏗᎨᏛᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏓᏲᏍᏓᏁᎸᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ, ᏂᎯ\u2019ll ᏣᎫᎯ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ. ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎩᏍᎪᎢ ᏑᏟᎶᏛ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ, ᎾᎯᏳ ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎠᏎ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎢᎸᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏩᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You\u0027re using  for mobile data. If you switch to ,  will no longer be used for mobile data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You\u0027re using  for mobile data. If you switch to ,  will no longer be used for mobile data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎬᏗᎭ  ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎥᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ,  ᎠᏎ ᎭᏗ ᎦᏅᎯᏓᎨ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To quickly resume playback, media player stays open in Quick Settings">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To quickly resume playback, media player stays open in Quick Settings</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᎵᏍᏓᏊ ᎠᎴᏂᏐᏗᏍᎩ ᏙᎠᏁᎶᏗᏍᎩ, ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏁᎶᎲᏍᎩ ᎡᏙᎮᏍᏗ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Games may restart after you turn on full screen">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Games may restart after you turn on full screen</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏧᎾᏁᎶᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎤᏟ ᏭᏩᏚᏛᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢᏍᎬ ᎧᎵᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎪᏕᏍᏗᎢ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" categories">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> categories</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᏗᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When Bluetooth is turned on, your device can communicate with other nearby Bluetooth devices.To improve device experience, apps and services can still scan for nearby devices at any time, even when Bluetooth is off. This can be used, for example, to improve location-based features and services. You can change this in Bluetooth scanning settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Bluetooth is turned on, your device can communicate with other nearby Bluetooth devices.To improve device experience, apps and services can still scan for nearby devices at any time, even when Bluetooth is off. This can be used, for example, to improve location-based features and services. You can change this in Bluetooth scanning settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ Bluetooth ᏄᏍᏛ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏗᏓᏛᎪᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏐᎢ ᎡᏍᎦᏂ Bluetooth ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᏦᎦᏤᎳᏍᏙᏗ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ and ᎢᏗᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏙᎢ ᏗᎦᎴᏴᏗᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏙᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎡᏍᎦᏂ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎢᏳᏃ Bluetooth ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ. ᎯᎠ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ, ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏱᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ, ᎾᎿᎢ ᏦᎦᏤᎳᏍᏙᏗ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ-ᏓᎳᏏᏔᏅᎩ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏗᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎾᎿ Bluetooth ᏗᎦᎴᏴᏗᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can map on-screen buttons to trigger buttons for better control and easier multitasking.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can map on-screen buttons to trigger buttons for better control and easier multitasking.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎡᎶᎯ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎤᎾᎢ-ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎪᏕᏍᏗᎢ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏓᏤᏢᎩ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎯᏗᎨ ᎢᎸᏍᎩ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You won\u2019t be able to use your fingerprint for authentication in apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You won\u2019t be able to use your fingerprint for authentication in apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏝᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Additional settings in the app">
