                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Call cannot be placed because there are no calling accounts which support calls of this type.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>CᎠll cᎠnᏃt bᎡ pᎳcᎡd bᎡcᎠᎤᏎ tᎮrᎡ ᎠrᎡ Ꮓ cᎠlᎵng ᎠccᎣᎤntᏍ wᎯch ᏑppᎣrt cᎠllᏍ Ꭳf tᎯᏍ typᎡ.</term></tig></langSet>
