            <termEntry id="When an app is pinned, the pinned app may open other apps and personal data may be accessible. To use app pinning: \t1.\tTurn on app pinning \t2.\tOpen Overview \t3.\tTap the app icon at the top of the screen, then tap Pin">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When an app is pinned, the pinned app may open other apps and personal data may be accessible. To use app pinning: \t1.\tTurn on app pinning \t2.\tOpen Overview \t3.\tTap the app icon at the top of the screen, then tap Pin</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎠᎴᎢ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᎭᏔᏅᎢ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᎭᏔᏅᎢ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏱᏓᏍᏚᎭ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏏᏴᏫ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎯᏓ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ. ᎾᎢ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎦᎭᏛᏍᎬᎢ: \t1.\tᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎦᎭᏛᏍᎬᎢ \t2.\tᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᏍᏆᎳ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ \t3.\tᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ, ᎿᏉᏃ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏗ ᎦᎭᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
