            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You won\u2019t be able to use your face or fingerprint for authentication in apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You won\u2019t be able to use your face or fingerprint for authentication in apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏝᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You won\u2019t be able to use your face for authentication in apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You won\u2019t be able to use your face for authentication in apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏝᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When the screen is off, press and hold the volume down key to go to the previous track. If this restarts the current track, perform the action again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When the screen is off, press and hold the volume down key to go to the previous track. If this restarts the current track, perform the action again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎮᏍᏗ, ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏒᎦᎶᏕᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᏜ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏤᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏧᏩᎫᏔᏅ ᎪᎷᏅᏍᏗ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᎯᎠ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏃᏊᏥᎩ ᎪᎷᏅᏍᏗ, ᎠᎵᏂᎬᏁᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏛᏁᎵᏓ ᏏᏊ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A pattern protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A pattern protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>D ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏃᏍᎩᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your device name is visible to apps on your phone. It may also be seen by other people when you connect to Bluetooth devices, connect to a Wi-Fi network or set up a Wi-Fi hotspot.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your device name is visible to apps on your phone. It may also be seen by other people when you connect to Bluetooth devices, connect to a Wi-Fi network or set up a Wi-Fi hotspot.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏚᏅᏙᎥ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎬᏩᏂᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎠᎪᎲᎩ ᎬᏗ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Bluetooth ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ Wi-Fi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏃᎴ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ Ꭰ Wi-Fi ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Avoid performance decrease in low battery mode, but it will consume more battery">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Avoid performance decrease in low battery mode, but it will consume more battery</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏅᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᏩᏍᎪᎵᏴ ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᎦᏲᎳᏗᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎡᎳᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎬᏔᏙᏗᎭ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To resume using your phone, you need to perform a factory reset.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To resume using your phone, you need to perform a factory reset.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎴᏂᏐᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏂᎬᏁᏗ Ꭰ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
