            <termEntry id="Show the sidebar by tapping on the icon or swiping left or right from the center edge of the screen">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Show the sidebar by tapping on the icon or swiping left or right from the center edge of the screen</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏟᏗᏢ ᎪᏪᎸᎢ ᏄᏩᎾ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏍᎦᏂ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏰᏟ ᎠᏍᏛᎢ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
