            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When magnification is turned on, you can zoom in on your screen.To zoom, start magnification, then tap anywhere on the screen.Drag 2 or more fingers to scrollPinch 2 or more fingers to adjust zoomTo zoom temporarily, start magnification, then touch &amp; hold anywhere on the screen.Drag to move around the screenLift finger to zoom outYou can’t zoom in on the keyboard or navigation bar.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When magnification is turned on, you can zoom in on your screen.To zoom, start magnification, then tap anywhere on the screen.Drag 2 or more fingers to scrollPinch 2 or more fingers to adjust zoomTo zoom temporarily, start magnification, then touch &amp; hold anywhere on the screen.Drag to move around the screenLift finger to zoom outYou can’t zoom in on the keyboard or navigation bar.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏔᏃᎲᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎦᏔᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ zᎾᎥ ᏅᎦ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᏑᎻ,ᎭᎴᎾ ᎠᏔᏃᎲᏍᏗᏍᎩ, ᎢᏳᏃ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᏂᎬᏉ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ.ᎦᎾᏏᏁᎦ 2 ᏃᎴ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᏕᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏓᎸᏪᏍᏗᎠᏇᏄᎩᏍᏗ 2 ᏃᎴ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᏕᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᎩ ᏑᎻᎾᎿᎢ ᏑᎻ ᏞᎦᏊ,ᎭᎴᎾ ᎠᏔᏃᎲᏍᏗᏍᎩ, ᎢᏳᏃ ᎭᏒᏂᎦ ᏃᎴ ᎯᎾᎯᏍᏓ ᏂᎬᏉ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ.ᎦᎾᏏᏁᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᎠᏕᏯᏍᏗ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢᎠᏌᎳᏙᏗ ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᎾ ᎢᎬᏁᏗᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎾᎥ ᏅᎦ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏓᏘᏂᏙᎯ ᏚᏓᏅᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
