            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Media center brings your video, gaming, and video chat apps into one location for easy access anytime.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Media center brings your video, gaming, and video chat apps into one location for easy access anytime.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᏟ ᎠᏂᏲᎯᎭ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ, ᏕᎭᏁᎶᎲᏍᎬᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᏗᏱ ᏌᏊ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᎯᏓ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭᏊ ᎢᏴᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
