                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Note: Some apps may not appear as expected when full screen is on.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Note: Some apps may not appear as expected when full screen is on. ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ Ꮭ ᏧᏠᏱᎭ ᏱᎨᏐ ᎬᎵ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏗ ᏱᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
