            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When Gametime turns off, your game list no longer updates automatically and moments no longer sync.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Gametime turns off, your game list no longer updates automatically and moments no longer sync.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎠCᏱᎶᎦ ᎠᎵᏍᏚᏅᎢ, ᏣᏤᏨ ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᏅᏛᎢ Ꮭ ᏃᏊᏃ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎠᎴ ᏂᏕᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ Ꮭ ᏃᏊᏃ ᎢᏧᎳᎭ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎨᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Conversations that can interrupt">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Conversations that can interrupt</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎾᏟᏃᎮᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎤᏓᏲᏍᏓᏁᎸᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Game tool overlay">
