            <termEntry id="Update Moto Voice app states">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Update Moto Voice app states</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ Moto ᎤᏁᎬ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When app is pinned: \u2022\t\tPersonal data may be accessible \t\t(such as contacts and email content) \u2022\t\tPinned app may open other apps Only use app pinning with people you trust.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When app is pinned: \u2022\t\tPersonal data may be accessible \t\t(such as contacts and email content) \u2022\t\tPinned app may open other apps Only use app pinning with people you trust.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᎭᏔᏅᎢ:  \u2022\t\tᎠᏏᏴᏫ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎯᏓ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ \t\t(ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᎦᎸᏛᎢ) \u2022\t\tᎦᎭᏔᏅᎢ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏱᏓᏍᏚᎭ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎦᎭᏛᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎯᏯᎨᏅᏗᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Now you can quickly check time, battery status, notifications and even take an action over the notifications when the screen is off">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Now you can quickly check time, battery status, notifications and even take an action over the notifications when the screen is off</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏃᏊ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏄᏟᏍᏛ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᏣᎦᏛᎲᎦ, ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ, ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏃᎴ ᎥᏍᏊ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎠᏓᏬᎯᎳᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎮᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
