            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The data recorded by Fingerprint is stored securely and never leaves your phone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The data recorded by Fingerprint is stored securely and never leaves your phone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎦᏂᏴᏔᏅ ᎬᏗ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᏄᏓᎴ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᎴ ᏞᏍᏗ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏓᏅᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Go to Peek Display settings to block notifications from specific apps, change notification details that appear, bypass authentication, and more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Go to Peek Display settings to block notifications from specific apps, change notification details that appear, bypass authentication, and more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎮᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏗᎧᎿᏅ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᏚᏓ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏂᏕᎬᎿᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᎤᎾᏄᎪᎢᏍᏗ, ᎠᏕᏯᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
