            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Access the sidebar by either tapping on the icon or swiping left or right from the center edge of the screen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Access the sidebar by either tapping on the icon or swiping left or right from the center edge of the screen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏟᏗᏢ ᎪᏪᎸᎢ ᎢᏳᏍᏗᏊ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏍᎦᏂ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏰᏟ ᎠᏍᏛᎢ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can choose your preference in settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can choose your preference in settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏯᏑᏯᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᏟ ᎠᏰᎸᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="As this type of service requires cellular network coverage (2G/3G) to proceed, they cannot be executed in airplane mode.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>As this type of service requires cellular network coverage (2G/3G) to proceed, they cannot be executed in airplane mode.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᏗᏓᏛᏁᏗᎢ ᎠᏎ ᏗᏝᏃᎮᏗ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎫᏝᎢ (2G/3G) ᎠᎯᎵᏒ, Ꮭ ᎡᎵ ᏴᎲᏓ ᏥᏳᎢ ᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
