            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can unlock your phone using your face or fingerprint.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can unlock your phone using your face or fingerprint.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
