            <termEntry id="In addition to a screen lock, you can use a SIM PIN to prevent access to cellular networks.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In addition to a screen lock, you can use a SIM PIN to prevent access to cellular networks.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>In addition to a screen lock, you can use a SIM PIN to prevent access to cellular networks. ᏗᎬᏁᏉᏍᏛᏅ ᎠᏛᏴᎵᏛᏍᎬ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ, SIM PIN ᏴᏓ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ</term></tig></langSet>
