            <termEntry id="Fingerprint images and models are stored on the phone until you delete them.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Fingerprint images and models are stored on the phone until you delete them.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᎠᎴ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
