            <termEntry id="In order to use cellular services, you must enter the PIN whenever you swap SIM cards or restart your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In order to use cellular services, you must enter the PIN whenever you swap SIM cards or restart your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>In order to use cellular services, you must enter the PIN whenever you swap SIM cards or restart your device. ᏍᏙᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎢᏗᏓᏛᏁᏗᎢ, ᎠᏎ ᎯᏴᏓ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ PIN ᎢᏘᏁᏟᏴ SIM ᎠᏉᏂᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
