            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You won\u2019t see or hear notifications. Calls from starred contacts and repeat callers are allowed.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You won\u2019t see or hear notifications. Calls from starred contacts and repeat callers are allowed.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎭᏗ ᎡᎵᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᏛᎪᏗ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏫᏗᎬᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎤᏛᏁᎸᏅᎩ ᏗᏟᎬᎮᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎢᎸᏍᎩᏳᏩᏔ ᏗᏅᏗᏍᎩ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Require pattern to start your device?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Require pattern to start your device?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏎᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="There's no special setup needed for Wi-Fi Calling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>There's no special setup needed for Wi-Fi Calling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎭᎢ Ꮭ ᎤᏓᏤᏟᏓ ᏘᎧᎲᎦ ᎤᏚᎸᏛ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you skip this, you can add your fingerprint later in settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you skip this, you can add your fingerprint later in settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏓᎾᏫᏓ ᎯᎠ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎣᏂᏯᎨᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Using your fingerprint to unlock your phone may be less secure than a strong pattern or PIN">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Using your fingerprint to unlock your phone may be less secure than a strong pattern or PIN</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎡᎵᏊ ᎦᏲᎵᎨ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ ᎡᏍᎦᏉ Ꭰ ᎤᎱᏍᏘ ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ ᎠᎴ PIN.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In addition to using your face to unlock your device, you can further protect this device by requiring your password before it starts up.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In addition to using your face to unlock your device, you can further protect this device by requiring your password before it starts up.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏓ ᎾᎢ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏣᎧᏛᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎤᏗᏗᏢ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏙᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏄᏩᏅ ᎠᏎᎾᏛᏁᎮᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏱᎦᏪᏍᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎤᏓᎷᎸ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏓᏂᎩᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Until the device starts up, it can\u2019t receive calls, messages, or notifications, including alarms.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Until the device starts up, it can\u2019t receive calls, messages, or notifications, including alarms.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎩᎳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏒᎢ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᏝᏰᎵ\u2019 ᎬᎩᏍᏗ ᏙᏓᏳᏅᏔᏅᎢ, ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ, ᎠᎴᏃ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Disconnected calls">
