            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When they use Pixel Imprint, images are used to update their fingerprint model.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When they use Pixel Imprint, images are used to update their fingerprint model.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᏓᏂᏙᎬ ᏂᎯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Pixel Imprint, ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
