            <termEntry id="When Locked mode is on, system navigation, gestures &amp; quick settings access are turned off so you can focus on gaming.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Locked mode is on, system navigation, gestures &amp; quick settings access are turned off so you can focus on gaming.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎬᏙᏗᎭ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ, ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᎠᏓᏘᏂᏙᎯ, ᏧᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ &amp; ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎾᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᎿᏊ ᎢᎦ ᏫᏔᎧᏅᎦ ᏕᎭᏁᎶᎲᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To connect to your Mobile Hotspot:1.Turn on Wi-Fi on the other devices.2.Select  in the list of available Wi-Fi networks.3.If a password is required, enter the password.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To connect to your Mobile Hotspot:1.Turn on Wi-Fi on the other devices.2.Select  in the list of available Wi-Fi networks.3.If a password is required, enter the password.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎱᏓᎸᎥᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢt:1.ᎯᏍᏚᎢ Wi-Fi ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.2.ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ  ᎤᎿ ᏕᎦᏅᏛᎢ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ Wi-Fi ᏚᎾᏚᏓᎵ.3.ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ, ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To save battery, keep your phone plugged in when using Mobile Hotspot.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To save battery, keep your phone plugged in when using Mobile Hotspot.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏍᏆᏂᎪᏓ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ, ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎫᏓᎸᏙᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
