            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Prevent others from using this device without your permission by activating device protection features.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Prevent others from using this device without your permission by activating device protection features.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗ ᏐᎢ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏄᏠᏯᏍᏛᎾ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎬᏗ ᎠᎴᏅᏙᏗ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
