            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allowing  to always run in the background may reduce battery life.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allowing  to always run in the background may reduce battery life.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ  ᎾᎢ ᏂᎪᎯᎸ ᎠᎢᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᎦᏲᎳᎨ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎬᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Battery is too low">
