                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ you ᏧᏩᎨᏩ this ᎠᏍᏚᎭ, ᎠᏓᏛᏗ your IT ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ to ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ it</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" apps used memory in the last ">
