                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When using Face Unlock in apps, always require confirmation step</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎠᏎᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎦᎫᏍᏛᏗᏱ ᎢᏯᎳᏍᎬᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
