                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᏥ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To pair your hearing aids, find and tap your device on the next screen. Make sure your hearing aids are in pairing mode.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To pair your hearing aids, find and tap your device on the next screen. Make sure your hearing aids are in pairing mode.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎠᏛᎩᏍᏗᎪ ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ, ᎯᏩᏔ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ. ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎠᏛᎩᏍᏗᎪ ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
