            <termEntry id="Gametime brings your games together with rich content from gaming community.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Gametime brings your games together with rich content from gaming community.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎠCᏱᎶᎦ ᎠᏲᎯᎲ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏧᎾᏁᎶᏗ ᎢᏧᎳᎭ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅᎯ ᎦᎸᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏓᏁᎶᎲᏍᎬ ᏚᏂᏚᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
