            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Once the collection starts, you'll return to the Home screen where you'll see a bubble that you can tap to return here.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Once the collection starts, you'll return to the Home screen where you'll see a bubble that you can tap to return here.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏊᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏂᏟᏏᏍᎬ ᎠᏓᎴᏅᎲᎢ, ᏂᎯᏊᏃ ᏫᎦᎷᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏧᏪᏅᏒ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏂᎯᏊᏃ ᏘᎪᎭ ᎠᎵᏆᎷᎲᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᏫᎦᎷᎬᎢ ᎠᎭᏂ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Use face and fingerprint for">
