            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you set up Face Unlock and Fingerprint Unlock, your phone will ask for your fingerprint when you wear a mask or are in a dark area">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you set up Face Unlock and Fingerprint Unlock, your phone will ask for your fingerprint when you wear a mask or are in a dark area</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏓᏛᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎾᏬᏍᏗ Ꭰ ᎠᎵᎬᏚᎶᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎾᎿ Ꭰ ᎤᎵᏏᎩ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" left">
