                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏦᎢᏁ-ᎤᎾᏓᏟᏌᎲ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᏙᎥᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ Ꮭ ᎴᏃᏉ ID</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Many shops stood in the street, and Dorothy saw that everything in them was green.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Many shops stood in the street, and Dorothy saw that everything in them was green.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎪᏗᏗ ᎪᏢᏅᏗᏱ ᎦᏙᎨ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎳᏅᏛᎢ, ᎠᎴ Dorothy ᎤᏂᎪᎲ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏄᏓᎴᏒᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
