            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In addition to unlocking your phone, you can also use your fingerprint to authorize purchases and app access.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In addition to unlocking your phone, you can also use your fingerprint to authorize purchases and app access.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᏟᏙᏗᎢ ᏗᏩᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
