            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To open the sidebar, you can tap on the icon or swipe right from edge.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To open the sidebar, you can tap on the icon or swipe right from edge.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏟᏗᏢ ᎪᏪᎸᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎯᏅᎦᎵᏓ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎠᏍᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="USB debugging is intended for development purposes only.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>USB debugging is intended for development purposes only.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>USB ᎪᎷᏩᏘᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏄᏪᎵᏒ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᏙᎷᏩᏛᏗ ᏂᏚᏰᎵᏛᎢ ᎤᏩᏌ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
