            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Carrier does not allow adding APNs of type .">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Carrier does not allow adding APNs of type .</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏛᏁ ᎥᏝ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ APNs ᎾᎿ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ .</term></tig></langSet>
