            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Reduce file size for UHD videos by saving as H.265/HEVC instead of H.264/AVC.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Reduce file size for UHD videos by saving as H.265/HEVC instead of H.264/AVC.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎦᏲᎳᎨ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎢᎩᏓ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ UHD ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏗᎵᏏᏅᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ H.265/HEVC ᎤᎬᏫᏳᏎᏍᏗ ᎥᎿᎢ H.264/AVC.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This will reset all network settings, including:Wi\u2011Fi">
