            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Because turning on  affects data encryption, you need to confirm your pattern.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Because turning on  affects data encryption, you need to confirm your pattern.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏅᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬᏃ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᏱᏗᎬᏂᏏᏍᎩ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏔᏅ, ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏦᎯᏳᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
