                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏰᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏙᏗ ᎣᏂᏯᎨᏍᏗ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Mobile Data is turned off. Would you like to turn it back on?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Mobile Data is turned off. Would you like to turn it back on?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎦᏔᎲᏒᏃ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ. ᏯᏓᎯᏗᏏ you ᎤᎸᏉᏔᏅ to ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ it ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎠᎢ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
