                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎥᏝ ᎤᏌᎯᎸ USB ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Hide icons from gentle notifications">
