            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allows the app to receive packets sent to all devices on a Wi-Fi network using multicast addresses, not just your tablet.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allows the app to receive packets sent to all devices on a Wi-Fi network using multicast addresses, not just your tablet.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏗᎩᏍᏗ ᏗᎦᏇᏅᎯ ᏫᎦᏅ ᏫᏗᎦᏅᏁᎸᎢ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᎾᎢ Ꮎ ᏫᎢ-ᏈᎢ ᎤᏚᏓᎵ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎢᎸᏍᎩ ᎠᏁᎸᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏂᏁᏍᏗᎢ, Ꮭ ᏍᎩᏋ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎪᏪᎶᏙᏗᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It uses more power than the non-multicast mode.">
