            <termEntry id="Apps will also have access to the accounts on your tablet that have created contacts.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Apps will also have access to the accounts on your tablet that have created contacts.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎤᎮᏍᏗ ᎤᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᎾᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎪᏪᎶᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏧᏬᏢᏅᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
