                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ ᎪᏢᏅᎯ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ EᏘᏅᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This permission allows apps to save your contact data, and malicious apps may share contact data without your knowledge.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This permission allows apps to save your contact data, and malicious apps may share contact data without your knowledge.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᏗᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎳᏏᏅᏗᏍᎪ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ, ᎠᎴ ᎤᏁᎫᏥᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏣᏅᏛᎾᏊ.</term></tig></langSet>
