            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To use an accessibility feature, swipe up from the bottom of the screen with 2 fingers.To switch between features, swipe up with 2 fingers and hold.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use an accessibility feature, swipe up from the bottom of the screen with 2 fingers.To switch between features, swipe up with 2 fingers and hold.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎨᏒ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ, ᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎡᎳᏗᏢ ᎠᏂ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎬᏗ 2 ᏕᎦᏰᏌᏛ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᏟ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ, ᎯᏅᎦᎵᏓ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ ᎬᏗ 2 ᏕᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
