            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allows the app to invoke methods to add and delete fingerprint templates for use.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allows the app to invoke methods to add and delete fingerprint templates for use.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏔᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎧᏁᏆᏍᏗ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎤᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᏗᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎬᏙᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Serial console enabled">
