            <termEntry id="After  more unsuccessful attempts, you will be asked to unlock your tablet using your Google signin.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>After  more unsuccessful attempts, you will be asked to unlock your tablet using your Google signin.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎶᏐᏅ  ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅᎢ ᏓᏁᎸᏗᏍᎬᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᏔᏲᏢ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎪᏪᎶᏙᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᏣᏤᎵ Google ᏙᏙᎥ ᎪᏪᎶᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
