                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Unsuccessful, enable SIM/RUIM Lock.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅᎢ, ᎡᎵᏊ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ SIM/RUIM ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
