                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>SP ᎤᏠᏯᎨᎢᏍᏗ ᏦᏪᏅᏒᎢ PLMN ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᏔᏲᎯᎭ ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allows the app to learn the screen lock complexity level (high, medium, low or none), which indicates the possible range of length and type of the screen lock.">
