            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Ring vibration">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Ring vibration</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏁᏍᏔᎫ ᎠᎵᏖᎸᎲᏍᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A pattern protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.This deletes the fingerprint model stored on your device. Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face or fingerprint for authentication in apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A pattern protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.This deletes the fingerprint model stored on your device. Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face or fingerprint for authentication in apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>D ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏃᏍᎩᏓᎯᎠ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎬᏩᎦᏘ ᏃᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ. ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Size limit reached.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Size limit reached.</term></tig></langSet>
