            <termEntry id="You don\u2019t have a data connection. To view this information now, go to  from any computer connected to the internet.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You don\u2019t have a data connection. To view this information now, go to  from any computer connected to the internet.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏝᏍᏗ ᎤᎭ Ꭰ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎧᏃᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ Ꭷ, ᏤᏅᏍᏗ  ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
