            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you set up your tablet after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you set up your tablet after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎣᏂᏗᏢ ᏥᎩ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ, ᏂᎯ\u2019ll ᎠᏎ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎤᎾᏜᏅᏓᏕᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Skip password setup?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Skip password setup?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᎾᏫᏓ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᏘᎧᎲ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Raise volume above recommended level?Listening at high volume for long periods may damage your hearing.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Raise volume above recommended level?Listening at high volume for long periods may damage your hearing.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏌᎳᏛᎦ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ ᎦᎸᏉᏔᏅ ᎠᏥᎶᏍᎩ?ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎪᎯᏓ ᏗᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎤᏲᏨᎯ ᏣᏛᎪᏗᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When using mobile data for downloading, using and updating apps, you will be billed according to your plan.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When using mobile data for downloading, using and updating apps, you will be billed according to your plan.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᏄᏰᎸᏛ ᎡᎳ ᏗᎬᏘ ᎦᏢᏗᏍᎬ, ᎲᏗᏍᎬ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏎᎯᎯ ᎢᎦ ᎠᏓᏚᏅ ᏂᎬᏅ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏧᎾᎵᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
