            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Turn off screen lock">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Turn off screen lock</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏓᎩᏍᏏ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When fragmentation is detected, phone storage will be optimized to let you open apps and view content more quickly.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When fragmentation is detected, phone storage will be optimized to let you open apps and view content more quickly.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎩ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎪᎷᏩᏛᏅᎢ, ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅ ᎾᎢ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎦᎸᏛᎢ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏄᏟᏍᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you set up your tablet after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you set up your tablet after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎣᏂᏗᏢ ᏥᎩ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ, ᏂᎯ\u2019ll ᎠᏎ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎤᎾᏜᏅᏓᏕᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Storage">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Storage</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Track all GNSS constellations and frequencies with no duty cycling">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Track all GNSS constellations and frequencies with no duty cycling</term></tig></langSet>
