            <termEntry id="Color inversion turns light screens dark.Note:\u00a0Color inversion also turns dark screens light.\u00a0Colors will change in media and images.\u00a0Dark theme can be used to display a dark background. Dark theme works with supported apps. Color inversion works on all apps. ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Color inversion turns light screens dark.Note:\u00a0Color inversion also turns dark screens light.\u00a0Colors will change in media and images.\u00a0Dark theme can be used to display a dark background. Dark theme works with supported apps. Color inversion works on all apps. </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏑᏫᏓ ᎠᏨᏍᏔᏅᎩ ᎠᎦᏔᎲᎠ ᎢᎦᎦᏅ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎤᎵᏏᎩ.ᏃᏖ\u00a0ᎠᏑᏫᏓ ᎠᏨᏍᏔᏅᎩ ᎠlᏐ tᎤrnᏍ Ꮣrk ᏍcrᎡᎡnᏍ Ꮅght.\u00a0ᏗᏑᏫᏓ ᎠᏎ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎾᎿ ᎦᎶᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ.\u00a0ᎤᎵᏏᎩ ᎤᏓᏤᏟᏓ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗᎢ Ꭰ ᎤᎵᏏᎩ ᎣᏂ ᏗᏜ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ. ᎤᎵᏏᎩ ᎤᏓᏤᏟᏓ ᏗᎧᏃᏗᏱ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎬᏗ ᎦᎫᏍᏛᏅᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ. ᎠᏑᏫᏓ ᎠᏨᏍᏔᏅᎩ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
