                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꭰ ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏃᏍᎩᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A PIN protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.This also deletes the fingerprint model stored on your device. You won\u2019t be able to use your fingerprint for authentication in apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A PIN protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.This also deletes the fingerprint model stored on your device. You won\u2019t be able to use your fingerprint for authentication in apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>D PIN ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏃᏍᎩᏓᎯᎠ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your apps are using a normal amount of battery. If apps use too much battery, your phone will suggest actions you can take.You can always turn on Battery Saver if you\u2019re running low on battery.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your apps are using a normal amount of battery. If apps use too much battery, your phone will suggest actions you can take.You can always turn on Battery Saver if you\u2019re running low on battery.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎬᏗᎭ Ꭰ ᏱᎬᏩᏍᏗᏭ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎲᏗᏍᎬ ᏧᏍᏈᏯ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ, ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎧᏁᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ.ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎡᎳᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
