            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Center the QR code below to connect to \u201c\u201d">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Center the QR code below to connect to \u201c\u201d</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏰᎵ ᏅᎦ Ꮎ QR ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ ᎡᎳᏗᏨ ᎫᏓᎸᏗ \u201c\u201d</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The only other way to decrypt is to perform a factory data reset, erasing all your data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The only other way to decrypt is to perform a factory data reset, erasing all your data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎤᏅᏒ ᏐᎢ ᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎭᏓᏗᎭ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏱᏣᏛᏁᏗ Ꭰ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ, ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you interrupt it, you\u2019ll lose some or all of your data.">
