            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When Bluetooth is turned on, your device can communicate with other nearby Bluetooth devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Bluetooth is turned on, your device can communicate with other nearby Bluetooth devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ Bluetooth ᏄᏍᏛ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏗᏓᏛᎪᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏐᎢ ᎡᏍᎦᏂ Bluetooth ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This app doesn't support always-on VPN">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This app doesn't support always-on VPN</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏝᏍ ᎠᏂᎫᏍᏛᎥᏍᎦ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ-ᎤᎾᎢ VPN</term></tig></langSet>
