            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Encryption takes an hour or more, during which the phone will restart several times.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Encryption takes an hour or more, during which the phone will restart several times.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎩᏍᎪᎢ ᏑᏟᎶᏛ ᎠᎴ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ, ᎾᎯᏳ ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎠᏎ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎢᎸᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏩᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
