            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The admin app can't be used. Your device will now be erased.If you have questions, contact your organization's admin.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The admin app can't be used. Your device will now be erased.If you have questions, contact your organization's admin.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᏱᎦᏴᏓ. ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏎᎢ ᏃᏊ ᎤᏍᎪᎸᏛᎢ.ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏱᏣᎭ ᏗᏛᏛᎲᏍᎩ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᎤᏂᎲᎢ ᏄᏂᎬᏫᏳᏌᏕᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
