            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can also find tools and settings for better gaming.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can also find tools and settings for better gaming.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎯᏩᏔ ᏗᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏓᏤᏢᎩ ᏓᏁᎶᎲᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tap GET HELP for further assistance.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tap GET HELP for further assistance.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᏗᏗᏢ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In Locked mode, system navigation, gestures, &amp; quick settings are turned off so you can focus on gaming.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In Locked mode, system navigation, gestures, &amp; quick settings are turned off so you can focus on gaming.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎬᏙᏗᎭ, ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᎠᏓᏘᏂᏙᎯ, ᏧᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ, &amp; ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎾᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᎿᏊ ᎢᎦ ᏫᏔᎧᏅᎦ ᏕᎭᏁᎶᎲᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
