            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make sure  is off and close any apps that may be using the camera.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make sure  is off and close any apps that may be using the camera.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ  ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏍᏚᏅᎢ ᏂᎦᎥ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ  ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If the problem continues, please restart your phone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If the problem continues, please restart your phone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎥᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏓᏓᎴᎬ ᏫᎬᎵᏱᎴᎩ, ᎰᏩᏊ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Selfie camera hardware isn't working.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Selfie camera hardware isn't working.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᏒ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏝᏰᏃ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please contact customer support.">
