            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Always alert at full volume">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Always alert at full volume</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏔᎲᏍᎩ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏧᎧᎵᏨᎯ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Use the preset profiles tuned by audio experts to get the most out of your phone’s speakers, headphones, and connected devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Use the preset profiles tuned by audio experts to get the most out of your phone’s speakers, headphones, and connected devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏙᏗ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᏗ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎭᏃᏴᎬ ᎬᏗ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎠᏏᎾᏍᏏ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎤᎪᏗᏗ ᎤᎾᏙᏣᎴᏍᏗ ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ ᏗᏂᏬᏂᏍᎩ, ᏗᏟᏳᏙᎾᏗᏍᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
