            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your tablet and personal data are more vulnerable to attack by unknown apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your tablet and personal data are more vulnerable to attack by unknown apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏩᎾᎦᎳᎢ ᏗᎦᏘᎴᎩ ᏄᏩᏅ ᎬᎪᏟᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏒᎾ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
