            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you unmount the SD card, some apps you are using will stop and may be unavailable until you remount the SD card.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you unmount the SD card, some apps you are using will stop and may be unavailable until you remount the SD card.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎥᏝ ᎤᏌᎯᎸ ᏥᎩ USB ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ, ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎠᏎ ᎭᎴᏫᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᏄᏛᏅᎢᏍᏛᎾ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏌᎯᎸ ᏥᎩ SD ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
