            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Autoclick works with a connected mouse. You can set the mouse cursor to click automatically when the cursor stops moving for a certain amount of time.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Autoclick works with a connected mouse. You can set the mouse cursor to click automatically when the cursor stops moving for a certain amount of time.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᏒ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎬᏗ Ꭰ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏍᏕᏥ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏍᏕᏥ ᎥᎪᏪᎵᏍᎬ ᎠᎴᏅᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏥᎩ ᎥᎪᏪᎵᏍᎬ ᏓᎴᏫᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏩᎲᏍᎩ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Ꭰ ᏑᏓᎴᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Background data restrictions for apps">
