            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can't have chatbot contacts in group. Remove  from the group.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can't have chatbot contacts in group. Remove  from the group.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏝᏰᎵ ᎤᎭ ᎤᎾᎵᎪᎯ ᎦᏬᏂᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ. ᎢᎬᎾᏕᏍᏗ  ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
