                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎬᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎢᏅ-ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᎠᎴ ᎢᏅ-ᎠᏍᎦᏂ ᎠᏍᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="App suggestions enabled">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>App suggestions enabled</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏙᏗ ᏗᎧᏁᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏂᏚᏩᏂᎸᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In your status bar, the carrier field will indicate if you are on &quot;&quot; when calls go through the cellular network or &quot; Wi-Fi Calling&quot; when the calls go through a Wi-Fi network.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In your status bar, the carrier field will indicate if you are on "" when calls go through the cellular network or " Wi-Fi Calling" when the calls go through a Wi-Fi network.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏄᏛᎿᏕᎬ ᎦᎾᎸᎢ, ᏥᎩ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᏠᎨᏏ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏓᏎᎮᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎤᎿᎢ "" ᎢᏳᏃ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎮᎾ ᎠᎦᏛᎴᏍᎩ ᏥᎩ ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎠᎴ " Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ" ᏳᏃ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎮᎾ ᎠᎦᏛᎴᏍᎩ Ꭰ Wi-Fi ᎫᏓᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
