            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Determines which app handles the Bug Report shortcut on your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Determines which app handles the Bug Report shortcut on your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏧᏬᎪᏙᏗ ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏗᎫᎭᎸᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏥᏳᎪᏗᏊ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="cards &amp; passes">
