            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You learned how to swipe from the right to go back.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You learned how to swipe from the right to go back.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎤᏕᎶᏆᎥ ᏙᎡᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎡᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
