            <termEntry id="If you stop this service, some features of your phone may stop working correctly until you power it off and then on again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you stop this service, some features of your phone may stop working correctly until you power it off and then on again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᎡᎩ ᏂᎯ ᎭᎴᏫᏍᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ, ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎭᎴᏫᏍᏓ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᏊ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᎴ ᎿᏉᏃ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏏᏯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
