            <termEntry id="To go back to the last screen, swipe from the left or right edge to the middle of the screen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To go back to the last screen, swipe from the left or right edge to the middle of the screen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎮᎾ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎣᏂ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ, ᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏍᎦᏂ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᎠᏍᏛᎢ to the ᏫᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏰᎵ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Prevent ringing:Shortcut available in the volume menu.">
