            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Joining conference call.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Joining conference call.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ ᏓᎾᏠᏍᎬᏔ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You completed the switch apps gesture.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You completed the switch apps gesture.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏂᏚᎵᏍᏆᏛᎾ ᏥᎩ ᎥᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You learned how to use gestures.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You learned how to use gestures.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏙᎡᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏧᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A PIN protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face for authentication in apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A PIN protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face for authentication in apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>D PIN ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏃᏍᎩᏓᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎬᏩᎦᏘ ᏃᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ. ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="With Wi\u2011Fi calling, calls are made and received over non\u2011carrier Wi\u2011Fi networks.">
