                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This admin app is active and allows the app  to perform the following operations:</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎬᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ  ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏂᎬᏁᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏓ ᏓᏂᏱᎵᏒᎢ:</term></tig></langSet>
