            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This info identifies whether your contacts can use certain features, like video calls or some messaging features.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This info identifies whether your contacts can use certain features, like video calls or some messaging features.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᏗᎬᏟᏍᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᏑᏓᎴᎩ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗᎢ, ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏫᏗᎬᏔᏅᎢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏓᎾᏓᏙᏪᎳᏁᎲ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
