            <termEntry id="Allows the app to route its calls through the system in order to improve the calling experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allows the app to route its calls through the system in order to improve the calling experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗ ᏂᏚᏩᏅ ᏫᏗᎬᏔᏅᎢ ᏬᎶᎯᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏅᏒ ᎾᎢ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏗᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎦᏙᎲᏒ.</term></tig></langSet>
