            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A full backup of all data to a connected desktop computer has been requested.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A full backup of all data to a connected desktop computer has been requested.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᎵ ᎠᏍᏃᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎢ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᏗᏔᏲᏢᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
