            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tap to visit the  website">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tap to visit the  website</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏩᏛᎯᏓᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ  ᎤᏂᎳᏛ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This feature enables you to set different visual and audio effects during a video call.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This feature enables you to set different visual and audio effects during a video call.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ ᎾᎯᏳ Ꭰ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you're on Wi\u2011Fi, you can check for voicemail by syncing now.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you're on Wi\u2011Fi, you can check for voicemail by syncing now.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎤᎿᎢ Wi\u2011Fi, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎴᏯ ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎬᏗ ᎢᏧᎳᎭ ᏥᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ Ꭷ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="With Wi\u2011Fi calling, calls are made and received over non\u2011carrier Wi\u2011Fi networks. Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>With Wi\u2011Fi calling, calls are made and received over non\u2011carrier Wi\u2011Fi networks. Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗ Wi\u2011Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ, ᏓᏯᏂ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎢᏴᏛ ᎬᏂᎬᎬ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ Wi\u2011Fi ᏚᎾᏚᏓᎵ. ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
