                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Wi\u2011Fi ᎠᎴ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿ ᏓᏤᎳ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To use this feature, swipe up from the bottom of the screen with 3 fingers.To switch between features, swipe up with 3 fingers and hold.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use this feature, swipe up from the bottom of the screen with 3 fingers.To switch between features, swipe up with 3 fingers and hold.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ, ᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎡᎳᏗᏢ ᎠᏂ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎬᏗ 3 ᏕᎦᏰᏌᏛ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᏟ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ, ᎯᏅᎦᎵᏓ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ ᎬᏗ 3 ᏕᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
