                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Data in this error report comes from system log files and may contain sensitive information, such as app usage and location data.">
