            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="See and listen to your messages, without having to call voicemail.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>See and listen to your messages, without having to call voicemail.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎭᏛᏓᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ, ᏄᏠᏯᏍᏛᎾ ᎤᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎧᏁᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A PIN is required to set up Face Unlock and Fingerprint Unlock.A PIN protects the phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A PIN is required to set up Face Unlock and Fingerprint Unlock.A PIN protects the phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>PIN ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ. PIN ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏃᏍᎩᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="These notifications will alert you">
