                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏔᏁᎶᎲᎦ  ᎬᏗ  ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Now, in Android 12, a helpful status bar indicator will show you anytime your camera or microphone are in use. You can also turn off your camera or microphone completely from the quick settings menu. Learn more about your device privacy in the new Privacy dashboard in device settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Now, in Android 12, a helpful status bar indicator will show you anytime your camera or microphone are in use. You can also turn off your camera or microphone completely from the quick settings menu. Learn more about your device privacy in the new Privacy dashboard in device settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Android 11 ᎠᎯᏓ ᏂᎬᏁᏲᎢ ᏂᏣᏛᏁᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏒᏂᏍᏗ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏓ. ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎤᏬᎯᏳᎯ ᎠᏰᎸᏅ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎠᏯᏙᎳᏛᏗ ᎤᎾᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎯᏗᎨᎢ ᏣᏴᏍᏗ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏗ ᏓᎾᏟᏃᎮᏍᎬᎢ.ᎾᏍᏊ, ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎰᏪᎸᎦ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏓᎾᏟᏃᎮᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏓ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎤᎾᏕᏯᏍᏗ ᏞᏍᏗ ᏣᏕᏯᏙᏔᏅᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎦᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Edit controls">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Edit controls</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᎪᏪᎸ ᏗᏱᎸᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The current media session cannot be hidden.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The current media session cannot be hidden.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎩ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏱᏂᎦᏛᎦ ᎬᏍᎦᏝ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
