            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Ready For lets you enjoy the full capability of your phone. Connect to a display for immersive entertainment and video chats, as well as a powerful desktop experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Ready For lets you enjoy the full capability of your phone. Connect to a display for immersive entertainment and video chats, as well as a powerful desktop experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ready For ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎭ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᎧᎵ ᎢᎬᏩᏛᏁᏗ ᎥᎿᎢᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗᎢ. ᏗᎵᎪᏙᎩ ᎥᎾᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏄᏰᎸᏛ ᎦᏃᏴᏘᏍᏦᏗ ᎤᎾᏛᏁᎸᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᏂᏬᏂᏍᎩ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯᏊᏃ ᎤᎳᏂᎩᏛ ᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏂᏙᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Open ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Open </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏍᏚᎢ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
