            <termEntry id="To charge faster, use the charger and cable that were provided with this phone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To charge faster, use the charger and cable that were provided with this phone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏣᎸᎳᎯᎨ, ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏧᏯᏅᎢᏗᏍᏕᏛ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏛ ᎬᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tap for more information">
