            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Ditch the small screen and enjoy your favorite video apps on your TV or display. While you’re watching, you can continue using your phone without stopping the video.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Ditch the small screen and enjoy your favorite video apps on your TV or display. While you’re watching, you can continue using your phone without stopping the video.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩ ᏩᏗᏅᏗ ᎤᏍᏗᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏣᎵᎮᏍᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏫᏣᎸᏉᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎥᎾ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ. ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏣᎦᏙᏍᏛᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏂᎦᏯᎢᏒ ᎲᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏠᏯᏍᏛᎾ ᏄᎴᏫᏍᏔᏅᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
