            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don\’t forget, you can also open the camera by twisting your wrist twice.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don\’t forget, you can also open the camera by twisting your wrist twice.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏞᏍᏗ\ ᏥᏠᎨᏫᏏ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏊ ᏱᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏗ ᎯᏄᏖᏯᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎧᏯᏌᏝ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᎫᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Click the &quot;&quot; button below to send a verification email to this address.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Click the "" button below to send a verification email to this address.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᏥᎩ "" ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎡᎳᏗᏢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏫᏅᎥᎦ Ꭰ ᎪᎯᏳᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏗᎦᏁᏍᏗᏱ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Carrier Provisioning Service">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Carrier Provisioning Service</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎵᏍᏕᎸᏙᏗ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="With power notification controls, you can set an importance level from 0 to 5 for an app's notifications.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>With power notification controls, you can set an importance level from 0 to 5 for an app's notifications.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏗᏱᎸᏍᏗ, ᏱᎧᎲᎦ ᏭᎵᏍᎨᏗᏴ ᎢᏗᎦᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ 0-5 ᏄᏰᎸᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ  ᎬᏙᏗ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This helps protect data on lost or stolen devices.">
