            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Video chatting with Ready For is the next best thing to being in the room. Subject tracking on your phone’s camera keeps everyone in the field of view for more natural conversation.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Video chatting with Ready For is the next best thing to being in the room. Subject tracking on your phone’s camera keeps everyone in the field of view for more natural conversation.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏛᏝᏃᎮᏍᎬ ᎬᏗ Ready For ᎥᎩᎾ ᏐᎢ ᎣᎯᏍᏗ ᎡᏙᎲᎩ ᎥᎾᎢ ᎦᏅᏑᎸᎢ. ᎢᏳᏍᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎥᎪᎷᏁᎬ ᎥᎾ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᎬᏅ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎤᏂᎮᏍᏗ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᏗᎧᏃᏗᏗ ᏄᏰᎸᏛ ᎤᎪᏛ ᏂᎬᏩᏍᏛ ᏓᎾᎵᏃᎮᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
