            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Motorola collects and reports usage information to keep your software up to date, provide personalized support, and improve products and services.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Motorola collects and reports usage information to keep your software up to date, provide personalized support, and improve products and services.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Motorola ᏗᎦᏟᏌᏅᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᏗᎬᏁᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎦᏃᎮᏢᎥᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏩᏂᎨ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏔᏅᎢ-ᎾᎢ-ᎢᎦ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ, ᎣᏤᎵ ᎢᎬᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᏅᎯ ᎠᎴ ᎢᏗᏓᏛᏁᏗᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
