            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The Google Assistant helps you find answers and get things done with just your voice. Features, functions, and supported languages may vary by country.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The Google Assistant helps you find answers and get things done with just your voice. Features, functions, and supported languages may vary by country.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ Google ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏥᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᏩᏛᏗ ᏗᎦᏬᎯᎵᏴᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᏧᏓᎴᏅᏛ ᏓᏍᏆᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎥᏍᏊ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎯᏁᎬᎢ. ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ, ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎦᎫᏍᏛᏅᎢ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏰᎵ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To clear music, pictures, and other user data, the SD card needs to be erased.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To clear music, pictures, and other user data, the SD card needs to be erased.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏍᎪᎸᏓ ᏗᎧᏃᎩᏙᏗ, ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ, ᏃᎴ ᏐᎢ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᏥᎩ SD ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎤᏚᎸᏗ ᏄᎾᏛᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If it doesn’t appear here, tap “Settings” to search for it.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If it doesn’t appear here, tap “Settings” to search for it.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏄᏍᏛ ᎾᎿ ᏝᏍ ᎬᏂᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᎭᏂᏃ, ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ “ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ” ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏱᏍᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎾᎿ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The content on this screen can\’t be shown on a secondary display.">
