            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Removing this account will delete all of its messages, contacts, and other data from the device!">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Removing this account will delete all of its messages, contacts, and other data from the device!</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎬᏅᏕᏍᎬᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ, ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏐᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ!</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Enabling data on ">
