            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The data recorded by Fingerprint is stored securely and never leaves your phone. You can delete your data anytime in Settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The data recorded by Fingerprint is stored securely and never leaves your phone. You can delete your data anytime in Settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎦᏂᏴᏔᏅ ᎬᏗ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᏄᏓᎴ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᏃᎴ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏓᏅᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭᏊ ᎢᏴᎢ ᎾᎿ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Ready For lets you share the power of your phone with nearby displays &amp; PCs.">
