            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="By connecting your mobile device you can share files, images, use your phone as a high-resolution webcam &amp; more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>By connecting your mobile device you can share files, images, use your phone as a high-resolution webcam &amp; more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗ ᏓᎾᎵᎪᏗᏍᎬ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ, ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ, ᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎤᎿ Ꭰ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ-ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏙᏗ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ &amp; ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
