            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Are you sure you want to delete the profile update?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Are you sure you want to delete the profile update?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᎯᏳᎢᏍ ᏣᏚᎵ sᏍᎪᎸᏙᏗ Ꮎ ᎠᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅ?</term></tig></langSet>
