                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Select "Accept and continue" to use current settings or change your .</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ “ᏗᏓᏂᎸᎢᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏂᎦᏯᎢᏒ” ᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ </term></tig></langSet>
