            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Select Overwrite to proceed or New to create a new profile.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Select Overwrite to proceed or New to create a new profile.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏑᏰᎦ ᎠᏓᏭᎯᎳᏛ ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᏱᏣᏚᎵ ᎠᎴ ᎢᏤ ᎭᏐᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏗ ᎢᏤ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
