            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="By registering my email, I agree to receive exclusive information about product launches, events, tips, beta tests, software updates, and much more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>By registering my email, I agree to receive exclusive information about product launches, events, tips, beta tests, software updates, and much more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏱᎪᏪᎵ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎸ, ᏥᏚᏍᏗᎭ ᏗᎩᏁᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏃᎯᏎᎯ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏳᏂᏍᎪᎵᏗ, ᎾᏅᏛᏁᎲ,ᎦᏃᏣᏢᏍ, ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛ ᎠᏟᎶᏍᎩ, ᏩᏁᎩ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ, ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦ</term></tig></langSet>
