                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>(ᏥᎯᏘᏅᏓᎩ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ )</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your IT admin requested a bug report to help troubleshoot this device. Apps and data may be shared, and your device may temporarily slow down.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your IT admin requested a bug report to help troubleshoot this device. Apps and data may be shared, and your device may temporarily slow down.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏤᎵ IT ᏄᏂᎬᏫᏳᏌᏕᎩ ᎤᏂᏔᏲᏢᎩ ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᎣᏍᏓᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎠᏓᏃᎯᏎᎭ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏔᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏞᎩᏊ ᏛᏍᎦᏃᎸᏔᏂ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Restrict screen refresh rate and background apps to preserve battery and play longer">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Restrict screen refresh rate and background apps to preserve battery and play longer</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏍᏚᏁᏗ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎯᏤᎲᏍᏓ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏛ ᎠᎴ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎥᎿ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗᎢ ᎢᎪᎯᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Too hot - Turning off.">
