                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏄᏛᏁᎸᏅ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᏩᎾᏕᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It turned off to prevent damage to the phone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>It turned off to prevent damage to the phone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᎤᏲᏍᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ Ꮎ ᏗᏝᏃᎮᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" This can be caused by:Using graphics intensive apps like video games and navigation apps for long periods of time.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> This can be caused by:Using graphics intensive apps like video games and navigation apps for long periods of time.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎯᎠ ᎢᎤᏍᏗ ᏥᏂᎬᎵᏍᏓ ᎪᎯᏗ ᎲᏗᎲ ᏧᏛᎴᎾᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ Ꮎ ᏗᏁᏞᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎮᏙᎲᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎪᎯᏗ ᎲᏗᏍᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" Downloading or uploading large files.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> Downloading or uploading large files.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎡᎳᏗᎬᏘ ᎦᏢᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᎴ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏝ ᎦᏢᏍᏗᎬ ᏧᏛᎾ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
