                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᎤᏟ ᎤᎦᎾᏩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To unlock your phone, drag your finger up from the bottom of the display">
