            <termEntry id="To open a notification, drag down to the fingerprint button and hold until it unlocks">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To open a notification, drag down to the fingerprint button and hold until it unlocks</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ, ᎦᎾᏏᏅᏍᏗ ᎡᎳᎵᏢ ᎾᏍᎩ  ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎤᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎩᎳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏒᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
