                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ &amp; PC ᎤᎭ Wi-Fi ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎬᏗ Ꭰ USB ᏔᎷᎩᏍᎩ ᏍᏕᏱᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To open a notification, drag down to the padlock button and hold until it unlocks">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To open a notification, drag down to the padlock button and hold until it unlocks</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ, ᎦᎾᏏᏅᏍᏗ ᎡᎳᎵᏢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏓᎦᏏ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎩᎳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏒᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The fingerprint sensor will still appear when the screen is off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The fingerprint sensor will still appear when the screen is off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎦᏴᏌᏛ ᎤᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᏩᏘᏍᎩ  ᎠᏎᎢ ᏏᏊ ᎤᎾᏄᎪᎢᏍᏗ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎮᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="1 - Install Ready for Assistant on your Windows PC, then set up the Ready For Assistant www.motorola.com/ready-for">
