                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>1 - ᎯᏘᏅᎦ Ready ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Assistant ᎤᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Windows PC, ᎢᏳᏃ ᏘᎧᎲᎦᏃ ᏥᎩ Ready For Assistant www.motorola.com/ready-for</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
