                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏗᎪᎲᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎲᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᏱᎩ Wi\u2011Fi</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Limit battery used by Wi\u2011Fi">
