            <termEntry id="You can change your PIN and voicemail greeting anytime by going to Settings -&gt;Visual Voicemail.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can change your PIN and voicemail greeting anytime by going to Settings -&gt;Visual Voicemail.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ PIN ᎠᎴ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏤᏘ ᎢᎸᎯᏳ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏰᏏ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ -&gt;ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᎧᏁᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Greetings:You can choose from 3 types of voicemail greetings.">
