            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your default PINis the last 4 digits of your phone number, but you’ll need to change it as part of thesetup.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your default PINis the last 4 digits of your phone number, but you’ll need to change it as part of thesetup.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ PINᎨᎡᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎣᏂ 4 ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎦᏛᏉ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Type a network prefix length between 0 and 32.">
