            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Custom Greeting: Allows you to record a personal greetingName Greeting: Allows you to record your nameDefault Greeting: Standard greeting with your phone numberHow to change your PIN and greeting?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Custom Greeting: Allows you to record a personal greetingName Greeting: Allows you to record your nameDefault Greeting: Standard greeting with your phone numberHow to change your PIN and greeting?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏄᏍᏛ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏤᏘ: ᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎲ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᏅᏅᏛᎢ Ꭰ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏤᏘᏚᏅᏙᎥ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏤᏘ: ᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎲ ᏂᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᏅᏅᏛᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏚᏅᏙᎥᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏤᏘ: ᎢᎬᏩᏍᏗᎭ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏤᏘ ᎬᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎᏍᏗᏰᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ PIN ᎠᎴ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏤᏘ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Setup:If you’re a first time user, you’ll need to set up your voicemail.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Setup:If you’re a first time user, you’ll need to set up your voicemail.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ:ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ Ꭰ ᎢᎬᏱ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ, ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
