            <termEntry id="If Wi\u2011Fi is lost, call will end.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If Wi\u2011Fi is lost, call will end.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi\u2011Fi ᏱᏣᏲᎱᏎᎵ, ᏯᎵᏍᏆᏗ ᏫᏯᏂᏍᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When Wi-Fi calling is on, your phone can route calls via Wi-Fi networks or your carrier\u2019s network, depending on your preference and which signal is stronger.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Wi-Fi calling is on, your phone can route calls via Wi-Fi networks or your carrier\u2019s network, depending on your preference and which signal is stronger.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᏪᏯᏂ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏗ ᏱᎩ, ᏗᏝᏃᎮᏗᎢ ᏳᏫᏕᎬᎶᎯᏍᏗ ᏪᏴᎾ Ꮎ Wi-Fi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᎴ Ꮎ ᏣᎯᏙᎯ/u2019s ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏫᏨᎸᏉᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᏫᏛᏤᏢᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Before turning on this feature, check with your carrier regarding fees and other details.">
