                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꮟ ᏂᎯᏍᏚᎢᏍᎬᎾ Ꮎ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ, ᎯᎵᏃᎮᏓ ᏣᎯᏙ ᏚᎬᏩᎵᏓᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏐᎢ ᏣᏕᎶᎰᎯᏍᏗ ᏱᏣᏚᎵᎠ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Used as your location when you make an emergency call over Wi\u2011Fi">
