                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏛ Ꮎ ᎮᏙᎲᎢ Ꮎ ᎤᏟᏍᏗ ᏴᏛᏂᏗ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎯᏬᎯᎸᏙᏗ Wi\u2011Fi</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Automatically set lower priority notifications to Gentle">
