            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Audio effects delivers a premium listening experience through your phone\’s loudspeakers and connected devices.You can also create custom profiles for each audio device. Each time you connect a device, Audio effects will remember the last settings you used.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Audio effects delivers a premium listening experience through your phone\’s loudspeakers and connected devices.You can also create custom profiles for each audio device. Each time you connect a device, Audio effects will remember the last settings you used.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ ᏂᏕᎬᏁᎰᎢ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᏣᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎶᎯᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ\’s ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏱᏗᎬᏁᎸᎯ ᏧᎾᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏌᏊᎭ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏂᏓᏟᏱᎵᏒᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎱᏓᎸᎥᏍᎬ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᎢ ᏛᏅᏓᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎣᏂ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏕᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Zoom in on screen">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Zoom in on screen</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎥ ᏅᎦ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Using triple-tap to magnify part of your screen causes typing and other delays.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Using triple-tap to magnify part of your screen causes typing and other delays.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗᎭ ᏦᎢ ᎢᎦᎢ-ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏔᏃᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᏛᏉ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏂᏕᎬᏂᏏᏍᎬ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏐᎢ ᎠᎵᎪᏂᏯᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
