            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Audio effects delivers a premium listening experience through your phone\’s loudspeaker and connected devices.You can also create custom profiles for each audio device. Each time you connect a device, Audio effects will remember the last settings you used.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Audio effects delivers a premium listening experience through your phone\’s loudspeaker and connected devices.You can also create custom profiles for each audio device. Each time you connect a device, Audio effects will remember the last settings you used.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ ᏂᏕᎬᏁᎰᎢ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᏣᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎶᎯᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ\’s ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏱᏗᎬᏁᎸᎯ ᏧᎾᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏌᏊᎭ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏂᏓᏟᏱᎵᏒᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎱᏓᎸᎥᏍᎬ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᎢ ᏛᏅᏓᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎣᏂ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏕᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The image is either corrupted or unavailable.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The image is either corrupted or unavailable.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎠᏅᏓᏗᏍᏙ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎢᏧᎳᏊ ᎤᏲᏨᎯ ᎠᎴ ᏄᏛᏅᎢᏍᏛᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
