            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make sure your phone and PC have Wi-Fi turned on, or connected by a USB data cable.Then enter the Wi-Fi or USB related IP address in PC client">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make sure your phone and PC have Wi-Fi turned on, or connected by a USB data cable.Then enter the Wi-Fi or USB related IP address in PC client</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎴ PC ᎤᎭ Wi-Fi ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ, ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎬᏗ Ꭰ USB ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᏔᎷᎩᏍᎩ ᏍᏕᏱᏛ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ Wi-Fi ᎠᎴ USB ᏧᏠᏱ IP ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎾᎿ PC ᎠᏥᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
