            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow ^1 to move this photo to trash?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow ^1 to move this photo to trash?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ^1 ᎾᎢ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎾᎢ ᎤᏲ ᏩᏗᏅᏗ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
