            <termEntry id="When Airplane mode is on, you won't be able to use the Internet, Email or other apps that require a data connection unless you use Wi-Fi.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Airplane mode is on, you won't be able to use the Internet, Email or other apps that require a data connection unless you use Wi-Fi.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏥᏳ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏝᏰᏍ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ, ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᎠᎴ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏎᏯᏛᏁᏗ Ꭰ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎢᏳᏍᎩᏂ ᏂᎯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Wi-Fi.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
