            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Bluetooth connect permission is not granted for Ready For app. To make sure Ready For can scan nearby device, turn it on.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Bluetooth connect permission is not granted for Ready For app. To make sure Ready For can scan nearby device, turn it on.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Bluetooth ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎤᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Ready For ᎬᏙᏗ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ Ready For ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎭᏫᏂ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
