            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Attentive Display keeps the screen on while you’re looking at it, and Peek Display lets you see notifications, even when the screen is off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Attentive Display keeps the screen on while you’re looking at it, and Peek Display lets you see notifications, even when the screen is off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏏᎾᎯᏍᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏂᎯᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎯᎪᎵᏰᏍᎬᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏗᎧᎿᏅ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
