                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎾᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᏯᎾᎨᏔᏗᏍᏗ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎢ ᏳᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your IT admin has the ability to monitor and manage settings, corporate access, apps, permissions, and data associated with this profile, including your network activity, as well as your device's location, call history, and contact search history.">
