                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎾᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ ᎠᏅᎦᏎᏍᏗᎰ ᎠᎴ ᏓᏄᎪᏔᏂᏙᎰᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎤᎾᏙᏢᏒ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ, ᏗᎪᏙᏗ, ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏁᎯ, ᎠᎴ ᎦᏟᏌᏅ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎾᏍᏊ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎾᏛᏁᎲ, ᎠᎴᏍᏊ ᏥᏂᎦᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎢᎦᏅᏕᎾ, ᏫᏗᏨᏠᏃᎮᏢ, ᎠᎴ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏕᎯᎲᎸ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Contact your IT admin for more information, including your organization's privacy policies.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Contact your IT admin for more information, including your organization's privacy policies.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏫᏛᏢᏃᎮᏗ ᎤᎾᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᎥᏍᎩ, Ꮎ ᏍᏇ ᎤᎾᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎠᏗᏍᎦᎸᏗ ᏧᎾᎳᏏᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To use theft-protection features, you must have a password-protected screen lock for your device.">
