                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎾᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Apps &amp; contacts">
