            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To turn the external display on and off, press the power key on the side of the device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To turn the external display on and off, press the power key on the side of the device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏙᏯᏗᏢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ, ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᎨᏂ ᎥᎿᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tapping on the fingerprint sensor also turns the display off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tapping on the fingerprint sensor also turns the display off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎤᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᏩᏘᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎠᏍᏚᎲᏍᎪ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏁᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can also tap on the external display during calls to see additional options.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can also tap on the external display during calls to see additional options.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏲᎤ cᎠn ᎠlᏐ Ꮤp Ꭳn tᎮ ᎡxᏖrᎾl ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ ᏚrᎢng cᎠllᏍ tᎣ ᏎᎡ ᎠdᏗᏘᎣᎾl ᎣpᏘᎣnᏍ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The Privacy dashboard shows you the permissions your apps have access to, as well as a timeline of apps accessing your camera, microphone, or device location in the last 24 hours.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The Privacy dashboard shows you the permissions your apps have access to, as well as a timeline of apps accessing your camera, microphone, or device location in the last 24 hours.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>TᎮ PrᎢᎥᎠcy ᏓᏍhbᎣᎠrd ᏍᎰwᏍ ᏲᎤ tᎮ pᎡrᎻᏍᏏᎣnᏍ ᏲᎤr ᎠppᏍ ᎭᎥᎡ ᎠccᎡᏍᏍ tᎣ, ᎠᏍ Ꮺll ᎠᏍ Ꭰ ᏘᎺᎵᏁ Ꭳf ᎠppᏍ ᎠccᎡᏍᏏng ᏲᎤr cᎠᎺrᎠ, ᎻcrᎣpᎰᏁ, Ꭳr ᏕᎥᎢcᎡ ᎶcᎠᏘᎣn Ꭲn tᎮ ᎳᏍt 24 ᎰᎤrᏍ.</term></tig></langSet>
