            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When using the Real Time Text (RTT) keyboard during a call, your device sends text instantly as you type.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When using the Real Time Text (RTT) keyboard during a call, your device sends text instantly as you type.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ (RTT) ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏫᎬᏔᏅ, ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏫᏗᎦᏅᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ ᎤᎵᏍᏗᏓᏬ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
