            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" wants to access your SIM card. Granting access to the SIM card will disable data connectivity on your device for the duration of the connection. Give access to ?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> wants to access your SIM card. Granting access to the SIM card will disable data connectivity on your device for the duration of the connection. Give access to ?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᏚᎾᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ. ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎳᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᎾᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎦᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏗᎫᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏥᎩ ᎢᏳᏓᏅᎯᏓ ᎤᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ. ᏧᏁᏗᏱ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
