            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The selected action isn't available while in the Emergency Callback mode.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The selected action isn't available while in the Emergency Callback mode.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎠᏑᏰᏛ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏛ ᏯᎵᏱᎵᏙᎭ ᏪᏯᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
