            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When Edge display is on, apps will display on the curved edges for a more immersive experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Edge display is on, apps will display on the curved edges for a more immersive experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎠᏍᏛᎢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᏯᎢ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎤᏕᏲᎸᎢ ᏓᏍᏛᏔ ᎤᎪᏕᏍᏗᏃ ᎦᏃᏴᏘᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Warm">
