            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It also helps you protect your information if your phone is lost.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>It also helps you protect your information if your phone is lost.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᏋ ᏍᏕᎵᏍᎪᎢ ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎦᏃᎮᏢᎥᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗᎢ ᏱᏣᏲᏎᎳ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Peek Display lets you interact with notifications on the external display, even when the screen is locked.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Peek Display lets you interact with notifications on the external display, even when the screen is locked.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᏘᎪᎵᏯ ᎴtᏍ ᏲᎤ ᎢnᏖrᎠct Ꮻth ᏃᏘfᎢcᎠᏘᎣnᏍ Ꭳn tᎮ ᎡxᏖrᎾl ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ wᎮn tᎮ ᏍcrᎡᎡn ᎢᏍ ᎶckᎡd.</term></tig></langSet>
