                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>^1 ^2</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you unmount the USB storage, some apps you are using will stop and may be unavailable until you remount the USB storage.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you unmount the USB storage, some apps you are using will stop and may be unavailable until you remount the USB storage.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎥᏝ ᎤᏌᎯᎸ ᏥᎩ USB ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ, ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎠᏎ ᎭᎴᏫᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᏄᏛᏅᎢᏍᏛᎾ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏌᎯᎸ ᏥᎩ USB ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Edge display extends app content over the edges for a more immersive experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Edge display extends app content over the edges for a more immersive experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎦᏅᎯᏗᏍᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ  ᎦᏬᎯᏣᎢ Ꮎ ᏓᏍᏛᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᏟᎢᎦᎢ ᎦᏃᏴᏘᏍᏙᏗ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏂᏙᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
