            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you eject this ^1, apps stored on it will stop working, and media files stored on it will not be available until it is reinserted.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you eject this ^1, apps stored on it will stop working, and media files stored on it will not be available until it is reinserted.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏓᏄᎪᏫᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ^1, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎭᎴᏫᏍᏓ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎥᏝ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᎩᎳ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎪᏣᎸᏗ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
