            <termEntry id="If you’re a gamer, explore the settings in Gametime that give you an edge over the competition.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you’re a gamer, explore the settings in Gametime that give you an edge over the competition.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏔᏁᎶᎲᏍᎩ, ᏫᏣᎦᏛᏂᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᏟᏱᎶᎦ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏣᏁᎲᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏛᎢ ᏕᎭᏓᏬᎭᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎾᏓᎪᎾᏗᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
