            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Motorola offers extended service plans for hardware failures, as well as accident protection against liquid damage and cracked screens">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Motorola offers extended service plans for hardware failures, as well as accident protection against liquid damage and cracked screens</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Motorola ᏓᏍᎪᎸᏗ ᎧᏁᏉᏛ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᏗᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏚᏄᎸᎲᎦ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯᏊᏃ ᎤᏓᏎᎦᏤᎸᎯ ᏧᎾᏓᎵᏍᎦᏍᏙᏗ ᎤᏡᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎹᎭ ᎠᏲᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏁᏍᏝ ᏓᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
