                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᎵᏓᏍᏔᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏚᏂᏲᏒᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏱᎬᏁᎸᎯ. ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅ ᎾᎢ ᎪᎷᏩᏛᏗ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎰᏩᏊ ᏣᎦᏛᎲᎦ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏔᏲᎯᎭ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏱᎬᏁᎸᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᎵᏗᎳᏏᏛᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Automatically back up device data (such as Wi-Fi passwords and call history) and app data (such as settings and files stored by apps) remotely.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Automatically back up device data (such as Wi-Fi passwords and call history) and app data (such as settings and files stored by apps) remotely.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏍtᎣp bᎠckᎢng Ꭴp ᏕᎥᎢcᎡ ᏓᏔ (Ꮡch ᎠᏍ Ꮻ-FᎢ pᎠᏍᏍᏬrdᏍ Ꭰnd cᎠll ᎯᏍtᎣry) Ꭰnd Ꭰpp ᏓᏔ (Ꮡch ᎠᏍ ᏎtᏘngᏍ Ꭰnd fᎢᎴᏍ ᏍtᎣrᎡd by ᎠppᏍ), pᎷᏍ ᎡrᎠᏎ Ꭰll cᎣpᎢᎡᏍ Ꭳn rᎡᎼᏖ ᏎrᎥᎡrᏍ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
