            <termEntry id="By proceeding, your user will be managed by your admin which may also be able to store associated data, in addition to your personal data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>By proceeding, your user will be managed by your admin which may also be able to store associated data, in addition to your personal data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>By prᎣcᎡᎡᏗng, ᏲᎤr ᎤᏎr Ꮻll bᎡ ᎹᎾᎨd by ᏲᎤr ᎠdᎻn wᎯch Ꮉy ᎠlᏐ bᎡ ᎠbᎴ tᎣ ᏍtᎣrᎡ ᎠᏍᏐcᎢᎠᏖd ᏓᏔ, Ꭲn ᎠdᏗᏘᎣn tᎣ ᏲᎤr pᎡrᏐᎾl ᏓᏔ.</term></tig></langSet>
