            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your credit provider can change settings and install software on this device.To learn more, contact your creditor provider.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your credit provider can change settings and install software on this device.To learn more, contact your creditor provider.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎾᏓᏚᎬ ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎯᏘᏅᏛᎦ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎾᏓᏚᎬ ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A password protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face for authentication in apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A password protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face for authentication in apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>D ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ or ᎦᏃᏍᎩᏓ.ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎬᏩᎦᏘ ᏃᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ. ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
