                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎾᏕᎯᏯᏍᎬᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A Google approach to syncing data to allow access to your contacts, appointments, and more from wherever you are.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A Google approach to syncing data to allow access to your contacts, appointments, and more from wherever you are.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꭰ ᎪᎣgᎴ ᎠpprᎣᎠch tᎣ ᏍyncᎢng ᏓᏔ tᎣ ᎠlᎶw ᎠccᎡᏍᏍ tᎣ ᏲᎤr cᎣnᏔctᏍ, ᎠppᎣᎢntᎺntᏍ, Ꭰnd ᎼrᎡ frᎣm wᎮrᎡᎥᎡr ᏲᎤ ᎠrᎡ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
