                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>TᎣ cᎭnᎨ tᎯᏍ ᏎtᏘng, ᏖmpᎣrᎠrᎢly tᎤrn Ꭳn bᎠckgrᎣᎤnd ᏓᏔ Ꭰnd ᎠᎤtᎣᎹᏘc Ꮝync.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
