            <termEntry id="Peek Display lets you read and interact with notifications while the screen is off, and Attentive Display keeps the screen on while you’re looking at it.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Peek Display lets you read and interact with notifications while the screen is off, and Attentive Display keeps the screen on while you’re looking at it.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏩᎦᏔ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏂᎯ ᏣᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏪᎳᏗᏓᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎤᎾᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ, ᎠᎴ ᎤᎵᏏᎾᎯᏍᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏣᎦᏙᏍᏛᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="* Did Device Help answer/solve your question/issue?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>* Did Device Help answer/solve your question/issue?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>* ᎾᏍᎩᎾᏍ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎤᏬᎯᎵᏴᏍᏙᏗ/ᎪᎷᏩᏛᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏛᏛᎲᏍᎩ/ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Inconsistent ticket and realm. This Ticket does not belong to this security domain">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Inconsistent ticket and realm. This Ticket does not belong to this security domain</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏤᎵᎪᎢ. ᎯᎠ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᏝ ᎤᏤᎵᎢ ᏱᎩ ᎯᎠ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᏂ ᏄᏩᏅᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Third-party account not bound. Third-party user name is not a Lenovo ID">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Third-party account not bound. Third-party user name is not a Lenovo ID</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏦᎢᏁ-ᎤᎾᏓᏟᏌᎲ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎭᏗ ᏯᎾᏚᏓᎸᎥᏍᎨᏍᏗ. ᏦᎢᏁ-ᎤᎾᏓᏟᏌᎲ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᏙᎥᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎭᏗ ᎴᏃᏉ ID</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In order to use actions and gestures make sure the stylus is connected via bluetooth.">
