            <termEntry id="You won't be able to use your fingerprint to unlock your work profile, authorize purchases, or sign in to work apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You won't be able to use your fingerprint to unlock your work profile, authorize purchases, or sign in to work apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎧᏛ, ᎠᎵᏍᎪᏟᏙᏗᎢ ᏗᏩᎯᏍᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏚᏙᎥ ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
