            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" has installed a certificate authority on your device, which may allow them to monitor your device network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> has installed a certificate authority on your device, which may allow them to monitor your device network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎭᏍ ᎢnᏍᏔlᎴd cᎡrᏘfᎢcᎠᏖ ᎠᎤtᎰrᎢᏘᎡᏍ Ꭳn ᏲᎤr ᏕᎥᎢcᎡ, wᎯch Ꮉy ᎠlᎶw tᎮm tᎣ ᎼᏂtᎣr ᏲᎤr ᏕᎥᎢcᎡ ᏁtᏬrk ᎠcᏘᎥᎢty, ᎢncᎷᏗng ᎡᎹᎢlᏍ, ᎠppᏍ, Ꭰnd ᏎcᎤrᎡ ᏪbᏏᏖᏍ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="For more information about this certificate, contact your admin.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>For more information about this certificate, contact your admin.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="For more information about these certificates, contact your admin.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>For more information about these certificates, contact your admin.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" has installed a certificate authority for your work profile, which may allow them to monitor work network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> has installed a certificate authority for your work profile, which may allow them to monitor work network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎭᏍ ᎢnᏍᏔlᎴd cᎡrᏘfᎢcᎠᏖ ᎠᎤtᎰrᎢᏘᎡᏍ Ꭳn ᏲᎤr ᏕᎥᎢcᎡ, wᎯch Ꮉy ᎠlᎶw tᎮm tᎣ ᎼᏂtᎣr ᏲᎤr ᏕᎥᎢcᎡ ᏁtᏬrk ᎠcᏘᎥᎢty, ᎢncᎷᏗng ᎡᎹᎢlᏍ, ᎠppᏍ, Ꭰnd ᏎcᎤrᎡ ᏪbᏏᏖᏍ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A trusted credential installed on your device is making this possible.">
