                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wi-Fi Calling lets you make and receive voice calls and text/multimedia messages over Wi-Fi when your phone is connected to a Wi-Fi network and registered for Wi-Fi Calling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏩᏂᎩ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏢᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎠᎴ ᎯᏪᏗ/ᎢᎸᏍᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᎸᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎢᏴᏛ Wi-Fi ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ Wi-Fi ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎪᏪᎳᏅᎯ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
