            <termEntry id="Dolby Audio delivers a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeaker and connected devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Audio delivers a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeaker and connected devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᎵᏈ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏙᏓᎨᏥᏁᎵ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏗᏛᏓᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
