            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The stylus button can help you take action inside an app, like pausing music or taking a picture.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The stylus button can help you take action inside an app, like pausing music or taking a picture.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎨᏍᏕᎸᏓ ᎠᎵᏖᎸᏅᎯ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎭᏫᎾᏗᏢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎬᏙᏗ, ᎤᏠᏱᏉ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗ ᏗᏂᏃᎩᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏛᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your stylus lets you take quick notes anytime.">
