                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Just pull it out to open Moto Note or another notes app.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏫᏣᏌᏁᏍᏗᏊ ᎾᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎼᏙ ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏅᏩᏓᎴᎢ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ ᎬᏙᏗ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
