            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you're ready to take a note, just remove the stylus to open Moto Note.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you're ready to take a note, just remove the stylus to open Moto Note.</term></tig></langSet>
