            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Click the button in the bottom right corner of the screen to access quick settings and notifications.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Click the button in the bottom right corner of the screen to access quick settings and notifications.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᏢ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᎤᏅᏏᏴ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your battery temperature is too low, please disconnect the charger!">
