            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you receive a call, you can send a quick text reply on the external display by swiping diagonally from the bottom left corner.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you receive a call, you can send a quick text reply on the external display by swiping diagonally from the bottom left corner.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>WᎮn ᏲᎤ rᎡcᎡᎢᎥᎡ Ꭰ cᎠll, ᏲᎤ cᎠn Ꮞnd Ꭰ Ꮘck Ꮦxt rᎡply Ꭳn tᎮ ᎡxᏖrᎾl ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ by ᏍᏫpᎢng ᏗᎠᎪᎾlly frᎣm tᎮ bᎣttᎣm Ꮄft cᎣrᏁr.</term></tig></langSet>
