            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Click on the desktop settings icon to change your wallpaper, display timeout and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Click on the desktop settings icon to change your wallpaper, display timeout and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎧᏑᎧᏡ ᎪᏪᎵ, ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏲᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
