            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Adaptive Battery">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Adaptive Battery</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A password protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.This deletes the fingerprint model stored on your device. Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face or fingerprint for authentication in apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A password protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.This deletes the fingerprint model stored on your device. Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face or fingerprint for authentication in apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>D ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏃᏍᎩᏓ.ᎯᎠ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎬᏩᎦᏘ ᏃᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ. ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Location time zone detection is disabled">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Location time zone detection is disabled</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᏗᏓᏓᎴᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᎾᏄᎪᏫᏍᏒᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏗᎦᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
