            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Bluetooth and wired accessories are supported, but you may need a USB hub for wired devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Bluetooth and wired accessories are supported, but you may need a USB hub for wired devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏌᎪᏂᎦᎢ ᎦᏅᏙᎬ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎳᎾᎥ ᏗᎬᏔᏅᏙᏗ ᏚᎵᏍᏕᎸᏗ, ᎠᏎᏃ  ᏱᏣᎷᎶ Ꮴ USB hub ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏗᎫᎳᎾᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Long press on the Home screen to customize.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Long press on the Home screen to customize.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏅᎯᏓ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏧᏪᏅᏒ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Inside the modes menu, you’ll also find pro settings that give you more control.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Inside the modes menu, you’ll also find pro settings that give you more control.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏫᎾᏗᏢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗᎭ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᏂᎯᏊᏃ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎯᏩᏔ ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏣᏁᎲᎢ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Open the app without restarting">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Open the app without restarting</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎬᎾ ᏔᎵᏁ ᎭᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
