            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can choose between an extended desktop view or a mirror of your phone screen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can choose between an extended desktop view or a mirror of your phone screen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏣᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᎦᏅᎯᏛᎯ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒ ᏗᎧᏅᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏓᎨᏗ ᎥᎿᎢ ᏂᎯᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
