            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Use Ultra-Res to capture photos with the highest resolution.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Use Ultra-Res to capture photos with the highest resolution.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏙᏓ ᎤᎶᏒᏍᏔᏅ-ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎬᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏩᎦᎸᎳᏗᏴ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
