                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Ready For lets you enjoy the full capability of your phone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏄᏰᎸᏛ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎭ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᎧᎵ ᎢᎬᏩᏛᏁᏗ ᎥᎿᎢᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
