            <termEntry id="Enable 2G service if you are in locations of limited cellular or Wi-Fi coverage to make emergency or non-emergency calls and to be able to use some apps and features.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Enable 2G service if you are in locations of limited cellular or Wi-Fi coverage to make emergency or non-emergency calls and to be able to use some apps and features.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᎵᏊ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ 2G ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎾᎿ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏩᏎᏢᏊ ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬᎢ ᎠᎴ Wi-Fi ᎫᏢᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏢᏗ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏛ ᏯᎵᏱᎵᏙᎭ ᎠᎴ ᎬᏂᎬᎬ-ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏛ ᏯᎵᏱᎵᏙᎭ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎠᎴ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
