            <termEntry id=" is requesting to upload a bug report from this device taken on  at . Bug reports include personal information about your device or logged by apps, for example, user names, location data, device identifiers, and network information. Only share bug reports with people and apps you trust with this information. Allow  to upload a bug report?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> is requesting to upload a bug report from this device taken on  at . Bug reports include personal information about your device or logged by apps, for example, user names, location data, device identifiers, and network information. Only share bug reports with people and apps you trust with this information. Allow  to upload a bug report?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏔᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎩᎴᏍᏗ ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎩᏒᎯ ᎤᎾᎢ  ᎾᎿᎢ . ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᎸ ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎠᏏᏴᏫ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᏄᏰᎵᏛᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏄᏛᏁᎸ ᎤᏃᎮᏢᎩ ᏳᏩᏅ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏱᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ, ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᎾᏙᎥᎢ, ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏗᏓᏙᎵᎩ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏚᏓᎵ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ. ᎤᏩᏌ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᎸ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᏃᎴ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏱᏯᎨᏅᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ. ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ  ᎾᎢᎠᎩᎴᏍᏗ ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᎸ?</term></tig></langSet>
