            <termEntry id="To help us better understand your issue, you'll need to provide a share log and complete a relevant questionnaire.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To help us better understand your issue, you'll need to provide a share log and complete a relevant questionnaire.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎣᎩᏍᏕᎵᏍᎪᎢ ᏓᏤᏢᎩ ᎪᎵᏍᏗᎢ ᏂᏨᏅ ᏕᏣᏓᎴᏤᎲᎢ, ᏂᎯᏊᏃ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᏄᏛᏁᎸ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏍᏆᏛᎢ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏗ ᎠᏛᏛᎮᎸᎥᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
