            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To use , make sure mobile data and data roaming are turned on. You can change these in mobile network settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use , make sure mobile data and data roaming are turned on. You can change these in mobile network settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ , ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎡᏙᎵᏙᎲ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎯᎠᏃ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
