                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Number of PPP Reset Since Boot:</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᎿ PPP ᏥᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᏓ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ:</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
