                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏅᏓᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᎪᏪᎵ: ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎥᏝ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ, ᎤᏐᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂ, ᎤᎶᏐᏅ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎯᏍᏆᏓ ᏥᎩ Setup Wizard.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This unprocessed file type is used to professionally edit photos.Note: The file size will be 4-5 times larger than the standard JPG format.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This unprocessed file type is used to professionally edit photos.Note: The file size will be 4-5 times larger than the standard JPG format.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎠᏱᎸᏒ ᏂᎦᏒᎾ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎢ ᏫᏓᎾᏤᏢ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎦᏂᏟᏴᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ.{ᎠᏓᏅᏓᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᎪᏪᎵ: ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎢᎩᏓ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ 4-5 ᎢᏳᏩᎩᏗ ᎡᏑᎯ ᏏᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᏩᏍᏗᎭ JPG ᏱᎬᏁᎸᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Now you can communicate with Group Messaging.A new conversation will be opened now. You can add a name and icon for the new conversation.">
