            <termEntry id=" is requesting full control of this device. The service can read the screen and act on behalf of users with accessibility needs. This level of control is not appropriate for most apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> is requesting full control of this device. The service can read the screen and act on behalf of users with accessibility needs. This level of control is not appropriate for most apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏔᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᏧᎧᎵᏨᎯ ᏗᎫᎪᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏥᎩ ᎤᎾᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎵᏁᎩ ᎤᎵᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎵᏍᏕᎸᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᏅᏗᏍᎩ ᎡᎵᏍᏗ ᏱᏩᏅᏓ ᎬᏗ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎨᏒ ᏧᏚᎸᏓ. ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎾᏕᏍᎩ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎫᎪᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏝᏰᏃ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
