                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗ ᏫᎬᎵᏱᎴᎬ, ᏂᎯ ᏧᏁᏗᏱ Branch ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏩᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎫᎪᏙᏗ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎯᎠ ᏗᏤᏞᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We’ve partnered with Branch to provide a better device and app navigation experience by using industry-leading privacy technology and data security standards.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We’ve partnered with Branch to provide a better device and app navigation experience by using industry-leading privacy technology and data security standards.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴ ᎤᎭ ᎤᎾᎵᎪᏒ ᎬᏗ Branch ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ Ꭰ ᏓᏤᎳ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏱᎴᎩ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏂᏙᎸᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ-ᎠᏘᏁᎦ ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᎢᏤ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᏧᎾᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᏗᎬᏩᏍᏗᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
