            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="After capturing a photo on the internal display, the external display can show a preview for your subject to review. You can turn this feature on in Camera settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>After capturing a photo on the internal display, the external display can show a preview for your subject to review. You can turn this feature on in Camera settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎶᏐᏅ ᎦᏂᏱᏍᎬ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎥᎾᎢ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ, Ꮎ ᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ ᏰᎵ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏓᎪᏩᏛᏗᏍᎩ ᏄᏰᎸᏛ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᏣᎪᎵᏰᏗ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏗᎧᏃᏗ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
