            <termEntry id="Even with eyes protected by the green spectacles, Dorothy and her friends were at first dazzled by the brilliancy of the wonderful City.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Even with eyes protected by the green spectacles, Dorothy and her friends were at first dazzled by the brilliancy of the wonderful City.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎥᏍᏊ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎦᏙᎵ ᎠᎵᏍᎦᏍᏙᏓ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᏗᎾᏙᏍᏗᏍᎩ, Dorothy ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎨᏴ ᏗᎦᎵᎢ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎤᎾᎿ ᎢᎬᏱᏱ ᎤᏍᏆᏂᎪᎯᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏬᎸᏣᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗ ᎦᏚᎲ.</term></tig></langSet>
