            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Do more with your voice">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Do more with your voice</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎾᏛᎦ ᎬᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="From authentication to network security, Android gives you the best possible protection against security threats. Now you can manage your privacy preferences more easily in Settings so you always feel in control of what you share. You can also rest easy knowing that Android is providing faster security updates to send fixes as soon as they\’re available.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>From authentication to network security, Android gives you the best possible protection against security threats. Now you can manage your privacy preferences more easily in Settings so you always feel in control of what you share. You can also rest easy knowing that Android is providing faster security updates to send fixes as soon as they\’re available.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ, Android ᏣᏁᎰᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗᏉ ᎤᎾᏓᎵᏍᎦᏍᏙᏗ ᏗᎦᏘᎴᎩ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏁᏄᎵᏍᎩ. ᏃᏊ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎨᏣᏱᎸᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᎤᏟ ᎯᏰᎸᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᎯᏗᎨ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎤᏓᏛᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏱᎵᏒᎯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎯᏯᏙᎯᎲᎢ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎠᎯᏓ ᏯᏣᏪᏐᎸᏍᏗ ᏣᏅᏘᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ Android ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎬ ᎦᏣᏄᎳ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏫᎦᏅᏗ ᏧᏍᏓ ᏱᏗᎬᏁᎸᎯ ᏄᎵᏍᏛᏉ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᏃ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This service is malfunctioning.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This service is malfunctioning.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎤᎾᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎢᏳᏩᏂᏌᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The Accessibility button is set to . To use magnification, touch &amp; hold the Accessibility button, then select magnification.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The Accessibility button is set to . To use magnification, touch &amp; hold the Accessibility button, then select magnification.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎨᏒ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬ ᎾᎿᎢ .ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏣᏔᏃᎯᏍᏔᏅᎢ, ᎭᏒᏂᎦ ᎠᎴ ᎯᎾᎯᏍᏓ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎨᏒ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ, ᎾᏉᏃ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏣᏔᏃᎯᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
