            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To be able to make and receive phone calls and messages, please install an Xfinity Mobile SIM card before continuing. For information about requesting or installing a SIM card please visit . Need help? We're standing by at .">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To be able to make and receive phone calls and messages, please install an Xfinity Mobile SIM card before continuing. For information about requesting or installing a SIM card please visit . Need help? We're standing by at .</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏢᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ, ᎰᏩᏊ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ Ꭰ Xfinity Mobile SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᏏᏅ ᏫᎬᎵᏱᎴᎬ. ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎢᎸᏢ ᎠᏔᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏘᏅᏛᏍᎬ Ꭰ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏩᏛᎯᏓᏍᏗ.  ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ? ᎢᏗ ᎦᏙᎦ ᎬᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ .</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Connect headphones or speakers for more audio effects">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Connect headphones or speakers for more audio effects</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏗᏟᏳᏙᎾᏗᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏂᏬᏂᏍᎩ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Rich, detailed audio that delivers every note and beat with power you can feel">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Rich, detailed audio that delivers every note and beat with power you can feel</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏪᎾᎢ, ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎦᏅᏁᏗ ᏂᎦᏗᏳ ᎠᏓᏅᏓᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᎪᏪᎵ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏤᎸᎦ ᎬᏗ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏒᎾᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Whenever an Xfinity Wi-Fi hotspot is available, your phone is set to auto-connect, so no log-ins are ever needed. Right now you're on our 4G LTE network. To change this feature, visit your Wi-Fi Preferences Settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Whenever an Xfinity Wi-Fi hotspot is available, your phone is set to auto-connect, so no log-ins are ever needed. Right now you're on our 4G LTE network. To change this feature, visit your Wi-Fi Preferences Settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ Ꭰ Xfinity Wi-Fi ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏩᏌ-ᎫᏓᎸᎢ, ᏓᏛ ᎭᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᎤᏚᎸᏛ. ᎠᎦᏘᏏ Ꭷ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎤᎿᎢ 4G LTE ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ, ᎠᏩᏛᎯᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Wi-Fi ᎤᏟ ᎠᏂᏰᎸᏍᎬᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We were not able to connect your phone to Xfinity Mobile. If you have not yet activated your phone please power it off and visit . Need help? We're standing by at .">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We were not able to connect your phone to Xfinity Mobile. If you have not yet activated your phone please power it off and visit . Need help? We're standing by at .</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎥᏝ ᏰᎵ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ Xfinity ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ. ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎥᏝ ᎩᎳ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎰᏩᏊ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏩᏛᎯᏓᏍᏗ . ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ? ᎢᏗ ᎦᏙᎦ ᎬᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To use this feature, swipe up from the bottom of the screen with 2 fingers.To switch between features, swipe up with 2 fingers and hold.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use this feature, swipe up from the bottom of the screen with 2 fingers.To switch between features, swipe up with 2 fingers and hold.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ, ᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎡᎳᏗᏢ ᎠᏂ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎬᏗ 2 ᏕᎦᏰᏌᏛ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᏟ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ, ᎯᏅᎦᎵᏓ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ ᎬᏗ 2 ᏕᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your phone will now auto-connect to your home Wi-Fi and millions of other Xfinity Wi-Fi hotspots. No log-ins are ever needed. If you want to change this feature, visit your Wi-Fi Preferences Settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your phone will now auto-connect to your home Wi-Fi and millions of other Xfinity Wi-Fi hotspots. No log-ins are ever needed. If you want to change this feature, visit your Wi-Fi Preferences Settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎ Ꭷ ᎤᏩᏌ-ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎣᏪᏅᏒ Wi-Fi ᏃᎴ ᎢᏧᏆᏗᏅᏛ ᎾᎿ ᏐᎢ Xfinity Wi-Fi ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ. ᎭᏗ ᎯᏴᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᎤᏚᎸᏛ. ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ, ᎠᏩᏛᎯᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Wi-Fi ᎤᏟ ᎠᏂᏰᎸᏍᎬᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Set the switch on or off to control the surround sound effect.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Set the switch on or off to control the surround sound effect.</term></tig></langSet>
