            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The intelligent equalizer analyzes and dynamically adjusts the audio to match a desired tone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The intelligent equalizer analyzes and dynamically adjusts the audio to match a desired tone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎠᎦᏔᎯ ᎢᏗᎦᏘᎭ ᏗᎫᎪᏙᏗ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎬᎾᏳᎦᎵᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᎩ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏙᎵᎩ Ꭰ ᎤᎾᏚᎸᏛ ᎭᏃᏴᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
