            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can set up your phone using Wi-Fi, but you won't be able to make or receive calls until your phone has been activated on the Xfinity Mobile network.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can set up your phone using Wi-Fi, but you won't be able to make or receive calls until your phone has been activated on the Xfinity Mobile network.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎴᏯ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏗᎭ Wi-Fi, ᎠᏎᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎩᎳ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏓ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ Xfinity Mobile ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ.</term></tig></langSet>
