            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="For Trip Mode to work, Easy Prefix must use: \u26AB Contacts - Checks if dialed number is a known contact.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>For Trip Mode to work, Easy Prefix must use: \u26AB Contacts - Checks if dialed number is a known contact.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏁᎳᏗᏍᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ, ᎠᎯᏓ ᎠᎴᏔᏅ ᎠᏎ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ: \n\n\u26AB ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ-ᏓᎦᏎᏍᏗᏍᎪ ᎾᎿ ᏗᏐᏂᎭ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ Ꭰ ᎠᎪᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
