            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn helpful hints and suggestions for your device with the tips widget">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn helpful hints and suggestions for your device with the tips widget</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎧᏁᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎧᏁᎢᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏓᏕᏲᎲᏍᎩ ᏫᏥᏘ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Whether you're streaming a movie, listening to music, or playing a game, Dolby technology gives you clearer dialog, crisper detail, and more engaging sound.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Whether you're streaming a movie, listening to music, or playing a game, Dolby technology gives you clearer dialog, crisper detail, and more engaging sound.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏃᏊᏥᎩ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ, ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛᎢ ᏗᎧᏃᎩᏍᏗ, ᎠᎴᏃ ᏓᏁᎶᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ, ᏙᎵᏈ ᎢᏤ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎩ ᏕᏣᏁᎭ ᎬᏂᎨᏒᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ, ᎬᏂᎦᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᎵᎶᎯ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Each time you connect a device, Dolby Audio will remember the last settings you used.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Each time you connect a device, Dolby Audio will remember the last settings you used.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏓᏟᏱᎵᏒᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎱᏓᎸᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᏙᎵᏈ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎠᏎ ᏛᏓᏗᏍᏔᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎣᏂ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏨᏔᏅᎯ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Because turning on  affects data encryption, you need to confirm your password.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Because turning on  affects data encryption, you need to confirm your password.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏅᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬᏃ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ  ᏱᏗᎬᏂᏏᏍᎩ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏔᏅ, ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏦᎯᏳᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏱᎦᏪᏍᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
