            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Note: If you restart your device and have a screen lock set, this app can\u2019t start until you unlock your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Note: If you restart your device and have a screen lock set, this app can\u2019t start until you unlock your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏅᏓᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᎪᏪᎵ: ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎯᎭᏂᎩᏍᏔᏅ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏃᎴ ᏣᎲᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏍᏓᏯ ᏍᏚᏅᎢ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎯᎠ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ\u2019 ᏱᎬᏂᎦ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎯᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏒᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="There isn't enough space in USB storage to save the file from \u0022\u0022">
