                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏃᏘfᎢcᎠᏘᎣnᏍ Ꮉy bᎡ ᏕᎳᏰd.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Note: RTT is not available while roaming">
