            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow Rescue and Smart Assistant to back up data from your device to a PC?\Rescue and Smart Assistant backs up the following data: - Photos- Videos- Music files- Contacts">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow Rescue and Smart Assistant to back up data from your device to a PC?\Rescue and Smart Assistant backs up the following data: - Photos- Videos- Music files- Contacts</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏌᏑᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ PC?\ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏌᏑᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏓ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ: - ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ- ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ- ᏗᎧᏃᎩᏙᏗ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ- ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
