            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Camera needs permission to access some things on your device. Open Camera on the internal display to grant permissions.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Camera needs permission to access some things on your device. Open Camera on the internal display to grant permissions.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᏚᎸᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏧᏓᎴᏅᏛ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎭᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Device Help can't contact the server right now. Check your network connection, and try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Device Help can't contact the server right now. Check your network connection, and try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᎯ ᏃᏊᏥᎩᎢᏃ. ᏣᎦᏛᎲᎦ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᏚᏓᎵ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎵᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This update will continue if you go back or close this window.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This update will continue if you go back or close this window.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎦᏢᏍᎬᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎮᎾ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏦᎳᏂ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
