            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Because this update is important, your device will install automatically on .">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Because this update is important, your device will install automatically on .</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏅᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬᏃ ᎯᎠ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏓ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏙ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make sure your camera is clean and nothing is blocking it. Can you see what it's capturing?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make sure your camera is clean and nothing is blocking it. Can you see what it's capturing?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎨᎡᎩ ᏧᏓᏅᎦᎸᏓ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏎᏉᏉ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎲ it. ᏰᎴᏯ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
