            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="As you have enabled Smart Updates feature, your device will automatically install the update on  if you haven't installed by then.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>As you have enabled Smart Updates feature, your device will automatically install the update on  if you haven't installed by then.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏂᏚᏩᏂᎸᎢ ᎠᏌᏑᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ  ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎥᏝ ᎦᏘᏅᏔᏅ ᎬᏗ ᎾᏉᏃ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make sure you have enough battery for installation.">
