            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Using a USB cable, connect your device to your computer and select System Update from the USB options on your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Using a USB cable, connect your device to your computer and select System Update from the USB options on your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗᎭ Ꭰ USB ᏔᎷᎩᏍᎩ ᏍᏕᏱᏛ, ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ USB ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
