            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Use the Software Upgrade Assistant tool to install.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Use the Software Upgrade Assistant tool to install.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏦᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Material You provides a more human smartphone experience. It gives you designs that are custom for every style, accessible for any need, and adaptive in the moment.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Material You provides a more human smartphone experience. It gives you designs that are custom for every style, accessible for any need, and adaptive in the moment.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏂᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏗᎾᏓᏁᏢᏍᎩ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏴᏫ ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏓᏤᏢᎢ. ᎤᏩᏌ ᎠᏓᏁᎭ ᏂᎯ ᏗᎪᏒᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏂᏚᏍᏛᎢ, ᏅᏛᏴᏍᏙᏗᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎦᎥᏉ ᎤᏚᎸᏛ, ᏃᎴ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It's easy to find the people you contact most. Just open the Phone app, tap on Favorites, and see the people you talk to frequently. You can also manually add contacts to this list.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>It's easy to find the people you contact most. Just open the Phone app, tap on Favorites, and see the people you talk to frequently. You can also manually add contacts to this list.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᎾᏃ ᎠᎯᏓ ᎠᏩᏛᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᏕᎭᎵᏃᎮᏙᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎪᏗᏗ. ᏍᎩᏋ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ, ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏗᏑᏰᏛ, ᎠᎴ ᎯᎪᏩᏔ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᏂᎯ ᏕᎭᎵᏃᎮᏗᏍᎬ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎣᏩᏌ ᎠᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏕᎦᏅᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tap for more info.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tap for more info.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Accessibility settings help everyone enjoy an engaging Android experience. Change the font &amp; display size, adjust color or motion, or hear audio that lets you use your device without looking at the screen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Accessibility settings help everyone enjoy an engaging Android experience. Change the font &amp; display size, adjust color or motion, or hear audio that lets you use your device without looking at the screen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏁᏤᎮᏍᏗ Android ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ. ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏙᏪᎵᏍᎩ &amp; ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎢᎩᏓ, ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏑᏫᏓ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎲᎢ, ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᏛᎪᏗ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎬᏙᏓ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏅᏐᏯᏍᏗᏍᎬᎾ ᎠᎦᏖᏃᎲᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Delete message?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Delete message?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎯ ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
