            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please free up  space and go to Settings &gt; System updates to try the download again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Please free up  space and go to Settings &gt; System updates to try the download again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏩᏊ ᏚᏓᎴᎩ ᎢᎦᏓ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᎠᎴ Ꭷ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ &gt; ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎦᏢᏍᎬᎢ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
