                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏪᎳᏗᏓᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ otaservice</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Welcome to Google sync!A Google approach to syncing data to allow access to your contacts, appointments, and more from wherever you are.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Welcome to Google sync!A Google approach to syncing data to allow access to your contacts, appointments, and more from wherever you are.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏕᎬᏯᏓᏁᎸᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ Google ᏥᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ!Ꭰ Google ᎤᎾᏄᎪᏫᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᏧᎳᎭ ᏥᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ , ᏚᏂᏒᏍᏔᏅᎩ , ᎠᎴ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎾᏉᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎨᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=": about  used, as measured by your tablet. Your carrier\u2019s data usage accounting may differ.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>: about  used, as measured by your tablet. Your carrier\u2019s data usage accounting may differ.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>: ᎢᎸᏢ  ᎬᏔᏅᎢ, ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᎢᏳᏟᎶᏛ ᎬᏗ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ. ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎠᏂᎯᏙᎯ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᏬᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏕᎳ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏚᏓᎴᎿᎥ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
