            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" has installed certificate authorities for your work profile, which may allow them to monitor work network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.For more information about these certificates, contact your admin.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> has installed certificate authorities for your work profile, which may allow them to monitor work network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.For more information about these certificates, contact your admin.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎦᏘᏅᏔᏅ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏄᏂᎬᏫᏳᏒᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎧᏛᎢ, ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎵᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᎾᎵᏖᎸᎲᏍᎬ, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ ᏓᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒ.ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
