            <termEntry id=" has installed certificate authorities on your device, which may allow them to monitor your device network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.For more information about these certificates, contact your admin.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> has installed certificate authorities on your device, which may allow them to monitor your device network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.For more information about these certificates, contact your admin.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎦᏘᏅᏔᏅ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎤᎾᏒᎦᎸᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎧᏛᎢ, ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎵᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᎾᎵᏖᎸᎲᏍᎬ, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ ᏓᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒ.ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
