            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Share your phone by adding new users. Each user has a personal space on your phone for custom Home screens, accounts, apps, settings, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Share your phone by adding new users. Each user has a personal space on your phone for custom Home screens, accounts, apps, settings, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏗᏤ ᏗᏅᏗᏍᎩ. ᏌᏊᎭ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ Ꭰ ᎠᏏᏴᏫ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎣᏪᏅᏒ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ, ᏗᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Take a tour to learn about your phone’s best features">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Take a tour to learn about your phone’s best features</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᎦᏖᏃᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏄᏰᎵᏛᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏩᏅ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" has installed a certificate authority on your device, which may allow them to monitor your device network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.For more information about this certificate, contact your admin.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> has installed a certificate authority on your device, which may allow them to monitor your device network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.For more information about this certificate, contact your admin.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎦᏘᏅᏔᏅ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎤᎾᏒᎦᎸᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎧᏛᎢ, ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎵᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᎾᎵᏖᎸᎲᏍᎬ, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ ᏓᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒ.ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Amount of time screen has been on since full charge">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Amount of time screen has been on since full charge</term></tig></langSet>
