            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you restrict background mobile data, some apps and services won\u2019t work unless you\u2019re connected to Wi\u2011Fi.This setting affects all users on this phone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you restrict background mobile data, some apps and services won\u2019t work unless you\u2019re connected to Wi\u2011Fi.This setting affects all users on this phone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏓᏍᏚᏁᏗ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ, ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎢᏗᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᏝᏰᎵ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎢᏳᏍᎩᏂ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᎤᎾᎢ Wi\u2011Fi.ᎯᎠ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏂᏙᏓᎬᏂᏌᏂ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᏅᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Battery use since unplugged">
