            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn how to use it, get the most out of it, or fix a problem.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn how to use it, get the most out of it, or fix a problem.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎾᎢ ᎨᎬᏙᏓ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎪᏗᏗ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ, ᎠᎴᏃ ᎣᏍᏛ ᏱᏨᏁᏗ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Permanently remove the user CA certificate?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Permanently remove the user CA certificate?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏩᎦᏘ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ CA ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Activating this admin app will allow the app  to perform the following operations:">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Activating this admin app will allow the app  to perform the following operations:</term></tig></langSet>
