            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Using the accessibility button. The gesture isn\u2019t available with 3-button navigation.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Using the accessibility button. The gesture isn\u2019t available with 3-button navigation.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗᎭ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ. ᏥᎩ ᏧᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ ᏝᏰᏃ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᎬᏗ 3-ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏱᎴᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Block connections without VPN">
