            <termEntry id="Sync is currently experiencing problems. It will be back shortly.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sync is currently experiencing problems. It will be back shortly.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏍᏗ ᏓᏓᎴᏍᏗᏍᎬ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎾᏉ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A third party is capable of monitoring your network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.A trusted credential installed on your device is making this possible.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A third party is capable of monitoring your network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.A trusted credential installed on your device is making this possible.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꭰ ᏦᎢᏁ ᎤᎾᏓᏟᏌᎲ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᎾᎵᏖᎸᎲᏍᎬ, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ ᏓᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒ.Ꭰ ᎨᎪᎢᏳᎯ ᎤᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎦᏘᏅᏔᏅ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏃᏢᏍᎬ ᎯᎠ ᏰᎵᏊ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
