            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When Advanced Messaging capable recipients are added to this group, conversation continues in the same group. All Advanced Messaging features are available for such conversations.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Advanced Messaging capable recipients are added to this group, conversation continues in the same group. All Advanced Messaging features are available for such conversations.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ Advanced Messaging ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏗᏂᏁᏍᎩ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᎠᏃ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ, ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏫᎬᎵᏱᎴᎩ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏠᏱ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ. ᏂᎦᏓ Advanced Messaging ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᏓᎾᏟᏃᎮᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Spell checker for work">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Spell checker for work</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏓ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Because you’ve used your device more than usual, your battery may run out sooner than it normally would.Apps using most battery:">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Because you’ve used your device more than usual, your battery may run out sooner than it normally would.Apps using most battery:</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬᏃ ᏂᎯᏃ ᎬᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎡᏍᎦᏉ ᎾᏍᎩᏯ, ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏓᎾᏫᏍᏗ ᎦᏅᎪᏫᏛ ᎢᎬᏱᎯᎨᏍᏗ ᎡᏍᎦᏉ ᎾᎿ ᏱᎬᏩᏍᏗᎭᎢ ᏯᏓᎯᏗᏏ.ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎤᎪᏗᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ:</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="View usage from last full charge">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>View usage from last full charge</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎣᏂ ᎧᎵ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏔᏅᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
