                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏢᏗ &amp; ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎵ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Write directly into text boxes">
