            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Select a VPN profile to always remain connected to. Network traffic will only be allowed when connected to this VPN.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Select a VPN profile to always remain connected to. Network traffic will only be allowed when connected to this VPN.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ Ꭰ VPN ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎤᏓᏃᎯᏴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ. ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏓᏓᏅᏓᏁᎸ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎤᏅᏒ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ VPN.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sync now">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sync now</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏃᏊ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="These apps can't run in the background">
