            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you’d like to listen on another device, choose from the options below.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you’d like to listen on another device, choose from the options below.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏯᏓᎯᏗᏏ ᏣᎸᏉᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎭᏛᏓᏍᏓ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏄᏓᎴ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᏣᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᏢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Only share bug reports with people and apps you trust with this information.">
