            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can change the order of tiles anytime by going to quick settings on the internal display and tapping on the pencil icon.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can change the order of tiles anytime by going to quick settings on the internal display and tapping on the pencil icon.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᎵᏊ ᏣᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᏗᏓᏁᎳᏅᎯ ᏗᏦᎳᏂ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᎬᏴ ᎬᏗ ᏅᏛᏁᎲ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎥᎾᎢ ᎤᎬᏫᏳᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᎬ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏙᏗ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ.</term></tig></langSet>
