                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow battery usage in background without restrictions. May use more battery.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᎿ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎾᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎬᎾ ᏚᏅᏍᏓᏕᎲ. ᏰᎵᏉ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
