            <termEntry id="You added a group icon locally">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You added a group icon locally</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎧᏁᏉᏓ Ꭰ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎡᏍᎦᏂᎨᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Group management lets you add and remove group participants, create shareable names and icons for your groups, and leave groups when you're no longer interested in the conversation. Contacts that are eligible for group messages will show a capability icon on their contact image.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Group management lets you add and remove group participants, create shareable names and icons for your groups, and leave groups when you're no longer interested in the conversation. Contacts that are eligible for group messages will show a capability icon on their contact image.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏙᎲ ᏗᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᏂᎯ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᏗᏁᎳᏗᏙᎯ, ᎪᏢᏗ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᏚᎾᏙᎥ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎢᎧᏂ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏚᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎬ ᏚᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ Ꮭ ᎦᏅᎯᏓᎨ ᎣᏣᏓᏂᎳᏗᎠ ᎠᏗᎾ ᎠᎾᏟᏃᎮᏍᎬᎢ. ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏣᎦᏓᏂᎸᏨᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏙᏗ Ꭰ ᎢᎬᏩᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎠᏅᏓᏗᏍᏙ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Start typing group name">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Start typing group name</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᎴᎾ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᏚᏅᏙᎥ</term></tig></langSet>
