            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="File transfer paused from : . Time: . .">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>File transfer paused from : . Time: . .</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏗᎲᏍᏗᏱ ᎠᏲᎯᏍᏔᏅ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ : . ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ: . .</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You'll continue to receive messages from this group but won't be notified anymore. This conversation will appear in Spam folder.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You'll continue to receive messages from this group but won't be notified anymore. This conversation will appear in Spam folder.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯᏊᏃ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎯᎠ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᎠᏎᏃ ᏝᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎤᏓᏃᎯᏎᎸ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ. ᎯᎠ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎᏃ ᎬᏂᎨᏒᎢ ᎾᎿ Spam ᏗᏴᏈᏛᎥᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Couldn't send.">
