            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="These new features are available to customers messaging with other Advanced Messaging capable AT&amp;T contacts.If you prefer other people not know when you've read their messages, turn read receipts off in message settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>These new features are available to customers messaging with other Advanced Messaging capable AT&amp;T contacts.If you prefer other people not know when you've read their messages, turn read receipts off in message settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠᏃ ᏗᏤ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏂᏩᏍᎩ ᏓᎾᏓᏙᏪᎳᏁᎲ ᎬᏗ ᏐᎢ Advanced Messaging ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ AT&amp;T ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏟ ᎠᏰᎸᏗ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ Ꮭ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᏒ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏕᏣᎲᎢ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ, ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎠᎩᏒᏅ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎯ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
