            <termEntry id="More than  recipients are only possible if all recipients are Advanced Messaging capable. To continue, select only recipients who are capable of Advanced Messaging as shown in blue dot.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>More than  recipients are only possible if all recipients are Advanced Messaging capable. To continue, select only recipients who are capable of Advanced Messaging as shown in blue dot.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎡᏍᎦᏉ  ᏗᏂᏁᏍᎩ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎤᏅᏒ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗᏉ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᏂᏁᏍᎩ ᎨᏒᎢ Advanced Messaging ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ, ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎤᏅᏒ ᏗᏂᏁᏍᎩ ᎩᎶ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ Advanced Messaging ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᎸ ᎾᎿ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
