            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When a sender's name appears as  instead of  in your messaging app, it means that the name is provided by the sender and that person isn't in your contact list.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When a sender's name appears as  instead of  in your messaging app, it means that the name is provided by the sender and that person isn't in your contact list.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ Ꭰ ᏫᏓᏂᏅᎥᏍᎩ ᏚᏅᏙᎥ ᏂᎬᏩᏍᏓ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ  ᎤᎬᏫᏳᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ  ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏓᎾᏓᏙᏪᎳᏁᎲ ᎬᏙᏗ, ᎾᎿ ᎤᏅᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏥᎩ ᏚᏅᏙᎥ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏛ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏫᎦᏅᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏴᏫ ᏝᏰᏃ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᏅᏅᏛ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
