            <termEntry id="To use Flip for DND, you need to allow Moto Actions and Gestures to modify system settings">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use Flip for DND, you need to allow Moto Actions and Gestures to modify system settings</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎡᏝᏪ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏓ ᏱᏘᎵᏆᏚᎦ, ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ Moto ᎾᎾᏛᏁᎲᎢ ᏃᎴ ᏧᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏃᏢᎯᏐᏗᏱ ᏂᏕᎬᏅᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Pick up the phone to silence the ringer">
