            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please restart your device to apply this important update as soon as possible. If you don't manually restart, your device will automatically restart on .">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Please restart your device to apply this important update as soon as possible. If you don't manually restart, your device will automatically restart on .</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏩᏊ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎲᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏓ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎾᏞᎬᏉ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏱᎬᏩᎵᏍᏙᏗ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏝᏍᏗ ᎣᏩᏌ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎤᎿᎢ .</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You need a data connection to check for updates. To check your Wi-Fi connection, go to Settings &gt; Network &amp; internet &gt; Wi-Fi.You can also visit motorola.com/systemupdates to see other update options.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You need a data connection to check for updates. To check your Wi-Fi connection, go to Settings &gt; Network &amp; internet &gt; Wi-Fi.You can also visit motorola.com/systemupdates to see other update options.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ Ꭰ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏓ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏫᎢ-ᏈᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ, Ꭷ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ &gt; ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ &amp; ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ &gt; ᏫᎢ-ᏈᎢ.ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎠᏩᏛᎯᏓᏍᏗ motorola.com/systemupdates ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏧᎾᏑᏰᏍᏗᏍ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Feature discovery">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Feature discovery</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ ᎠᏩᏛᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When using the Verizon Wireless network, the voice portion of a video call will appear on your bill as mobile-to-mobile voice usage, and the video portion will be billed as data.When Video calling is turned on, others can see that your phone has Video calling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When using the Verizon Wireless network, the voice portion of a video call will appear on your bill as mobile-to-mobile voice usage, and the video portion will be billed as data.When Video calling is turned on, others can see that your phone has Video calling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏥᎩ Verizon Wireless ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ, ᏥᎩ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎢᎦᏛ ᎾᎿ Ꭰ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎬᏂᎨᏒᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏓᏚᎬᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ-ᎾᎿᎢ-ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ, ᏃᎴ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᏛ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏎᎯᎯ ᎢᎦ ᎠᏓᏚᏅᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ.ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎦᏔᎲᏒᏃ ᎠᎢ, ᏐᎢ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᎪᏩᏔ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" added to contacts.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> added to contacts.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎧᏁᏉᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
