            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Conversation deleted. Tap to show a different Messages conversation">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Conversation deleted. Tap to show a different Messages conversation</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ. ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ Ꭰ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
