            <termEntry id="Power sharing lets your phone charge another wireless charging compatible device. Your phone may not be able to charge another device when your battery is low.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Power sharing lets your phone charge another wireless charging compatible device. Your phone may not be able to charge another device when your battery is low.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏄᏟᏂᎬᎬ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᏩᏂᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏄᏓᎴ ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬ ᏗᏙᎵᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎥᏝ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏄᏓᎴ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎡᎳᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Couldn't complete call. Error code 58.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Couldn't complete call. Error code 58.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎥᏝ ᏰᎵᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏛᏃᏅ ᏪᏯᎾ. ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ: 58</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Couldn't complete call. Error code 8.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Couldn't complete call. Error code 8.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎥᏝ ᏰᎵᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏛᏃᏅ ᏪᏯᎾ. ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ: 8</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Enabling Smart SIM means a SIM card will be selected automatically based on the carrier of your contact's phone number. If a SIM of the same carrier is not found, phone learns your usage pattern to choose the best SIM for an outgoing voice call.Smart SIM will use your data connection periodically to determine carrier information for your contact numbers. The data usage may incur additional charges for you from your carrier. Also, we may choose a SIM which is not on the same carrier as your contact since the contact may have ported their number to another carrier before Smart SIM performs its periodic update.Smart SIM doesn't add or change the carrier code (CSP) and doesn't add the DDD when making long distance voice calls. Long distance voice calls are charged based on CSP and charges can vary.Smart SIM uses information about carriers provided by Anatel (National Telecom Agency) and by ABR Telecom, Motorola is not responsible for the accuracy of this information.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Enabling Smart SIM means a SIM card will be selected automatically based on the carrier of your contact's phone number. If a SIM of the same carrier is not found, phone learns your usage pattern to choose the best SIM for an outgoing voice call.Smart SIM will use your data connection periodically to determine carrier information for your contact numbers. The data usage may incur additional charges for you from your carrier. Also, we may choose a SIM which is not on the same carrier as your contact since the contact may have ported their number to another carrier before Smart SIM performs its periodic update.Smart SIM doesn't add or change the carrier code (CSP) and doesn't add the DDD when making long distance voice calls. Long distance voice calls are charged based on CSP and charges can vary.Smart SIM uses information about carriers provided by Anatel (National Telecom Agency) and by ABR Telecom, Motorola is not responsible for the accuracy of this information.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᎵᏊ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏌᏑᏗ SIM ᎤᏅᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Ꭰ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏑᏰᏛ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᏓᎳᏏᏔᏅᎩ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ. ᎾᎿ Ꭰ SIM ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏠᏱ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏩᏛᏓ, ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏣᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ SIM ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Ꭰ ᎤᎵᎶᎲᏍᎩ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏪᏯᎾ.ᎠᏌᏑᏗ SIM ᎠᏎ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎢᏳᏓᎵᏊ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏧᏬᎪᏙᏗ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ. ᏥᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᏛ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏙᏔᏅ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏂᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ. ᎾᏍᏊ, ᎢᏧᎳ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏣᏑᏰᏍᏗ Ꭰ SIM ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏠᏱ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏥᎨᏒ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎤᎭ ᎫᏓᎸᏗ ᏫᎦᏅᎥᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏄᏓᎴ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᏓᎷᎸ ᎠᏌᏑᏗ SIM ᎠᎵᏂᎬᏁᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏱᎪᎯᏓ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅᎯ.ᎠᏌᏑᏗ SIM ᏝᏍ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ (CSP) ᏃᎴ ᏝᏍ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ DDD ᎢᏳᏃ ᎪᏢᏍᎦ ᎤᏓᏅᎯᏓ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂ. ᎤᏓᏅᎯᏓ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎨᎡᎩ ᏗᎬᏩᎶᏔᏅ ᏓᎳᏏᏔᏅᎩ ᎤᎿᎢ CSP ᏃᎴ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏧᏓᎴᎾᎢ.ᎠᏌᏑᏗ SIM ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎢᎸᏨ ᎠᏂᎯᏙᎯ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏛ ᎬᏗ Anatel (ᎠᏰᎵ ᏗᎾᎦᎳᏔᏅ ᏗᏜᏃᎮᏗᏍᎩ ᏗᎦᏘᏲᎢ) ᏃᎴ ᎬᏗ ABR ᏗᎾᎦᎳᏔᏅ ᏗᏜᏃᎮᏗᏍᎩ, Motorola ᎨᎡᎩ ᎥᏝ ᎤᎾᏚᏓᎸ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏥᎩ ᎧᎵᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
