            <termEntry id="Now you can get high quality document scans from your phone. Once you capture the document photo, Camera makes necessary adjustments so you’re ready to share.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Now you can get high quality document scans from your phone. Once you capture the document photo, Camera makes necessary adjustments so you’re ready to share.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏃᏊ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎩ ᎤᏥ ᎢᏲᏍᏓ ᏃᏌᏅᏱ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᏱᎦᏂᏴᎭ Ꮎ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ, ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏕᎪᏒᏍᎦ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏫᏗᎧᎲᎦ,ᎢᏳᏃ ᏣᏛᏅᏍᏔᏅ ᏱᎦ ᏣᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dual capture mode lets you capture photos and videos with your selfie and rear cameras simultaneously.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dual capture mode lets you capture photos and videos with your selfie and rear cameras simultaneously.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏐᏯ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᎬᏙᏗᎭ ᏣᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏂᎯ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᏓᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎤᏐᏯᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎣᏩᏒ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏃᎴ ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ᏧᏓᏥᎶᏍᏙᏗ ᎡᏧᎳᎭ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Photo modes">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Photo modes</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏗᎬᏙᏗᎭ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Cinemagraph mode lets you create artistic photos in motion. Take a short video, highlight the area you want to keep in motion, and share an animated GIF with friends.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Cinemagraph mode lets you create artistic photos in motion. Take a short video, highlight the area you want to keep in motion, and share an animated GIF with friends.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏍᏆᎳ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏣᎦᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎪ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ. ᎯᎩ ᏍᏆᎳ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ, ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ Ꮎ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏣᏚᎵᏍᎬᎢ ᏣᎬᎵᏗᎩ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᎠᏯᏙᎸ ᎬᏃᏓᏳᏍᏗ GIF ᎬᏗ ᏦᎵᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make your photos pop with Spot Color. Pick a color on your photo and turn everything else black &amp; white.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make your photos pop with Spot Color. Pick a color on your photo and turn everything else black &amp; white.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏒᏗ ᏣᏤᏁ ᏓᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎠᏔᏍᎩ ᎤᏐᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᏓᏓᎸ ᎠᏑᏫᏓ. ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏑᏫᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏃᎴ ᏘᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ ᏄᏓᎴᏒᎢ ᏧᏓᎴᏅᏓ ᎬᎿᎨ &amp; ᎤᏁᎦ ᏂᏛᎦ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
