                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Help improve Motorola products</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᎪᏒᎯᏐᏗ Motorola ᏗᎪᏒᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
