            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Optimized charging helps your battery stay healthy over time.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Optimized charging helps your battery stay healthy over time.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏩᎧᎵᏏᏌᏅ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᏓᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎪ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎡᏙᎮᏍᏗ ᏙᎯ ᎢᏴᏛ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Attentive Display requires permission to prevent your screen from dimming or going to sleep.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Attentive Display requires permission to prevent your screen from dimming or going to sleep.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏌᏪᏐᎸᏍᏓᏊ ᏂᎪᏩᏛᎾ ᏱᎩ ᎠᏎᏳᎾᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏲᏍᏙᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎯᏍᎪᎸᏓ ᎠᎵ ᏓᏰᏏ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏟᏔᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Vibrate when flashlight turns on/off">
