            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Overcharge protection keeps your battery healthy by limiting charging to  when your device has been plugged in continuously for 3 days.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Overcharge protection keeps your battery healthy by limiting charging to  when your device has been plugged in continuously for 3 days.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ ᏗᎬᏩᎶᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏙᎯ ᎬᏗ ᏳᏰᏅ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ  ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏓ ᎤᏊᏄᎾᏘ ᎾᎿ ᏫᎬᎵᏱᎵᏒᏊ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ 3 ᏧᏒᎯᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Optimized charging helps your battery stay healthy by reducing the amount of time spent charging over .">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Optimized charging helps your battery stay healthy by reducing the amount of time spent charging over .</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏩᎧᎵᏏᏌᏅ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᏓᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎪ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎡᏙᎮᏍᏗ ᏙᎯ ᎬᏗ ᎠᎦᏲᎳᎨᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᎿ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒ ᎤᏂᏩᏒᎢ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎢᏴᏛ .</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Hold your phone and twist your wrist twice like you're turning a doorknob">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Hold your phone and twist your wrist twice like you're turning a doorknob</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎾᎯᏍᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏓᏄᏖᏲᎭ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏯᏌᏝ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᎫᏗ ᏣᎸᏉᏛ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᎬ Ꭰ ᏍᏚᏗ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Overcharging your device can shorten the lifespan of your battery.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Overcharging your device can shorten the lifespan of your battery.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ ᏗᎬᏩᎶᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏗᏍᏆᎶᏗ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏗᏍᏆᎶᏗ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᎴᏂᏙᎲᎢ ᏫᎬᏍᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Overcharging your battery causes strain that can shorten its lifespan.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Overcharging your battery causes strain that can shorten its lifespan.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ ᏗᎬᏩᎶᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏂᏗᎬᏂᏏᏍᎩ ᎦᏅᏐᎸᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏗᏍᏆᎶᏗ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᎴᏂᏙᎲᎢ ᏫᎬᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="While your device is charging, you can press the power key to see the lights show your battery level">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>While your device is charging, you can press the power key to see the lights show your battery level</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏏᏉ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᏥᎩ ᎤᎵᏂᎩᏗᏳ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏓᏨᏍᏛ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᏟᏂᎬᎬ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
