            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Keep your finger on the screen until you complete the gesture.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Keep your finger on the screen until you complete the gesture.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎧᎵᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏧᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Swipe your finger from left to right and back again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Swipe your finger from left to right and back again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎠᏍᎦᏂᏗᏟ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏨᏍᏗᎢ ᏏᏯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Now you can easily switch between tracks when you're listening to music with the screen off">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Now you can easily switch between tracks when you're listening to music with the screen off</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꭷ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᎯᏓ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᏟ ᎤᏔᏏᏄᏱ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎧᏃᎩᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Share Debugging Data">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Share Debugging Data</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᎪᎷᏩᏘᏍᎬ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To keep your battery healthy and prevent long-term overcharging (the amount of time spent charging between  and ) charging is limited to  until your device is unplugged.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To keep your battery healthy and prevent long-term overcharging (the amount of time spent charging between  and ) charging is limited to  until your device is unplugged.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏙᎯ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗ ᎪᎯᏓ-ᎦᎬᎢ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ ᏗᎬᏩᎶᏙᏗ (ᏥᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒ ᎤᏂᏩᏒᎢ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎠᏰᏟ  ᎠᎴ ) ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏩᏎᏢᏊ ᎾᎿᎢ  ᎩᎳ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎫᏓᎴᏍᎪ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Turn on Do Not Disturb by turning the phone face down.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Turn on Do Not Disturb by turning the phone face down.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᏞᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᎬ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎡᎳᏗ ᏭᎧᏔ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tap to turn off the flashlight.">
