            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This one-time step will ensure Messages will deliver your group messages properly.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This one-time step will ensure Messages will deliver your group messages properly.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᏌᏊ-ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒ ᎠᎳᏏᏗ ᎠᏎᎢ ᏦᎯᏳᏙᏗᏊ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎦᏅᏁᏗ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏗᏙᎳᏤᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Create a new message. Only recipient can be Emergency Number.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Create a new message. Only recipient can be Emergency Number.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏢᏗ Ꭰ ᏗᏤ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎯ. ᎤᏅᏒ ᏗᎦᏁᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
