            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Monitor the number of incorrect passwords typed when unlocking the screen, and lock the tablet or erase all the tablet's data if too many incorrect passwords are typed.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Monitor the number of incorrect passwords typed when unlocking the screen, and lock the tablet or erase all the tablet's data if too many incorrect passwords are typed.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏴᎵᏛᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏱᏗᎦᏪᏍᏗ ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎶᏙᏗᎢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎪᏪᎶᏙᏗᎢ ᎤᏤᎵ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᏳᏃ ᎤᎪᏗᏗ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏱᏗᎦᏪᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏔᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allows the app to modify the data about your contacts stored on your tablet. This permission allows apps to delete contact data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allows the app to modify the data about your contacts stored on your tablet. This permission allows apps to delete contact data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎲ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏍᏆᎳ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎢᎸᏨ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᎯᎠ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎲ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
