            <termEntry id="Install the voice data required for speech synthesis">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Install the voice data required for speech synthesis</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏘᏅᏛᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᏁᏨᎯ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏎᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎦᏬᏂᏍᎬ ᏧᏓᎴᏅᏓ ᎬᏩᏃᏍᏓ ᏱᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To change the order of the tiles, open quick settings on the internal display and tap on the pencil icon.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To change the order of the tiles, open quick settings on the internal display and tap on the pencil icon.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏁᎳᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏓᏲᏓᏅᏗ, ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can share this device with other people by creating additional users. Each user has their own space, which they can customize with apps, wallpaper, and so on. Users can also adjust device settings like Wi\u2011Fi that affect everyone.When you add a new user, that person needs to set up their space.Any user can update apps for all other users. Accessibility settings and services may not transfer to the new user.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can share this device with other people by creating additional users. Each user has their own space, which they can customize with apps, wallpaper, and so on. Users can also adjust device settings like Wi\u2011Fi that affect everyone.When you add a new user, that person needs to set up their space.Any user can update apps for all other users. Accessibility settings and services may not transfer to the new user.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>YᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏂᏐᎢ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ Ꮕ ᏂᏚᏅᏅ ᎪᏢᏍᎬᎢ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏙᏔᏅ ᏗᏅᏗᏍᎩ. ᏧᏤᎵᏛ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᎭ ᎤᏅᏌ ᎤᏜᏅᏛᎯ, ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎧᏑᎧᏡ ᎪᏪᎵ, ᏃᎴ ᏅᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ. ᏗᏅᏗᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎢᏳᏍᏘ Wi\u2011Fi ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᎠᏕᏯᏙᏗ ᏂᎦᏗᏳ.ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏗᏤ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ, ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᎤᏚᎸᏗ ᏄᎾᏛᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏘᎧᎲᎦ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ.ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏐᎢ ᏗᏅᏗᏍᎩ. ᎬᏴᏍᏗᎨᏒ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏗᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎭᏗ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᏤ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
