            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your device is unlocked and can support any SIM">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your device is unlocked and can support any SIM</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏲᎵᏯ ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏛᏁᎭ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ SIM</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Privacy Alert:If you use a 3rd party app, it may directly collect your personal information or require your carrier to disclose your personal information, including location information (where applicable), to the app provider or some other 3rd party.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Privacy Alert:If you use a 3rd party app, it may directly collect your personal information or require your carrier to disclose your personal information, including location information (where applicable), to the app provider or some other 3rd party.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏔᎲᏍᎩ:ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Ꭰ 3rd ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ, ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏓᏎᎮᎸᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏎᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏚᏕᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ (ᎭᏢᏃ ᏗᏓᏂᎸᎩ), ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏐᎢ 3rd ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" Please contact Sprint to unlock your device to support a different UICC if needed">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> Please contact Sprint to unlock your device to support a different UICC if needed</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ Sprint ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏛᏁᎭ Ꭰ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ UICC ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏚᎸᏛ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
