                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ Ꭰ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏁᏟᏗᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏎᏳᎾᏛᏁᏗ Ꭰ ᏥᎯᎧᎲᎦ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Would you like to reset the device?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Would you like to reset the device?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏯᏓᎯᏗᏏ ᏂᎯ ᎯᎸᏉᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Separately, if you have questions about your carrier's Privacy Policy, please visit your carrier's homepage and click on the &quot;Privacy Policy&quot; link.">
