                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="After youre done setting up your device, enroll in the My Verizon app to get started.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>After youre done setting up your device, enroll in the My Verizon app to get started.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎶᏐᏅ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏛᎯ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᏚᏙᎥ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ My Verizon ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏔᏅᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It's fast, easy with no fee to join.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>It's fast, easy with no fee to join.</term></tig></langSet>
