            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This program customizes your experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This program customizes your experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎤᎾᏙᏢᏒ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" By combining information we have about you, such as your web browsing, app usage, device location, and use of Verizon services, with Oath information.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> By combining information we have about you, such as your web browsing, app usage, device location, and use of Verizon services, with Oath information.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎬᏗ ᏓᎵᎪᏗᏍᎬ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎠᏴ ᎤᎭ ᎢᎸᏢ ᏂᎯ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏂᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎩᏲᎲ, ᎬᏙᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ, ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ Verizon ᎢᏗᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ, ᎬᏗ ᎠᏎᎵᏛᏍᎬ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
