            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow Digital Secure to access your mobile number to confirm eligibility and your photos, media and other storage on your device to scan for viruses and other malware.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow Digital Secure to access your mobile number to confirm eligibility and your photos, media and other storage on your device to scan for viruses and other malware.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏦᎯᏳᏙᏗ ᏗᎨᎦᏓᏂᎸᏨᎯ ᎠᎴ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ, ᎦᎶᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏨᏳᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏐᎢ ᎤᏲ ᎠᎯᎵᏙᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can manage these permissions any time from your device Settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can manage these permissions any time from your device Settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠᏃ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎢᎸᎯᏳ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Let Verizon collect information about the apps on your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Let Verizon collect information about the apps on your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏩᏂᎩ Verizon ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎢᎸᏢ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="With this info, we can troubleshoot more quickly when you call us for support.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>With this info, we can troubleshoot more quickly when you call us for support.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᎠᎢ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎣᏍᏓᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎠᏓᏃᎯᏎᎭ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏟᏍᏓᏬ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎢᎩᎪᏓ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏛᏁᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This helps us find and fix network issues and optimize your services.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This helps us find and fix network issues and optimize your services.</term></tig></langSet>
