            <termEntry id=" Verizon Selects will help make the promotions, offers, and ads you see across the devices you use match your interests better.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> Verizon Selects will help make the promotions, offers, and ads you see across the devices you use match your interests better.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> Verizon Selects ᎠᏎ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ ᎪᏢᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎾᏓᏌᎳᏗᏍᎩ, ᎠᏂᏍᎪᎸᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏕᎦᏃᏣᎸ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏗᎦᎾᏗᏫᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏂᎯ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏗᏙᎵᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅ ᏓᏤᎳ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow Digital Secure to access your photos, media, files, text messages and location in order to check for harmful files.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow Digital Secure to access your photos, media, files, text messages and location in order to check for harmful files.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ, ᎦᎶᏙᏗ, ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ, ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏓᏅᏍᏗ to ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏓ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᏐᏅ ᏯᏓᏛᏁᎯ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
