            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To turn on Adaptive performance, Moto needs permission to access your app usage so it can learn your usage patterns. Adaptive performance collects this data at appropriate times and only stores the information on your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To turn on Adaptive performance, Moto needs permission to access your app usage so it can learn your usage patterns. Adaptive performance collects this data at appropriate times and only stores the information on your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎯ, Moto ᏚᏚᎸᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ. ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎯ ᏗᎦᏟᏌᏅᎩ ᎯᎠ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏓᏟᎢᎵᏒ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏛ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your Phone will try again when you restart.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your Phone will try again when you restart.</term></tig></langSet>
