            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, Voicemail won’t work unless you allow the app to access the following information on your phone:PhoneRequired so Voicemail can identify your account and so you can reply to a voicemail with a call.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, Voicemail won’t work unless you allow the app to access the following information on your phone:PhoneRequired so Voicemail can identify your account and so you can reply to a voicemail with a call.</term></tig></langSet>
