            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In case still can't find your phone, Use your Moto camera scan the QR code">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In case still can't find your phone, Use your Moto camera scan the QR code</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᎢᎸᎯᏳ ᏏᏃ ᏝᏰᎵ ᏂᏩᏘᏍᎬᎾ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗᎢ, ᎬᏙᏓ ᏣᏤᎵ Moto ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ QR ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Choose the connection you prefer when outside the Xfinity Mobile network (Wi-Fi or Cellular)">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Choose the connection you prefer when outside the Xfinity Mobile network (Wi-Fi or Cellular)</term></tig></langSet>
