            <termEntry id="In the future, if you want to use Wi-Fi for Voice Calling you can turn on Wi-Fi Calling by going to Call settings menu or Mobile network settings menu.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In the future, if you want to use Wi-Fi for Voice Calling you can turn on Wi-Fi Calling by going to Call settings menu or Mobile network settings menu.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏩᎫᏗᏗᏒ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Wi-Fi ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏰᏏ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏫᎬᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Choose the kind of network you prefer for making and receiving calls when you're outside your Home network and other networks are available.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Choose the kind of network you prefer for making and receiving calls when you're outside your Home network and other networks are available.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏂᎯ ᏫᏟ ᎬᏰᎸᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎪᏢᏍᎦ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎩᏍᎬᎢ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏙᏯᏗᏢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎣᏪᏅᏒ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᎴ ᏐᎢ ᏚᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ.</term></tig></langSet>
