            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your phone's Video Calling function won't work when mobile data is off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your phone's Video Calling function won't work when mobile data is off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗᏱ ᏝᏍᏗ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Also, you won't be able to use the Internet, Email or other apps that need a data connection unless you use Wi-Fi.">
