            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The user currently signed in to this device can't turn on USB debugging. To use this feature, switch to the primary user.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The user currently signed in to this device can't turn on USB debugging. To use this feature, switch to the primary user.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᏚᏙᎥ ᎪᏪᎸᎦ ᎤᎿ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ USB ᎯᏩᏔ. To ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ, ᎥᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
