            <termEntry id="This app is displaying over other apps on your screen and using the microphone and camera.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This app is displaying over other apps on your screen and using the microphone and camera.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏁᎨᏒ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭ ᎠᏓᏬᎯᎳᏗᏍᎬ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏥᎩ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
