            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="While recording, Android System can capture any sensitive information that\u2019s visible on your screen or played on your device. This includes passwords, payment info, photos, messages, and audio.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>While recording, Android System can capture any sensitive information that\u2019s visible on your screen or played on your device. This includes passwords, payment info, photos, messages, and audio.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎦᏂᏴᎲᎢ, Android ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎤᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏌᏘ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎬᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎾᏛᏁᎸᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎯᎠ ᏚᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ, ᎠᏈᏴᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ, ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can't charge via USB. Use the charger that came with your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can't charge via USB. Use the charger that came with your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿ ᎢᏗᏨ USB. ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᎷᏨ ᎬᏐ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This device belongs to your organization.Your IT admin can monitor and manage settings, corporate access, apps, data associated with your device, and your device's location information.For more information, contact your IT admin.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This device belongs to your organization.Your IT admin can monitor and manage settings, corporate access, apps, data associated with your device, and your device's location information.For more information, contact your IT admin.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏓᏤᎵᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎢᏣᏙᏢᏒᎢ.ᏂᏨᎤᎢ IT ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏓᏴᎵᏛᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎤᎾᏙᏢᏒ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏚᎵᎪᏒᎢ ᎬᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᏃᎴ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ.ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ IT ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
