            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This program customizes your experience. By combining information we have about you, such as your web browsing, app usage, device location, and use of Verizon services, with Oath information.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This program customizes your experience. By combining information we have about you, such as your web browsing, app usage, device location, and use of Verizon services, with Oath information.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎤᎾᏙᏢᏒ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ. ᎬᏗ ᏓᎵᎪᏗᏍᎬ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎠᏴ ᎤᎭ ᎢᎸᏨ ᏂᎯ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏂᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎩᏲᎲ, ᎬᏙᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ, ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ Verizon ᎢᏗᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ, ᎬᏗ ᎠᏎᎵᏛᏍᎬ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow Digital Secure to access your mobile number to confirm eligibility and your photos, media and other storage on your device to scan for viruses and other malware. You can manage these permissions any time from your device Settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow Digital Secure to access your mobile number to confirm eligibility and your photos, media and other storage on your device to scan for viruses and other malware. You can manage these permissions any time from your device Settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏦᎯᏳᏙᏗ ᏗᎨᎦᏓᏂᎸᏨᎯ ᏃᎴ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ, ᎦᎶᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏨᏳᎩ ᏃᎴ ᏐᎢ ᎤᏲ ᎠᎯᎵᏙᎯ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠᏃ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎢᎸᎯᏳ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, Voicemail won’t work unless you allow the app to access the following information on your phone:PhoneRequired so Voicemail can identify your account and so you can reply to a voicemail with a call.SMSRequired for Voicemail to communicate with Verizon.ContactsRequired so Voicemail can identify callers and so you can create caller groups.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, Voicemail won’t work unless you allow the app to access the following information on your phone:PhoneRequired so Voicemail can identify your account and so you can reply to a voicemail with a call.SMSRequired for Voicemail to communicate with Verizon.ContactsRequired so Voicemail can identify callers and so you can create caller groups.</term></tig></langSet>
