            <termEntry id="With Visual Voicemail there is no more dialing to check messages! Instead, you see a list of your voicemail messages and can manage them directly from your phone. You can listen to your messages in any order and delete messages without having to listen to instructions.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>With Visual Voicemail there is no more dialing to check messages! Instead, you see a list of your voicemail messages and can manage them directly from your phone. You can listen to your messages in any order and delete messages without having to listen to instructions.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᎧᏁᎬ ᏓᎭᎢ ᎭᏗ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏓ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ! ᎤᎬᏫᏳᏎᏍᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᎯᎪᏩᏔ Ꭰ ᏓᏎᏍᏛᎢ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎠᎵ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎠᏓᏎᎮᎸᎢ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎭᏛᏓᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᏓᏅᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎬᎾ ᎤᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎭᏛᏓᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏓᏕᏲᎲᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can't Connect to Your Voice Mailbox">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can't Connect to Your Voice Mailbox</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎱᏓᎸᎥᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎪᏪᎵᎧᏁᏌ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tap Continue below, then tap Allow on the following screen(s) so we can open Voicemail.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tap Continue below, then tap Allow on the following screen(s) so we can open Voicemail.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎡᎳᏗᏨ, ᎾᏉᏃ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏓ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏓᏛ ᎠᏴ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎤᏁᎬ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Saving a message locally will delete the message from the server.Locally saved messages will be removed on factory reset or when app data is cleared.Do you want to proceed?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Saving a message locally will delete the message from the server.Locally saved messages will be removed on factory reset or when app data is cleared.Do you want to proceed?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏗᎭ Ꭰ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎯ ᎡᏍᎦᏂᎨᏍᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᎯ.ᎡᏍᎦᏂᎨᏍᏗ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏔᏅᎢ ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᎲᏍᏓ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᏥᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛ.ᏣᏚᎵᎭᏍ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Premium Visual Voicemail provides features such as Caller Dependent Greetings, Voicemail to Text which converts your messages to text so you can discreetly read your voicemails without listening to them and a bigger inbox to hold more messages.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Premium Visual Voicemail provides features such as Caller Dependent Greetings, Voicemail to Text which converts your messages to text so you can discreetly read your voicemails without listening to them and a bigger inbox to hold more messages.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᎧᏁᎬ ᏓᎾᏓᏁᏢᏍᎬ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏍᎦᏍᏙᏗ ᎨᏥᏲᎵᏍᏗᏱ, ᎤᏁᎬ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏓᏛ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᎵᏏᎾᎯᏍᏗᏱ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏁᎬ ᎾᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎬᎾ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᏃᎴ Ꭰ ᎤᏔᏂᏗ ᏂᎬᏅ ᎧᏁᏌᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Caller Dependent Greetings allow you to create personal greetings for a caller or a group of callers.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Caller Dependent Greetings allow you to create personal greetings for a caller or a group of callers.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏰᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏍᎦᏍᏙᏗ ᎨᏥᏲᎵᏍᏗᏱ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᎠᏏᏴᏫ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Ꭰ ᎠᏰᎵᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ Ꭰ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏰᎵᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Enhance your experience with Premium Visual Voicemail">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Enhance your experience with Premium Visual Voicemail</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᏤᎴᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᎤᏁᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Voicemail can’t save your voicemails without permission to access information stored on your phone.To give permission, go to Settings. Then turn on Storage.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Voicemail can’t save your voicemails without permission to access information stored on your phone.To give permission, go to Settings. Then turn on Storage.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏁᎬ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎭᎵᏏᏅᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏁᎬ ᎾᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎬᎾ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏩᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᏧᏁᏗᏱ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ, Ꭷ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If your voice mailbox is full, last 5 messages shall be deleted and moved to Saved Voicemail folder.Locally saved messages will be removed on factory reset or when app data is cleared.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If your voice mailbox is full, last 5 messages shall be deleted and moved to Saved Voicemail folder.Locally saved messages will be removed on factory reset or when app data is cleared.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏁᎬ ᎪᏪᎵᎧᏁᏌ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏧᎧᎵᏨᎯ, ᎣᏂ 5 ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎤᏙᎯᏳᏒ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏂᎲᎠ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏗᏴᏈᏛᎥᏍᎩ.ᎡᏍᎦᏂᎨᏍᏗ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏔᏅᎢ ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᎲᏍᏓ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᏥᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="About">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>About</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᎸᏨ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, we're not able to connect to your voice mailbox at this time. Please try again later.If there is still a problem, please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is .">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, we're not able to connect to your voice mailbox at this time. Please try again later.If there is still a problem, please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is .</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎤᏰᎸᏅ, ᎢᏗ ᎥᏝ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎱᏓᎸᎥᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎪᏪᎵᎧᏁᏌ ᎾᏊᎨᏒ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᏏᏊ ᎪᎯᏴ ᎯᎭᏁᎵᏔᏅᎢ.ᎢᏳᏃ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏏᏉ Ꭰ ᏓᏓᎴᎬ, ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ Customer Service ᎤᎿᎢ  ᏃᎴ ᎤᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="New voicemails are not downloaded due to data connectivity failure.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>New voicemails are not downloaded due to data connectivity failure.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏤ ᎤᏁᎬ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎥᏝ ᎡᎳᏗᎬᏘ ᏫᎦᏢᏅᎯ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᏗᏍᏗ ᎢᏴᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏗᎫᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᎤᏄᎸᎲᎦ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please enter a password that doesn't have 3 or more consecutive digits (e.g. 1234, 4321)">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Please enter a password that doesn't have 3 or more consecutive digits (e.g. 1234, 4321)</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ Ꭰ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏝᏍᏗ ᎤᎭ 3 ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ (e.g. 1234, 4321)</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Voicemail can’t record your greetings without permission to record audio.To give permission, go to Settings. Then turn on Microphone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Voicemail can’t record your greetings without permission to record audio.To give permission, go to Settings. Then turn on Microphone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏁᎬ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᏕᎦᏅᏅᏛᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎨᏥᏲᎵᏍᏗᏱ ᎾᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎬᎾ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᏅᏅᏛᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ.To ᏧᏁᏗᏱ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ, Ꭷ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your free trial has ended and you now have Basic Visual Voicemail.If you have more than 20 messages in your voice mailbox, no new messages can be left for you. But don't worry—all the messages you have now will be saved. Save or delete some messages so you have fewer than 20 to make room for new ones.Or subscribe to Premium to keep your larger inbox.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your free trial has ended and you now have Basic Visual Voicemail.If you have more than 20 messages in your voice mailbox, no new messages can be left for you. But don't worry—all the messages you have now will be saved. Save or delete some messages so you have fewer than 20 to make room for new ones.Or subscribe to Premium to keep your larger inbox.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏎᏊᎢ ᎠᏓᎪᎵᏰᏍᎬ ᎤᎭ ᎤᎴᏫᏍᏔᏅ ᏃᎴ ᏂᎯ Ꭷ ᎤᎭ ᏂᎬᏩᏍᏛᏊ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᎤᏁᎬ.ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎡᏍᎦᏉ 20 ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏁᎬ ᎪᏪᎵᎧᏁᏌ, ᎭᏗ ᏗᏤ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᎦᏍᎦᏂ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏂᎯ. ᎠᏎᏃ ᏤᏍᏗ ᏱᏤᎵᎯᏍᎨᏍᏗ—ᏂᎦᏓ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ Ꭷ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏔᏅᎢ. ᎭᎵᏏᏅᏓ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏓᏛ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎦᏲᎳᎨᏍᏗ ᎡᏍᎦᏉ 20 ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᎧᏅᏑᎸ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏗᏤ ᏌᏇ.ᎠᎴ ᏔᏓᏅᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎡᏉᎯᎨᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎬᏅ ᎧᏁᏌᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Verizon provisioning service needs permission to access some things in your device. Select Permissions in App info to enable them.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Verizon provisioning service needs permission to access some things in your device. Select Permissions in App info to enable them.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Verizon ᎤᎾᎵᏍᏕᎸᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᏚᎸᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏧᏓᎴᏅᏛ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎯᏑᏰᎦ "ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎵᏗᏍᎩ" ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎣᏃᎮᏎᏱ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎵᏗᏍᎩ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Verizon provisioning service needs permissions to read your device configuration.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Verizon provisioning service needs permissions to read your device configuration.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Verizoon ᎤᎾᎵᏍᏕᎸᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᏚᎸᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎪᏢᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your call will not be able to be completed.In the future if you would like to use Wi-Fi for Voice calling you can go to Call settings menu or Mobile network settings menu to turn it on.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your call will not be able to be completed.In the future if you would like to use Wi-Fi for Voice calling you can go to Call settings menu or Mobile network settings menu to turn it on.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎥᏝ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏙᎾ.ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏩᎫᏗᏗᏒ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᏯᏓᎯᏗᏏ ᏣᎸᏉᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Wi-Fi ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ Ꭷ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏫᎬᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎤᎿᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you turn off Wi-Fi Calling, all your future calls will go over the mobile network. If the mobile network isn't available, you may not be able to make calls.In the future, if you want to use Wi-Fi for Voice Calling you can turn on Wi-Fi Calling by going to Call settings menu or Mobile network settings menu.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you turn off Wi-Fi Calling, all your future calls will go over the mobile network. If the mobile network isn't available, you may not be able to make calls.In the future, if you want to use Wi-Fi for Voice Calling you can turn on Wi-Fi Calling by going to Call settings menu or Mobile network settings menu.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ, ᏂᎦᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏩᎫᏗᏗᏒ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎠᏎ ᎮᎾ ᎢᏴᏛ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ. ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎥᏝ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ.ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏩᎫᏗᏗᏒ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Wi-Fi ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏰᏏ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏫᎬᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Wi-Fi Calling lets you make calls using Wi-Fi when the mobile network is not available.To set up Wi-Fi Calling you will need to enter a US address. This address will be used by emergency services as your location if you make an emergency \(E911\) call over Wi-Fi from this phone within the US.We recommend you change this address when you make calls using a different Wi-Fi network so your location information is accurate. You can change your location any time by going to Wi-Fi Calling in the Call settings menu or Mobile network settings menu.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wi-Fi Calling lets you make calls using Wi-Fi when the mobile network is not available.To set up Wi-Fi Calling you will need to enter a US address. This address will be used by emergency services as your location if you make an emergency \(E911\) call over Wi-Fi from this phone within the US.We recommend you change this address when you make calls using a different Wi-Fi network so your location information is accurate. You can change your location any time by going to Wi-Fi Calling in the Call settings menu or Mobile network settings menu.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏗᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎬᏗᎭ Wi-Fi ᎢᏳᏃ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ Ꭰ US ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ. ᎯᎠ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎬᏔᏅᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎢᏗᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ Ꭰ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ \(E911\) ᏪᏯᎾ ᎢᏴᏛ Wi-Fi ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎯᎠ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏫᏂᏗᏢ ᏥᎩ US.ᎠᏴ ᎦᎸᏉᏗᎭ ᏂᎯ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎯᎠ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎬᏗᎭ Ꭰ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ Wi-Fi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏓᏛ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎢᎸᎯᏳ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏰᏏ ᎾᎿᎢ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Mobile data is unavailable while on this call. Apps like email, Internet and social networking will work if you connect to Wi-Fi.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Mobile data is unavailable while on this call. Apps like email, Internet and social networking will work if you connect to Wi-Fi.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎭᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎭᏗ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᏱᎩ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏪᏯᎾ. ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎢᏳᏍᏘ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ, ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎾᏓᏟᏏᏍᎬ ᏓᎾᏚᏓᎸᏍᎬ ᎠᏎ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ to Wi-Fi.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Deny data roaming access for this trip">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Deny data roaming access for this trip</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏆᏓᏱᎸᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎡᏙᎵᏙᎲ ᏩᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏁᎳᏗᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your phone's Video Calling function won't work when mobile data is off. Also, you won't be able to use the Internet, Email or other apps that need a data connection unless you use Wi-Fi.Turn off the mobile data connection?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your phone's Video Calling function won't work when mobile data is off. Also, you won't be able to use the Internet, Email or other apps that need a data connection unless you use Wi-Fi.Turn off the mobile data connection?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗᏱ ᏝᏍᏗ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ. ᎾᏍᏉ, ᏂᎯ ᏝᏰᏍ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ, ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ, ᏃᎴ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ Ꭰ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎢᏳᏍᎩᏂ ᏂᎯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Wi-Fi.ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Mobile Data Not Available">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Mobile Data Not Available</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
