            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Time">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Time</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Wi-Fi Calling lets you make calls using Wi-Fi when the mobile network is unavailable. To turn it on, confirm or change the U.S. address where you want emergency responders sent if you call 911, and accept the Terms and Conditions below. It is very important that you update your 911 address (which can be done at any time through your device settings) whenever you change your location, since this is the location that will be given to emergency services when you dial 911.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wi-Fi Calling lets you make calls using Wi-Fi when the mobile network is unavailable. To turn it on, confirm or change the U.S. address where you want emergency responders sent if you call 911, and accept the Terms and Conditions below. It is very important that you update your 911 address (which can be done at any time through your device settings) whenever you change your location, since this is the location that will be given to emergency services when you dial 911.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏗᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎬᏗᎭ Wi-Fi ᎢᏳᏃ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎭᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎭᏗ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᏱᎩ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ, ᏦᎯᏳᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᏥᎩ U.S. ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎭᏢᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎵᎭ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏬᎯᎵᏴᏍᏗ ᏭᏅᏅᎢ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᏪᏯᎾ 911, ᏃᎴ ᏗᏓᏂᎸᎢᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏓᏁᏤᎸ ᏃᎴ ᏂᏚᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᏨ. ᎾᎿ ᎰᎡᎢ ᎤᏣᏘ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏓ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎯ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ 911 ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ (ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏗᏍᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎢᎸᎯᏳ ᏭᎵᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ) ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᏥᎨᏒ ᎯᎠ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎡᏥᏁᎸᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎢᏗᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏗᏍᎩ 911.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We could not find the address that you entered:">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We could not find the address that you entered:</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎯᏩᏔ ᏥᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ:</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The city, state, or zip code that you entered may not be correct.Please check the address and try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The city, state, or zip code that you entered may not be correct.Please check the address and try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎦᏚᎲ, ᎧᏃᎮᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏧᎦᏄᏱ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎥᏝ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᎢ.ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏫᏗᎦᏅᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Mobile Hotspot uses your mobile data connection. Your Wi-Fi connection will be turned off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Mobile Hotspot uses your mobile data connection. Your Wi-Fi connection will be turned off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Mobile Hotspot ᏗᏅᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎱᏓᎸᎦ. ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Wi-Fi ᎱᏓᎸᎦ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏭᎪᎸᏍᏔᏁᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Call not connected">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Call not connected</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏫᎬᏔᏅ ᎭᏗ ᏱᏣᏚᏓᎵ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Unable to activate Wi-Fi calling at this time.Please try again later.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Unable to activate Wi-Fi calling at this time.Please try again later.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎩ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ.ᎰᏩᏊ ᏏᏊ ᎪᎯᏴ ᎯᎭᏁᎵᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We could not find the address that you entered because the street address could not be found, or the city, state, and zip code may not be correct.If your city, state, and zip are not correct tap Edit, otherwise tap Save Anyway.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We could not find the address that you entered because the street address could not be found, or the city, state, and zip code may not be correct.If your city, state, and zip are not correct tap Edit, otherwise tap Save Anyway.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎠᏩᏛᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬᏃ ᏥᎩ ᎦᎳᏅᏛᎢ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ be ᎠᏩᏛᏓ, ᏃᎴ ᏥᎩ ᎦᏚᎲ, ᎧᏃᎮᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏫᎦᏅᏗ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎥᏝ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᎢ.ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏚᎲ, ᎧᏃᎮᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᎯᎧᏁᎦ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎥᏝ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᎢ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᎪᏪᎸ, ᎢᏳᏃ ᏰᎵ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎭᎵᏏᏅᏓ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏉ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Wi-Fi Calling lets you make calls using Wi-Fi when the mobile network is not available.To set up Wi-Fi Calling you will need to enter a US address. This address will be used by emergency services as your location if you make an emergency \(E911\) call over Wi-Fi from this phone within the US.We recommend you change this address when you make calls using a different Wi-Fi network so your location information is accurate. You can change your location any time by going to Wi-Fi Calling in the Call settings menu.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wi-Fi Calling lets you make calls using Wi-Fi when the mobile network is not available.To set up Wi-Fi Calling you will need to enter a US address. This address will be used by emergency services as your location if you make an emergency \(E911\) call over Wi-Fi from this phone within the US.We recommend you change this address when you make calls using a different Wi-Fi network so your location information is accurate. You can change your location any time by going to Wi-Fi Calling in the Call settings menu.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏗᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎬᏗᎭ Wi-Fi ᎢᏳᏃ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ Ꭰ US ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ. ᎯᎠ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎬᏔᏅᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎢᏗᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ Ꭰ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ \(E911\) ᏪᏯᎾ ᎢᏴᏛ Wi-Fi ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎯᎠ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏫᏂᏗᏢ ᏥᎩ US.ᎠᏴ ᎦᎸᏉᏗᎭ ᏂᎯ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎯᎠ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎬᏗᎭ Ꭰ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ Wi-Fi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏓᏛ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎢᎸᎯᏳ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏰᏏ ᎾᎿᎢ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Address couldn't be updated">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Address couldn't be updated</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you turn off Wi-Fi Calling, all your future calls will go over the mobile network. If the mobile network isn't available, you may not be able to make calls.In the future, if you want to use Wi-Fi for Voice Calling you can turn on Wi-Fi Calling by going to Call settings menu.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you turn off Wi-Fi Calling, all your future calls will go over the mobile network. If the mobile network isn't available, you may not be able to make calls.In the future, if you want to use Wi-Fi for Voice Calling you can turn on Wi-Fi Calling by going to Call settings menu.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ, ᏂᎦᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏩᎫᏗᏗᏒ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎠᏎ ᎮᎾ ᎢᏴᏛ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ. ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎥᏝ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ.ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏩᎫᏗᏗᏒ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Wi-Fi ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏰᏏ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏫᎬᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You are currently out of range of the mobile network.Would you like to use Wi-Fi to make and receive voice calls when the mobile network is not available?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You are currently out of range of the mobile network.Would you like to use Wi-Fi to make and receive voice calls when the mobile network is not available?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᏃᏊᎨᏒᎢ ᎦᏅᎪᏫᏛ ᎾᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ.ᏯᏓᎯᏗᏏ ᏂᎯ ᎢᏳᏍᏘ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Wi-Fi ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We need to verify that you own the email address . Click the &quot;&quot; button below to send a verification email to this address.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We need to verify that you own the email address . Click the "" button below to send a verification email to this address.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎰᎯᏳᏓ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏤᎵᎦ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏗᎦᏁᏍᏗᏱ . ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᏥᎩ "" ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎡᎳᏗᏨ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏫᏅᎥᎦ Ꭰ ᎪᎯᏳᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏗᎦᏁᏍᏗᏱ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We use your Google email address, stored in Contacts, to create a Motorola ID. Please tap &quot;Allow&quot; in the next screen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We use your Google email address, stored in Contacts, to create a Motorola ID. Please tap "Allow" in the next screen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Google ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ, ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎾᎿ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ, ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ Ꭰ Motorola ID. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ "ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ" ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allows the app to read Android Beam data from another app">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allows the app to read Android Beam data from another app</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎲ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ Android Beam ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏄᏓᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Network type">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Network type</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏚᏓᎵ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Account registration unsuccessful: (); will try later">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Account registration unsuccessful: (); will try later</term></tig></langSet>
