                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can't connect to MicroCell right now. Try again later.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ MicroCell ᎠᎦᏘᏏ Ꭷ. ᏏᏊ ᎪᎯᏴ ᎯᎭᏁᎵᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
