            <termEntry id="WiFi Calling is the service providing the ability to make and receive voice calls over the Internet connection in any available WiFi network, even if you are out of mobile coverage. The WiFi Calling icon on the notification bar indicate that all your calls are using WiFi Calling.Details on www.orange.pl/wificallingChoose the SETTINGS menu below to activate your WiFi Calling service on your mobile device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>WiFi Calling is the service providing the ability to make and receive voice calls over the Internet connection in any available WiFi network, even if you are out of mobile coverage. The WiFi Calling icon on the notification bar indicate that all your calls are using WiFi Calling.Details on www.orange.pl/wificallingChoose the SETTINGS menu below to activate your WiFi Calling service on your mobile device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>WiFi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎬ ᏥᎩ ᎾᏏᎾᏒ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎢᏴᏛ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ WiFi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎤᎾᏙᏣᎴᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎫᏢᏗ. ᏥᎩ WiFi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎦᎾᎸ ᎠᏓᏎᎮᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎬᏗᎭ WiFi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ.ᏂᏕᎬᎿᏅᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ www.orange.pl/wificallingᏣᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᏨ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ; WiFi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Update the Moto feedback assistant to get started">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Update the Moto feedback assistant to get started</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ Moto ᎦᏬᎯᎵᏴᏓ ᎤᏂᏍᏕᎸᎯᏙᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎭᎴᏅᏗᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
