                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allows the app to completely reset the system to its factory settings, erasing all data, all configuration, and installed apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allows the app to completely reset the system to its factory settings, erasing all data, all configuration, and installed apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎲ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎧᎵᏬᎯ ᏥᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᏥᎩ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᏂᎦᏓ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎪᏢᏒᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᎦᏘᏅᏔᏅ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="WiFi Calling is the service providing the ability to make and receive voice calls over the Internet connection in any available WiFi network, even if you are out of mobile coverage. The WiFi Calling icon on the notification bar(shown below) indicates that all your calls are using WiFi Calling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>WiFi Calling is the service providing the ability to make and receive voice calls over the Internet connection in any available WiFi network, even if you are out of mobile coverage. The WiFi Calling icon on the notification bar(shown below) indicates that all your calls are using WiFi Calling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>WiFi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎬ ᏥᎩ ᎾᏏᎾᏒ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎢᏴᏛ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ WiFi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎤᎾᏙᏣᎴᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎫᏢᏗ. ᏥᎩ WiFi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎦᎾᎸ (ᎤᏓᏎᎮᎸᎩ ᎡᎳᏗᏨ) ᎠᏓᏎᎮᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎬᏗᎭ WiFi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Not now">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Not now</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏗ ᏆᏊ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
