                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> can't open here because it's already running</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᏱᎦᏴᏍᏚᎢ ᎠᏂ ᏅᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᏃ ᎦᏳᎳ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
