                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Third-party account not bound. Third-party user name is a Lenovo ID</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏦᎢᏁ-ᎤᎾᏓᏟᏌᎲ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎭᏗ ᏯᎾᏚᏓᎸᎥᏍᎨᏍᏗ. ᏦᎢᏁ-ᎤᎾᏓᏟᏌᎲ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᏙᎥᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎴᏃᏉ ID</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
