            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Wizard can't proceed because device is in airplane mode.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wizard can't proceed because device is in airplane mode.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wizard ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᏅᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬᏃ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎾᎿ ᏥᏳ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This app needs your permission to access data and show you mobile and Wi-Fi usage statistics. Please tap to PERMIT usage. You can revoke this permit at any time tapping in option &quot;Manage app's usage access&quot; under app's menu.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This app needs your permission to access data and show you mobile and Wi-Fi usage statistics. Please tap to PERMIT usage. You can revoke this permit at any time tapping in option "Manage app's usage access" under app's menu.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᏚᎸᏗ ᏄᎾᏛᏅ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ Wi-Fi ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎢᎦ ᏂᏚᎵᏍᏔᏅᏒᎢ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ PERMIT ᎬᏗᏍᎬ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏓᏲᎨᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏯᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ "ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ" ᎤᏓᏄᏴᏛᎢ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="LifetimeData">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>LifetimeData</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᎪᎯᏓ ᎠᎴᏂᏙᎲ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Default Data SIM Assistant">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Default Data SIM Assistant</term></tig></langSet>
