            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your Dual SIM phone is readyLearn more about SIM features and make adjustments at any time via the Settings menu.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your Dual SIM phone is readyLearn more about SIM features and make adjustments at any time via the Settings menu.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Dual SIM ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᎢᎸᏨ SIM ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎪᏒᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏫᎧᎲᎦ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᎾᎿ ᎢᏗᏨ ᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Wi-Fi is out of reach. Do you want to automatically turn data on when you disconnect from Wi-Fi network?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wi-Fi is out of reach. Do you want to automatically turn data on when you disconnect from Wi-Fi network?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᎭᏗ ᏱᎨᎭᏙᏯᏂᏓ. ᏣᏚᎵᏍ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎢ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏱᏧᏓᎴᏌ ᏗᏓᎴᎲᏍᎬ Wi-Fi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Feature unavailable. SIM card is missing or not supported.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Feature unavailable. SIM card is missing or not supported.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ SIM ᎠᏆᏂᏲᏍᏗ ᎦᎷᎶᎦ ᏃᎴ ᎭᏗ ᎤᎵᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᏱᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Operation is not allowed since airplane mode is turned on. Please try again after turning off airplane mode.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Operation is not allowed since airplane mode is turned on. Please try again after turning off airplane mode.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎢᏒᎢ ᎭᏗ ᏯᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗ ᎣᏂ ᎤᏂ ᏧᏩᎫᏛ ᏥᏳ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏒ. ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎶᏓ ᎣᏂ ᎯᏍᏚᎲᏍᎬ ᏥᏳ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Data switch operation failed. Please try again later.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Data switch operation failed. Please try again later.</term></tig></langSet>
