            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Do you want to store photos and videos on your SD card?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Do you want to store photos and videos on your SD card?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯᏍᎪᏃ ᏣᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ SD ᏆᏂᏲᏍᏗ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
