            <termEntry id="Sorry, there was a problem updating your . No changes were made. If you'd like to get this update later, go to Settings &gt; System updates.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, there was a problem updating your . No changes were made. If you'd like to get this update later, go to Settings &gt; System updates.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎤᏰᎸᏅ, ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ ᏓᏓᎴᎬ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ . Ꮭ ᏗᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᏱᎨᏎᎢ. ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏯᏓᎯᏗᏏ ᏣᎸᏉᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎪᎯᏴᎢ, Ꭷ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ &gt; ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
