                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏗ ᏆᏊ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To turn on Auto mute, Adaptive volume needs permission to display information over other apps.To grant permission, turn on &quot;Adaptive volume&quot; on the next screen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To turn on Auto mute, Adaptive volume needs permission to display information over other apps.To grant permission, turn on "Adaptive volume" on the next screen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎡᎳᏪ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ, ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏚᏚᎸᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗᎢ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏬᎯᎳᏗᏍᎬ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ. ᎾᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ, ᎯᏍᏚᎢ "ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ" ᎤᎾᎢ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
