                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏗ ᏆᏊ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Auto mute turned off because it doesn't have permission to display over other apps">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Auto mute turned off because it doesn't have permission to display over other apps</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᏌ ᎡᎳᏪ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᏅᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎤᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎢ ᏳᎭ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏓᏬᎯᎳᏗᏍᎬ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To turn on Auto mute, Adaptive volume needs permission to display information over other apps. To grant permission, tap &quot;Adaptive volume&quot; on the next screen and then turn the toggle on.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To turn on Auto mute, Adaptive volume needs permission to display information over other apps. To grant permission, tap "Adaptive volume" on the next screen and then turn the toggle on.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎡᎳᏪ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ, ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏚᏚᎸᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏬᎯᎳᏗᏍᎬ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ. ᎾᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ, ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ "ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ" ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎿᏉᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
