                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎯ ᎥᏝ ᏫᎦᏅᏅᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="General settings">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>General settings</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎦᏗᏳ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Request a delivery report for each SMS you send">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Request a delivery report for each SMS you send</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏔᏲᏍᏗ Ꭰ ᏩᏲᎯᏍᏗᎢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᏗᎬᏁᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏧᏤᎵᏛ SMS ᏂᎯ ᏫᏅᎥᎦ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Failed to load attachment.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Failed to load attachment.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏄᎸᏅᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏢᎦ ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To continue, give Messages access to SMS, Phone and Contacts.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To continue, give Messages access to SMS, Phone and Contacts.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ, ᏧᏁᏗᏱ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏩᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ SMS, ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ .</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Messages might not send or receive messages until more space is available on your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Messages might not send or receive messages until more space is available on your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏄᎵᏂᎬᎬ ᎥᏝ ᏫᏅᎥᎦ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎩᎳ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can give apps permission to open on the external display, though not all apps are designed for that screen size. To access the app tray, swipe left on the external display home screen.You can fill the app tray with a curated group of apps that work well on the external display, or add a full list of apps, including those that may not work as expected. You can manage the app tray and permissions in External display settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can give apps permission to open on the external display, though not all apps are designed for that screen size. To access the app tray, swipe left on the external display home screen.You can fill the app tray with a curated group of apps that work well on the external display, or add a full list of apps, including those that may not work as expected. You can manage the app tray and permissions in External display settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏱᎲᏎ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ, ᎤᏁᎳᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᏊᎾ ᎭᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᏅᎯ ᎢᏳᏰᎸᏗ Ꮎ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᎩᏓ ᎨᏒ. ᏣᏴᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏂᎬᏁᎲ, ᎠᎦᏍᎯᏂ ᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩᏲᎤ cᎠn fᎢll tᎮ Ꭰpp trᎠy Ꮻth Ꭰ cᎤrᎠᏖd grᎣᎤp Ꭳf ᎠppᏍ tᎭt Ꮼrk Ꮺll Ꭳn tᎮ ᎡxᏖrᎾl ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ, Ꭳr Ꭰdd Ꭰ fᎤll ᎵᏍt Ꭳf ᎠppᏍ, ᎢncᎷᏗng tᎰᏎ tᎭt Ꮉy Ꮓt Ꮼrk ᎠᏍ ᎡxpᎡcᏖd. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏓᏍᏗ app ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ in ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Send photos">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Send photos</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏫᏅᎥᎦ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can only send one video per message. Please remove additional videos and try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can only send one video per message. Please remove additional videos and try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎤᏅᏒ ᏫᏅᎥᎦ ᏌᏊ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᏊ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎯ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᏍᏗ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏙᏔᏅ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Mobile desktop turns your phone into a convenient workstation. When you connect to a display, mouse, and keyboard, you’re ready for easy remote work, e-learning, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Mobile desktop turns your phone into a convenient workstation. When you connect to a display, mouse, and keyboard, you’re ready for easy remote work, e-learning, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏱᏂᎬᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎯᏗᎨᏍᏗ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏘᏱ. ᏂᎯ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎱᏓᎸᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗᎢ, ᏥᏍᏕᏥ, ᏃᎴ ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ, ᏂᎯᏃ ᏣᎴᏅᏓ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᎯᏓ ᎢᎾ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ, Ꭲ-ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᎬ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Auto capture disable">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Auto capture disable</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᏒ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᎦᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can't send message while loading attachments.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can't send message while loading attachments.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏝᏰᎵ ᏫᏅᎥᎦ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎯ ᎠᏏᏉ ᎦᏢᏍᎬ ᏗᎦᏯᎸᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When parents put the latest technologies in the children\’s hands, they want to make sure they\’re developing healthy digital habits. Family Link lets you connect your child\’s device to yours. Use the control panel to set daily screen time limits, view app activity, manage content restrictions, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When parents put the latest technologies in the children\’s hands, they want to make sure they\’re developing healthy digital habits. Family Link lets you connect your child\’s device to yours. Use the control panel to set daily screen time limits, view app activity, manage content restrictions, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏧᎾᏓᎦᏴᎵᎨᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏱᏚᏂᏠᎾ ᎩᎳ ᏣᎾᏄᎪᏨᎯ ᎢᏤ ᏗᎦᏙᎲᏒᎩ ᏗᏂᏲᏟ\’s ᏧᏃᏰᏂ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᏚᎵᏍᎬ ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏂᎯᏊ ᎠᏙᎷᏩᏘᏍᎬ ᏙᎯᏊ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᎳᏅᏔᏅ ᎢᏳᎾᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗᎢ. ᏏᏓᏁᎸᎯ ᏚᏂᏢᏔᏅᏒᎢ ᏗᏣᎵᏍᎪᏛᏓᏁᎯ ᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ ᏱᏕᎭᏠᎯᏍᏓ ᏤᏥ ᎠᏲᏟ\’s ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ. ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎠᏯᏔᎾᎸ ᎾᎢ ᏧᎩᏨᏅᏓ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛ ᎠᏟᏰᎵᏒ ᏓᏎᎸᎯ, ᎯᎪᎵᏯ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎵᏖᎸᎲᏍᎬᎢ, ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏙᎯ ᎦᎸᏛᎢ ᏗᏓᏲᏍᏓᏁᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
