            <termEntry id="Android 10\’s latest features make your device more helpful while giving you the balance you need in your digital life.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Android 10\’s latest features make your device more helpful while giving you the balance you need in your digital life.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Android 10\'s ᎢᏤᎯᎨᎢᏍᏗ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎰᏢᎾ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏣᏁᎲᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᏗᎦᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏣᏂᎬᎬᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᎴᏂᏙᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn how to use your Razr like a pro. Razr Tips gives you information about basic functions, shortcuts on the external display, transitioning between the 2 displays, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn how to use your Razr like a pro. Razr Tips gives you information about basic functions, shortcuts on the external display, transitioning between the 2 displays, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏙᎡᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Razr ᎯᎸᏉᏗ Ꭰ ᎧᎵ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏄᏍᏗ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ. Razr ᎠᏍᏕᎸᏗᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎭ ᏂᎯ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎢᎸᏨ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏛ ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗᏱ, ᏍᏆᎳ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᎯ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ, ᏓᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᏥᎩ 2 ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᎪᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Camera settings">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Camera settings</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Mobile desktop turns your phone into a convenient workstation. When you connect to a display, mouse, and keyboard, you’re ready for easy remote work, e-learning, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Mobile desktop turns your phone into a convenient workstation. When you connect to a display, mouse, and keyboard, you’re ready for easy remote work, e-learning, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏱᏂᎬᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎯᏗᎨᏍᏗ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏘᏱ. ᏂᎯ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎱᏓᎸᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗᎢ, ᏥᏍᏕᏥ, ᏃᎴ ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ, ᏂᎯᏃ ᏣᎴᏅᏓ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᎯᏓ ᎢᎾ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ, Ꭲ-ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᎬ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you set a timer on the internal display, the countdown will also appear on the external display.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you set a timer on the internal display, the countdown will also appear on the external display.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᏕᎯᎧᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏥᏱᎵᏒ ᎠᎦᏘᏯ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏏᏁᎦᏘ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎤᎾᏄᎪᎢᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ .</term></tig></langSet>
