            <termEntry id="When you're connected to your PC via USB, you can use your phone as a webcam for enhanced video chats.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you're connected to your PC via USB, you can use your phone as a webcam for enhanced video chats.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏳᏓᎸᏅᎢ PC ᏣᏤᎵ ᎾᎿ USB ᎬᏗ, ᏰᎵᏊ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏣᏩᏙᏗ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏓᏤᏒᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᎾᏟᏃᎮᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
