            <termEntry id="To capture higher quality selfie photos and videos, use your Razr’s external 16 MP camera instead of the internal camera.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To capture higher quality selfie photos and videos, use your Razr’s external 16 MP camera instead of the internal camera.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏴᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎨᏍᏙᏗ ᏃᏌᏅᏱ ᎣᏩᏌ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ, ᏙᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ Razr"s ᏙᏱᏗᏢ 16 MP ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎬᏫᏳᏎᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᎭᏫᏂ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
