            <termEntry id="Personalize helps you set up your device in a way that reflects your needs and preferences. Choose font styles, wallpapers, icon shapes, and more to make your device unique.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Personalize helps you set up your device in a way that reflects your needs and preferences. Choose font styles, wallpapers, icon shapes, and more to make your device unique.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ ᏕᎦᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏄᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᎬᎾᎨᏒ ᏱᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏣᏚᎸᏛᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏟ ᏕᎯᏰᎸᏍᎬᎢ. ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏙᏪᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎪᏪᎶᏗ, ᏕᎧᏑᎧᏡ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ, ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏩᏒᎯᏯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
