            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="I understand that my consent is not required and is not a condition of any purchase. Standard data rates may apply. I may unsubscribe to push notifications by selecting Unsubscribe in the notifications I receive.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>I understand that my consent is not required and is not a condition of any purchase. Standard data rates may apply. I may unsubscribe to push notifications by selecting Unsubscribe in the notifications I receive.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏯ ᎪᎵᎦ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᎠᏆᏤᎵ ᎣᏏ ᏥᏰᎸᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏎᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᏱᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎥᏝ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎥᎿᎢ ᏂᎦᎥ ᎠᏩᎯᏍᏗ. ᎢᎬᏩᏍᏗᎭ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏓᏟᎶᎲᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏓ. ᎠᏯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏗᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏅᏒᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏌᏙᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏄᏅᏅ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏗᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏅᏒᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎠᏯ ᎠᎩᏁᏒᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It was not possible to copy logs to SD card. Check the logs for more information.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>It was not possible to copy logs to SD card. Check the logs for more information.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏗ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᏱᎨᏎᎢ ᎾᎢ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏂᏚᎵᏍᏔᏂᏙᎸ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎾᎾᎢ to SD ᎠᏆᏂᏲᏍᏗ. ᏣᎦᏛᎲᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏚᎵᏍᏔᏂᏙᎸ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
