            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Based on current settings, only information required to keep software updated will be shared.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Based on current settings, only information required to keep software updated will be shared.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎳᏏᏔᏅᎩ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏃᏊᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎤᏩᏌ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏩᏂᎨ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏯᏙᏢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Based on current settings, device usage information will not be shared to provide personalized support.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Based on current settings, device usage information will not be shared to provide personalized support.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎳᏏᏔᏅᎩ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏃᏊᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎬᏙᏗᎢ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᎭᏗ ᏱᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏯᏙᏢ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗᏍᎬ ᎣᏤᎵᎢ ᎢᎬᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎦᎫᏍᏛᎥ.</term></tig></langSet>
