                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᎵᏊ ᏂᎬᏁᎲᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Security updates are automatically downloaded &amp; installed when they're available.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Security updates are automatically downloaded &amp; installed when they're available.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᏙᏢᎯᏌ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎡᎳᏗᎳᎦᎸᏍᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏱᏕᎦᏛᏅᏛᎦ ᏳᏛᏅᎢᏍᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
