            <termEntry id="Without a data connection, TalkBack is only fully supported in English.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Without a data connection, TalkBack is only fully supported in English.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏄᏠᏯᏍᏛᎾ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏗᎵᎪᏔᏅᎯ, ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ ᎥᏍᎩ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎧᎵᎢ ᎧᎵᎢ ᎤᎵᏍᏕᎸᏛ ᎾᎢ ᎩᎵᏏ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It locks the device to be used only with the Telcel network when associated with an imposed term and / or financing.The lock is removed automatically once that the device cost is fully recovered or the imposed term expires.More information at www.telcel.com/desbloqueo">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>It locks the device to be used only with the Telcel network when associated with an imposed term and / or financing.The lock is removed automatically once that the device cost is fully recovered or the imposed term expires.More information at www.telcel.com/desbloqueo</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᎰ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏩᏌ Ꮎ Telcel ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏧᎾᏙᎵᏒ ᏱᎩ ᏓᏓᏁᏤᎸ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏙᏗ ᎠᏕᎸ ᎬᏗᏍᏓ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᏯᎵᏍᏚᎢ ᎤᏩᏌ Ꮎ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏚᎬᏮᏢᎾ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏯᏩᏛᎢ ᏃᎴ Ꮎ ᏚᏅᏓᏁᏤᎸ ᏳᎵᏍᏆᏗᎤᎪᏓ ᎠᏓᏃᎯᏎᎯ Ꮎ www.telcel.com/desbloqueo</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Got it">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Got it</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᎵᎦ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Without your ID, Motorola may not be able to help you with issues on your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Without your ID, Motorola may not be able to help you with issues on your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏄᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎬᎾ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ID, Motorola ᎭᏗ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎨᏣᎵᏍᏕᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Enable data">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Enable data</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᎵᏊ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Based on current settings, device usage information will not be shared to help improve our products.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Based on current settings, device usage information will not be shared to help improve our products.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎳᏏᏔᏅᎩ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏃᏊᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᎭᏗ ᏱᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᏗᎦᏤᎵ ᏗᎪᏢᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="By providing your ID, you give Motorola permission to give you fast and specific help on your device, as well as information about service centers and more.Remember, Motorola will always keep your data safe.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>By providing your ID, you give Motorola permission to give you fast and specific help on your device, as well as information about service centers and more.Remember, Motorola will always keep your data safe.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎬ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ID, ᎯᏁᎲ Motorola ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᏣᏓᏁᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏃᎴ ᏗᎪᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᏯᏊᏃ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᏄᏰᎵᏗ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᏗᏰᏟ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ.ᎭᏅᏓᏛ, Motorola ᏂᎪᎸ ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏂᎦᎾᏰᎬᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Based on current settings, device usage information will be shared to provide personalized support.">
