            <termEntry id="I agree to receive push notifications from Motorola about promotions and offers to my device. I understand that my consent is not required and is not a condition of any purchase. Standard data rates may apply. I may unsubscribe to push notifications by selecting &quot;Unsubscribe&quot; in the notifications I receive. ">
