            <termEntry id="Reset device settings restores your phone to its original settings. Any changes you've made to the following settings will be undone: BatteryDisplayStorage">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Reset device settings restores your phone to its original settings. Any changes you've made to the following settings will be undone: BatteryDisplayStorage</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎦᎬᎲᎢ ᏱᏙᎪᏢᎯᏌ ᏗᏢᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎬᏱ ᏕᏣᎧᏅᎢ. ᎢᏳᏍᏓ ᏕᏨᏁᏟᏴᏒ ᏕᎦᎧᎲ ᏙᎠᏓᏛᏁᏟᏴᏌ: ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
