            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To use Talk to Me, you must give Moto permission to access your location. Select &quot;Permissions&quot; in App info to grant permission.Select &quot;allow all the time&quot; for the best.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use Talk to Me, you must give Moto permission to access your location. Select "Permissions" in App info to grant permission.Select "allow all the time" for the best.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Talk to Me, ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ Moto ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏩᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ. ᎯᏑᏰᎦ "ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎵᏗᏍᎩ" ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎣᏃᎮᏎᏱ ᎭᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓ ᎯᏑᏰᎦ "ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ" ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏥᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
