            <termEntry id="Google Duo video calling lets you chat with friends and family face-to-face. Data charges may apply. ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Google Duo video calling lets you chat with friends and family face-to-face. Data charges may apply. </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Google Duo ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏩᏂᎩ ᏂᎯ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏧᎾᎵᎢ ᏃᎴ ᏏᏓᏁᎸᎢᏓᎾᏓᎧᏅ. ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎲᏓ. </term></tig></langSet>
