            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Visual Voicemail cannot be used on this device. Please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is 9992.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Visual Voicemail cannot be used on this device. Please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is 9992.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎤᏩᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏛᏁᎭ ᎤᎿᎢ  ᏃᎴ ᎤᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ 9992</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Voicemail is not set up on your account. Please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is 9991.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Voicemail is not set up on your account. Please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is 9991.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏁᎬ ᎾᎿ ᎥᏝ ᏘᎧᎲᎦ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎤᏩᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏛᏁᎭ ᎤᎿᎢ  ᏃᎴ ᎤᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ 9991</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Try again when your Wi\u2011Fi or mobile data connection is better. You can still call to check voicemail.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Try again when your Wi\u2011Fi or mobile data connection is better. You can still call to check voicemail.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Wi\u2011Fi ᏃᎴ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿ ᏓᏤᎳ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏙᎢ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅ ᎧᏁᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="See and listen to your messages, without having to call voicemail. Transcripts of your voicemail are provided by Google’s free transcription service. You can turn either off in Settings any time. ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>See and listen to your messages, without having to call voicemail. Transcripts of your voicemail are provided by Google’s free transcription service. You can turn either off in Settings any time. </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎭᏛᏓᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ, ᏄᏠᏯᏍᏛᎾ ᎤᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎧᏁᎬ. ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏂᎬᏁᎸ ᎤᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏛ ᎬᏗ Google’s ᏗᏣᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏂᎬᏁᎸ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ ᎢᏳᏍᏗᏊ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎾᎿ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You won't be notified for new voicemails. Turn off airplane mode to sync your voicemail.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You won't be notified for new voicemails. Turn off airplane mode to sync your voicemail.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎠᏓᏃᎯᏎᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏗᏤ ᎧᏁᎬ. ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᏥᏳ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᏧᎳᎭ ᏥᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can't Connect to Your Voice Mailbox">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can't Connect to Your Voice Mailbox</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎱᏓᎸᎥᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎪᏪᎵᎧᏁᏌ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, we're not able to connect to your voice mailbox at this time. Please try again later. If there is still a problem, please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is 9990.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, we're not able to connect to your voice mailbox at this time. Please try again later. If there is still a problem, please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is 9990.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎤᏰᎸᏅ, ᎢᏗ ᎥᏝ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎱᏓᎸᎥᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎪᏪᎵᎧᏁᏌ ᎾᏊᎨᏒ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᏏᏊ ᎪᎯᏴ ᎯᎭᏁᎵᏔᏅᎢ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏏᏉ Ꭰ ᏓᏓᎴᎬ, ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎤᏩᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏛᏁᎭ ᎤᎿᎢ  ᏃᎴ ᎤᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ 9990.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
