            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Wi-Fi no longer available. Your call is transferring to the cellular network. Voice and data rates may apply.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wi-Fi no longer available. Your call is transferring to the cellular network. Voice and data rates may apply.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᎭᏗ ᎦᏅᎯᏓᎨ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ. ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏙᏓᏰᏣᏲᎯᏎᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ. ᎤᏁᎬ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏗᎪᏣᎴᏒᏛ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎲᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Simultaneous voice and real-time text calling is currently available only over high speed LTE and Wi-Fi networks.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Simultaneous voice and real-time text calling is currently available only over high speed LTE and Wi-Fi networks.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᏧᎳᎭ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᎤᏅᏒ ᎢᏴᏛ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎠᏍᎦᏃᎳ LTE ᏃᎴ Wi-Fi ᏚᎾᏚᏓᎵ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can't merge audio only calls with video calls.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can't merge audio only calls with video calls.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᏓᏠᎯᏍᏛ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎤᏅᏒ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎬᏗ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂ.</term></tig></langSet>
