            <termEntry id=" wants to chat using Real Time Text (RTT).To hide or show the RTT keyboard, use the menu.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> wants to chat using Real Time Text (RTT).To hide or show the RTT keyboard, use the menu.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᏚᎾᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ (RTT).ᎾᎿᎢ ᎲᏍᎦᏢᎦ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏙᏗ ᏥᎩ RTT ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ, ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
