            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You turned off Mobile Data. Do you want to continue with current Video call or End it? ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You turned off Mobile Data. Do you want to continue with current Video call or End it? </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏭᎪᎸᏍᏔᏁᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ. ᏣᏚᎵᎭᏍ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᎦᏯᎢᏒ ᎬᏗ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎵᏍᏆᏓ it? </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The call can't switch to Video when TTY is set to on.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The call can't switch to Video when TTY is set to on.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎥᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ TTY ᎨᎡᎢ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This is a data warning you've set for yourself. To check your data usage, go to Settings &gt; Network &amp; Internet &gt; Data usage.Your video call is using data. Do you want to continue your call?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This is a data warning you've set for yourself. To check your data usage, go to Settings &gt; Network &amp; Internet &gt; Data usage.Your video call is using data. Do you want to continue your call?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎨᎡᎢ Ꭰ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏔᎲᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎢᏨᏌ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ, ᎡᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ &gt; ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ &amp; ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ &gt; ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ.ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ. ᏣᏚᎵᎭᏍ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏪᏯᎾ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" can't receive video calls at this time.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> can't receive video calls at this time.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Select photo">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Select photo</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Unable to update the current emergency address at this time. Please try again later.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Unable to update the current emergency address at this time. Please try again later.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏛ ᏯᎵᏱᎵᏙᎭ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᏏᏊ ᎪᎯᏴ ᎯᎭᏁᎵᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
