            <termEntry id="To use these features, you and the contacts you exchange messages with need to have phones and services that are compatible with Advanced Messaging. If you prefer other people not know when you've read their messages, turn read receipts off in message settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use these features, you and the contacts you exchange messages with need to have phones and services that are compatible with Advanced Messaging. If you prefer other people not know when you've read their messages, turn read receipts off in message settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠᏃ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᏃᎴ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᎭ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏗᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎨᎡᎩ ᏗᏙᎸᎩ ᎬᏗ ᎢᏴᏛ ᎠᏱᎸᏛ ᏓᎾᏓᏪᎳᏁᎲᎢ. ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏟ ᎠᏰᎸᏗ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᎥᏝ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᏒ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ, ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎠᎩᏒᏅ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Channel to notify the user about changing the default SMS application">
