            <termEntry id="Moto Feedback is requesting to upload a bug report from the device. Bug reports include personal information about your device or data logged by apps, such as user names, location data, device identifiers, and network information. Only share bug reports with people and apps you trust with this information.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Feedback is requesting to upload a bug report from the device. Bug reports include personal information about your device or data logged by apps, such as user names, location data, device identifiers, and network information. Only share bug reports with people and apps you trust with this information.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎦᏬᎯᎵᏴᏓ ᎠᏔᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏢᏙᏗ ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᏗᎬᏁᎯ ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏓ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᎥᏍᎩ ᏄᏰᎵᏛᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᏄᏛᏁᎸ ᎤᏃᎮᏢᎩ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᎾᏙᎥᎢ, ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ, ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏗᏓᏙᎵᎩ, ᎠᎴ ᎤᏚᏓᎵ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᎥᏍᎩ. ᎤᏩᏌ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᎸ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎯᏯᎨᏅᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᎥᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your location information may be sent to Google and to your network provider to allow the Wi-Fi calls to go through.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your location information may be sent to Google and to your network provider to allow the Wi-Fi calls to go through.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏫᎦᏅᏅᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Google ᏃᎴ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏫᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="modify calendar">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>modify calendar</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏃᏒᎯᏐᏗ ᏅᏓ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
