            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moving ^1 and its data to ^2 will take only a few moments. You won\u2019t be able to use the app until the move is complete. Don\u2019t remove the ^2 during the move.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moving ^1 and its data to ^2 will take only a few moments. You won\u2019t be able to use the app until the move is complete. Don\u2019t remove the ^2 during the move.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏩᎲᏍᎩ ^1 ᏃᎴ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ^2 ᎠᏎ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎤᏅᏒ Ꭰ ᎦᏲᎵ ᏂᏚᎵᏍᏔᏅᎩ. You ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎩᎳ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎧᎵᎢ. ᏝᏍᏗ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ^2 ᎾᎯᏳ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Retry after 60 Minutes">
