            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="These settings can't be changed right now. An app () has automatically turned on Do Not Disturb with custom behavior.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>These settings can't be changed right now. An app () has automatically turned on Do Not Disturb with custom behavior.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠᏃ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏱᎩ ᏃᏊ ᎨᏒᎢ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ () ᏄᏍᏛ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᎩ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎤᏂᎲᎩ ᎢᏳᎾᏛᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can delete your fingerprint images and model, or turn off Fingerprint Unlock at any time in Settings. Fingerprint images and models are stored on the phone until you delete them.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can delete your fingerprint images and model, or turn off Fingerprint Unlock at any time in Settings. Fingerprint images and models are stored on the phone until you delete them.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᏃᎴ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᎾᎿ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ. ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᏃᎴ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Create widget and allow access?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Create widget and allow access?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏒᏗ ᏫᏥᏘ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can\u2019t change PIN.Possibly incorrect PIN.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can\u2019t change PIN.Possibly incorrect PIN.</term></tig></langSet>
