                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Let notifications silenced by Do Not Disturb pop on screen and show a status bar icon</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅᎢ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎡᎳᏪᏍᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎦᎾᎸᎢ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="No installed apps have requested Do Not Disturb access">
