            <termEntry id="May drain your battery more quickly. App will no longer be restricted from using background battery.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>May drain your battery more quickly. App will no longer be restricted from using background battery.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏰᎵᏉ ᎡᎳᏗᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏏᏄᎵ. ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎭᏗ ᎭᏗ ᏃᏊᏃ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏓᎨᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
