            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A PIN protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.This deletes the fingerprint model stored on your device. Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face or fingerprint for authentication in apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A PIN protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.This deletes the fingerprint model stored on your device. Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face or fingerprint for authentication in apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>D PIN ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ Ꮒ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏃᏍᎩᏓᎯᎠ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎬᏩᎦᏘ ᏃᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ. ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To turn on Wi\u2011Fi automatically, you first need to turn on Wi\u2011Fi scanning.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To turn on Wi\u2011Fi automatically, you first need to turn on Wi\u2011Fi scanning.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᎵᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᏱᏣᏚᎵ Wi\u2011Fi, ᎠᎬᏱ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ Wi\u2011Fi ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Languages, gestures, time, backup">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Languages, gestures, time, backup</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏗ, ᏚᏂᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ, ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ, ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Some system functions, such as syncing, may not work correctly. Try to free space by deleting or unpinning items, such as apps or media content.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Some system functions, such as syncing, may not work correctly. Try to free space by deleting or unpinning items, such as apps or media content.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᎦᏓ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗᏱ, ᏕᎧᏁᎢᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎢᏧᎳᎭ ᏥᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ, ᏰᎵᏯ ᎥᏝ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᏊ. ᏣᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏣᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎥᏝ ᎦᎭᏛᏗ ᏑᏓᎴᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ, ᏕᎧᏁᎢᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The carrier can\u2019t be switched due to an error.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The carrier can\u2019t be switched due to an error.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The app will be able to turn on/off Do Not Disturb and make changes to related settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The app will be able to turn on/off Do Not Disturb and make changes to related settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎡᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᎩ/ᎠᏍᏚᏓ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏣᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏧᏠᏱ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A Bluetooth device, , wants to access your contacts and call log. This includes data about incoming and outgoing calls.You haven\u2019t connected to  before.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A Bluetooth device, , wants to access your contacts and call log. This includes data about incoming and outgoing calls.You haven\u2019t connected to  before.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Bluetooth ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, , ᏚᎾᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎠᎵ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎸᏛᏁᎸ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ. ᎯᎠ ᏚᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎢᎸᏨ ᎦᎷᎦ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏅᎪᏫᏛ ᏓᏰᏏ ᏪᏯᎾ.ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ  ᎤᏓᎷᎸ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Unrestricted data usage">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Unrestricted data usage</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᎦᏅᏍᏙᏒᎯ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Standard time">
