                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>No certificate specified. Your connection will not be private.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏗ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏗᎪᎥᎯ. ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎥᏝ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏕᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
