            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow this app to turn Wi-Fi on or off, scan and connect to Wi-Fi networks, add or remove networks, or start a local-only hotspot">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow this app to turn Wi-Fi on or off, scan and connect to Wi-Fi networks, add or remove networks, or start a local-only hotspot</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ Wi-Fi ᎤᎿᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ, ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Wi-Fi ᏚᎾᏚᏓᎵ, ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᏚᎾᏚᏓᎵ, ᏃᎴ ᎭᎴᎾ Ꭰ ᎡᏍᎦᏂ-ᎤᏅᏒ ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="After formatting, you can use this ^1 in other devices. All data on this ^1 will be erased. Consider backing up first. Back up photos &amp; other mediaMove your media files to alternative storage on this device, or transfer them to a computer using a USB cable. Back up appsAll apps stored on this ^1 will be uninstalled and their data will be erased. To keep these apps, move them to alternative storage on this device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>After formatting, you can use this ^1 in other devices. All data on this ^1 will be erased. Consider backing up first. Back up photos &amp; other mediaMove your media files to alternative storage on this device, or transfer them to a computer using a USB cable. Back up appsAll apps stored on this ^1 will be uninstalled and their data will be erased. To keep these apps, move them to alternative storage on this device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎣᏂᏗᏢ ᎪᏢᏗᏍᎬᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ^1 ᎾᎿ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏂᎦᏓ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ^1 ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ. ᎭᏓᏅᏛᎵ ᎠᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᏱ. ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ &amp; ᏐᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎵᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᏃᎴ ᏙᏓᏰᏣᏲᎯᏎᎵ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎬᏗᎭ Ꭰ USB ᏧᏯᏅᎢᏗᏍᏕᏛ. ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ^1 ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏥᎯᏘᏅᏓᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏍᎪᎸᏛ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᎯᎠᏃ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎵᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="These settings can't be changed right now. An app has automatically turned on Do Not Disturb with custom behavior.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>These settings can't be changed right now. An app has automatically turned on Do Not Disturb with custom behavior.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠᏃ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏱᎩ ᏃᏊ ᎨᏒᎢ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᎩ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎤᏂᎲᎩ ᎢᏳᎾᏛᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
