            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To check time, notifications, and other info, double-tap your screen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To check time, notifications, and other info, double-tap your screen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ, ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᏐᎢ, ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᎪᏘ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
