            <termEntry id="Only one downloaded SIM can be active at a time.Switching to  won\u2019t cancel your  service.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Only one downloaded SIM can be active at a time.Switching to  won\u2019t cancel your  service.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏅᏒ ᏌᏇ ᎡᎳᏗᎬᏘ ᏫᎦᏢᏅᎯ SIM ᏰᎵᏯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎬᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ Ꭰ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ.ᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ  ᎭᏗ ᏰᎴ ᎠᏎᏒᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ  ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
