            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="FDN wasn't updated because you typed an incorrect PIN.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>FDN wasn't updated because you typed an incorrect PIN.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>FDN ᏤᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅ ᎢᎬᏂᏏᏍᎩ ᏥᏕᎭᏐᏅᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ PIN</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Lets you transfer photos using camera software, and transfer any files on computers that don\u2019t support MTP">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Lets you transfer photos using camera software, and transfer any files on computers that don\u2019t support MTP</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏩᏂᎩ ᏂᎯ ᏙᏓᏰᏣᏲᎯᏎᎵ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏙᏓᏰᏣᏲᎯᏎᎵ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏤᏍᏗ ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏛᏁᎭ MTP</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow data exchange when the phone touches an NFC device">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow data exchange when the phone touches an NFC device</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏒᏂᏍᏗ NFC ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
