            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" will be used for mobile data, calls, and SMS.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> will be used for mobile data, calls, and SMS.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎤᏅᏒ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᏓᏯᏂ, ᏃᎴ SMS.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Notification category">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Notification category</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can still use this ^1, but it may be slow. Apps stored on this ^2 may not work properly, and content transfers could take a long time. Try using a faster ^3, or use this ^4 for portable storage instead.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can still use this ^1, but it may be slow. Apps stored on this ^2 may not work properly, and content transfers could take a long time. Try using a faster ^3, or use this ^4 for portable storage instead.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏏᏉ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ^1, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏍᎦᏃᎵ. ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ^2 ᏰᎵᏯ ᎥᏝ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏗᏙᎳᏤᎩ, ᏃᎴ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᏙᏓᏰᏣᏲᎯᏎᎵ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ Ꭰ ᎦᏅᎯᏓ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ. ᏣᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎬᏗᎭ Ꭰ ᎦᏣᎸᎳᎯᎨ ^3, ᏃᎴ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ^4 ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎤᎬᏫᏳᏎᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can’t make calls">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can’t make calls</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
