            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This will reset all network settings, including:Wi\u2011FiMobile dataBluetooth">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This will reset all network settings, including:Wi\u2011FiMobile dataBluetooth</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᏱᏙᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎾᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎾᏍᏊ Wi\u2011FiᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯBluetooth</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Uses . No daylight savings time.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Uses . No daylight savings time.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ . ᎭᏗ ᎢᎦ ᎤᏘᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you enter an incorrect password on the next attempt, your work profile and its data will be deleted">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you enter an incorrect password on the next attempt, your work profile and its data will be deleted</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏐᎢ ᎤᏁᎸᏙᏗ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎧᏛ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="About extra dim">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>About extra dim</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᎸᏨ ᎧᏁᏉᏓ ᎯᏍᎪᎸᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Apps cannot read notifications">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Apps cannot read notifications</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Background data">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Background data</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can encrypt your accounts, settings, downloaded apps and their data, media, and other files. After you encrypt your phone, assuming you\u2019ve set up a screen lock (that is, a pattern or numeric PIN or password), you\u2019ll need to unlock the screen to decrypt the phone every time you power it on. The only other way to decrypt is to perform a factory data reset, erasing all your data.Encryption takes an hour or more. You must start with a charged battery and keep your phone plugged in throughout the process. If you interrupt it, you\u2019ll lose some or all of your data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can encrypt your accounts, settings, downloaded apps and their data, media, and other files. After you encrypt your phone, assuming you\u2019ve set up a screen lock (that is, a pattern or numeric PIN or password), you\u2019ll need to unlock the screen to decrypt the phone every time you power it on. The only other way to decrypt is to perform a factory data reset, erasing all your data.Encryption takes an hour or more. You must start with a charged battery and keep your phone plugged in throughout the process. If you interrupt it, you\u2019ll lose some or all of your data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ, ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎡᎳᏗᎬᏘ ᏫᎦᏢᏅᎯ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏐᎢ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ. ᎤᎶᏐᏅ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ, ᏃᎵᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᎯ\u2019ve ᏘᎧᎲᎦ Ꭰ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ (ᎥᏍᎩᎾ, Ꭰ ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏎᏍᏙᏗ PIN ᏃᎴ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ), ᏂᎯ\u2019ll ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎭᏓᏗᎭ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᏂᎪᎯᎸ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎾᎿ ᎤᎿᎢ. ᏥᎩ ᎤᏅᏒ ᏐᎢ ᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎭᏓᏗᎭ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏱᏣᏛᏁᏗ Ꭰ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ, ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ.ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎩᏍᎪᎢ Ꭰ ᏑᏟᎶᏛ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ. ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎭᎴᎾ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎬᏩᎶᏔᏅ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎤᏊᏄᎾᏘ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎦᏅᎯᏒ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎯᎵᏒ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏓᏲᏍᏓᏁᎸᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ, ᏂᎯ\u2019ll ᏣᎫᎯ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏃᎴ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Subnet mask">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Subnet mask</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏫᏂᏗᏨᎢ ᎠᏚᏢᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To use, select a network rating provider">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use, select a network rating provider</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ, ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ Ꭰ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏂᏅᏅᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Migrate data">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Migrate data</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏅᏍᎪ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Erases all data on the internal USB storage, such as music and photos">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Erases all data on the internal USB storage, such as music and photos</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎭᏫᏂ USB ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ, ᏕᎧᏁᎢᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏗᎧᏃᎩᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="^1 data limit">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>^1 data limit</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>^1 ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏎᎸᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can't erase SIM">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can't erase SIM</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ SIM</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" is the only SIM in your device. Do you want to use this SIM for mobile data, calls, and SMS messages?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> is the only SIM in your device. Do you want to use this SIM for mobile data, calls, and SMS messages?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᏄᏍᏛ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏅᏒ SIM ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎿᏛᎦ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ SIM ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᏓᏯᏂ, ᏃᎴ SMS ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Data Saver">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Data Saver</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your IT admin requested a bug report to help troubleshoot this device. Apps and data may be shared, and your device may temporarily slow down.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your IT admin requested a bug report to help troubleshoot this device. Apps and data may be shared, and your device may temporarily slow down.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏤᎵ IT ᏄᏂᎬᏫᏳᏌᏕᎩ ᎤᏂᏔᏲᏢᎩ ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᎣᏍᏓᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎠᏓᏃᎯᏎᎭ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏔᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏞᎩᏊ ᏛᏍᎦᏃᎸᏔᏂ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Require PIN to start up your device. While off, this device can't receive calls, messages, notifications, or alarms.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Require PIN to start up your device. While off, this device can't receive calls, messages, notifications, or alarms.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏎᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏎᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ, ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ, ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ, ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᏗᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow this app to read, modify and delete all files on this device or any connected storage volumes. If granted, app may access files without your explicit knowledge.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow this app to read, modify and delete all files on this device or any connected storage volumes. If granted, app may access files without your explicit knowledge.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏁᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ, ᎤᏃᏒᎯᏐᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏂᎦᎥ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏧᎪᏗᏓᏃ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᏱᎩ, ᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏣᎦᏙᎲᏒ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can not select certificate automatically. Please select a certificate from the list, and then try to connect.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can not select certificate automatically. Please select a certificate from the list, and then try to connect.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏗ ᏰᎵᎢ ᎬᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏰᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᏅᏛᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᎿᏉᏃ ᎭᏁᎵᏓ ᏧᏓᎸᏗᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Change call barring password">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Change call barring password</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎦᎵᏌᏅᎯ ᏱᎦᏪᏍᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Toggle DNS Check">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Toggle DNS Check</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏗᏞᎩ DNS ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
