                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏰᎵ ᏅᎦ Ꮎ QR ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ ᎡᎳᏗᏨ ᎤᏂᏉᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᏂ Ꮎ \u201c\u201d</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To provide access to your work data, your organization may change settings and install software on your device.For more details, contact your organization's admin.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To provide access to your work data, your organization may change settings and install software on your device.For more details, contact your organization's admin.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎢᏣᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎯᏘᏅᏛᎦ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᏂᏕᎬᎿᏅᎢ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎢᏣᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
