            <termEntry id="Allow data exchange when the tablet touches an NFC device">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow data exchange when the tablet touches an NFC device</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎠᏒᏂᏍᏗ NFC ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your credit provider can change settings and install software on this device.To learn more, contact your creditor provider.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your credit provider can change settings and install software on this device.To learn more, contact your creditor provider.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎾᏓᏚᎬ ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎯᏘᏅᏛᎦ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎾᏓᏚᎬ ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A password protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face for authentication in apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A password protects your phone if it\u2019s lost or stolen.Your face model will also be permanently and securely deleted. You won\u2019t be able to use your face for authentication in apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>D ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ or ᎦᏃᏍᎩᏓ.ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎬᏩᎦᏘ ᏃᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ. ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Not on lock screen">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Not on lock screen</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᏓ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This will reset all network settings, including:Wi\u2011FiMobile dataBluetoothNFC">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This will reset all network settings, including:Wi\u2011FiMobile dataBluetoothNFC</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᏱᏙᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎾᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎾᏍᏊ Wi\u2011FiᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯBluetoothᎧᏁᎦ ᏴᏛᏁNFC</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Face unlock lets you unlock your device by looking at it. Keep in mind:\u25CF Your device may unlock any time you look at it.\u25CF Your device can be unlocked by someone else if they hold it in front of your face while your eyes are open.\u25CF Your device may also be unlocked by someone who looks a lot like you, such as a child or identical sibling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Face unlock lets you unlock your device by looking at it. Keep in mind:\u25CF Your device may unlock any time you look at it.\u25CF Your device can be unlocked by someone else if they hold it in front of your face while your eyes are open.\u25CF Your device may also be unlocked by someone who looks a lot like you, such as a child or identical sibling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎣᎧᏛ ᎠᏐᎭᎾᎸᏗ ᎣᎵᏍᎸᏓᏁ ᎠᏐᎭᎾᎸᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎢ ᎥᏘᏍᎬᎢ. ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᎣᏓᏅᏛ:\u25CF ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏐᎭᎾᎸᏗ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏘᏴᏊ ᏱᏣᎪᎵᏰᎠ.\u25CF ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏱᎩ ᎠᏐᎭᎾᎸᏗ ᎩᎳ ᏄᏓᎴᎢ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏱᏄᏅᏁᎳ ᎠᎬᏱᏗᏨ ᏣᎧᏛᎢ ᏕᎯᎦᏅ ᏧᎵᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᏱᎩ.\u25CF ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎤᏂᏐᎭᎾᎸᏗ ᎩᎶ ᎠᏏᏴᏫᏱᎩ ᎥᏠᏱ ᏤᎦᎦᏅᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏣᏍᏛ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎠᏲᏟ ᏃᎴ ᎧᎵᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᎤᏠᏱ ᏏᏓᏁᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can’t change volume">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can’t change volume</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᎥ ᎤᏜᏅᏛᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Quickly open camera">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Quickly open camera</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Use hotspot and tethering to provide internet to other devices through your mobile data connection. Apps can also create a hotspot to share content with nearby devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Use hotspot and tethering to provide internet to other devices through your mobile data connection. Apps can also create a hotspot to share content with nearby devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ ᏃᎴ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎦᏛᎴᏍᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ. ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎴᏯ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎪᏒᏗ Ꭰ ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎬᏗ ᎡᏍᎦᏂ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Update Do Not Disturb">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Update Do Not Disturb</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="SIM  is unusable.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>SIM  is unusable.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>SIM  ᏄᏍᏛ ᎬᏔᏅᏂᎨᏒᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To use mobile data, call features, and SMS at a later time, go to your network settings">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use mobile data, call features, and SMS at a later time, go to your network settings</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᏓᏯᏂ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ, ᏃᎴ SMS ᎤᎿᎢ Ꭰ ᎣᏂᏯᎨᏍᏗ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ, ᏤᏅᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Never show these notifications">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Never show these notifications</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏗ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎯᎠᏃ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Satellite imagery providers:©2014 CNES / Astrium, DigitalGlobe, Bluesky">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Satellite imagery providers:©2014 CNES / Astrium, DigitalGlobe, Bluesky</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏯᏅᎢᏗᏍᏕᏛ ᎬᏔᏅ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏍᎩ:©2014 CNES / Astrium, DigitalGlobe, Bluesky</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow this SIM to be used for mobile data only during calls">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow this SIM to be used for mobile data only during calls</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎯᎠ SIM ᎾᎢ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏫᏛᎬᏗᏍᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Network PUK locked">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Network PUK locked</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ PUK ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Permissions, account activity, personal data">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Permissions, account activity, personal data</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ, ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎾᏛᏁᎲ, ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Erasing this SIM removes  service from this device.Service for  won't be canceled.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Erasing this SIM removes  service from this device.Service for  won't be canceled.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ ᎯᎠ SIM ᏱᏗᎬᎾᏕᏍᏗ  ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ for  ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎠᏎᏒᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You won't be able to use your fingerprint to unlock your work profile, authorize purchases, or sign in to work apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You won't be able to use your fingerprint to unlock your work profile, authorize purchases, or sign in to work apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎧᏛ, ᎠᎵᏍᎪᏟᏙᏗᎢ ᏗᏩᎯᏍᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏚᏙᎥ ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can’t open this app">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can’t open this app</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎬᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can\u2019t add more fingerprints">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can\u2019t add more fingerprints</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The password you entered is correct, but unfortunately your data is corrupt. To resume using your tablet, you need to perform a factory reset. When you set up your tablet after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The password you entered is correct, but unfortunately your data is corrupt. To resume using your tablet, you need to perform a factory reset. When you set up your tablet after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᎢ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎡᏍᎦ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏓᏁᎸ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎤᏲ.  ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎴᏂᏐᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏂᎬᏁᏗ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎣᏂᏗᏢ ᏥᎩ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ, ᏂᎯ\u2019ll ᎠᏎ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎤᎾᏜᏅᏓᏕᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have lost data connectivity because you left your home network with data roaming turned off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have lost data connectivity because you left your home network with data roaming turned off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏗᎫᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᏅᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎦᏍᎦᏂ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎣᏪᏅᏒ ᏚᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎬᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎡᏙᎵᏙᎲ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="timezone">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>timezone</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᏗᏓᏓᎴᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Time">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Time</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This will erase all data from your tablet\u2019s internal storage, including:Your Google AccountSystem and app data and settingsDownloaded apps">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This will erase all data from your tablet\u2019s internal storage, including:Your Google AccountSystem and app data and settingsDownloaded apps</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎠᏎ ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ, ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎩ:ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Google ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏃᎴ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢᎡᎳᏗᎬᏘ ᏫᎦᏢᏅᎯ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can encrypt your accounts, settings, downloaded apps and their data, media, and other files. After you encrypt your tablet, assuming you\u2019ve set up a screen lock (that is, a pattern or numeric PIN or password), you\u2019ll need to unlock the screen to decrypt the tablet every time you power it on. The only other way to decrypt is to perform a factory data reset, erasing all your data.Encryption takes an hour or more. You must start with a charged battery and keep your tablet plugged in throughout the process. If you interrupt it, you\u2019ll lose some or all of your data">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can encrypt your accounts, settings, downloaded apps and their data, media, and other files. After you encrypt your tablet, assuming you\u2019ve set up a screen lock (that is, a pattern or numeric PIN or password), you\u2019ll need to unlock the screen to decrypt the tablet every time you power it on. The only other way to decrypt is to perform a factory data reset, erasing all your data.Encryption takes an hour or more. You must start with a charged battery and keep your tablet plugged in throughout the process. If you interrupt it, you\u2019ll lose some or all of your data</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ, ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎡᎳᏗᎬᏘ ᏫᎦᏢᏅᎯ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏐᎢ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ. ᎤᎶᏐᏅ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ, ᏃᎵᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᎯ\u2019ve ᏘᎧᎲᎦ Ꭰ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ (ᎥᏍᎩᎾ, Ꭰ ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏎᏍᏙᏗ PIN ᏃᎴ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ), ᏂᎯ\u2019ll ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎭᏓᏗᎭ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᏂᎪᎯᎸ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎾᎿ ᎤᎿᎢ. ᏥᎩ ᎤᏅᏒ ᏐᎢ ᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎭᏓᏗᎭ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏱᏣᏛᏁᏗ Ꭰ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ, ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ.ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎩᏍᎪᎢ Ꭰ ᏑᏟᎶᏛ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ. ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎭᎴᎾ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎬᏩᎶᏔᏅ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎤᏊᏄᎾᏘ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎦᏅᎯᏒ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎯᎵᏒ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏓᏲᏍᏓᏁᎸᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ, ᏂᎯ\u2019ll ᏣᎫᎯ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏃᎴ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Got it">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Got it</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᎵᎦ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="During the move: \u2022 Don\u2019t remove the ^1. \u2022 Some apps won\u2019t work correctly. \u2022 Keep the device charged.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>During the move: \u2022 Don\u2019t remove the ^1. \u2022 Some apps won\u2019t work correctly. \u2022 Keep the device charged.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ: \u2022 ᏝᏍᏗ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ^1. \u2022 ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᏊ. \u2022 ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏗᎬᏩᎶᏔᏅ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don\u2019t show notifications at all">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don\u2019t show notifications at all</term></tig></langSet>
