            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your phone and personal data are more vulnerable to attack by unknown apps. By installing apps from this source, you agree that you are responsible for any damage to your phone or loss of data that may result from their use.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your phone and personal data are more vulnerable to attack by unknown apps. By installing apps from this source, you agree that you are responsible for any damage to your phone or loss of data that may result from their use.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏩᎾᎦᎳᎢ ᏗᎦᏘᎴᎩ ᏄᏩᏅ ᎬᎪᏟᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏒᎾ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ. ᎬᏗ ᎦᏘᏅᏛᏍᎦ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎯᎠ ᏧᏓᎴᏅᎲᎢ, ᏕᎭᏓᏁᎸᎩ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎤᎾᏚᏓᎸ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎤᏲᏨᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏲᎲᏎᎸ ᎾᎿ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don\u2019t allow">
