            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Do Not Disturb overridden">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Do Not Disturb overridden</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏤᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗ ᏓᏓᏭᎯᎳᏗᏍᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To use the apps, photos, or data this ^1 contains, reinsert it. Alternatively, you can choose to forget this storage if the device isn\u2019t available. If you choose to forget, all the data the device contains will be lost forever. You can reinstall the apps later, but their data stored on this device will be lost.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use the apps, photos, or data this ^1 contains, reinsert it. Alternatively, you can choose to forget this storage if the device isn\u2019t available. If you choose to forget, all the data the device contains will be lost forever. You can reinstall the apps later, but their data stored on this device will be lost.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎯᎠ ^1 ᏕᎦᎸᏛᎢ, ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ. ᎠᏓᏁᎵᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏧᏩᎨᏩ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ. ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏧᏩᎨᏩ, ᏂᎦᏓ ᏥᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏕᎦᎸᏛᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᎬᏩᎦᏔᏉ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᏘᏅᏛᎦ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎣᏂᏯᎨᏍᏗ, ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don\u2019t play sound when inserting or removing tablet from dock">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don\u2019t play sound when inserting or removing tablet from dock</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏤᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᏛᏁᎸᏗ ᎦᏃᏴᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎪᏣᎸᏗ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏂᎬᏅᏕᏍᎬᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎠᏝᏅᏗᏱ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
