            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This requires the ^1 to be formatted. Formatting erases all data currently stored on the ^1. To avoid losing the data, consider backing it up.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This requires the ^1 to be formatted. Formatting erases all data currently stored on the ^1. To avoid losing the data, consider backing it up.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎠᏎᏳᎾᏛᏁᏗ ᏥᎩ ^1 ᎾᎿᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎪᏢᏅᎯ. ᎪᏢᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ all ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ on the ^1. To ᏗᏓᏅᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᏲᎱᏎᎲ the ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᎭᏓᏅᏛᎵ ᎠᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
