            <termEntry id="Fingerprint Unlock creates a unique model of your child\u2019s fingerprint to verify it\u2019s them. To create this fingerprint model during setup, they will take images of their fingerprint from different positions.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Fingerprint Unlock creates a unique model of your child\u2019s fingerprint to verify it\u2019s them. To create this fingerprint model during setup, they will take images of their fingerprint from different positions.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏓᏙᏢᏍᎪᎢ ᎤᏩᏒᎯᏯ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅ ᎤᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎰᎯᏳᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ. To ᎪᏒᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎨᏒ ᏘᎧᎲᎦ, ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᎤᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᎾᎿ ᏓᏂᏙᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When Do Not Disturb is on, messages, reminders, and events will be muted, except for the items you allow above. You can adjust messages settings to allow your friends, family, or other contacts to reach you.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Do Not Disturb is on, messages, reminders, and events will be muted, except for the items you allow above. You can adjust messages settings to allow your friends, family, or other contacts to reach you.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ, ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ, ᏗᏓᏅᏓᏗᏍᏗᏍᎩ, ᏃᎴ ᏂᏕᎦᎵᏍᏔᏂᏙᎲ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎡᎳᏪᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ, ᎢᏳᏍᎩᏂᏃᏅ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏑᏓᎮᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎸᎢ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎸ ᏗᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏣᎵᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
