            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Styles lets you create custom themes with unique fonts, colors, icon shapes, and layouts. Themes may not work well with third party launchers.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Styles lets you create custom themes with unique fonts, colors, icon shapes, and layouts. Themes may not work well with third party launchers.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏧᎾᏣᏅᏙᏗ ᏩᏂᎩ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏄᏍᏛᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗᎢ ᏧᏓᏤᏟᏓ ᏗᎧᏃᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎤᏩᏒᎯᏯ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏗᏙᏪᎵᏍᎩ, ᏗᏑᏫᏓ, ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᏱᎬᏂ. ᏧᏓᏤᏟᏓ ᏗᎧᏃᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎥᏝ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗᎢ ᎬᏗ ᏦᎢᏁ ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
