            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="System Tracing files may include sensitive system and app data (such as app usage). Only share system traces with people and apps you trust.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>System Tracing files may include sensitive system and app data (such as app usage). Only share system traces with people and apps you trust.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏗᏍᏒ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏙᏗ ᎤᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏌᏘ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ (ᏕᎧᏁᎢᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ). ᎤᏅᏒ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᏃᎴ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎪᎯᏳᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="All traces will be deleted from /data/local/traces">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>All traces will be deleted from /data/local/traces</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎦᏓ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ /ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ/ᎡᏍᎦᏂ/ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
