            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If an app is unused for a few months:\u2022 Permissions are removed to protect your data\u2022 Temporary files are removed to free up space">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If an app is unused for a few months:\u2022 Permissions are removed to protect your data\u2022 Temporary files are removed to free up space</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᎡᎢ Ꭰ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎬᏔᏅᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Ꭰ ᎦᏲᎵ ᏓᏦᎳᏂᏒᎢ:\u2022 ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᎲᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ\u2022 ᏞᎦᏊ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎠᎲᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏚᏓᎴᎩ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ</term></tig></langSet>
