            <termEntry id=" is a provider of location services for this device. Location access can be modified from location settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> is a provider of location services for this device. Location access can be modified from location settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎨᎡᎢ Ꭰ ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏍᎩ ᎾᎿ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎢᏗᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ can be ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏗ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If an app is unused for a few months:\u2022 Permissions are removed to protect your data\u2022 Notifications are stopped to save battery\u2022 Temporary files are removed to free up spaceTo allow permissions and notifications again, open the app.">
