                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>FDN wasn't updated because the number exceeds  digits.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>FDN ᏤᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅ ᎢᎬᏂᏏᏍᎩ Ꮎ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎦᎶᏒᏍᏗᏍᎪᎢ  ᏗᏎᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
