                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When one number isn't reachable, always forward calls to your other number</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏌᏊ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᏝᏰᏃ ᏫᎨᎦᎷᎯᏍᏗ, ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎠᎬᏱᏗᏨ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏗ ᏫᎬᏔᏅ ᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
