                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Choose an equalizer preset to enhance your sound.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᎭ ᏱᏗᎬᏁᎯ ᎦᏳᎳ ᎦᎧᏅᎯ ᎾᎢ ᏓᏤᎴᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
