            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="TTY is not compatible with Voice over Wi-Fi. Please disable TTY funtionality before attempting Voice over Wi-Fi calls.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>TTY is not compatible with Voice over Wi-Fi. Please disable TTY funtionality before attempting Voice over Wi-Fi calls.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>TTY ᏄᏍᏛ ᎭᏗ ᏗᏙᎵᎩ ᏱᎩ ᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎤᏓᏬᎯᎳᏗᏍᏗ ᏫᎢ-ᏈᎢ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏓ TTY ᎣᏍᏛ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎤᏓᎷᎸ ᎠᏁᎶᏗᏍᎬ ᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎤᏓᏬᎯᎳᏗᏍᏗ ᏫᎢ-ᏈᎢ ᏫᏗᎬᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
