            <termEntry id="This service is only available with China Unicom SIM. Set &lt;&gt; as default data SIM?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This service is only available with China Unicom SIM. Set &lt;&gt; as default data SIM?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᎾᎿ ᏣᎢᎾ ᎤᏃᎴ ᎦᏙᎯ ᎠᏓᏛᎪᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᎸ ᏏᎻ. ᎦᎧᎲᎢ &lt;&gt; ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏏᎻ?</term></tig></langSet>
