            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can create custom profiles for Bluetooth and USB-C audio devices. Each time you connect a device, Moto Audio will remember the last settings you used.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can create custom profiles for Bluetooth and USB-C audio devices. Each time you connect a device, Moto Audio will remember the last settings you used.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏲᏢᎾ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎢᏳᎾᏛᏁᏗ ᏚᎧᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎠᏓᎾᏙᏓ ᎠᎴ USB-C ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏂᏓᏟᏱᎵᏒᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎱᏓᎸᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, Moto ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎠᏎ ᏛᏓᏗᏍᏔᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎣᏂ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏨᏔᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
