            <termEntry id="Hold the top of your phone to NFC tags like business cards or product tags in-store to access information quickly and easily.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Hold the top of your phone to NFC tags like business cards or product tags in-store to access information quickly and easily.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏚ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗᎢ ᎾᎾᎢ NFC ᏗᎦᏛᏗ ᎤᏐᏱ ᎠᏕᎳᎪᏢᏗ ᏗᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏗᎦᏛᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ-ᎠᏓᎾᏅᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗᎢ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᎤᎵᏍᏗᏳ ᎠᎩᏍᏗᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎯᏗᎨᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Current proposal doesn't fit in routing table, select another configuration">
