            <termEntry id="Make sure the Ready For Assistant is open on your PC.If the Ready For Assistant is not installed, you can download it from ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make sure the Ready For Assistant is open on your PC.If the Ready For Assistant is not installed, you can download it from </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ PC. ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ  ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎥᏝ is not ᎦᏘᏅᏔᏅ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎦᏢᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="While you're gaming, you can access settings through the toolkit. You can also find settings in the Moto app anytime.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>While you're gaming, you can access settings through the toolkit. You can also find settings in the Moto app anytime.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏓᏁᎸᏗᏍᎬᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏱᏴᎯ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᎦᏛᎴᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏧᏓᎴᏅᏛ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏉ ᏱᏩᏔ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Moto ᎬᏙᏗ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭᏊ ᎢᏴᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
