            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Connect your phone to an external display for immersive entertainment, video chat capability, and a powerful desktop experience">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Connect your phone to an external display for immersive entertainment, video chat capability, and a powerful desktop experience</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏙᏯᏗᏜ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎭᏓᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᏛᏁᎸᏗ, ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏓ ᎢᎬᏩᏛᏁᏗ, ᎠᎴ  ᎤᎳᏂᎩᏛ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
