            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You would need to be restart  session post establishing Mobile hotspot.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You would need to be restart  session post establishing Mobile hotspot.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏱᏣᏚᎵᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎢᏣᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ  ᏗᎦᎳᏫᎢᏍᏗ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᏢᏍᎩ  ᎠᏃᏢᏍᎬ  ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
