            <termEntry id="You can customize your phone’s color palette with Moto’s Personalize feature found in the home screen menu or within the Moto App.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can customize your phone’s color palette with Moto’s Personalize feature found in the home screen menu or within the Moto App.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏑᏫᏓ ᏧᏂᏠᏗ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏗ Moto’s Personalize ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ ᎠᎩᏩᏛᎲᎩ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ ᏧᏪᏅᏒ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏫᏂᏗᏢ Moto App.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Click to switch pen typesIn Moto Note you can switch between your current and last used pen styles by single clicking the stylus button.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Click to switch pen typesIn Moto Note you can switch between your current and last used pen styles by single clicking the stylus button.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎢᏧᏍᏗᎾᎿ Moto Note ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎣᏂ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᏂᏚᏍᏛ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᎵ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏌᏊᎢᏳᎪᏗ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Choose what happens when you single click the stylus button">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Choose what happens when you single click the stylus button</term></tig></langSet>
