            <termEntry id="When you increase the display size, the keyboard and some apps may not work as expected">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you increase the display size, the keyboard and some apps may not work as expected</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎳᏴᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎧᏁᏉᎩ ᎢᎩᏓ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏅᎦ, ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ Ꮭ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏚᎩ ᎤᏩᏒ</term></tig></langSet>
