            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow apps to receive Moto state">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow apps to receive Moto state</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ Moto ᏗᎪᏏᏐᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Turn on to use 2.4GHz hotspot, it helps other devices find this hotspot but reduces hotspot connection speed.Turn off to use 5GHz hotspot.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Turn on to use 2.4GHz hotspot, it helps other devices find this hotspot but reduces hotspot connection speed.Turn off to use 5GHz hotspot.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ 2.4GHz ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᏓᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎪ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎯᏩᏔ ᎯᎠ ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ ᎠᏎᏃ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ ᎦᏣᏄᎵ ᏗᎦᏲᎳᎨ .ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ 5GHz ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto Gametime enhances your gaming experience with tools and settings that help you block unwanted distractions and focus on the game you’re playing.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Gametime enhances your gaming experience with tools and settings that help you block unwanted distractions and focus on the game you’re playing.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᏟᏱᎶᎦ ᏓᏤᏢᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏕᎭᏁᎶᎲᏍᎬ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏥᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏍᏚᏗᏍᎦ ᏃᏚᎵᏍᎬᎾ ᏗᏓᏲᎯᏍᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᎴ ᎤᎿᏊ ᎢᎦ ᏫᏔᎧᏅᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏕᎭᏁᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Easy gestures and touch interactions help you perform everyday tasks with quick and intuitive motions. Use the toggles to enable each Moto Action, and tap on the descriptions for tutorials and more information.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Easy gestures and touch interactions help you perform everyday tasks with quick and intuitive motions. Use the toggles to enable each Moto Action, and tap on the descriptions for tutorials and more information.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎯᏓ ᏧᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏒᏂᏍᏗ ᏓᏔᎳᏗᏍᎬᎩ ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᏧᎩᏨᏅᏓ ᎢᏗᏛᏁᏗ ᎤᏐᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏃᎴ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏕᎳᎰᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ. ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏧᏗᏞᎩ ᎾᎢ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ ᏧᏤᎵᏛ Moto ᎠᎵᏖᎸᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏚᏍᏛ ᏗᎧᏃᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏗᏓᏕᏲᎲᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Go to Moto">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Go to Moto</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎮᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ Moto</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Turn on to use both 2.4GHz and 5GHz hotspot, it helps other devices find this hotspot but increases battery usage.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Turn on to use both 2.4GHz and 5GHz hotspot, it helps other devices find this hotspot but increases battery usage.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎢᏧᎳ 2.4GHz ᎠᎴ 5GHz ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᏓᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎪ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎯᏩᏔ ᎯᎠ ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ ᎠᏎᏃ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗᎢ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᎪ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To enjoy the full Moto experiences, go to settings and enable Moto Actions and Moto Display">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To enjoy the full Moto experiences, go to settings and enable Moto Actions and Moto Display</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᎵᎢ Moto ᎤᏂᎦᏙᎲᏒ, ᎮᎾ ᎾᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ Moto ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎠᎴ Moto ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The features in Moto Display give you more control over your screen. Attentive Display keeps the screen on while you’re looking at it, and Peek Display lets you see notifications, even when the screen is off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The features in Moto Display give you more control over your screen. Attentive Display keeps the screen on while you’re looking at it, and Peek Display lets you see notifications, even when the screen is off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ Moto ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏣᏁᎮᏍᏗ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏬᎯᎳᏗᏍᎬ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ. ᎠᎵᏏᎾᎯᏍᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏂᎯᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎯᎪᎵᏰᏍᎬᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏗᎧᎿᏅ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To access the media player when the screen is locked, swipe left or right on the external display. When the screen is unlocked, swipe up. When media controls are enabled in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked. Tap and hold the volume up key to go to the next track, and tap and hold the volume down key to go to the previous track.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To access the media player when the screen is locked, swipe left or right on the external display. When the screen is unlocked, swipe up. When media controls are enabled in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked. Tap and hold the volume up key to go to the next track, and tap and hold the volume down key to go to the previous track.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏁᎶᎲᏍᎩ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏙᏯᏗᏢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᏕᏗ, ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏗᏍᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ Moto ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏚᎾᎳᏍᏅᎢ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ. ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎮᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᏐᎢ ᎤᎳᏍᏅᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎡᎳᏗᏢ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎮᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏧᏩᎫᏔᏅ ᎤᎳᏍᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby Audio provides a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeaker and connected devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Audio provides a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeaker and connected devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Audio ᏙᏓᎨᏥᏁᎵ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏗᏛᏓᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Ready For lets you share the power of your phone with nearby PCs.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Ready For lets you share the power of your phone with nearby PCs.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎾᎥᏂᎨᏍᏗ PCs.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To access the media player, swipe down from the top of the display. When the screen is unlocked, swipe up.When media controls are turned on in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To access the media player, swipe down from the top of the display. When the screen is unlocked, swipe up.When media controls are turned on in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏁᎶᎲᏍᎩ, ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏗᏍᎬ ᎡᎳᏗᏢ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᏕᏗ, ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏗᏍᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ.ᎾᎯᏳ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ Moto ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏚᎾᎳᏍᏅᎢ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
