                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Some operations haven't finished yet, so your request will be closed.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᏱᎸᏒᎯ ᎥᏝᏃ ᏝᏏ ᎤᏂᏍᏆᏛ ᏱᎩ, ᎾᏃ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏔᏲᎯᎭ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏍᏚᏅᎩ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
