            <termEntry id="Moto Intelligence">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Intelligence</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎠᏌᏑᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When media controls are turned on in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When media controls are turned on in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ Moto ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᏐᎨᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏚᎾᎳᏍᏅᎢ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Many apps provide shortcuts you can access by pressing and holding on the app icon. Try it on the Moto app icon for easy access to your favorite features.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Many apps provide shortcuts you can access by pressing and holding on the app icon. Try it on the Moto app icon for easy access to your favorite features.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏂᏣᏘ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ ᏍᏆᎳ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᎯ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏂᏱᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ. ᏣᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ Moto ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᎯᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏫᏣᏉᏛᎢ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Not all third-party apps support audio zoom">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Not all third-party apps support audio zoom</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎥᏝ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏦᎢᏁ-ᎤᎾᏓᏟᏌᎲ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎦᎫᏍᏛᏓ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏧᎻ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Move the pointer to the upper left of the screen">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Move the pointer to the upper left of the screen</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎲᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᎯᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ ᎠᏍᎦᏂ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="See what's in the latest softwareImproved dashboard managementMore sidebar optionsMute/unmute from the sidebar in video calls">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>See what's in the latest softwareImproved dashboard managementMore sidebar optionsMute/unmute from the sidebar in video calls</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᏤᎯᎨᎢᏍᏗ ᏩᏂᎨ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅ ᎠᏝᏅᏗ ᎠᏯᏔᎾᎸ ᏄᏂᎬᏫᏳᏌᏕᎩᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏟᏗᏢ ᎪᏪᎸᎢ ᏗᏑᏰᏍᏗᎡᎳᏪ/ᎡᏝᏪ ᏱᎬᏕᏍᏗ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏟᏗᏢ ᎪᏪᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏫᏗᎬᏔᏅᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto makes it easy to open the camera, even when your device is locked. Just twist your wrist twice quickly, and you'll never miss a moment you want to capture.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto makes it easy to open the camera, even when your device is locked. Just twist your wrist twice quickly, and you'll never miss a moment you want to capture.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᏂᎬᏁᎠ ᎠᏂᏗᎨ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᎲᎢ. ᏣᏍᏕᏯᏍᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎵᏰᏑᏜᏗᏍᏗ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᏗ ᎤᎵᏍᏛ, ᏃᎴ ᎭᏗ ᎯᎷᎯᏴ ᏱᎨᎯᏅᏓ ᎢᏳᏊ ᏱᏣᏚᎵ ᏣᏂᏴᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When media controls are enabled in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked. Tap and hold the volume up key to go to the next track, and tap and hold the volume down key to go to the previous track.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When media controls are enabled in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked. Tap and hold the volume up key to go to the next track, and tap and hold the volume down key to go to the previous track.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎡᎵᏊ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Moto ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎪᏫᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏗᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏗᎪᎷᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᎲᎢ. ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎡᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏐᎢ ᎪᎷᏅᏍᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎡᎳᏗ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎡᎾᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏧᏩᎫᏔᏅ ᎪᎷᏅᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Crystaltalk AI for recording">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Crystaltalk AI for recording</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Crystaltalk AI ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎦᏂᏴᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Just so you know">
