            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Are you sure you want to restore battery, display, and storage to their original settings?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Are you sure you want to restore battery, display, and storage to their original settings?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᎯᏍᎪ ᏣᏚᎵ ᏥᎬᎧᎭ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ, ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ, ᎠᎴ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏥᏄᏍᏓᏭ ᏕᎦᎧᎲ?</term></tig></langSet>
