            <termEntry id="Wi\u2011Fi doesn\u0027t turn back on automatically">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wi\u2011Fi doesn\u0027t turn back on automatically</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi\u2011Fi ᏝᏍ ᎠᏨᏒᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Show conversations, default, and silent">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Show conversations, default, and silent</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏓᎾᏟᏃᎮᏍᎬᎢ, ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎡᎳᏪ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Bluetooth scanning is on, Wi\u2011Fi scanning is off">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Bluetooth scanning is on, Wi\u2011Fi scanning is off</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Bluetooth ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᎢ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ, Wi\u2011Fi ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᎢ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In addition to a screen lock, you can use a SIM PIN to prevent access to cellular networks. Your SIM card came with a default PIN from your carrier. In order to use cellular services, you must enter the PIN whenever you swap SIM cards or restart your device.Warning: If you enter an incorrect PIN code multiple times, your SIM card will be completely disabled.You will then need to obtain a PIN Unlock Key (PUK) from your carrier to enable your SIM card again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In addition to a screen lock, you can use a SIM PIN to prevent access to cellular networks. Your SIM card came with a default PIN from your carrier. In order to use cellular services, you must enter the PIN whenever you swap SIM cards or restart your device.Warning: If you enter an incorrect PIN code multiple times, your SIM card will be completely disabled.You will then need to obtain a PIN Unlock Key (PUK) from your carrier to enable your SIM card again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎬᏁᏉᏍᏛᏅ ᎠᏛᏴᎵᏛᏍᎬ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ, SIM PIN ᏴᏓ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ. Ꮒ SIM ᎠᏆᏂᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ PIN ᏧᏛᎴᏅᎲ. ᏍᏙᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎢᏗᏓᏛᏁᏗᎢ, ᎠᏎ ᎯᏴᏓ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ PIN ᎢᏘᏁᏟᏴ SIM ᎠᏉᏂᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏔᎲᏍᎩ: ᏴᏯᏝ ᏂᏚᏳᎬᏛᎾ PIN ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ ᎯᎸᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏩᎦᏗ, Ꮒ ᏣᏤᎵ SIM ᏗᏉᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎧᎵ ᏛᎴᏫᏍᏔᏂ.ᎢᏣᏚᎵᏍᎨᏍᏗ ᎠᎩᏍᎥ PIN ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᏧᏛᎴᏅᎲ ᎠᎵᏊᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ Ꮎ SIM ᏗᏉᎾᏲᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tools">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tools</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Stop backing up your Wi\u2011Fi passwords, bookmarks, other settings, and app data, plus erase all copies on Google servers?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Stop backing up your Wi\u2011Fi passwords, bookmarks, other settings, and app data, plus erase all copies on Google servers?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᎴᏫᏍᏓ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ Wi\u2011Fi ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᏗᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ, ᎪᏪᎵ ᎠᏩᏛᏙᏗ, ᏐᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ , ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎤᎾᎢ Google ᏗᏯᏙᎯᎯ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="No visuals or sound from notifications">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>No visuals or sound from notifications</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏂᎩᏓ ᏓᏥᎶᏍᏛ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏃᏴᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your screen brightness will automatically adjust to your environment and activities. You can move the slider manually to help adaptive brightness learn your preferences.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your screen brightness will automatically adjust to your environment and activities. You can move the slider manually to help adaptive brightness learn your preferences.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎤᏍᎪᏍᏗᏴ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎡᎶᎯ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᏃᎴ ᏄᎾᏛᏁᎸᏅ. ᏰᎵᏯ ᏣᎲᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎲᏍᎩ ᎣᏩᏌ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᏍᎪᏍᏗᏴ ᎤᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏣᏟᎠᏰᎸᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Add another language for a better Moto experience">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Add another language for a better Moto experience</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏗ ᏓᏤᏢ Moto ᎤᎦᏙᎲᏒ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="SIM card changed">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>SIM card changed</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can create categories to easily find and manage all of your notes.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can create categories to easily find and manage all of your notes.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏲᏢᎾ ᏗᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎯᏗᎨᎢ ᎠᏩᏛᏗ ᎠᎴ  ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏙᎯ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="New category">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>New category</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏤ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your stylus lets you take quick notes on the go.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your stylus lets you take quick notes on the go.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᏗᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏗᏣᏪᎶᏛ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎮᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Navigate with buttons at the bottom of your screen">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Navigate with buttons at the bottom of your screen</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏪᎸ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏓᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎦᏗ ᎤᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎭᏫᏂᏗᏨ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" apps can use unrestricted data">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> apps can use unrestricted data</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏅᏍᏙᏒᎥᎾ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Some people can interrupt">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Some people can interrupt</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᎦᏓ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏧᎾᏓᏲᏍᏓᏁᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When there are no shortcuts added, you won’t see the shortcuts bubble when you remove the stylus">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When there are no shortcuts added, you won’t see the shortcuts bubble when you remove the stylus</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᎿᏃ Ꮭ ᏥᏳᎪᏓᏃ ᎧᏁᏉᏓ, ᏂᎯ Ꮭ ᏒᎵᎢ ᏱᎦᏴᎪᏩᏔ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᏳᎪᏓᏃ ᎠᎵᏆᎷᎲᏍᎬ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can pair other styluses with your Moto phone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can pair other styluses with your Moto phone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎼᏙ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="However, some styluses may not be compatible.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>However, some styluses may not be compatible.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏎᏍᎩᏂ, ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ Ꮭ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏗᏙᎵᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Based on your activity">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Based on your activity</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎳᏏᏔᏅᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᎾᏛᏁᎲ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Never vibrate">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Never vibrate</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏤᏍᏗ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᏳᎵᏖᎸᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When Moto stylus is connected, this function will turn off automatically.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Moto stylus is connected, this function will turn off automatically.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎼᏙ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᎣᏍᏛ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ, ᎯᎠ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏍᏚᏓ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Find the sensor">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Find the sensor</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏩᏘᏍᎩ ᎯᏩᏔ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Stylus was last removed atLocation:">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Stylus was last removed atLocation:</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᎨᏍᏒ ᎣᏂ ᎠᎲᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ:</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Until you turn off">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Until you turn off</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᏣᏍᏚᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Charging sounds and vibration">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Charging sounds and vibration</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬ ᏚᏃᏴᎬ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎵᏖᎸᎲᏍᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Choose the action when you single click the button on the stylus.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Choose the action when you single click the button on the stylus.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᏌᏊᎢᏳᎪᏗ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Stylus hardware has new firmware (version ),update to provide better experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Stylus hardware has new firmware (version ),update to provide better experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᎭ iᏤ ᎠᏍᏓᏯᎪᏢᏅᎯ (ᏄᏓᎴᏒᎢ ),ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ ᏓᏤᏢᎩ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="1 app can use unrestricted data">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>1 app can use unrestricted data</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>1 ᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏅᏍᏙᏒᎥᎾ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto Audio lets you create custom profiles for your headphones and Bluetooth speakers so you can always enjoy the best sound, no matter how you listen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Audio lets you create custom profiles for your headphones and Bluetooth speakers so you can always enjoy the best sound, no matter how you listen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎢᏳᎾᏛᏁᎯ ᏚᎧᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏳᏙᎾᏗᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎠᏓᎾᏙᏓ ᏗᏂᏬᏂᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ, ᎭᏗ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏅᏰᎵᏛᎾ ᏰᎵᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏕᎭᏛᏓᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your phone will no longer be paired with ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your phone will no longer be paired with </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎ Ꮭ ᎦᏅᎯᏓᎨ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please make sure the stylus is connected with the phone by bluetooth and keep connecting during updating.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Please make sure the stylus is connected with the phone by bluetooth and keep connecting during updating.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏩᏊ ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᎤᏠᎯᏯᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎠᏓᎾᏙᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏂᎦᏯᎢᏒ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏗᏍᎬ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The board is resetting, please restart the app.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The board is resetting, please restart the app.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ, ᎰᏩᏊ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To open the toolkit panel, you can tap on the floating icon.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To open the toolkit panel, you can tap on the floating icon.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏧᏓᎴᏅᏛ ᎠᏯᏔᎾᎸ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏟᏲᎷᎲᏍᎩ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Single click:Switch between the last used pen and the current used pen when drawing">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Single click:Switch between the last used pen and the current used pen when drawing</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏌᏊᎢᏳᎪᏗ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ:ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᏟ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎣᏂ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎦᏁᎯ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏃᏊᏥᎩ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎦᏁᎯ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Shared data ID: ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Shared data ID: </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏔᏅ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ID: </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="1 hour">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>1 hour</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>1 ᎢᏳᏪᏅᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="LOCAL">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>LOCAL</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᏍᎦᏂ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Single click:Switch between the last used pen and the current used pen when drawingLong press and hold:Switch to rubber temporarily">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Single click:Switch between the last used pen and the current used pen when drawingLong press and hold:Switch to rubber temporarily</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏌᏊᎢᏳᎪᏗ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ:ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᏟ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎣᏂ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎦᏂᎯ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏊᏥᎩ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎦᏁᎯ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢᎦᏅᎯᏓ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ;ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏜ ᎾᎢ ᏞᎩᏊ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don't show it again">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don't show it again</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎮᏍᏗ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏙᏗ ᏏᏊ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make sure bluetooth is enabled on both devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make sure bluetooth is enabled on both devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ bluetooth ᎨᎡᎢ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏂᏚᏩᏂᎸᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎢᏧᎳᏃ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Automatically connected via network rating provider">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Automatically connected via network rating provider</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᎾᎿ ᎢᏗᏨ ᎤᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᏟᎶᏍᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The icon can be moved around to anywhere you want.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The icon can be moved around to anywhere you want.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᏰᎴᏯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎠᏂᎲᎠ ᎠᏕᏯᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᎬᏉ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎵᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto Note asks for the following permissions:">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Note asks for the following permissions:</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ ᏗᏓᏛᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto Note is the hub for all of your handwritten notes and drawings. You can create categories to easily find and manage all of your notes.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Note is the hub for all of your handwritten notes and drawings. You can create categories to easily find and manage all of your notes.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏰᏟ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᏬᏰᏂ ᎬᏔᏅ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎯ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ ᎠᎴ ᏓᎵᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏲᏢᎾ ᏗᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎯᏗᎨᎢ ᎯᏩᏔ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏙᎯ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto Note is the hub for all of your creations. You can create categories to easily find and manage all of your notes.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Note is the hub for all of your creations. You can create categories to easily find and manage all of your notes.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏰᏟ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎪᏢᏅᎯ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏲᏢᎾ ᏗᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎯᏗᎨᎢ ᎠᏩᏛᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏙᎯ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto Note">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Note</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can manage the features setting in Settings&gt;System&gt;Video call effects.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can manage the features setting in Settings&gt;System&gt;Video call effects.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎿ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ&gt;ᏂᏕᎬᏅᎩ&gt;ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please include an area code with the number and try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Please include an area code with the number and try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏗ Ꭰ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Click this icon to adjust camera settings during a video call">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Click this icon to adjust camera settings during a video call</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎯᏳ Ꭰ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It will take at most 1 minute to obtain GPS fix.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>It will take at most 1 minute to obtain GPS fix.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏉᏃ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎪᏗᏗ 1 ᎢᏯᏔᏬᏍᏔᏅ ᎾᎿ ᎠᎩᏍᏒ GPS ᎣᏍᏓ ᏱᏨᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="See the list of enabled apps">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>See the list of enabled apps</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏓᏎᏍᏛᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏂᏚᏩᏂᎸᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Less time.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Less time.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏲᎵᎨ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This feature enables you to set different visual effects during a video call.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This feature enables you to set different visual effects during a video call.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ ᎾᎯᏳ Ꭰ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can tap on it to configure the settings for that app.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can tap on it to configure the settings for that app.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᎳ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎤᎿ ᎾᎿ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Camera Desktop Settings is active">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Camera Desktop Settings is active</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎬᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Besides, GPS may fail to provide time due to weak environmental signal.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Besides, GPS may fail to provide time due to weak environmental signal.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏗᎨᏒᎾ, GPS ᏰᎵᏉ ᎤᏄᎸᏅ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᎡᏗᎬ ᎾᎢ ᎤᏩᎾᎦᎳᎢ ᎡᏍᎦᏂ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="QR code is expired, please scan again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>QR code is expired, please scan again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>QR ᎦᎵᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎶᏒᏍᏔᏅ, ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏏᏊ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Folder name is too long">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Folder name is too long</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏴᏈᏛᎥᏍᎩ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎦᏅᎯᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This spell checker may be able to collect all the text you type, including personal data like passwords and credit card numbers. It comes from the app . Use this spell checker?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This spell checker may be able to collect all the text you type, including personal data like passwords and credit card numbers. It comes from the app . Use this spell checker?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎠᏍᏇᎵᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ ᎠᏎ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎡᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎩ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏣᏐᎥᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ, ᎤᏐᏯᏍᏗ ᎠᏏᏴᏫ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎩ ᎢᏳᏍᏘ ᏱᏗᎦᏪᏍᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏓᏚᎲᏍᎩ ᏆᏂᏲᏍᏗ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎤᎷᏨᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ . ᎯᎠ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏇᎵᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="For storing anything on this device only, including apps and photos. Requires formatting that prevents it from working with other devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>For storing anything on this device only, including apps and photos. Requires formatting that prevents it from working with other devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎬ ᏂᎦᎥᏉ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏩᏌ, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ. ᎠᏎᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎪᏢᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏗᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗᎢ ᎬᏗ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your stylus lets you write quick notes anytime. Just pull it out to start a new note. Your notes will save to Moto Note.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your stylus lets you write quick notes anytime. Just pull it out to start a new note. Your notes will save to Moto Note.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏣᏪᎶᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭᏊ ᎢᏴᎢ. ᏫᏣᏌᏁᏍᏗᏊ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎴᏅᏓ ᎢᏤ ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸᎢ. ᏣᏤᎵ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ ᎠᏎ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏙᏗ ᎾᎾᎢ Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏑᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To record an audio note, Moto Note needs permission to record audio.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To record an audio note, Moto Note needs permission to record audio.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎦᏂᏴᏙᏗ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ, Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ ᏧᏚᎸᏗ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏂᏴᏙᏗ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto Note ()">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Note ()</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ ()</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To simulate mouse left click, single press the stylus button.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To simulate mouse left click, single press the stylus button.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎤᏠᏱ ᏯᏛᏁᎯ ᏥᏍᏕᏥ ᎠᏍᎦᏂ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏗ, ᏌᏊᎢᏳᎪᏗ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To simulate mouse right click, single press the stylus button twice.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To simulate mouse right click, single press the stylus button twice.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎤᏠᏱ ᏯᏛᏁᎯ ᏥᏍᏕᏥ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏗᏓ, ᏌᏊᎢᏳᎪᏗ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᎫᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The WAPI certificates does not exist. Please intall them.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The WAPI certificates does not exist. Please intall them.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ WAPI ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏤᏍᏗ ᏱᏄᏍᏓ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᏘᏘᏅᏛᎦ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sydney, Canberra">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sydney, Canberra</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏏᏛᏂ, ᎨᏅᏇᎳ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Insert the SIM card into the tray. Then, insert the tray with the metal contacts facing the screen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Insert the SIM card into the tray. Then, insert the tray with the metal contacts facing the screen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏣᎸᎥᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎾᎾᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏝᏅᏙᏗ. ᎿᏉᏃ, ᎰᏣᎸᎥᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏝᏅᏙᏗ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏔᎷᎩᏍᎩ ᏚᏓᏂᏴᏒᎢ ᏫᏟᎢ ᏭᎦᏛᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you don’t want  to use this feature, tap to open settings and turn it off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you don’t want  to use this feature, tap to open settings and turn it off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏂᏣᏚᎵᏍᎬᎾ ᏱᎩ  ᎾᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ, ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Files were deleted from your phone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Files were deleted from your phone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can even use the stylus as an air mouse when connected to an external display.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can even use the stylus as an air mouse when connected to an external display.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎥᏍᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᎤᏃᎴ ᏥᏍᏕᏥ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᎾᎢ ᏙᏯᏗᏜ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Never Allow">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Never Allow</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏞᏍᏗ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᏥᎭᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏂ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Just a moment while we connect your devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Just a moment while we connect your devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏚᏳᎪᏛᏉ Ꭰ ᏞᎦ ᎠᏏᏉ ᎠᏴ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don't have a Motorola ID?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don't have a Motorola ID?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏞᏍᏗ ᏯᎩᎭ Ꮎ Motorola ID?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, you don't have permission to connect to ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, you don't have permission to connect to </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎠᏰᎸᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᏞᏍᏗ ᎡᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎸ ᏱᎩ ᎾᎢ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᎾᎾᎢ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Note: Face unlock can’t be used if the device has been locked for 4 hours or longer.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Note: Face unlock can’t be used if the device has been locked for 4 hours or longer.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ: ᎤᎧᏛ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᏝᏰᎵ ᎨᏒ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎾᏍᏚᎰ 4 ᎢᏳᏟᎶᏛ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎪᎯᏓᎨᏍᏗ. </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To connect to your PC, use a USB cable or switch to another Wi-Fi network.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To connect to your PC, use a USB cable or switch to another Wi-Fi network.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ PC, ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Ꭰ USB ᏔᎷᎩᏍᎩ ᏍᏕᏱᏛ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏄᏓᎴ Wi-Fi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Turning on Airplane Mode disables all network features including calling, messaging, mobile data, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth. To still use Wi-Fi or Bluetooth, turn them on in Settings or in the notification panel.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Turning on Airplane Mode disables all network features including calling, messaging, mobile data, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth. To still use Wi-Fi or Bluetooth, turn them on in Settings or in the notification panel.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᏥᏳ ᎦᏃᎯᎵᏙᎯ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎤᏐᏯᏍᏗ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ, ᏛᎦᏃᏣᎵᏍᎬ, ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, Wi-Fi, ᏃᎴ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎠᏓᎾᏙᏓ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏏᏉ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏫᎢ-ᏈᎢ Bluetooth, ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎾᎿ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎠᏯᏔᎾᎸ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don\u2019t remove">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don\u2019t remove</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏞᏍᏗ\u2019ᎠᎲᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make sure your phone and PC have Wi-Fi turned on, or connected by a USB data cable">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make sure your phone and PC have Wi-Fi turned on, or connected by a USB data cable</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎴ PC ᎤᎭ Wi-Fi ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ, ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎬᏗ Ꭰ USB ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᏔᎷᎩᏍᎩ ᏍᏕᏱᏛ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You will not be able to place or receive calls, including emergency calls during reboot!">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You will not be able to place or receive calls, including emergency calls during reboot!</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎥᏝ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏗᎩᏍᏗ ᏚᏓᏳᏅᏔᏅᎢ, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᏓᏳᏅᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏗ!</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Contacts with can be added to make a group.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Contacts with can be added to make a group.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎨᏒ ᎧᏁᏉᏓ ᎾᎢ ᎪᏢᏗ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Private DNS server cannot be accessed">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Private DNS server cannot be accessed</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏕᎸᎢ DNS ᎠᏯᏙᎯᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Ready For connect quickly via USB cable insert">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Ready For connect quickly via USB cable insert</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ready For ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎤᏟᏍᏓᏬ ᎤᎶᏒ USB ᏔᎷᎩᏍᎩ ᏍᏕᏱᏛ ᎰᏣᎸᎥᎦ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Show popup to choose desired mode">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Show popup to choose desired mode</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎪᏩᏛᎪᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒᏱᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎥᏑᏰᏍᎬ ᎠᏚᎸᏓ ᎬᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The bug report will appear on the phone shortly">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The bug report will appear on the phone shortly</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩ ᏍᎪᏯ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏎᎤᎾᏄᎪᎢᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎾᏉ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Turn on Do Not Disturb by turning the phone face down. This feature works with flip open and closed.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Turn on Do Not Disturb by turning the phone face down. This feature works with flip open and closed.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᏞᏍᏗ ᏣᏓᏕᏯᏙᏔᏅᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎯᎦᏔᎲᏍᏓ ᏭᎧᏛᎢ. ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏁᏍᏆᏕᎦ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏍᏚᏅᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make sure the nearby share setting is turned on your PC.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make sure the nearby share setting is turned on your PC.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ PC.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Turn the flashlight on/off with two chopping motions. This feature works with flip open and closed.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Turn the flashlight on/off with two chopping motions. This feature works with flip open and closed.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎯᏨᏍᏛᎦ/ᎲᏜᏓ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏔᎵ ᎯᏌᎳᏗᏍᎬ ᎯᎷᏍᎬᎢ. ᎯᎠ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏚᏂᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲᎢ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏁᏍᏆᏕᎦ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏍᏚᎲᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can pair other styluses with your Moto phone. However, some styluses may not be compatible.When Moto stylus is connected, this function will turn off automatically.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can pair other styluses with your Moto phone. However, some styluses may not be compatible.When Moto stylus is connected, this function will turn off automatically.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ Moto ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᎠᏎᏍᎩᏂ, ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ Ꮭ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏗᏙᎵᎩ.ᎾᎯᏳ Moto ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᎣᏍᏛ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ, ᎯᎠ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏍᏚᏓ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Not now">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Not now</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏗ ᏆᏊ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Ready For is active in order to transfer files from your PC">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Ready For is active in order to transfer files from your PC</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ready For ᎨᎡᎢ ᎬᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏓᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ PC</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don't turn off">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don't turn off</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏞᏍᏗ ᏥᎯᏍᏚᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don't show">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don't show</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏞᏍᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏥᏂᎲᏁᎵ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The eSIM can\u2019t be disabled due to an error.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The eSIM can\u2019t be disabled due to an error.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ eSIM ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ\u2019 ᎨᏒᎩ ᏗᎬᏩᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏂᎨᏒ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please install &quot;Ready For Assistant&quot; from official channel.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Please install "Ready For Assistant" from official channel.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏩᏊ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ "Ready For Assistant" ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎠᏒᎧᎵ ᎦᎳᏅᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don't forget the edges">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don't forget the edges</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏞᏍᏗ ᏥᏙᏨᎨᏫᏍᏌ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏓᏍᏛᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Face Detection uses the front-facing camera to improve Auto-rotate accuracy. Images are never stored or sent to Google.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Face Detection uses the front-facing camera to improve Auto-rotate accuracy. Images are never stored or sent to Google.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎧᏛ ᎦᎾᏄᎪᏫᏍᏒᎢ ᏗᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᏱᏗᏢ-ᏭᎦᏘ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎤᏩᏌ-ᎠᏗᏆᎸᏕᏲᎯ. ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏞᏍᏗ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏫᎦᏅᏅᎢ ᎾᎾᎢ Google.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Use your face to unlock your phone or for authentication in apps, like when you sign in or approve a purchase.Keep in mind:You can only have one face set up at a time. To add another face, delete the current one.Looking at the phone can unlock it when you don\u2019t intend to.Your phone can be unlocked by someone else if it\u2019s held up to your face.Your phone can be unlocked by someone who looks a lot like you, like an identical sibling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Use your face to unlock your phone or for authentication in apps, like when you sign in or approve a purchase.Keep in mind:You can only have one face set up at a time. To add another face, delete the current one.Looking at the phone can unlock it when you don\u2019t intend to.Your phone can be unlocked by someone else if it\u2019s held up to your face.Your phone can be unlocked by someone who looks a lot like you, like an identical sibling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᎧᏛᎢ ᏨᏙᏓ ᏣᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎤᏠᏱᏉ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏕᏣᏙᎥ ᏦᏪᎵᏍᎪᎢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎪᎯᏳᏙᏗ Ꮎ ᎠᏩᎯᏍᏗ.ᎯᏍᏆᏂᎪᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏣᏓᏅᏛᎢ:ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎤᏅ ᏌᏇᏊ ᏭᎦᏛᎢ ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᎦᎪᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒᎢ. ᎾᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏄᏓᎴ ᏭᎦᏛᎢ, ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏃᏊᏥᎩ ᏌᏇᎢ.ᎠᎦᏖᏃᎲ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏱᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᏳᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏞᏍᏗ\u2019 ᎾᏁᎵᏍᎬ ᎾᎢ.ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎤᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎩᎶᎢ ᏄᏓᎴᎢ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ\u2019 ᎤᏌᎳᏓᏅ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᎧᏛᎢ.ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏯᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎬᏗ ᎩᎶᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏠᏯ ᏤᏍᏓᎦᏅᏗᎢ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯᎢ ᎤᏠᏱᎨᎢᏍᏗ ᎢᏍᏓᏜᏅᏢᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Permission to restrict other apps send specific broadcast to Moto Note.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Permission to restrict other apps send specific broadcast to Moto Note.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎤᏅᏍᏙᏒ ᏅᏩᏓᎴ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏫᎦᏅᏗ ᎠᏎᎸ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" wants to send files to this device">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> wants to send files to this device</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎤᏚᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏫᏅᎥᎦ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Screen attention uses the front camera to see if someone is looking at the screen. It works on device, and images are never stored or sent to Google.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Screen attention uses the front camera to see if someone is looking at the screen. It works on device, and images are never stored or sent to Google.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎭᎦᏎᏍᏓ ᏗᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᏱᏗᏢ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎩᎶᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏯᎦᏘᎭ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎠᎴ ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏞᏍᏗ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏫᎦᏅᏅᎢ ᎾᎾᎢ Google.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The assistant will be able to read information about apps in use on your system, including information visible on your screen or accessible within the apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The assistant will be able to read information about apps in use on your system, including information visible on your screen or accessible within the apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᎥᏍᎩ ᏄᏰᎵᏛ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᎿ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᎥᏍᎩ ᎬᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏅᏛᏴᏍᏙᏗᎢ ᎠᏫᏂᏗᏢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Searching for wireless display...">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Searching for wireless display...</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎩᏲᎭ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ...</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Use your face to unlock your phone or for authentication in apps, like when you sign in or approve a purchase.Keep in mind:You can only have one face set up at a time. To add another face, delete the current one.Looking at the phone can unlock it when you don\u2019t intend to.Your phone can be unlocked by someone else if it\u2019s held up to your face, even if your eyes are closed.Your phone can be unlocked by someone who looks a lot like you, like an identical sibling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Use your face to unlock your phone or for authentication in apps, like when you sign in or approve a purchase.Keep in mind:You can only have one face set up at a time. To add another face, delete the current one.Looking at the phone can unlock it when you don\u2019t intend to.Your phone can be unlocked by someone else if it\u2019s held up to your face, even if your eyes are closed.Your phone can be unlocked by someone who looks a lot like you, like an identical sibling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏛᎢ ᏨᏙᏓ ᏣᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎤᏠᏱᏉ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏕᏣᏙᎥ ᏦᏪᎵᏍᎪᎢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎪᎯᏳᏙᏗ Ꮎ ᎠᏩᎯᏍᏗ.ᎯᏍᏆᏂᎪᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏣᏓᏅᏛᎢ:ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎤᏅ ᏌᏇᏊ ᏭᎦᏛᎢ ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᎦᎪᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒᎢ. ᎾᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏄᏓᎴ ᏭᎦᏛᎢ, ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏃᏊᏥᎩ ᏌᏇᎢ.ᎠᎦᏖᏃᎲ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏱᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᏳᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏞᏍᏗ\u2019 ᎾᏁᎵᏍᎬ ᎾᎢ.ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎤᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎩᎶ ᏄᏓᎴᎢ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ\u2019 ᎤᏌᎳᏓᏅ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᎧᏛᎢ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏱᏗᏣᎦᏔᏍᏗ.ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏯᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎬᏗ ᎩᎶᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏠᏯ ᏤᏍᏓᎦᏅᏗᎢ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯᎢ ᎤᏠᏱᎨᎢᏍᏗ ᎢᏍᏓᏜᏅᏢᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Ask once (don't ask again if connected)">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Ask once (don't ask again if connected)</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏛᏗ ᏌᏊᏊ (ᏝᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏛᏗ ᏏᏊ ᎾᎿ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ)</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
