            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your tablet will turn off mobile data once it reaches the limit you set.Since data usage is measured by your tablet, and your carrier may account for usage differently, consider setting a conservative limit.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your tablet will turn off mobile data once it reaches the limit you set.Since data usage is measured by your tablet, and your carrier may account for usage differently, consider setting a conservative limit.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᏌᏊ ᎢᏳᏩᎫᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏙᏯᏅᎯᏗᎠ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏎᎸᎯ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬ.ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᏓ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎢᏳᏟᎶᏛ ᎬᏗ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢᎭ, ᎭᏓᏅᏛᎵ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ Ꭰ ᏗᎪᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏎᎸᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
