            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="I agree to receive product information and special promotional offers by the selected channels above from Motorola, and I confirm that I am 16 years of age or older. I understand that my consent is not required and is not a condition of any purchase. ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>I agree to receive product information and special promotional offers by the selected channels above from Motorola, and I confirm that I am 16 years of age or older. I understand that my consent is not required and is not a condition of any purchase. </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏕᎭᏓᏂᎸᎩ ᎠᎩᎩᏍᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᏅᎢ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᏅᏓᏤᏟᏓ ᏗᏓᏌᎳᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏂᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ Ꮎ ᎤᏂᏑᏰᏓ ᏕᎦᏔᏅᏛ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏟ Ꮎ Motorola, ᏃᎴ ᏥᏚᏍᏗᎭ ᏑᏓᎵᏚ ᎢᏴᏩᏕᏘᏴᏓ ᎠᎦᏴᎳᎯᎨᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏩᏅᏔ ᎯᎠ ᎣᏏ ᎠᎩᏰᎸᏅᎢ ᏤᎩ ᎭᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎢᏯᏩᏛᏁᏗ ᏱᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎭᏗ ᎠᏎ ᏄᏍᏗᏛᏅᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎠᎩᏩᎯᏍᏗ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please check your phone's Wi-Fi status and try turning it off and then on again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Please check your phone's Wi-Fi status and try turning it off and then on again.</term></tig></langSet>
