            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your CPF is used to uniquely identify you across all Moto's touchpoints including kiosks, repair and communications. It will not be shared with others who are not authorized.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your CPF is used to uniquely identify you across all Moto's touchpoints including kiosks, repair and communications. It will not be shared with others who are not authorized.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏣᏤᎵ CPF ᏄᏍᏛ ᏧᏅᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏩᏒᎯᎨᎢ ᏦᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏗᎦᎾᏗᏫᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ Moto ᎠᏒᎯᏍᏗ ᏗᏎᎯᎯ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᎸ ᎧᏅᏑᎵ, ᎣᏍᏓ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏧᎾᏓᏛᎪᏔᏅ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏎ Ꮭ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏔᏅ ᏄᎾᏓᎴᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ Ꮭ ᎠᏥᏁᏉᎸᎯ ᏱᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Go to the Mobile data sharing tab in the Ready For Assistant to manage data limits, view data speeds, and see how long data has been used.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Go to the Mobile data sharing tab in the Ready For Assistant to manage data limits, view data speeds, and see how long data has been used.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎮᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ  ᎠᎾᏓᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏱᎸᏍᏗ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ  ᏓᏎᎸᎯ ᏥᎩ, ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᏂᏕᎦᏣᏄᎸᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎯᎳᎩ ᏂᎪᎯᏓ ᏄᏍᏙᎢ ᎬᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your ID number is used to uniquely identify you across all Moto's touchpoints including kiosks, repair and communications. It will not be shared with others who are not authorised.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your ID number is used to uniquely identify you across all Moto's touchpoints including kiosks, repair and communications. It will not be shared with others who are not authorised.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ID ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏅᏗᎰ ᎡᏦᏟᏍᏗᎢ ᏂᎬ ᏂᎦᏓ Moto ᎠᏒᏂᏍᏗᏗᎪᏍᏓᏱ ᎾᏍᏊ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ, ᎣᏍᏓ ᏱᏗᎬᏂᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏓᏛᎪᏙᏗ ᎭᏗ ᎩᎶ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᏟᏙᏗᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Automatically sync personal data">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Automatically sync personal data</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎢᏧᎳᎭ ᏥᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="On your phone, open Camera or Scanner in the Ready For settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>On your phone, open Camera or Scanner in the Ready For settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ, ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="By providing your CPF, you give Motorola permission to give you fast and specific help on your device, as well as information about service centers and more.Remember, Motorola will always keep your data safe.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>By providing your CPF, you give Motorola permission to give you fast and specific help on your device, as well as information about service centers and more.Remember, Motorola will always keep your data safe.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎬ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ CPF, ᎯᎲᏏ Motorola ᎦᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎨᏣᏁᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏃᎴ ᏗᎪᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᎸᏗ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᏯᏊᏃ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᏄᏰᎵᏗ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᏗᏰᏟ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ.ᎭᏅᏓᏛ, Motorola ᏂᎪᎸ ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏂᎦᎾᏰᎬᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Motorola collects and reports usage information to keep your software up to date, provide personalized support, and improve products and services. ">
