            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Open your phone's camera, or the QR scanner inside the Ready For app">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Open your phone's camera, or the QR scanner inside the Ready For app</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᎬᏅ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ QR  ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗᏍᎩ ᎭᏫᎾᏗᏢ ᎾᏍᎩ  ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎬᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To use your phone as a webcam, go to camera &amp; audio settings inside your video calling app, and select Motorola Ready For camera">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use your phone as a webcam, go to camera &amp; audio settings inside your video calling app, and select Motorola Ready For camera</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎬᏙᏓ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎵᏗ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ, ᎮᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ &amp; ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎭᏫᎾᏗᏢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏫᏗᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ Motorola ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Modify Motorola system settings">
