            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="On your phone, make sure &quot;visible to other devices&quot; is turned on in the Ready For app settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>On your phone, make sure "visible to other devices" is turned on in the Ready For app settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ, ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ "ᎬᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ" ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
