            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The Ready For Assistant can scan your available devices and determine which features can be used from your PC.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The Ready For Assistant can scan your available devices and determine which features can be used from your PC.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎴ  ᏗᎫᎪᏙᏗ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎨᏒ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ  ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᏣᏤᎵ PC.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
