            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tap Manage to turn off bubbles from this app">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tap Manage to turn off bubbles from this app</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎠᏱᎸᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᏓᎵᏆᎷᎲᏍᎬ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎯᎠ ᎬᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
