            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="- If you try to find a phone or tablet, open Ready For from quick settings and follow the instruction there">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>- If you try to find a phone or tablet, open Ready For from quick settings and follow the instruction there</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>- ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏱᏣᏁᎵᏔᎾ ᏣᏩᏛᏗᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ, ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏕᏲᎲᏍᎩ ᎤᎿᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can also copy and paste between devices - like a shared clipboard.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can also copy and paste between devices - like a shared clipboard.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏉ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏯᎸᏗ ᎠᏰᏟ ᏂᏚᏓᎸᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ - ᎤᏠᏱᏉ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏔᏅ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏗᎦᏛᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can drag files from a PC folder and drop them into the nearby device icon.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can drag files from a PC folder and drop them into the nearby device icon.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏱᏍᏏᏅᎦ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ PC ᏗᏴᏈᏛᎥᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏫᏗᎦᎸᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ  ᎾᎥᏂᎨᏍᏗ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To transfer files to an unpaired device, make sure that device is set to visible to other devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To transfer files to an unpaired device, make sure that device is set to visible to other devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᏫᏓᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ tᎠᎵᎪᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎬᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you're connected to a PC you can use your phone as a high-quality webcam.">
