            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The available functions are indicated on the in the Ready For devices section of the Assistant.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The available functions are indicated on the in the Ready For devices section of the Assistant.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲᎢ ᎨᏒᎢ  ᎤᏓᏎᎮᎸ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏓᏡᎬ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
