            <termEntry id="Data in this error report comes from system log files and may contain sensitive information, such as app usage and location data. By continuing, you acknowledge that the app service provider will use this data to help you solve technical or maintenance issues. Make sure you only share this error report with people or apps you trust.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Data in this error report comes from system log files and may contain sensitive information, such as app usage and location data. By continuing, you acknowledge that the app service provider will use this data to help you solve technical or maintenance issues. Make sure you only share this error report with people or apps you trust.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎦᎵᏓᏍᏔᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎩ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏄᏛᏁᎸ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᎸᏛᎢ ᎤᏁᏟᏴᏌᏘ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᏃᎴ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ. ᏫᎬᎵᏱᎴᎬ, ᏂᎯ ᏗᏓᏂᎸᏨᎯ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎩ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎠᏍᏕᎸᏗᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎣᏍᏓ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎤᏦᏍᏗ ᏂᎬᎿᏅ ᎠᎴ ᎣᏍᏓᎢᏯᏅᏁᎯ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ. ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎦᎵᏓᏍᏔᏅ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎯᎦᏕᏅᏴᏯ.</term></tig></langSet>
