            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Battery use is an approximation of power use and does not include every source of battery drain. Miscellaneous is the difference between the computed approximate power use and the actual drain observed on the battery.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Battery use is an approximation of power use and does not include every source of battery drain. Miscellaneous is the difference between the computed approximate power use and the actual drain observed on the battery.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎾᎥᏂᎨ ᎡᎵᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎦᎥᏉ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ. ᎻᏍcᎡlᎳᏁᎣᎤᏍ ᎢᏍ tᎮ ᏗffᎡrᎡncᎡ bᎡtᏪᎡn tᎮ cᎣmpᎤᏖd ᎠpprᎣxᎢᎹᏖ pᎣᏪr ᎤᏎ Ꭰnd tᎮ ᎠctᎤᎠl drᎠᎢn ᎣbᏎrᎥᎡd Ꭳn tᎮ bᎠtᏖry.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
