                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Reduce the screen brightness and/or screen timeout</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎦᏲᎳᎨ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎤᏍᎪᏍᏗᏴ ᎠᎴ/ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᏲᏍᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
