            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To open the private space, you need to set a different password or fingerprint for the main space and the private space">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To open the private space, you need to set a different password or fingerprint for the main space and the private space</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏕᎸᎢ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ, ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎢ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏧᏓᎴᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎤᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏕᎸᎢ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
