            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Enabling the private space will disable the None and Swipe screen lock method">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Enabling the private space will disable the None and Swipe screen lock method</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᎵᏊ ᏯᏛᏁᎲᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏕᎸᎢ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᏂᎩᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎯᏅᎦᎵᏓ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
