            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To extend battery life, Adaptive Battery limits battery for infrequently used apps. Your phone will learn how you use apps over time.Notifications may be delayed for these apps.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To extend battery life, Adaptive Battery limits battery for infrequently used apps. Your phone will learn how you use apps over time.Notifications may be delayed for these apps.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎥᎦᏅᎯᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎬᏅᎢ, ᏗᎾᎪᎳᎩ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᎸᎢ ᎠᎾᎠᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏰᎸᏗ ᎢᏳᏓᎵᎭ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ. ᏂᎯᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗᎢ ᏯᏕᎶᏆ ᏂᎯ ᎲᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᏗᏗᏢ ᎢᎪᎯᏓ. ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎤᏬᎯᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can edit this video with Moto 360 Editor.">
