                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎾᏞᎬ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ, ᎦᏅᏓ ᏓᏯᏂ, ᎠᎴ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏐᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your recent conversations will show up here">
