                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>PIN in the main space should be different from that in the privacy space</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>PIN ᎾᎢ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎤᏜᏁᏛ ᎾᎢᏳᏃ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To open the private space, you need to set a different password for the main space and the private space">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To open the private space, you need to set a different password for the main space and the private space</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏗ Ꮎ ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ, ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏗ ᏣᎪᏗᎢ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᎠᎴ Ꮎ ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ</term></tig></langSet>
