            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Password in the main space should be different from that in the privacy space">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Password in the main space should be different from that in the privacy space</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᎾᎢᏳᏃ  ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby Atmos brings out the vivid details in your audio to create an immersive listening experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Atmos brings out the vivid details in your audio to create an immersive listening experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Atmos ᏓᎦᏅᎪᏫᏍᏏ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗ ᏂᏕᎬᎿᏅᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎾᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎭᏓᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
