            <termEntry id="Moto Gametime gives you easy access to tools and settings that enhance your gaming experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Gametime gives you easy access to tools and settings that enhance your gaming experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎠCᏱᎶᎦ ᏕᏣᏁᎭ ᎠᎯᏗᎨᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏗᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏓᏤᎴᏍᏗ ᏕᎭᏁᎸᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᏣᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
