            <termEntry id="TD_SCDMA">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>TD_SCDMA</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>TD_SCDMA</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To help reduce data usage, Data Saver prevents some apps from sending or receiving data in the background. An app you’re currently using can access data, but may do so less frequently. This may mean, for example, that images don’t display until you tap them.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To help reduce data usage, Data Saver prevents some apps from sending or receiving data in the background. An app you’re currently using can access data, but may do so less frequently. This may mean, for example, that images don’t display until you tap them.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ ᎠᎦᏲᎳᏅ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ, ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏗᏍᎩ ᏗᏣᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏫᎦᏅᎥᏍᎬᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎩᏍᎬᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎣᎾᏗᏨ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ. ᎬᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᏥᎪᏃ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎿᏛᎦ ᎦᏲᎵᎨ ᎢᏳᏓᎵᎭ. ᎯᎠ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏂᎨᎵᏍᎬ, ᏱᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ, ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
