            <termEntry id="To help free up storage space, storage manager removes backed up photos and videos from your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To help free up storage space, storage manager removes backed up photos and videos from your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ ᏚᏓᎴᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ, ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏙᎯ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏣᏤᎵ.</term></tig></langSet>
