            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Video calling is turned off. Would you like to turn it back on?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Video calling is turned off. Would you like to turn it back on?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎦᏔᎲᏒᏃ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ. ᏱᏣᏚᎵᏍᎪ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏔᎵᏁ ᎢᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗᎢ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Mobile Data is turned off. Would you like to turn it back on?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Mobile Data is turned off. Would you like to turn it back on?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎦᏔᎲᏒᏃ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ. ᏱᏣᏚᎵᏍᎪ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏔᎵᏁ ᎢᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗᎢ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, we're having trouble activating your phone. Please call (800) 922-0204 from another phone to activate your service and then try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, we're having trouble activating your phone. Please call (800) 922-0204 from another phone to activate your service and then try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎤᏰᎸᏅ, ᎢᏗ ᎤᎲᎢ ᎤᏪᎵᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᎴᏅᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᏪᏯᎾ (800) 922-0204 ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏄᏓᎴ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎾᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎾᏉᏃ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Want to verify another way?Use your account's Billing Password instead.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Want to verify another way?Use your account's Billing Password instead.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏚᎵ ᏦᎯᏳᏙᏗ ᏄᏓᎴ ᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ?ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎤᏓᏚᏍᎬᎢ ᏱᎦᏪᏍᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎤᎬᏫᏳᏎᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To get started, enter the last 4 digits of the Account Owner's Social Security Number:">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To get started, enter the last 4 digits of the Account Owner's Social Security Number:</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᎴᏅᏗᏍᎬ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎯᏴᏓ ᎣᏂ ᏅᎩ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎤᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᏰᎵ ᎤᏙᏢᎯ ᏗᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ:</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, the screen has expired. It will update when you tap OK.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, the screen has expired. It will update when you tap OK.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎤᏰᎸᏅ, ᏥᎩ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎤᎶᏒᏍᏔᏅ. ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏎ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎭᏩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, we're having trouble activating your phone. Please call  from another phone to activate your service and then try again by restarting your phone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, we're having trouble activating your phone. Please call  from another phone to activate your service and then try again by restarting your phone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎤᏰᎸᏅ, ᎢᏗ ᎤᎲᎢ ᎤᏪᎵᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᎴᏅᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᏪᏯᎾ  ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏄᏓᎴ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎾᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎾᏉᏃ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Lower battery temperature">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Lower battery temperature</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᎳᏗᏢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᎦᎾᏮᎢ ᎠᏎᎯᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow Digital Secure to access your photos, media, files, text messages and location in order to check for harmful files. Also, let it access your phone in order to identify you and register the app.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow Digital Secure to access your photos, media, files, text messages and location in order to check for harmful files. Also, let it access your phone in order to identify you and register the app.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ, ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ, ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ, ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ ᏗᏓᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᏐᏅ ᎢᏳᏍᏓ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ. ᎾᏍᏉ, ᏩᏂᎩ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏓᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏟᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏃᎴ ᏚᏙᎥ ᎤᏬᏪᎶᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your Phone will try again when you restart.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your Phone will try again when you restart.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tap to get Verizon service.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tap to get Verizon service.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ Verizon ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Due to a change in your phone, we need to update your voicemail service.When we finish the update, Basic Visual Voicemail will be provided free of charge.If you don't update today, you will still be able to listen to your voicemails by dialing *86.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Due to a change in your phone, we need to update your voicemail service.When we finish the update, Basic Visual Voicemail will be provided free of charge.If you don't update today, you will still be able to listen to your voicemails by dialing *86.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ, ᎠᎢ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏁᎬ ᎤᎾᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ.ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᎢ ᎯᏍᏆᏓ ᏥᎩ ᎤᎾᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ, ᎠᎯᏓ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᎤᏁᎬ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏛ ᎠᏎᏊᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏔᏅᎢ.ᏝᏍᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎲᏍᏔᏅᎾ ᏱᎩ ᎪᎯ ᎢᎦ, ᏂᎯ ᏏᏃ ᎠᏎ ᎨᏣᏛᏓᏍᏙᏗ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏓᏂᏁᎬ ᏗᎦᏂᏱᏍᎩ ᎬᏗ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ *86.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have  new voicemails. Please call Voicemail (*86) to listen to your voicemails.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have  new voicemails. Please call Voicemail (*86) to listen to your voicemails.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏕᏣᎭ  ᎢᏤ ᎧᏁᎬ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᏫᏴᏓᏏ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎦᏂᏱᏍᎩ (*86) ᎾᎢ ᎭᏛᏓᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏓᏂᏁᎬ ᏗᎦᏂᏱᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Privacy Policy">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Privacy Policy</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᏗᎳᏏᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Unable to connect to mobile network while Airplane mode is on. Please disable and try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Unable to connect to mobile network while Airplane mode is on. Please disable and try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᏏᏉ ᏥᏳ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎦᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᎠᎴ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have new voicemail(s). Please call Voicemail (*86) to listen to your voicemail(s).">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have new voicemail(s). Please call Voicemail (*86) to listen to your voicemail(s).</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎢᏤ ᎧᏁᎬ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᏫᏴᏓᏏ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎦᏂᏱᏍᎩ (*86) ᎾᎢ ᎭᏛᏓᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏓᏂᏁᎬ ᏗᎦᏂᏱᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Voicemail can’t record your greetings without permission to record audio.To give permission, go to Settings. Then turn on Microphone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Voicemail can’t record your greetings without permission to record audio.To give permission, go to Settings. Then turn on Microphone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏁᎬ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᏕᎦᏅᏅᏛᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎨᏥᏲᎵᏍᏗᏱ ᎾᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎬᎾ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᏅᏅᏛᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ.ᎾᎢ ᎯᎲᏏ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ, ᎮᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, we're having trouble connecting to your voice mailbox. If you're in an area with poor signal strength, wait until you have a strong signal and try again.If there is still a problem, please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is .">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, we're having trouble connecting to your voice mailbox. If you're in an area with poor signal strength, wait until you have a strong signal and try again.If there is still a problem, please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is .</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎤᏰᎸᏅ, ᎢᏧᎳ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎤᎲᎢ ᎤᏦᎠᏎᏗ ᏫᏛᎬᏓᎸᎥᏍᎬ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎪᏪᎵᎧᏁᏌ. ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎬᏗ ᎤᎴᏌᏓᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎤᎵᏂᎪᎯᏍᏗ, ᎯᎦᏘᏓ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ Ꭰ ᎤᎱᏍᏘ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.ᎢᏳᏃ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏏᏉ Ꭰ ᏓᏓᎴᎬ, ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎤᏩᏍᎩ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ  ᎠᎴ ᎤᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don't update &amp; Call Voicemail">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don't update &amp; Call Voicemail</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏝᏍᏗ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ &amp; ᏪᏯᎾ ᎤᏁᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When someone calls you, they will hear your greeting. After your greeting, do you also want callers to hear instructions for leaving their message?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When someone calls you, they will hear your greeting. After your greeting, do you also want callers to hear instructions for leaving their message?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᎩᎶᎢ ᏫᏗᎬᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᎯ, ᎾᏍᎩᏛ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏛᎪᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏤᏘ. ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏤᏘ, ᏣᏚᎵᎭᏍ ᎠᏰᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏛᎪᏗ ᏗᏓᏕᏲᎲᏍᎩ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎬ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎯ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="OBTAINING_IPADDR">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>OBTAINING_IPADDR</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>OBTAINING_IPADDR</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Update &amp; Subscribe to Basic Visual Voicemail">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Update &amp; Subscribe to Basic Visual Voicemail</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ &amp; ᏔᏓᏅᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᎬᏩᏍᏛᏊ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᎤᏁᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Mobile data is unavailable while on this call. Apps like email, Internet and social networking will work if you connect to Wi-Fi.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Mobile data is unavailable while on this call. Apps like email, Internet and social networking will work if you connect to Wi-Fi.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎭᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎭᏗ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᏱᎩ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏪᏯᎾ. ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎢᏳᏍᏘ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ, ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏰᎵ ᎤᎾᏚᏓᏕᏫᏒ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏱᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏍᏏ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏱᏧᏓᎸᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᏫᎢ-ᏈᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Insert your SIM card to reconnect">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Insert your SIM card to reconnect</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏣᎸᎥᎦ ᏣᏤᎵ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎢᏧᏓᎸᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow data roaming access for this trip">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow data roaming access for this trip</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎡᏙᎵᏙᎲ ᏩᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᎯᎠᏰᏃ ᎠᏁᎳᏗᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Check for new system update">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Check for new system update</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏗᏤ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Configure smart update">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Configure smart update</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Select to continue with update">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Select to continue with update</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="LAST SYSTEM UPDATE INFORMATION">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>LAST SYSTEM UPDATE INFORMATION</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎣᏂ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="System update available">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>System update available</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The city, state, or zip code that you entered may not be correct.Please check the address and try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The city, state, or zip code that you entered may not be correct.Please check the address and try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎦᏚᎲ, ᎧᏃᎮᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏧᎦᏄᏱ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎥᏝ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᎢ.ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏫᏗᎦᏅᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The city, state, or zip code that you entered may not be correct.Please check the address and try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The city, state, or zip code that you entered may not be correct.Please check the address and try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎦᏚᎲ, ᎧᏃᎮᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏧᎦᏄᏱ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎥᏝ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᎢ.ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏫᏗᎦᏅᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Confirm or update current emergency address">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Confirm or update current emergency address</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏦᎯᏳᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Wi-Fi Calling lets you make calls using Wi-Fi when the mobile network is unavailable. To activate, let us know the address to send emergency responders if you call 911 and we are unable to determine your location, and then accept the terms. Please update this address if it changes, which you can do at any time in your device settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wi-Fi Calling lets you make calls using Wi-Fi when the mobile network is unavailable. To activate, let us know the address to send emergency responders if you call 911 and we are unable to determine your location, and then accept the terms. Please update this address if it changes, which you can do at any time in your device settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏗᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏢᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎬᏗᎭ Wi-Fi ᎢᏳᏃ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ Ꮭ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏱᎩ Ꮭ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᏱᎩ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎩ, ᏗᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᏒ ᏥᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏫᏅᎥᎦ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᏁᏨᎯ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᏪᏯᎾ 911 ᎠᎴ ᎢᏗ ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏧᏬᎪᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎾᏉᏃ ᏗᏓᏂᎸᎢᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏓᏁᏤᎸ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎯᎠ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏧᏁᏍᏗᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏗᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ, ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭᏊ ᎢᏴᎢ ᎾᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Phone  not allowed MM#6">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Phone  not allowed MM#6</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ  Ꮭ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᏱᎩ MM#6</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make sure the device you’re casting to is turned on. If it doesn’t appear here, tap “Settings” to search for it.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make sure the device you’re casting to is turned on. If it doesn’t appear here, tap “Settings” to search for it.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎬᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎨᎡᎩ ᏫᏚᏕᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏭᎪᎸᏍᏔᏁᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ. ᏄᏍᏛ ᎾᎿ ᎨᏍᏗᏍ ᏱᎬᏂᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᎭᏂᏃ, ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ “ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ” ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏱᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allows application to receive the broadcast of app state changes.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allows application to receive the broadcast of app state changes.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎲ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᏗᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Welcome to Google sync!A Google approach to syncing data to allow access to your contacts, appointments, and more from wherever you are.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Welcome to Google sync!A Google approach to syncing data to allow access to your contacts, appointments, and more from wherever you are.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏪlcᎣᎺ tᎣ ᎪᎣgᎴ Ꮝync!Ꭰ Google ᎤᎾᏄᎪᏫᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᏧᎳᎭ ᏥᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ , ᏚᏂᏒᏍᏔᏅᎩ, ᎠᎴ ᎤᏟ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭᏊ ᎢᎸᏢᎢ ᏂᎯᏃ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" is open using a different display resolution. Continuing on this display may cause visual distortion. Restarting the app will fix this issue.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> is open using a different display resolution. Continuing on this display may cause visual distortion. Restarting the app will fix this issue.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᏄᏍᏛ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎬᏗᎭ Ꭰ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᎸ ᎤᏓᏴᎳᏛ. ᏫᎬᎵᏱᎴᎬ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏅᏓᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬᎩ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ. ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎣᏍᏓ ᏱᏨᏁᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᎲ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow the application to publish and subscribe the presence information.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow the application to publish and subscribe the presence information.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏘᎴᏴᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏔᏓᏅᎵ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎦᏔᎲᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Privacy Policy">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Privacy Policy</term></tig></langSet>
