            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your device is offlineCheck your Wi-Fi or mobile data connection and try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your device is offlineCheck your Wi-Fi or mobile data connection and try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏂᎫᏓᎸᎾᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Wi-Fi ᏃᎴ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏃᎴ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
