            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have incorrectly drawn your unlock pattern  times. After  more unsuccessful attempts, you will be asked to unlock your Android TV device using an email account. Try again in  seconds.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have incorrectly drawn your unlock pattern  times. After  more unsuccessful attempts, you will be asked to unlock your Android TV device using an email account. Try again in  seconds.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎤᎭ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ  ᎢᏳᏓᎵ ᎠᎵᏱᎵᏒ. ᎣᏂᏗᏨ  ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎥᏝ ᎤᏁᎸᏙᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎨᎦᏛᏛᎲᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Android TV ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎬᏗᎭ Ꭰ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ. ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ ᎾᎿ ᏓᏓᎾᏩᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="MIDI via USB turned on">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>MIDI via USB turned on</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>MIDI ᎾᎿ ᎢᏗᏨ USB ᏭᎪᎸᏍᏔᏁᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your phone will occasionally use your recent fingerprint images to create improved fingerprint models.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your phone will occasionally use your recent fingerprint images to create improved fingerprint models.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎢᏳᏓᎵᎭᏊ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎾᏞᎬ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
