            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the tablet  times. After  more unsuccessful attempts, the tablet will be reset to factory default and all user data will be lost.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the tablet  times. After  more unsuccessful attempts, the tablet will be reset to factory default and all user data will be lost.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᎤᎾᏁᎶᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ  ᎢᏳᏩᏗ. ᎣᏂᏗᏨ  ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎥᏝ ᎤᏁᎸᏙᏗ, ᏥᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏥᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎤᏃᏢᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the phone  times. After  more unsuccessful attempts, the phone will be reset to factory default and all user data will be lost.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the phone  times. After  more unsuccessful attempts, the phone will be reset to factory default and all user data will be lost.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᎤᎾᏁᎶᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ  ᎢᏳᏩᏗ. ᎣᏂᏗᏨ  ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎥᏝ ᎤᏁᎸᏙᏗ, ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏥᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎤᏃᏢᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have incorrectly drawn your unlock pattern  times. After  more unsuccessful attempts, you will be asked to unlock your tablet using your Google signin. Try again in  seconds.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have incorrectly drawn your unlock pattern  times. After  more unsuccessful attempts, you will be asked to unlock your tablet using your Google signin. Try again in  seconds.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎤᎭ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ  ᎢᏳᏓᎵ ᎠᎵᏱᎵᏒ. ᎤᎶᏐᏅ  ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅᎢ ᏓᏁᎸᏗᏍᎬᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᏔᏲᏢ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎪᏪᎶᏙᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᏣᏤᎵ Google ᏙᏙᎥ ᎪᏪᎶᏗ. ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ ᎾᎿ ᏓᏓᎾᏩᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Fingerprint time out reached. Try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Fingerprint time out reached. Try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎤᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᏙᎮᏓᏍᏗ ᏭᎷᏨᎩ. ᏏᏊ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have incorrectly drawn your unlock pattern  times. After  more unsuccessful attempts, you will be asked to unlock your phone using your Google signin. Try again in  seconds.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have incorrectly drawn your unlock pattern  times. After  more unsuccessful attempts, you will be asked to unlock your phone using your Google signin. Try again in  seconds.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎤᎭ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎤᎾᎶᎢᏓ  ᎢᏳᏓᎵ ᎠᎵᏱᎵᏒ. ᎣᏂᏗᏨ  ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎥᏝ ᎤᏁᎸᏙᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎨᎦᏛᏛᎲᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Google ᏚᏙᎥ ᎪᏪᎶᏗ. ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ ᎾᎿ ᏓᏓᎾᏩᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
