            <termEntry id="Moto Experience Hub needs some permissions to provide the best experience. To grant permissions, tap on &quot;Permissions&quot; in App info.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Experience Hub needs some permissions to provide the best experience. To grant permissions, tap on "Permissions" in App info.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎤᎦᏙᎲᏒ ᎠᏰᏟ ᏓᏤᏢᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏚᏚᎸᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ ᎤᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ. ᎾᎢ ᎭᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ, ᎤᎾᎢ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ "ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ" ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᎥᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
