            <termEntry id="Moto Gametime enhances your gaming experience with tools and settings that help you block unwanted distractions and focus on the game you’re playing.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Gametime enhances your gaming experience with tools and settings that help you block unwanted distractions and focus on the game you’re playing.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᏟᏱᎶᎦ ᏓᏤᏢᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏕᎭᏁᎶᎲᏍᎬ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏥᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏍᏚᏗᏍᎦ ᏃᏚᎵᏍᎬᎾ ᏗᏓᏲᎯᏍᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᎴ ᎤᎿᏊ ᎢᎦ ᏫᏔᎧᏅᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏕᎭᏁᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn about the Moto app">
