            <termEntry id="Everything you do on your phone each day is easier with Moto">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Everything you do on your phone each day is easier with Moto</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏄᏓᎴᏒᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎿᏛᎦ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᏚᎩᏨᏂᏒᎢ ᎠᎯᏗᏳ ᎬᏗ Moto</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Easy gestures and touch interactions help you perform everyday tasks with quick and intuitive motions. Use the toggles to enable each Moto Action, and tap on the descriptions for tutorials and more information.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Easy gestures and touch interactions help you perform everyday tasks with quick and intuitive motions. Use the toggles to enable each Moto Action, and tap on the descriptions for tutorials and more information.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎯᏓ ᏧᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏒᏂᏍᏗ ᏓᏔᎳᏗᏍᎬᎩ ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᏧᎩᏨᏅᏓ ᎢᏗᏛᏁᏗ ᎤᏐᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏃᎴ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏕᎳᎰᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ. ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏧᏗᏞᎩ ᎾᎢ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ ᏧᏤᎵᏛ Moto ᎠᎵᏖᎸᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏚᏍᏛ ᏗᎧᏃᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏗᏓᏕᏲᎲᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
