            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To enjoy the full Moto experiences, go to settings and enable Moto Actions and Moto Display">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To enjoy the full Moto experiences, go to settings and enable Moto Actions and Moto Display</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᎵᎢ Moto ᎤᏂᎦᏙᎲᏒ, ᎮᎾ ᎾᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ Moto ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎠᎴ Moto ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The features in Moto Display give you more control over your screen. Attentive Display keeps the screen on while you’re looking at it, and Peek Display lets you see notifications, even when the screen is off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The features in Moto Display give you more control over your screen. Attentive Display keeps the screen on while you’re looking at it, and Peek Display lets you see notifications, even when the screen is off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ Moto ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏣᏁᎮᏍᏗ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏬᎯᎳᏗᏍᎬ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ. ᎠᎵᏏᎾᎯᏍᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏂᎯᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎯᎪᎵᏰᏍᎬᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏗᎧᎿᏅ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto Gametime">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Gametime</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᏟᏱᎶᎦ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Each time you open the Moto app, you can discover new features that make your phone easier and more enjoyable to use.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Each time you open the Moto app, you can discover new features that make your phone easier and more enjoyable to use.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏓᏟᏱᎵᏒᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎯᏍᏚᎢᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ Moto ᎬᏙᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎪᎷᏩᏛᏗ ᎢᏤ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏱᏗᎬᏁᎯ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎭᎯᏗᎨᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎬᏗᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Some of your phone's best features are waiting for you in Moto app. Personalize your device, find helpful tips, explore gestures, and more!">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Some of your phone's best features are waiting for you in Moto app. Personalize your device, find helpful tips, explore gestures, and more!</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᎦᏓ ᎥᎿᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏣᎦᏘᏯ ᎾᎿᎢ Moto ᎬᏙᏗ. ᎣᏤᎵᎢ ᎢᎬᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎯᏩᏔ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏕᏲᎲᏍᎩ, ᎪᎷᏅᏓ ᏧᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ!</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Everything you do on your phone each day is easier with Moto">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Everything you do on your phone each day is easier with Moto</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎿᏛᎦ ᏄᏓᎴᏒᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᎩ ᎠᎯᏗᏳ ᏂᏚᎩᏨᏂᏒᎢ ᎬᏗ Moto</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make your mark and transform your device with custom fonts, colors, icon shapes, wallpapers, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make your mark and transform your device with custom fonts, colors, icon shapes, wallpapers, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏪᎸᎦ ᏨᏌ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎬᏙ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏗᏙᏪᎵᏍᎩ, ᏗᏑᏫᏓ, ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᎠᏍᏆᏚᎸ ᎦᏯᎸᏗ , ᎠᎴ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make it yours">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make it yours</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏨᏌ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏅᎦ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Choose custom fonts, colors, and more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Choose custom fonts, colors, and more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏗᏙᏪᎵᏍᎩ, ᏗᏑᏫᏓ, ᎠᎴ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Choose wallpapers from your personal gallery">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Choose wallpapers from your personal gallery</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏕᎧᏑᎧᏡ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ ᏣᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏏᏴᏫ ᏗᏑᏰᏍᏗᏱ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Wallpaper experiences">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wallpaper experiences</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏆᏚᎸ ᎦᏯᎸᏗ ᏧᏂᎦᏙᎲᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto requires permission to access your photos. Please update the permission settings by granting access to Files and Media">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto requires permission to access your photos. Please update the permission settings by granting access to Files and Media</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎠᏎᏳᎾᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᎶᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To access the media player when the screen is locked, swipe left or right on the external display. When the screen is unlocked, swipe up. When media controls are enabled in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked. Tap and hold the volume up key to go to the next track, and tap and hold the volume down key to go to the previous track.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To access the media player when the screen is locked, swipe left or right on the external display. When the screen is unlocked, swipe up. When media controls are enabled in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked. Tap and hold the volume up key to go to the next track, and tap and hold the volume down key to go to the previous track.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏁᎶᎲᏍᎩ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏙᏯᏗᏢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᏕᏗ, ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏗᏍᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ Moto ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏚᎾᎳᏍᏅᎢ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ. ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎮᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᏐᎢ ᎤᎳᏍᏅᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎡᎳᏗᏢ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎮᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏧᏩᎫᏔᏅ ᎤᎳᏍᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To access the media player, swipe down from the top of the display. When the screen is unlocked, swipe up.When media controls are turned on in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To access the media player, swipe down from the top of the display. When the screen is unlocked, swipe up.When media controls are turned on in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏁᎶᎲᏍᎩ, ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏗᏍᎬ ᎡᎳᏗᏢ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᏕᏗ, ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏗᏍᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ.ᎾᎯᏳ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ Moto ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏚᎾᎳᏍᏅᎢ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
