            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Get tips &amp; tricks">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Get tips &amp; tricks</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏃᎯᏎᎯ &amp; ᏗᎬᏩᏓᎵᏓᏍᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tips">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tips</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏃᎯᏎᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Incorrect SIM PIN code you must now contact your carrier to unlock your device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Incorrect SIM PIN code you must now contact your carrier to unlock your device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ SIM PIN ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏫᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto essentials">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto essentials</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᏧᎵᏍᎨᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="See what’s new and discover quick tips &amp; tricks that help you get the most out of your Moto experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>See what’s new and discover quick tips &amp; tricks that help you get the most out of your Moto experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎢᏤ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎤᎦᏚᏂᏙᎯ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏗᏓᏃᎯᏎᎯ &amp; ᏗᏓᎶᎾᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ ᏂᎯ ᎦᎴᏒ ᎤᎪᏗᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏣᏤᎵ Moto ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏂᏙᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tips">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tips</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏃᎯᏎᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When media controls are turned on in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When media controls are turned on in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ Moto ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᏐᎨᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏚᎾᎳᏍᏅᎢ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Personalize your Moto experience with unique fonts, colors, icon shapes, and more. Go to Personalize in the Moto app to create your custom themes.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Personalize your Moto experience with unique fonts, colors, icon shapes, and more. Go to Personalize in the Moto app to create your custom themes.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ Moto ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏓ ᎤᏩᏒᎯᏯ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏗᏙᏪᎵᏍᎩ, ᏗᏑᏫᏓ, ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ. ᎡᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ Moto ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎢᏳᎾᏛᏁᏗ ᏧᏓᏤᏟᏓ ᏗᎧᏃᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Many apps provide shortcuts you can access by pressing and holding on the app icon. Try it on the Moto app icon for easy access to your favorite features.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Many apps provide shortcuts you can access by pressing and holding on the app icon. Try it on the Moto app icon for easy access to your favorite features.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏂᏣᏘ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ ᏍᏆᎳ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᎯ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏂᏱᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ. ᏣᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ Moto ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᎯᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏫᏣᏉᏛᎢ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Material You provides a more human smartphone experience. It gives you designs that are custom for every style, accessible for any need, and adaptive in the moment.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Material You provides a more human smartphone experience. It gives you designs that are custom for every style, accessible for any need, and adaptive in the moment.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏂᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏗᎾᏓᏁᏢᏍᎩ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏴᏫ ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏓᏤᏢᎢ. ᎤᏩᏌ ᎠᏓᏁᎭ ᏂᎯ ᏗᎪᏢᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏂᏚᏍᏛᎢ, ᏅᏛᏴᏍᏙᏗᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎦᎥᏉ ᎤᏚᎸᏛ, ᏃᎴ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby Atmos brings out the vivid details in your audio to create an immersive listening experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Atmos brings out the vivid details in your audio to create an immersive listening experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Atmos ᏓᎦᏅᎪᏫᏍᏏ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗ ᏂᏕᎬᎿᏅᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎾᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎭᏓᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dual capture mode lets you capture photos and videos with your selfie and rear cameras simultaneously.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dual capture mode lets you capture photos and videos with your selfie and rear cameras simultaneously.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏐᏯ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᎬᏙᏗᎭ ᏣᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏂᎯ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᏓᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎤᏐᏯᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎣᏩᏒ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏃᎴ ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ ᎡᏧᎳᎭ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Android 12 provides a more human smartphone experience. Shapes are softer, buttons and fonts are bigger, and color is infused throughout the device. You can customize your phone’s color palette with Moto’s Personalize feature found in the home screen menu or within the Moto App.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Android 12 provides a more human smartphone experience. Shapes are softer, buttons and fonts are bigger, and color is infused throughout the device. You can customize your phone’s color palette with Moto’s Personalize feature found in the home screen menu or within the Moto App.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Android 12 ᏗᎾᏓᏁᏢᏍᎩ ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏴᏫ ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏓᏤᏢᎢ. ᏩᏂᎨᎢ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎨᏒᎢ, ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏗᏙᏪᎵᏍᎩ ᎤᏔᎾ ᎨᏒᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎠᏑᏫᏓ ᏂᎬᎾᏛ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎧᏁᏉᏓ. ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏑᏫᏓ ᏧᏂᏠᏗ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏗ Moto’s Personalize ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ ᎠᎩᏩᏛᎲᎩ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ ᏧᏪᏅᏒ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏫᏂᏗᏢ Moto App.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto makes it easy to open the camera, even when your device is locked. Just twist your wrist twice quickly, and you'll never miss a moment you want to capture.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto makes it easy to open the camera, even when your device is locked. Just twist your wrist twice quickly, and you'll never miss a moment you want to capture.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᏂᎬᏁᎠ ᎠᏂᏗᎨ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᎲᎢ. ᏣᏍᏕᏯᏍᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎵᏰᏑᏜᏗᏍᏗ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᏗ ᎤᎵᏍᏛ, ᏃᎴ ᎭᏗ ᎯᎷᎯᏴ ᏱᎨᎯᏅᏓ ᎢᏳᏊ ᏱᏣᏚᎵ ᏣᏂᏴᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When media controls are enabled in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked. Tap and hold the volume up key to go to the next track, and tap and hold the volume down key to go to the previous track.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When media controls are enabled in the Moto Actions menu, you can use the volume keys to change tracks while the screen is locked. Tap and hold the volume up key to go to the next track, and tap and hold the volume down key to go to the previous track.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎡᎵᏊ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Moto ᏗᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎪᏫᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏗᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏗᎪᎷᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎠᏍᏚᎲᎢ. ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎡᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏐᎢ ᎪᎷᏅᏍᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎡᎳᏗ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎡᎾᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏧᏩᎫᏔᏅ ᎪᎷᏅᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto Audio lets you create custom profiles for your headphones and Bluetooth speakers so you can always enjoy the best sound, no matter how you listen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Audio lets you create custom profiles for your headphones and Bluetooth speakers so you can always enjoy the best sound, no matter how you listen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎢᏳᎾᏛᏁᎯ ᏚᎧᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏳᏙᎾᏗᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎠᏓᎾᏙᏓ ᏗᏂᏬᏂᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ, ᎭᏗ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏅᏰᎵᏛᎾ ᏰᎵᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏕᎭᏛᏓᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Android 10 also gives you more control over where and when you receive notifications. When you mark notifications as “Silent”, they won’t make a noise or appear on your lock screen, so you\’ll only see the notifications that matter to you. Additionally, Android 10 uses on-device machine learning to predict what you\’ll type next and suggest responses that are tailored to the messages you receive. Smart Reply also suggests actions, such as opening an address in Google Maps, to save you even more time.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Android 10 also gives you more control over where and when you receive notifications. When you mark notifications as “Silent”, they won’t make a noise or appear on your lock screen, so you\’ll only see the notifications that matter to you. Additionally, Android 10 uses on-device machine learning to predict what you\’ll type next and suggest responses that are tailored to the messages you receive. Smart Reply also suggests actions, such as opening an address in Google Maps, to save you even more time.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Android 10 ᎾᏍᏊ ᏗᏣᏁᎯ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏱᎸᏍᏗ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏅᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎯᎩᏍᏒᎢ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᎰᏪᎸᎦ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ “ᎡᎳᏪᎢ”, ᏤᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏱᏛᏓᏃᏟᏍᏔᎾ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎦᎾᏄᎪᎦ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ\’ll ᎤᏩᏌ ᎯᎪᏩᏔ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏗᏳ ᏂᏨᎾ. ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏨ, Android 10 ᏗᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ-ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏢᏅᏙᏗ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᎬ ᎾᎢ ᎨᏴ ᏩᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏂᎯᎾᎢ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᏔᎵᏁᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎧᏁᎢᏍᏙᏔᏅ ᏗᎦᏬᎯᎵᏴᏓ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏓᏤᏢ ᏱᎬᏁᎸᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᏕᏣᏁᏒᎩ. ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᎦᏬᎯᎵᏴᏓ ᎾᏍᏉ ᏗᎧᏁᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎢᏗᏛᏁᏗ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏃᎮᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ Google Maps, ᎾᎢ ᎭᎵᏏᏅᏓ ᎥᏍᏊ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="A download error occurred. Try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>A download error occurred. Try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩ ᎡᎳᏗC ᎦᏢᏍᎬ ᎦᎵᏓᏍᏔᏅ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅᎩ. ᏏᏊ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="No network connection. Connect to a network and try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>No network connection. Connect to a network and try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꮭ ᎤᏚᏓᎵ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ. ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎤᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᎴ ᏏᏊ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
