                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ ()</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can pair other styluses with your Moto phone. However, some styluses may not be compatible.When Moto stylus is connected, this function will turn off automatically.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can pair other styluses with your Moto phone. However, some styluses may not be compatible.When Moto stylus is connected, this function will turn off automatically.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ Moto ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᎠᏎᏍᎩᏂ, ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ Ꮭ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏗᏙᎵᎩ.ᎾᎯᏳ Moto ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᎣᏍᏛ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ, ᎯᎠ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏍᏚᏓ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Permission to restrict other apps send specific broadcast to Moto Note.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Permission to restrict other apps send specific broadcast to Moto Note.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎤᏅᏍᏙᏒ ᏅᏩᏓᎴ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏫᎦᏅᏗ ᎠᏎᎸ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your stylus lets you take quick notes anytime. Just pull it out to open Moto Note or another notes app.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your stylus lets you take quick notes anytime. Just pull it out to open Moto Note or another notes app.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎯᎦ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭᏊ ᎢᏴᎢ. ᏫᏣᏌᏁᏍᏗᏊ ᎾᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏅᏩᏓᎴᎢ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ ᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Note saved to Moto Note">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Note saved to Moto Note</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Take notes anytime without unlocking your device. When you're ready to take a note, just remove the stylus to open Moto Note.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Take notes anytime without unlocking your device. When you're ready to take a note, just remove the stylus to open Moto Note.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᏪᎸᎦ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭᏊ ᎢᏴᎢ ᏄᏠᏯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᎬᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᎢ ᏙᏪᎸᎦ ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸ, ᏍᎩᏋ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᎾᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ Moto ᎤᏍᏗ ᎪᏪᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
