            <termEntry id="The Moto app has some of Motorola’s most unique features. It’s your destination for learning about your device and making it work the way you want.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The Moto app has some of Motorola’s most unique features. It’s your destination for learning about your device and making it work the way you want.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ Moto ᎬᏙᏗ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎥᎿᎢ Motorola’s ᎤᎪᏗᏗ ᎤᏩᏒᎯᏯ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ. ᎾᏍᎩᎾᏃ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏭᎦᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᎾᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏄᏰᎵᏛᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎴ ᏗᏙᎵᎩ ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᏣᏚᎵᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
