            <termEntry id="Be up to date with tips on using your smartphone, personalized news, videos and games.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Be up to date with tips on using your smartphone, personalized news, videos and games.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏤᎯᏐᏙᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏗᏓᏕᏲᎲᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ, ᎣᏤᎵᎢ ᎢᎬᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ  ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎸᏗ, ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ  ᎠᎴ ᏧᎾᏁᎸᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
