            <termEntry id="Data usage for downloading, using and updating apps is billed according to your carrier plan. Usage in excess of your plan's data limits can result in steep coverage charges. Use Wi-Fi to minimize mobile data use. You may turn data on or off any time in Settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Data usage for downloading, using and updating apps is billed according to your carrier plan. Usage in excess of your plan's data limits can result in steep coverage charges. Use Wi-Fi to minimize mobile data use. You may turn data on or off any time in Settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦCᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᏄᏰᎸᏛ ᎡᎳ ᏗᎬᏘ ᎦᏢᏗᏍᎬ, ᎲᏗᏍᎬ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏎᎯᎯ ᎢᎦ ᎠᏓᏚᏅ ᏂᎬᏅ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏧᎾᎵᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎾᏛᏁᎲ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᎬᏙᏗᎢ ᎤᎶᏒᏍᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏗᏎᎸᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ ᎥᎾᎢ ᎦᎸᏗᏜ ᎢᎦᎢᎡᏒ ᏗᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎩ. ᎲᏗᏍᎬ ᏫᎢ-ᏈᎢ ᏱᎬᏗ ᎠᏍᏗᎪᎲᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏙᏗ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏍᏚᏗ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏴᎢ ᎾᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="By providing your CPF, you give Motorola permission to give you fast and specific help on your devices, as well as information about service centers and more. Remember, Motorola will always keep your data safe.">
