            <termEntry id="Allow Rescue and Smart Assistant to back up data from your device to a PC?\Rescue and Smart Assistant backs up the following data: - Photos- Videos- Music files- Contacts">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow Rescue and Smart Assistant to back up data from your device to a PC?\Rescue and Smart Assistant backs up the following data: - Photos- Videos- Music files- Contacts</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ PC?\ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏓ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ: - ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ- ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ- ᏗᎧᏃᎩᏙᏗ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ- ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Extended warranty &amp; accident protection">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Extended warranty &amp; accident protection</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏅᎯᏛᎯ ᎫᏓᎸ &amp; ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎤᏎᎦᏤᎸᎯ ᎠᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="By allowing Motorola to collect your dogfooding usage data, you\’ll help to build better AI experiences for end users. Turning this feature on will not compromise your privacy or security.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>By allowing Motorola to collect your dogfooding usage data, you\’ll help to build better AI experiences for end users. Turning this feature on will not compromise your privacy or security.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꮧ ᎥᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎲ Motorola ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎩᏟ ᎤᎾᎵᏍᏓᏴᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎦCᏌᏅᎯ, ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏁᏍᎨᏗ ᏓᏤᎳ AI ᎤᏂᎦᏙᎲᏒ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᎵᏍᏆᏓ ᏗᏅᏗᏍᎩ ᎡᎵᏍᏗ ᏱᏩᏅᏓ. ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᎬ ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎥᏝ ᎣᏍᏛ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᏃᎴ ᏧᎾᎦᏎᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
