            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please install the update or else the device will install automatically in the next reboot. Make sure the battery level is more than ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Please install the update or else the device will install automatically in the next reboot. Make sure the battery level is more than </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏩᏊ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏃᎴ ᏰᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏐᎢ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏗ. ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᏟᏂᎬᎬ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎡᏍᎦᏉ </term></tig></langSet>
