            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We were not able to download this update. If you'd like to get this update later, please restart your device and then go to Settings &gt; System updates.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We were not able to download this update. If you'd like to get this update later, please restart your device and then go to Settings &gt; System updates.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎥᏝ ᏰᎵ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎦᏢᏍᎬᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ. ᎨᎡᎢ ᏯᏓᎯᏗᏏ ᏣᎸᏉᏛ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎣᏂᏯᎨᏍᏗ, ᎰᏩᏊ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏃᎴ ᎾᏉᏃ Ꭷ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ &gt; ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Because this update is important, your device will restart automatically on ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Because this update is important, your device will restart automatically on </term></tig></langSet>
