                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏅᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬᏃ ᎯᎠ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏓ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏙ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ ᎠᏟᎵᏒᎢ:  ᎢᏯᏔᏬᏍᏔᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="An unexpected error has occurred.Device will retry for an update in background.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>An unexpected error has occurred.Device will retry for an update in background.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꭰ ᏅᎦᏖᏃᎲᎾ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅᎩ.ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏎ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Ꭰ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You need a data connection to check for updates. To check your Wi-Fi connection, go to Settings &gt; Network &amp; internet &gt; Wi-Fi.You can also visit motorola.com/systemupdates to see other update options.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You need a data connection to check for updates. To check your Wi-Fi connection, go to Settings &gt; Network &amp; internet &gt; Wi-Fi.You can also visit motorola.com/systemupdates to see other update options.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ Ꭰ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏓ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏫᎢ-ᏈᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ, Ꭷ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ &gt; ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ &amp; ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ &gt; ᏫᎢ-ᏈᎢ.ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎠᏩᏛᎯᏓᏍᏗ motorola.com/systemupdates ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏐᎢ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏧᎾᏑᏰᏍᏗᏍ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This is an important update, so please install by . Otherwise, it will automatically install at a time when your device is least used. Make sure you have enough battery life for installation.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This is an important update, so please install by . Otherwise, it will automatically install at a time when your device is least used. Make sure you have enough battery life for installation.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎨᎡᎢ Ꭰ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏓ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ, ᏓᏛ ᎰᏩᏊ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ ᎬᏗ . ᎢᏳᏃ ᏰᎵ, ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ ᎤᎿᎢ Ꭰ ᎠᏟᎵᏒᎢ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏍᏗᎧᏂ ᎬᏔᏅᎢ. ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᎴᏂᏙᎲᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎦᏘᏅᏛᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Get the latest security update">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Get the latest security update</term></tig></langSet>
