            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tethered Update Result">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tethered Update Result</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎵᎪᏔᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="There was a problem updating your device. No changes were made. Use the Software Upgrade Assistant tool to install this update. Using a USB cable, connect your device to your computer and select System Update from the USB options on your device. The tool will open on your computer.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>There was a problem updating your device. No changes were made. Use the Software Upgrade Assistant tool to install this update. Using a USB cable, connect your device to your computer and select System Update from the USB options on your device. The tool will open on your computer.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ ᏓᏓᎴᎬ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓ. Ꮭ ᏗᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᏱᎨᏎᎢ. ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏦᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ ᎯᎠ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ. ᎬᏗᎭ Ꭰ USB ᏔᎷᎩᏍᎩ ᏍᏕᏱᏛ, ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ USB ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏥᎩ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You will not be able to place or receive calls, including emergency calls during reboot!">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You will not be able to place or receive calls, including emergency calls during reboot!</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎥᏝ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏗᎩᏍᏗ ᏚᏓᏳᏅᏔᏅᎢ, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᏓᏳᏅᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏗ!</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It's labeled as">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>It's labeled as</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎦᏯᎸᏗ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="As you have enabled Smart Updates feature, your device will automatically update on  if you haven't restarted by then.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>As you have enabled Smart Updates feature, your device will automatically update on  if you haven't restarted by then.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏂᏚᏩᏂᎸᎢ ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ  ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎥᏝ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎬᏗ ᎾᏉᏃ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This important update will automatically install on . Make sure you have enough battery for installation.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This important update will automatically install on . Make sure you have enough battery for installation.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏓ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎯᏘᏅᎦ ᎾᎿᎢ . ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎦᏘᏅᏛᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The SD Card was removed. Download process was not completed. Please re-insert the SD Card and go to Settings &gt; System updates to try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The SD Card was removed. Download process was not completed. Please re-insert the SD Card and go to Settings &gt; System updates to try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ SD ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎠᎲᏍᏓ. ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎦᏢᏍᎬᎢ ᎠᏱᎵᏒ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏍᏆᏙᎾ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎰᏣᎸᎥᎦ ᏥᎩ SD ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ Ꭷ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ &gt; ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Smart updates help your device run safely and efficiently. When you turn them on, all future security updates will automatically download when they're available. After an update is downloaded, your device will restart at the time you choose below.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Smart updates help your device run safely and efficiently. When you turn them on, all future security updates will automatically download when they're available. After an update is downloaded, your device will restart at the time you choose below.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏓᎾᏫᏍᏗ ᎤᏓᎵᏏᏅᏓ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬᎩ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ, ᏂᎦᏓ ᎤᏩᎫᏗᏗᏒ ᏧᎾᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎦᏢᏍᎬᎢ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩᏛ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ. ᎤᎶᏐᏅ Ꭰ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᎬᏘ ᏫᎦᏢᏅᎯ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏎ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏟᎵᏒᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏣᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎡᎳᏗᏨ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Turn on smart updates">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Turn on smart updates</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please charge your device to at least  before installing this update">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Please charge your device to at least  before installing this update</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏩᏊ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎤᏍᏗᎧᏂ  ᎠᏏᏅ ᎦᏘᏅᏛᏍᎬ ᎯᎠ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
