            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your wallpaper couldn’t be downloaded. Check your internet connection and try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your wallpaper couldn’t be downloaded. Check your internet connection and try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏚᎸ ᎦᏯᎸᏗ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᎬᏘ ᏫᎦᏢᏅᎯ. ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏃᎴ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Show an opt-out dialog after displaying the first alert (other than National alert).">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Show an opt-out dialog after displaying the first alert (other than National alert).</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏙᏗ Ꭰ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎠᏎᏒᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ ᏥᎩ ᎢᎬᏱ ᏗᏓᏃᏎᎯ (ᏐᎢ ᎡᏍᎦᏉ ᏂᎬᎾᏛᎢ ᏗᏓᏃᏎᎯ).</term></tig></langSet>
