            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, we're having trouble connecting to your voice mailbox. If you're in an area with poor signal strength, wait until you have a strong signal and try again. If there is still a problem, please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is 9004.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, we're having trouble connecting to your voice mailbox. If you're in an area with poor signal strength, wait until you have a strong signal and try again. If there is still a problem, please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is 9004.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎤᏰᎸᏅ, ᎢᏧᎳ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎤᎲᎢ ᎤᏦᎠᏎᏗ ᏫᏛᎬᏓᎸᎥᏍᎬ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎪᏪᎵᎧᏁᏌ. ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎬᏗ ᎤᎴᏌᏓᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎤᎵᏂᎪᎯᏍᏗ, ᎯᎦᏘᏓ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ Ꭰ ᎤᎱᏍᏘ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏏᏉ Ꭰ ᏓᏓᎴᎬ, ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎤᏩᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏛᏁᎭ ᎤᎿᎢ  ᎠᎴ ᎤᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ 9004.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, we're having trouble connecting to your voice mailbox. If you're in an area with poor signal strength, wait until you have a strong signal and try again. If there is still a problem, please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is 9006.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, we're having trouble connecting to your voice mailbox. If you're in an area with poor signal strength, wait until you have a strong signal and try again. If there is still a problem, please contact Customer Service at  and tell them the error code is 9006.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎤᏰᎸᏅ, ᎢᏧᎳ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎤᎲᎢ ᎤᏦᎠᏎᏗ ᏫᏛᎬᏓᎸᎥᏍᎬ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎪᏪᎵᎧᏁᏌ. ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎬᏗ ᎤᎴᏌᏓᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎤᎵᏂᎪᎯᏍᏗ, ᎯᎦᏘᏓ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ Ꭰ ᎤᎱᏍᏘ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏏᏉ Ꭰ ᏓᏓᎴᎬ, ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎤᏩᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏛᏁᎭ ᎤᎿᎢ  ᎠᎴ ᎤᏃᎮᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ 9006.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
