            <termEntry id="Video Calls are charged differently than standard voice calls\t• Voice uses your plan's voice minutes \t• Video uses your plan's data To use Video Call you must be an AT&amp;T postpaid customer in HD voice coverage. For more information and restrictions, visit www.att.com/videocall.">
