            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In addition to unlocking your phone, you can also use your fingerprint to authorize purchases and app access. Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In addition to unlocking your phone, you can also use your fingerprint to authorize purchases and app access. Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ, ᏰᎵᏯ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏙᏗᎢ ᏗᏩᎯᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ. ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏣᏕᎶᎰᎯᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
