            <termEntry id="Screen attention uses the front camera to see if someone is looking at the screen. It works on device, and images are never stored or sent to Google.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Screen attention uses the front camera to see if someone is looking at the screen. It works on device, and images are never stored or sent to Google.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎭᎦᏎᏍᏓ ᏗᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᏱᏗᏢ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎩᎶᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏯᎦᏘᎭ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎠᎴ ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏞᏍᏗ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏫᎦᏅᏅᎢ ᎾᎾᎢ Google.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=": about  used, as measured by your phone. Your carrier\u2019s data usage accounting may differ.">
