            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To set the time zone using your location, turn on location, then update time zone settings">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To set the time zone using your location, turn on location, then update time zone settings</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᏗᏓᏓᎴᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ, ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ, ᎢᏳᏃ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᏗᏓᏓᎴᏗᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
