            <termEntry id="dim screen, touchscreen, battery, smart brightness, dynamic brightness, Auto brightness">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>dim screen, touchscreen, battery, smart brightness, dynamic brightness, Auto brightness</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏍᎪᎸᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ, ᎠᏒᏂᏍᏗ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ, ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ, ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᎤᏍᎪᏍᏗᏴᎢ, ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎤᏍᎪᏍᏗᏴᎢ, ᎤᏩᏌ ᎠᎾᎩᏍᎩ ᎤᏍᎪᏍᏗᏴᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
