            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" seconds">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> seconds</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᏓᏓᎾᏩᏍᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Encryption was interrupted and can\u2019t complete. As a result, the data on your tablet is no longer accessible.  To resume using your tablet, you need to perform a factory reset. When you set up your tablet after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Encryption was interrupted and can\u2019t complete. As a result, the data on your tablet is no longer accessible.  To resume using your tablet, you need to perform a factory reset. When you set up your tablet after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎤᏓᏲᏍᏓᏁᎸᎩ ᏃᎴ ᏝᏰᎵt ᎧᎵᎢ. ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ, ᏥᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎭᏗ ᎦᏅᎯᏓᎨ ᏅᏛᏴᏍᏙᏗᎢ.  ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎴᏂᏐᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏂᎬᏁᏗ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ᏥᎩ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ, ᏂᎯ\u2019ll ᎠᏎ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎤᎾᏜᏅᏓᏕᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Warning: Your device will be wiped after ^1 more failed attempts to be unlocked!">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Warning: Your device will be wiped after ^1 more failed attempts to be unlocked!</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏔᎲᏍᎩ: ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎦᏅᎦᎸᏗ ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ^1 ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅᎢ ᎤᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ!</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
