            <termEntry id="Wi-Fi time">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wi-Fi time</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you use Pixel Imprint, images are used to update your fingerprint model. Images used to create your fingerprint model are never stored, but the fingerprint model is stored securely on your phone and never leaves the phone. All processing occurs securely on your phone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you use Pixel Imprint, images are used to update your fingerprint model. Images used to create your fingerprint model are never stored, but the fingerprint model is stored securely on your phone and never leaves the phone. All processing occurs securely on your phone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏱᏨᏔᎾ ᎾᎿ ᏓᏂᏙᎬ ᏂᎯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᏍᏗ ᏅᎩ ᏧᏅᏏᏯ ᎤᏙᏪᎸᎢ, ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎢ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎯᏰᏌᏛ ᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅᎢ. ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎪᏢᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎯᏰᏌᏛ ᎤᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅᎢ ᎨᏒᎢ Ꮭ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᏱᎩ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎴ Ꮭ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᏯᎯᏯᏍᎪ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗᎢ. ᏂᎦᏓ ᎠᎵᏱᎵᏍᏒᎢ ᏂᎦᎳᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Couldn't complete call. Error code 91.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Couldn't complete call. Error code 91.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎥᏝ ᏰᎵᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏛᏃᏅ ᏪᏯᎾ. ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ: 91</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your screen brightness will automatically adjust to your environment and activities. You can move the slider manually to help adaptive brightness learn your preferences.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your screen brightness will automatically adjust to your environment and activities. You can move the slider manually to help adaptive brightness learn your preferences.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎤᏍᎪᏍᏗᏴ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎡᎶᎯ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᏃᎴ ᏄᎾᏛᏁᎸᏅ. ᏰᎵᏯ ᏣᎲᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎲᏍᎩ ᎣᏩᏌ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏓ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᏍᎪᏍᏗᏴ ᎤᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏣᏟᎠᏰᎸᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Not connected">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Not connected</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏱᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Only share internet via USB and Bluetooth">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Only share internet via USB and Bluetooth</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏅᏒ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎢᏗᏨ USB ᎠᎴ Bluetooth</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Scan this QR code with another device to join \u201c\u201d">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Scan this QR code with another device to join \u201c\u201d</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎲᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᎢ ᏄᏕᎳ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᏂ ᏍᏓᎵᎪᏗ \u201c\u201d</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Fingerprint enrollment didn't work. Try again or use a different finger.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Fingerprint enrollment didn't work. Try again or use a different finger.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ ᏚᎾᏙᎥ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Camera on">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Camera on</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Even with eyes protected by the green spectacles Dorothy and her friends were at first dazzled by the brilliancy of the wonderful City. The streets were lined with beautiful houses all built of green marble and studded everywhere with sparkling emeralds. They walked over a pavement of the same green marble, and where the blocks were joined together were rows of emeralds, set closely, and glittering in the brightness of the sun. The window panes were of green glass; even the sky above the City had a green tint, and the rays of the sun were green. There were many people, men, women and children, walking about, and these were all dressed in green clothes and had greenish skins. They looked at Dorothy and her strangely assorted company with wondering eyes, and the children all ran away and hid behind their mothers when they saw the Lion; but no one spoke to them. Many shops stood in the street, and Dorothy saw that everything in them was green. Green candy and green pop-corn were offered for sale, as well as green shoes, green hats and green clothes of all sorts. At one place a man was selling green lemonade, and when the children bought it Dorothy could see that they paid for it with green pennies. There seemed to be no horses nor animals of any kind; the men carried things around in little green carts, which they pushed before them. Everyone seeemed happy and contented and prosperous.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Even with eyes protected by the green spectacles Dorothy and her friends were at first dazzled by the brilliancy of the wonderful City. The streets were lined with beautiful houses all built of green marble and studded everywhere with sparkling emeralds. They walked over a pavement of the same green marble, and where the blocks were joined together were rows of emeralds, set closely, and glittering in the brightness of the sun. The window panes were of green glass; even the sky above the City had a green tint, and the rays of the sun were green. There were many people, men, women and children, walking about, and these were all dressed in green clothes and had greenish skins. They looked at Dorothy and her strangely assorted company with wondering eyes, and the children all ran away and hid behind their mothers when they saw the Lion; but no one spoke to them. Many shops stood in the street, and Dorothy saw that everything in them was green. Green candy and green pop-corn were offered for sale, as well as green shoes, green hats and green clothes of all sorts. At one place a man was selling green lemonade, and when the children bought it Dorothy could see that they paid for it with green pennies. There seemed to be no horses nor animals of any kind; the men carried things around in little green carts, which they pushed before them. Everyone seeemed happy and contented and prosperous.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎥᏍᏊ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎦᏙᎵ ᎠᎵᏍᎦᏍᏙᏓ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᏗᎾᏙᏍᏗᏍᎩ Dorothy ᏃᎴ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎨᏴ ᏗᎦᎵᎢ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎤᎾᎿ ᎢᎬᏱᏱ ᎤᏍᏆᏂᎪᎯᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏬᎸᏣᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗ ᎦᏚᎲ. ᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎳᏅᏛᎢ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎠᏰᎦᎶᏛ ᎬᏗ ᎤᏬᏚᎯ ᏓᏂᏁᎸᎢ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎤᏁᏍᎨᎲᎩ ᎾᎿ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᎦᏓᏲᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏍᏛᏗ ᏂᎬᎾᏛ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏓᏪᎳᎩᏍᎬ ᎠᏕᎳᏗᏣᏅᏙᏗ. ᏧᏄ ᎡᎳᏗ ᎤᏂᎩᏒᎢ ᎠᏓᏬᎯᎳᏗᏍᎬ Ꭰ ᎠᏰᏍᏛᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏠᏱ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᎦᏓᏲᏍᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᎭᏢᏃ ᏥᎩ ᏍᏆᎳ ᏗᏍᏆᎵᏛ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎤᎾᏖᎳᏛᎩ ᎡᏧᎳᎭᎢ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎤᏓᏅᏅ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏕᎳᏗᏣᏅᏙᏗ, ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎥᏂᎨᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᎠᏓᏪᎳᎩᏍᎬ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏍᎪᏍᏗᏴ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏅᏙ ᎢᎦ ᎡᎯ. ᏥᎩ ᏓᎨᏗ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎾᎿ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᎤᎸᏌᏗ; ᎥᏍᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎦᎸᎶᎯ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏟ ᏥᎩ ᎦᏚᎲ ᎠᏰᎲ Ꭰ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏗᏑᏫᏓ, ᏃᎴ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎦᎵᏍᎬ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏅᏙ ᎢᎦ ᎡᎯ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ. ᎤᎿᎢ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎤᏣᏘ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ, ᎠᏂᏍᎦᏯ, ᎠᏂᎨᏯ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏂᏲᎵ, ᎠᎢ ᎢᎸᏨ, ᏃᎴ ᎯᎠᏃ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏚᏄᏭᎩ ᎾᎿ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᎡᎾᎿᏬ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏰᎲ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᎤᏁᎦᎸ. ᏧᏄ ᎤᎦᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ Dorothy ᏃᎴ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎵᏎᎩ ᏗᏑᏰᏛ ᎤᎾᏙᏢᏒ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏍᎬᎢ ᏗᎦᏙᎵ, ᏃᎴ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏂᏲᎵ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎤᏓᏫᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᏣᏘᎾ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏩᏍᎦᎸᏅ ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᎡᏥ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏧᏄ ᎤᏂᎪᎲ ᏥᎩ ᏢᏓᏥ; ᎠᏎᏃ ᎭᏗ ᏌᏇ ᎤᏁᏨᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ. ᎤᎪᏗᏗ ᎪᏢᏅᏗᏱ ᎦᏙᎨ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎳᏅᏛᎢ, ᏃᎴ Dorothy ᎤᏂᎪᎲ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏄᏓᎴᏒᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ. ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᎧᎵᏤᏥ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᎠᎾᏔᏍᎩᏍᎩ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎠᏂᎾᏕᏒᎲᏍᎬ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯᏊᏃ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᏗᎳᏑᎶ, ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᏗᎵᏍᏇᏚᏬ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᎡᎾᎿᏬ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏓᏑᏰᏍᎬ. ᎤᎿᎢ ᏌᏇ ᎤᏙᏢᏒ Ꭰ ᎠᏍᎦᏯ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎦᎾᏕᎨᏍᏗ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᎴᎼᏂ ᎦᏨᏯᏍᏔᏅ, ᏃᎴ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏂᏲᎵ ᎠᏩᏒ ᎾᏍᎩ Dorothy ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏧᏄ ᎠᏈᏴᎲᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏗ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᏌᏊ ᎢᏯᏓᏅᏖᏗ. ᎤᎿᎢ ᎢᎦᏰᎵᏒ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎭᏗ ᏐᏈᎵ ᎥᏝ ᎦᎾᏝᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᏳᏍᏗ; ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᏍᎦᏯ ᎠᏫᏛᏓ ᏧᏓᎴᏅᏛ ᎠᏕᏯᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎤᏍᏗ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ ᏓᏆᎴᎵ, ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏧᏄ ᏭᏩᏌᏙᏴ ᎤᏓᎷᎸ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ. ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎢᎦᏰᎵᏒ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏕᎦᎸᏛᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏁᏉᏤᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Try again. If the issue continues, contact the device manufacturer">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Try again. If the issue continues, contact the device manufacturer</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏏᏊ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ. ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᏂᎦᏯᎡᏎᏍᏗ, ᏫᏛᎳᏃᎮᏓ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᏂ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Only share internet via Bluetooth">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Only share internet via Bluetooth</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏅᏒ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎢᏗᏨ Bluetooth</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Defaults">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Defaults</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏚᏓᏄᎸᏅᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Microcell selection failed">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Microcell selection failed</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Microcell ᏗᏑᏰᏓ ᎠᏓᏄᎸᎲᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Too many incorrect attempts. Try again in  seconds.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Too many incorrect attempts. Try again in  seconds.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏧᏍᏈᏯ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᎠᏁᏗᏍᎪᎢ.  ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ ᎾᎿ ᏓᏓᎾᏩᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Smart Forwarding">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Smart Forwarding</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᎠᎬᏱᏗᏜ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Automatic restore">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Automatic restore</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏩᏌ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Share phone\u2019s internet connection via Bluetooth">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Share phone\u2019s internet connection via Bluetooth</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ Bluetooth ᎬᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Couldn\u2019t find networks. Try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Couldn\u2019t find networks. Try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꮭ ᎬᏩᏛᏗ ᏱᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ. ᏏᏊ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Restrict battery usage while in background. App may not work as expected. Notifications may be delayed.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Restrict battery usage while in background. App may not work as expected. Notifications may be delayed.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏍᏚᏁᏗ ᎬᏙᏗᎢ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎾᎿᎢᎣᏂ ᏗᏜ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ. ᎬᏙᏗ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎤᏚᎩ ᎤᏩᏒ ᏰᎵᏊ Ꮭ. ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎡᎵᏊ ᎤᏬᎯᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Screen lock was already changed. Try again with the new screen lock.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Screen lock was already changed. Try again with the new screen lock.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎦᏳᎳ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ. ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏤ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Navigate with buttons at the bottom of your screen">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Navigate with buttons at the bottom of your screen</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏪᎸ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏓᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎦᏗ ᎤᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎭᏫᏂᏗᏨ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The volume leveler provides a consistent volume across all content and applications based on the master volume level of the device. Set the switch on or off to control automatic volume leveling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The volume leveler provides a consistent volume across all content and applications based on the master volume level of the device. Set the switch on or off to control automatic volume leveling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎠᏥᎶᏍᎩ ᏗᎾᏓᏁᏢᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏠᏱᎭ ᏱᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏗᎦᎾᏗᏫᏍᏒ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎦᎸᏛᎢ ᏃᎴ ᏗᏔᏲᏍᏙᏗ ᏓᎳᏏᏔᏅᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏕᏲᎲᏍᎩ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎠᏟᎶᎲᎢ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᏍᏚᏓ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎲᎸᏍᏗ ᎤᏩᏌ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎬᎾᏕᏍᏗᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Create a surround sound experience through your connected device">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Create a surround sound experience through your connected device</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏒᏗ ᎬᏩᏕᏱᏓ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏣᎦᏙᎲᏒ ᏣᎦᏛᎴᏍᏒ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏣᏚᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When Wi-Fi calling is on, your phone can route calls via Wi-Fi networks or your carrier\u2019s network, depending on your preference and which signal is stronger. Before turning on this feature, check with your carrier regarding fees and other details.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Wi-Fi calling is on, your phone can route calls via Wi-Fi networks or your carrier\u2019s network, depending on your preference and which signal is stronger. Before turning on this feature, check with your carrier regarding fees and other details.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᏪᏯᏂ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏗ ᏱᎩ, ᏗᏝᏃᎮᏗᎢ ᏳᏫᏕᎬᎶᎯᏍᏗ ᏪᏴᎾ Ꮎ Wi-Fi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᎴ Ꮎ ᏣᎯᏙᎯ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏫᏨᎸᏉᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᏫᏛᏤᏢᎢ Ꮟ ᏂᎯᏍᏚᎢᏍᎬᎾ Ꮎ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ, ᎯᎵᏃᎮᏓ ᏣᎯᏙ ᏚᎬᏩᎵᏓᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏐᎢ ᏣᏕᎶᎰᎯᏍᏗ ᏱᏣᏚᎵᎠ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn more about time to take action (Accessibility timeout)">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn more about time to take action (Accessibility timeout)</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗᎢ ᎢᎸᏢ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏓᎴᏂᏍᎩ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ (ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎨᏒ ᎠᏲᏍᏙᏗ)</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto Gametime">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Gametime</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᏟᏱᎶᎦ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto essentials">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto essentials</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᏧᎵᏍᎨᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Use your face to unlock your phone or for authentication in apps, like when you sign in or approve a purchase.Keep in mind:You can only have one face set up at a time. To add another face, delete the current one.Looking at the phone can unlock it when you don\u2019t intend to.Your phone can be unlocked by someone else if it\u2019s held up to your face, even if your eyes are closed.Your phone can be unlocked by someone who looks a lot like you, like an identical sibling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Use your face to unlock your phone or for authentication in apps, like when you sign in or approve a purchase.Keep in mind:You can only have one face set up at a time. To add another face, delete the current one.Looking at the phone can unlock it when you don\u2019t intend to.Your phone can be unlocked by someone else if it\u2019s held up to your face, even if your eyes are closed.Your phone can be unlocked by someone who looks a lot like you, like an identical sibling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏛᎢ ᏨᏙᏓ ᏣᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎤᏠᏱᏉ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏕᏣᏙᎥ ᏦᏪᎵᏍᎪᎢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎪᎯᏳᏙᏗ Ꮎ ᎠᏩᎯᏍᏗ.ᎯᏍᏆᏂᎪᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏣᏓᏅᏛᎢ:ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎤᏅ ᏌᏇᏊ ᏭᎦᏛᎢ ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᎦᎪᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒᎢ. ᎾᎢ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏄᏓᎴ ᏭᎦᏛᎢ, ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏃᏊᏥᎩ ᏌᏇᎢ.ᎠᎦᏖᏃᎲ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᏱᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᏳᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏞᏍᏗ\u2019 ᎾᏁᎵᏍᎬ ᎾᎢ.ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎨᏒᎩ ᎤᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎩᎶ ᏄᏓᎴᎢ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ\u2019 ᎤᏌᎳᏓᏅ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᎧᏛᎢ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏱᏗᏣᎦᏔᏍᏗ.ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏯᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎬᏗ ᎩᎶᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏠᏯ ᏤᏍᏓᎦᏅᏗᎢ, ᎾᏍᎩᏯᎢ ᎤᏠᏱᎨᎢᏍᏗ ᎢᏍᏓᏜᏅᏢᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
