            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" has installed certificate authorities for your work profile, which may allow them to monitor work network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.For more information about these certificates, contact your admin.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> has installed certificate authorities for your work profile, which may allow them to monitor work network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.For more information about these certificates, contact your admin.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎯᏘᏅᏛ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏗᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎩ, ᏱᏅᎦᎵᏍᏙᏓ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᏂᎬᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎵᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏄᏛᏁᎸᏅ, ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏗᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ ᎤᏂᎳᏛᎢ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ.ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="camera, smart, auto rotate, auto-rotate, rotate, flip, rotation, portrait, landscape, orientation, vertical, horizontal">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>camera, smart, auto rotate, auto-rotate, rotate, flip, rotation, portrait, landscape, orientation, vertical, horizontal</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ, ᎠᏌᎹᏗ, ᎤᏩᏌ ᎠᎾᎩᏍᎩ ᎠᏗᏆᎸᏕᏯᏍᏗ, ᎤᏩᏌ ᎠᎾᎩᏍᎩ-ᎠᏗᏆᎸᏕᏯᏍᏗ, ᎠᏗᏆᎸᏕᏯᏍᏗ, ᏓᏁᏍᏆᏕᎦ, ᎠᏗᏆᎸᏕᏲᎲ, ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ, ᎦᏙᎯ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ, ᎾᎢ ᎢᏴ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ, ᎦᏚᎳᎠᎦᏘ, ᎠᏍᏆᎾᎳᏃ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" has installed certificate authorities on your device, which may allow them to monitor your device network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.For more information about these certificates, contact your admin.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> has installed certificate authorities on your device, which may allow them to monitor your device network activity, including emails, apps, and secure websites.For more information about these certificates, contact your admin.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎯᏘᏅᏛ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏗᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᏱᏅᎦᎵᏍᏙᏓ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᏂᎬᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎵᏛᏍᎩ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏄᏛᏁᎸᏅ, ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏗᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾᏉ ᎤᏂᎳᏛᎢ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ.ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
