            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When Battery Manager detects that apps are draining battery, you\u2019ll have the option to restrict these apps. Restricted apps may not work properly and notifications may be delayed.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Battery Manager detects that apps are draining battery, you\u2019ll have the option to restrict these apps. Restricted apps may not work properly and notifications may be delayed.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>WᎮn BᎠtᏖry ᎹᎾᎨr ᏕᏖctᏍ tᎭt ᎠppᏍ ᎠrᎡ drᎠᎢᏂng bᎠtᏖry, ᏲᎤ'll ᎭᎥᎡ tᎮ ᎣpᏘᎣn tᎣ rᎡᏍtrᎢct tᎮᏎ ᎠppᏍ. ᎠᏓᎨᏗᏍᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏗᏙᎳᏤᎩ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ Ꮭ ᎠᎴ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎤᏬᎯᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Battery usage data is approximate and doesn't measure usage when phone is charging">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Battery usage data is approximate and doesn't measure usage when phone is charging</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏕᎶᎰᎯᏍᏔᏅ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᎥᏂ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎨᏍᏗ ᎤᏥᎢᎵᏍᎪ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="After formatting, you can use this ^1 in other devices. All data on this ^1 will be erased. Consider backing up first. Back up photos &amp; other mediaMove your media files to alternative storage on this device, or transfer them to a computer using a USB cable. Back up appsAll apps stored on this ^1 will be uninstalled and their data will be erased. To keep these apps, move them to alternative storage on this device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>After formatting, you can use this ^1 in other devices. All data on this ^1 will be erased. Consider backing up first. Back up photos &amp; other mediaMove your media files to alternative storage on this device, or transfer them to a computer using a USB cable. Back up appsAll apps stored on this ^1 will be uninstalled and their data will be erased. To keep these apps, move them to alternative storage on this device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ᎪᏢᏗᏍᎬᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ^1 ᎾᎿ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏂᎦᏓ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ^1 ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏛᏍᏍᎪᎸᏥ. ᎭᏓᏅᏛᎵ ᎠᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᏱ. ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ &amp; ᏐᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᎠᏗᎦᎴᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎵᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᏃᎴ ᏙᏓᏰᏣᏲᎯᏎᎵ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎬᏗᎭ Ꭰ USB ᏧᏯᏅᎢᏗᏍᏕᏛ. ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ^1 ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏥᎯᏘᏅᏓᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏍᎪᎸᏛ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᎯᎠᏃ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎵᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Moto Tour APK">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Tour APK</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᎠᎦᏖᏃᎵᏓᏍᏗ APK</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This spell checker may be able to collect all the text you type, including personal data like passwords and credit card numbers. It comes from the app . Use this spell checker?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This spell checker may be able to collect all the text you type, including personal data like passwords and credit card numbers. It comes from the app . Use this spell checker?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎠᏍᏇᎵᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ ᎠᏎ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎡᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎩ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏣᏐᎥᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ, ᎤᏐᏯᏍᏗ ᎠᏏᏴᏫ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎩ ᎢᏳᏍᏘ ᏱᏗᎦᏪᏍᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏓᏚᎲᏍᎩ ᏆᏂᏲᏍᏗ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎤᎷᏨᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ . ᎯᎠ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏇᎵᏲᏍᏗ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
