            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can\u2019t store new face data. Delete an old one first.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can\u2019t store new face data. Delete an old one first.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ\u2019t ᎠᏓᎾᏅ ᏗᏤ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ. ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᎠᎦᏴᎵ ᏌᏊ ᎢᎬᏱ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allows the app to change the phone's time zone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allows the app to change the phone's time zone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎲ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᎠᏎᏢᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Erase user data">
