            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Increase Wi\u2011Fi logging level, show per SSID RSSI in Wi\u2011Fi Picker">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Increase Wi\u2011Fi logging level, show per SSID RSSI in Wi\u2011Fi Picker</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏁᏉᏍᏗ Wi\u2011Fi ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏥᎶᏍᎩ, ᏍᎩᎪᏩᏛᏓ ᎢᎦᏊ SSID RSSI ᎾᎿᎢ Wi\u2011Fi ᎠᏑᏰᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="USB debugging is intended for development purposes only. Use it to copy data between your computer and your device, install apps on your device without notification, and read log data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>USB debugging is intended for development purposes only. Use it to copy data between your computer and your device, install apps on your device without notification, and read log data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>USB ᎪᎷᏩᏘᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏄᏪᎵᏒ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᏙᎷᏩᏛᏗ ᏂᏚᏰᎵᏛᎢ ᎤᏩᏌ. ᎬᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᎢ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏰᏟ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎯᏘᏅᏛᎦ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᏨ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏄᏠᏯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎸᏛᏁᎸ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
