            <termEntry id="Your SIM card has been permanently disabled. Contact your wireless service provider for another SIM card.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your SIM card has been permanently disabled. Contact your wireless service provider for another SIM card.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᏅᎢ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᏭᏪᏙᎸ ᎬᏩᎦᏘ ᏗᎬᏩᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏂᎨᏒ. ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏍᎩ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏄᏓᎴ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the tablet  times. This user will be removed, which will delete all user data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the tablet  times. This user will be removed, which will delete all user data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᎤᎾᏁᎶᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ  ᎢᏳᏩᏗ. ᎯᎠ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎲᏍᏓ, ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Too many incorrect attempts. This work profile and its data will be deleted.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Too many incorrect attempts. This work profile and its data will be deleted.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏧᏍᏈᏯ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᎠᏁᏗᏍᎪᎢ. ᎯᎠ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎧᏛ ᏃᎴ ᎾᎿ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the phone  times. This phone will be reset, which will delete all its data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the phone  times. This phone will be reset, which will delete all its data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᎤᎾᏁᎶᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ  ᎢᏳᏩᏗ. ᎯᎠ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ, ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the tablet  times. The work profile will be removed, which will delete all profile data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the tablet  times. The work profile will be removed, which will delete all profile data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᎤᎾᏁᎶᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ  ᎢᏳᏩᏗ. ᏥᎩ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎧᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎲᏍᏓ, ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎧᏛ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the phone  times. The work profile will be removed, which will delete all profile data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have incorrectly attempted to unlock the phone  times. The work profile will be removed, which will delete all profile data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᎤᎾᏁᎶᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ  ᎢᏳᏩᏗ. ᏥᎩ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎧᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎲᏍᏓ, ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏧᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎤᎧᏛ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
