            <termEntry id="Your phone will automatically try to cool down. You can still use your phone, but it may run slower.Once your phone has cooled down, it will run normally.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your phone will automatically try to cool down. You can still use your phone, but it may run slower.Once your phone has cooled down, it will run normally.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᏣᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏁᏌᏴᏟ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏏᏉ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᎢᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᏍᎦᏃᎵ.ᏌᏊᏊ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎤᏁᏌᏴᏟ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏎ ᎠᎢᏎᏍᏗ ᏄᎶᏒᏍᏛᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can\u2019t recognize fingerprint. Use screen lock instead.">
