            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="While recording, Android System can capture any sensitive information that\u2019s visible on your screen or played on your device. This includes passwords, payment info, photos, messages, and audio.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>While recording, Android System can capture any sensitive information that\u2019s visible on your screen or played on your device. This includes passwords, payment info, photos, messages, and audio.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎦᏂᏴᎲᎢ, Android ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎤᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏌᏘ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎬᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎾᏛᏁᎸᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎯᎠ ᏚᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ, ᎠᏈᏴᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ, ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ, ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
