            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The user currently signed in to this device can\u2019t turn on wireless debugging. To use this feature, switch to the primary user.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The user currently signed in to this device can\u2019t turn on wireless debugging. To use this feature, switch to the primary user.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᏚᏙᎥ ᎪᏪᎸᎦ ᎤᎿ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛ ᎯᏩᏔ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ, ᎥᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Do Not Disturb was turned on by an automatic rule or app.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Do Not Disturb was turned on by an automatic rule or app.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏤᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎤᎦᏔᎲᏒ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎬᏗ Ꭰ ᎤᏩᏌ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎠᏟᎶᎥᎯ ᏃᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
