            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Camera stopped recording">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Camera stopped recording</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏓ ᎦᏂᏴᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When they use Pixel Imprint, images are used to update their fingerprint model. Images used to create your child\u2019s fingerprint model are never stored, but the fingerprint model is stored securely on the phone and never leaves the phone. All processing occurs securely on the phone.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When they use Pixel Imprint, images are used to update their fingerprint model. Images used to create your child\u2019s fingerprint model are never stored, but the fingerprint model is stored securely on the phone and never leaves the phone. All processing occurs securely on the phone.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᏓᏂᏙᎬ ᏂᎯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᏍᏗ ᏅᎩ ᏧᏅᏏᏯ ᎠᏟᎶᏍᏛ, ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ. ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ, ᏥᎩ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᏧᎦᎶᎦ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᏂᎦᏓ ᎠᏂᎯᎵᏒ ᏂᎦᎳᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Data is paused">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Data is paused</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎠᏲᎯᏍᏔᏅ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Couldn\u2019t access . Check the  app to make sure the control is still available and that the app settings haven\u2019t changed.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Couldn\u2019t access . Check the  app to make sure the control is still available and that the app settings haven\u2019t changed.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏄᎸᏅᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ . ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᏥᎩ  ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏢᏗ ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏱᎸᏍᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏏᏉ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᎠᎴ ᏥᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎤᎭ ᎥᏝ ᏧᏓᏁᏟᏴᏛ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can\u2019t save. Try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Can\u2019t save. Try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Ꮭ \u2019 ᏯᎯᏯᎢ ᏏᏊ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You won't hear your next alarm  unless you turn this off before then">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You won't hear your next alarm  unless you turn this off before then</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎢᏣᏛᏓᏍᏓ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗᏍᎩ  ᎢᏳᏍᎩᏂ ᏂᎯ ᎭᎦᏔᎲᎾ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎤᏓᎷᎸ ᎿᏉᏃ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Battery  percent, about  left based on your usage">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Battery  percent, about  left based on your usage</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ  ᎢᎦᏛᎢ, ᎢᎸᏨ  ᎠᎦᏍᎦᏂ ᏓᎳᏏᏔᏅᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This device is managed by your parent. Your parent can see and manage information such as the apps you use, your location, and your screen time.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This device is managed by your parent. Your parent can see and manage information such as the apps you use, your location, and your screen time.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏗᎦᏅᏏᏙᎯ ᎬᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏧᎾᏓᎦᏴᎵᎨ. ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏧᎾᏓᎦᏴᎵᎨ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᏕᎧᏁᎢᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Shows at the top of conversation notifications and as a profile picture on lock screen, appears as a bubble">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Shows at the top of conversation notifications and as a profile picture on lock screen, appears as a bubble</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᎾᎨᏒᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏩᎦᎸᎳᏗᏴ ᎠᎾᏟᏃᎮᏍᎬ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎠᎴ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᏌᏆᎦᏘ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎾᎢ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ, ᏂᎬᏩᏍᏗ ᎯᎾᎢ ᎤᏆᎷᏒ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Mobile Data On">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Mobile Data On</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᎾᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Unblock device camera?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Unblock device camera?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your admin can monitor and manage settings, corporate access, apps, data associated with your device, and your device's location information.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your admin can monitor and manage settings, corporate access, apps, data associated with your device, and your device's location information.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᏓᏴᎵᏛᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎤᎾᏙᏢᏒ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏚᎵᎪᏒᎢ ᎬᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᏃᎴ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="More time.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>More time.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To save battery, stop  from using battery in the background. This app may not work properly and notifications may be delayed.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To save battery, stop  from using battery in the background. This app may not work properly and notifications may be delayed.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎭᎵᏏᏅᏓ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ, ᎭᎴᏫᏍᏓ  ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᏗᎾ ᎣᏂᏗᏣ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ. ᎯᎠ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ Ꮭ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏗᏙᎳᏤᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᏬᎯᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Got it">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Got it</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᎵᎦ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Camera is recording">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Camera is recording</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏂᏴᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="camera off">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>camera off</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Got it">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Got it</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᎵᎦ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Include battery, airplane mode, mobile data, hotspot, Wi-Fi, etc. Suggested to turn on.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Include battery, airplane mode, mobile data, hotspot, Wi-Fi, etc. Suggested to turn on.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ, ᏥᏳ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ, ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ, ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ, Wi-Fi, ᏓᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬ. ᎧᏁᎢᏍᏙᏔᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="W. Africa Time">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>W. Africa Time</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏭᏕᎵᎬ ᎬᎿᎨᏍᏛ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Do you want to restart your phone to turn off safe mode? All of your apps will be restored once safe mode is turned off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Do you want to restart your phone to turn off safe mode? All of your apps will be restored once safe mode is turned off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏚᎵᎭᏍ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᏂᎦᎾᏰᎬᎾ ᎬᏙᏗ? ᏂᎦᏓ ᎤᎿ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏎᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅ ᏌᏊ ᎢᏳᏩᎫᏗ ᏂᎦᎾᏰᎬᎾ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Liquid or debris is detected in USB port. Charging now may damage your device.Check the USB port for dust or debris and disconnect any device. If you see or feel moisture, shake it out or point a fan or dryer(cold air) at the port.Don\u2019t plug anything into the port until you\u2019re notified that it\u2019s safe to use again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Liquid or debris is detected in USB port. Charging now may damage your device.Check the USB port for dust or debris and disconnect any device. If you see or feel moisture, shake it out or point a fan or dryer(cold air) at the port.Don\u2019t plug anything into the port until you\u2019re notified that it\u2019s safe to use again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᏁᎩᏯᎫᎵ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏲ ᏩᏗᏅᏓ ᎪᎷᏩᏛᏓ ᎾᎿ USB ᎫᏓᎸᏗ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬ Ꭷ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎤᏲᏨᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅ ᏥᎩ USB ᎫᏓᎸᏗ for ᏥᏁᎩᏯᎫᎵ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏲ ᏩᏗᏅᏓ ᏃᎴ ᎱᏓᎳᎩ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏒᎾᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᎸ ᎦᏅᎵᏰᏗ, ᎲᏣᎬᎥᎦ ᎦᏅᎪᏫᏛ ᏃᎴ ᏩᏎᎯᎯ Ꭰ ᎠᏔᏃᏰ ᏃᎴ ᏗᎧᏲᏗᏍᎩᎢ(ᎤᏴᏟ ᎤᏃᎴ) ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎫᏓᎸᏗ.ᏝᏍᏗ\u2019 ᎫᏓᎸᏙᏗ ᏂᎦᎥᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎫᏓᎸᏗ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ\u2019 ᎤᏓᏃᎯᏎᎸ ᎾᏍᎩ\u2019 ᏂᎦᎾᏰᎬᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏏᏊ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To protect your device from liquid or debris, the USB port is turned off and won\u2019t detect any accessories.Check the USB port for dust or debris and disconnect any device. If you see or feel moisture, shake it out or point a fan or dryer(cold air) at the port.Don\u2019t plug anything into the port until you\u2019re notified that it\u2019s safe to use again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To protect your device from liquid or debris, the USB port is turned off and won\u2019t detect any accessories.Check the USB port for dust or debris and disconnect any device. If you see or feel moisture, shake it out or point a fan or dryer(cold air) at the port.Don\u2019t plug anything into the port until you\u2019re notified that it\u2019s safe to use again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>To ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᏁᎩᏯᎫᎵ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏲ ᏩᏗᏅᏓ, ᏥᎩ USB ᎫᏓᎸᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᏯᏕᎳᎰᏌ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎬᏔᏅᏙᏗ.ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅ ᏥᎩ USB ᎫᏓᎸᏗ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏥᏁᎩᏯᎫᎵ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏲ ᏩᏗᏅᏓ ᏃᎴ ᎱᏓᎳᎩ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏒᎾᏍᏗ ᎠᏰᎸ ᎦᏅᎵᏰᏗ, ᎲᏣᎬᎥᎦ ᎦᏅᎪᏫᏛ ᏃᎴ ᏩᏎᎯᎯ Ꭰ ᎠᏔᏃᏰ ᏃᎴ ᏗᎧᏲᏗᏍᎩᎢ(ᎤᏴᏟ ᎤᏃᎴ) ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎫᏓᎸᏗ.ᏝᏍᏗ\u2019 ᎫᏓᎸᏙᏗ ᏂᎦᎥᏉ ᎾᎿᎢ the ᎫᏓᎸᏗ until you\u2019re ᎤᏓᏃᎯᏎᎸ that ᎾᏍᎩ\u2019 ᏂᎦᎾᏰᎬᎾ to ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏏᏊ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Some advanced settings are not available on external display.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Some advanced settings are not available on external display.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᎦᏓ ᎢᏴᏛ ᎠᏱᎸᏛ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
