                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Not secure. Update to an IKEv2 VPN</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎪᏒᎯᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᎿᎢ Ꭰ IKEv2 VPN</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You cannot get the sim status while the device is in airplane mode. Would you like to turn airplane mode off?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You cannot get the sim status while the device is in airplane mode. Would you like to turn airplane mode off?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ SIM ᏄᏛᎿᏕᎬᎢ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᎡᎩ ᎾᎿ ᏥᏳ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ. ᏯᏓᎯᏗᏏ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎯᎸᏉᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ ᏥᏳ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Data usage for downloading, using and updating apps will be billed according to your plan.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Data usage for downloading, using and updating apps will be billed according to your plan.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᏄᏰᎸᏛ ᎡᎳᏗᎬᏘ ᎦᏢᏗᏍᎬ, ᎲᏗᏍᎬ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏎᎯᎯ ᎢᎦ ᎠᏓᏚᏅ ᏂᎬᏅ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏧᎾᎵᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Activating your phone...  Don't turn it off">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Activating your phone...  Don't turn it off</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏕᎳᏗᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ...  ᏤᏍᏗ ᎭᎦᏔᎲᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Note: You will not be able to make or receive phone calls, including emergency calls, after this screen until you finish the Setup Wizard.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Note: You will not be able to make or receive phone calls, including emergency calls, after this screen until you finish the Setup Wizard.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏅᏓᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᎪᏪᎵ: ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎥᏝ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ, ᎤᏐᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂ, ᎤᎶᏐᏅ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎯᏍᏆᏓ ᏥᎩ Setup Wizard.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The device is unable to complete the setup process. Please check your connection as Visual Voicemail needs a cellular data network to work properly.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The device is unable to complete the setup process. Please check your connection as Visual Voicemail needs a cellular data network to work properly.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏛᏃᏅ ᏥᎩ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᎠᏱᎵᏒ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏧᏚᎸᏓ Ꭰ ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏗᏙᎳᏤᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Data usage limited">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Data usage limited</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏩᏎᏢᏊ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don't Activate">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don't Activate</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏤᏍᏗ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Do you want to purchase data so you can use the Verizon network to access the Internet?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Do you want to purchase data so you can use the Verizon network to access the Internet?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏚᎵᎭᏍ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏩᎯᏍᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Verizon ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Also, you won’t be able to make emergency calls after this screen until you finish the Setup Wizard.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Also, you won’t be able to make emergency calls after this screen until you finish the Setup Wizard.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᏉ, ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏰᎵ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂ, ᎤᎶᏐᏅ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎯᏍᏆᏓ ᏥᎩ Setup Wizard.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, that Wi-Fi network is not connected to the Internet right now. Please try a different network or leave setup.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, that Wi-Fi network is not connected to the Internet right now. Please try a different network or leave setup.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎤᏰᎸᏅ, ᎥᏍᎩᎾ Wi-Fi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ Ꭷ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᏣᏁᎸᏙᏗ Ꭰ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏓᏅᏍᏗ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Sorry, this SIM card is not supported. Please contact your wireless service provider.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Sorry, this SIM card is not supported. Please contact your wireless service provider.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏲ ᎤᏰᎸᏅ, ᎯᎠ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎦᎫᏍᏛᏅᎢ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Email setup is not available because you don't have a data connection. Connect to a Wi-Fi network to set up email now, or set it up later in the Email app.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Email setup is not available because you don't have a data connection. Connect to a Wi-Fi network to set up email now, or set it up later in the Email app.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᏍᎬᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏝᏍᏗ ᎤᎭ Ꭰ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ. ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ Wi-Fi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ Ꭷ, ᏃᎴ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᎣᏂᏯᎨᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Don't worry, your choice here won't affect any other Verizon services, and you can change it at any time">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Don't worry, your choice here won't affect any other Verizon services, and you can change it at any time</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏝᏍᏗ ᎤᏰᎵᎯᏍᏗᏍᎬ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎠᎭᏂ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᏐᎢ Verizon ᎢᏗᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ</term></tig></langSet>
