            <termEntry id="The device is unable to start the setup process. Please check your connection as Visual Voicemail needs a cellular data network to work properly.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The device is unable to start the setup process. Please check your connection as Visual Voicemail needs a cellular data network to work properly.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎭᎴᎾ ᏥᎩ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᎠᏱᎵᏒ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏓ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏛ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏧᏚᎸᏓ Ꭰ ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏗᏙᎳᏤᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
