            <termEntry id="WiFi Calling is the service providing the ability to make and receive voice calls over the Internet connection in any available WiFi network, even if you are out of mobile coverage. The WiFi Calling icon on the notification bar(shown below) indicates that all your calls are using WiFi Calling.">
