            <termEntry id="To use Mobile Hotspot, you will need to subscribe to the Mobile Hotspot service.To subscribe to Mobile Hotspot visit My Verizon or call customer care at (800) 922-0204">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To use Mobile Hotspot, you will need to subscribe to the Mobile Hotspot service.To subscribe to Mobile Hotspot visit My Verizon or call customer care at (800) 922-0204</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎬᎯᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏔᏓᏅᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎬᎯᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ.ᎾᎿᎢ ᏔᏓᏅᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᎯᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎠᏩᏛᎯᏓᏍᏗ ᎠᏯ Verizon ᏃᎴ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎤᏩᏍᎩ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ (800) 922-0204</term></tig></langSet>
