            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Camera needs permission to access some things on your device. Open Camera on the internal display to grant permissions.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Camera needs permission to access some things on your device. Open Camera on the internal display to grant permissions.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᏚᎸᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏧᏓᎴᏅᏛ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎭᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
