                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏗ ᏚᎾᎧᏛ ᎪᎷᏩᏛᎲᎢ ᏱᎩ. ᏱᎬᏩᏍᏗᎭᏭ ᏱᎭᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Access locationOpen cameraRecord audioRead &amp; write storageAccess internet">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Access locationOpen cameraRecord audioRead &amp; write storageAccess internet</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎦᏂᏴᏗᏍᎩᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ &amp; ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Pro mode photos are optimized for the best resolution. The ratio can\’t be changed in some modes or when the Pro mode photo format is RAW.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Pro mode photos are optimized for the best resolution. The ratio can\’t be changed in some modes or when the Pro mode photo format is RAW.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᎬᏙᏗᎭ ᏓᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎨᏒ ᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᏙᏗ. ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎢᎦᏛᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ\’ ᏱᎦᏴᎦᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗᎭ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᎬᏙᏗᎭ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏱᎬᏁᎸᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎪᏍᏘ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Macro mode helps you take detailed photos of subjects as close as 1.5 inches away from the lens">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Macro mode helps you take detailed photos of subjects as close as 1.5 inches away from the lens</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎹᎧᎣ ᎬᏙᏗᎭ ᏍᏕᎵᏍᎪᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᏎᎸᎩ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ 1.5 ᎢᏏᏔᏗᏍᏗ ᎤᏣᏘᎾ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᎨᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
