                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎧᏛ ᎤᏬᏚ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᏱᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏙᎯ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎨᏒᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Twist your wrist twice quickly to open the selfie camera">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Twist your wrist twice quickly to open the selfie camera</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏄᏖᏲᎭ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎧᏯᏌᏝ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᎫᏗ ᎤᎵᏍᏓᏊ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎣᏩᏒ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
