            <termEntry id="When fragmentation is detected, phone storage will be optimized to let you open apps and view content more quickly.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When fragmentation is detected, phone storage will be optimized to let you open apps and view content more quickly.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎩ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎪᎷᏩᏛᏅᎢ, ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅ ᎾᎢ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎦᎸᏛᎢ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏄᏟᏍᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
