                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏩᎦᏔ ᏥᏳᎪᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Now you can quickly check time, battery status, notifications and even take an action over the notifications when the screen is off">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Now you can quickly check time, battery status, notifications and even take an action over the notifications when the screen is off</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏃᏊ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏄᏟᏍᏛ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᏣᎦᏛᎲᎦ, ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ, ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏃᎴ ᎥᏍᏊ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏖᎸᏗ ᎠᏓᏬᎯᎳᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎮᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Go to Peek Display settings to block notifications from specific apps, change notification details that appear, bypass authentication, and more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Go to Peek Display settings to block notifications from specific apps, change notification details that appear, bypass authentication, and more</term></tig></langSet>
