            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You don't need to unlock your phone to see notifications. Just bump it to wake up Peek Display.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You don't need to unlock your phone to see notifications. Just bump it to wake up Peek Display.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᏗᎾᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ. ᏍᎩᏋ ᎤᏩᏍᏔᏅᎩ ᎾᎢ ᏱᏰᏍᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏗᎧᎿᏅ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
