                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᎢᏎᏍᏗ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎣᏂᏗᏣ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Note: Face unlock can’t be used if the device has been locked for 4 hours or longer. After you unlock your device by another method, you can use Face unlock again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Note: Face unlock can’t be used if the device has been locked for 4 hours or longer. After you unlock your device by another method, you can use Face unlock again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏅᏓᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᎪᏪᎵ: ᎤᎧᏛ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᏝᏰᎵ ᎨᏒ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎾᏍᏚᎰ 4 ᎢᏳᏟᎶᏛ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎪᎯᏓᎨᏍᏗ. ᎤᏕᏐᏅ ᏂᎯ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏅᏩᏓᎴᎢ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᎤᎧᏛ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩᏍᏗ ᏏᏊ.</term></tig></langSet>
