            <termEntry id="Moto Gametime needs permission to access background data to identify apps as games. Tap &quot;Continue&quot; to grant permission.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Moto Gametime needs permission to access background data to identify apps as games. Tap "Continue" to grant permission.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Moto ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᏟᏱᎶᎦ ᏚᏚᎸᏛᎢ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎢ ᎪᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏁᎸᏙᏗ. ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ "ᏂᎦᏯᎢᏒᎢ" ᎾᎢ ᎭᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
