            <termEntry id="Learn how to use your Razr like a pro. Razr Tips gives you information about basic functions, shortcuts on the external display, transitioning between the 2 displays, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn how to use your Razr like a pro. Razr Tips gives you information about basic functions, shortcuts on the external display, transitioning between the 2 displays, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏙᎡᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Razr ᎯᎸᏉᏗ Ꭰ ᎧᎵ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏄᏍᏗ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ. Razr ᎠᏍᏕᎸᏗᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎭ ᏂᎯ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᎢᎸᏨ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏛ ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗᏱ, ᏍᏆᎳ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᎯ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ, ᏓᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᏥᎩ 2 ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᎪᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
