            <termEntry id="Personalize your phone with custom themes, wallpapers, animations, and more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Personalize your phone with custom themes, wallpapers, animations, and more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎣᏤᎵᎢ ᎢᎬᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎢᏳᎾᏛᏁᏗ ᏧᏓᏤᏟᏓ ᏗᎧᏃᏗ, ᏕᎧᏑᎧᏡ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ, ᏗᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Choose fonts, colors &amp; more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Choose fonts, colors &amp; more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏗᏙᏪᎵᏍᎩ, ᏗᏑᏫᏛ &amp; ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Femtocell Preference">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Femtocell Preference</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Femtocell ᎤᏟ ᎠᏰᎸᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="My Photos">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>My Photos</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏗᏆᏤᎵ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can talk to the Google Assistant anytime, even when the flip is closed. Just double tap on the power key or say “Hey Google” to make calls, get the weather, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can talk to the Google Assistant anytime, even when the flip is closed. Just double tap on the power key or say “Hey Google” to make calls, get the weather, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏱᎵᏃᎮᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ Google ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭᏊ ᎢᏴᎢ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏗᏁᏍᏆᏕᎦ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏚᏅᎩ. ᏍᎩᏋ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᎫᏗ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏫᏂᏫ “ᏂᏃ Google” ᎾᎢ ᏫᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏙᏱᏗᏜ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏔᏅᎲᏍᎬᎢ, ᎠᎴᏃ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When the screen is locked, open the camera by twisting your wrist twice. When the screen is unlocked, open the camera by swiping right on the external display. Then, either tap on the screen or press the volume up or down key.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When the screen is locked, open the camera by twisting your wrist twice. When the screen is unlocked, open the camera by swiping right on the external display. Then, either tap on the screen or press the volume up or down key.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏍᏓᏱ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ, ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏄᏩᏅ ᏣᏄᏖᏲᏍᏓ ᏣᏯᏌᏝ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᎫᏗ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᏕᏗ, ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏄᏩᏅ ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᎦᏘᏏ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ. ᎾᏉᏃ, ᎢᏳᏍᏗᏊ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎠᎴᎬ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can talk to the Google Assistant anytime, even when the flip is closed. Just double tap on the power key or say “Hey Google”.When you’re using the Google Assistant on the external display, specific commands work best (e.g. “Play my cooking playlist on Spotify” or “Set a timer for 3 minutes”).">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can talk to the Google Assistant anytime, even when the flip is closed. Just double tap on the power key or say “Hey Google”.When you’re using the Google Assistant on the external display, specific commands work best (e.g. “Play my cooking playlist on Spotify” or “Set a timer for 3 minutes”).</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏱᎵᏃᎮᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ Google ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭᏊ ᎢᏴᎢ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏗᏁᏍᏆᏕᎦ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏚᏅᎩ. ᏍᎩᏋ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᎫᏗ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏫᏂᏫ “ᏂᏃ Google”.ᎾᎯᏳ ᎲᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ Google ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ, ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏗᏓᏁᏤᏗ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎰ ᏫᏓᏤᎸᎢ (e. g. "ᏔᏁᎶᏓ ᎠᏆᏤᎵ ᎦᏓᏍᏓᏴᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᎾᏛᏁᎸᏗ ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎤᏓᏓᏢᏃ ᎢᏗᏓᏛᏁᏗ" ᎠᎴᏃ "ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏥᏱᎵᏒ ᎠᎦᏘᏯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ 3 ᎢᏯᏔᏬᏍᏔᏅ"</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Big screen gaming">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Big screen gaming</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏔᎾ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏣᏁᎸᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It's not always easy to reach the capture button when you're taking a selfie. The new Gesture Selfie feature lets you take a selfie by showing the palm of your hand.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>It's not always easy to reach the capture button when you're taking a selfie. The new Gesture Selfie feature lets you take a selfie by showing the palm of your hand.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏗ ᏂᎪᎸ ᎠᎯᏓ ᏱᎩ ᎠᏙᏯᏅᎯᏗᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎣᏩᏌ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ. Ꮎ ᎢᏤ ᎤᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ ᎣᏩᏌ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᎸᏗᏍᎪ ᎣᏩᏌ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎬᏗ ᏍᎩᎪᏩᏛᏗᏍᎬ ᎭᏫᎾᏗᏢ ᏦᏰᏂ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="After capturing a photo on the internal display, the external display can show a preview for your subject to review. You can turn this feature on in Camera settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>After capturing a photo on the internal display, the external display can show a preview for your subject to review. You can turn this feature on in Camera settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎶᏐᏅ ᎦᏂᏱᏍᎬ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎥᎾᎢ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ, Ꮎ ᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ ᏰᎵ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏓᎪᏩᏛᏗᏍᎩ ᏄᏰᎸᏛ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᏣᎪᎵᏰᏗ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏗᎧᏃᏗ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="No cable? No problem.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>No cable? No problem.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏂᎩᏓ ᏔᎷᎩᏍᎩ ᏍᏕᏱᏛ? ᎣᏏᏊ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Twist to open the camera">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Twist to open the camera</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏄᏖᏲᎸ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When the screen is locked, open the camera by twisting your wrist twice. When the screen is unlocked, open the camera by swiping right on the external display home screen. Then, either tap on the screen or press the volume up or down key to capture.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When the screen is locked, open the camera by twisting your wrist twice. When the screen is unlocked, open the camera by swiping right on the external display home screen. Then, either tap on the screen or press the volume up or down key to capture.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ, ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ by ᏣᏄᏖᏲᏍᏓ ᏂᏨᏅᎩ ᎧᏯᏌᏝ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᎦᏔ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳᏕᏗ, ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎦᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᏧᏪᏅᏒᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ. ᎾᏉᏃ, ᎢᏳᏃ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎡᎳᏗ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Do more with your voice">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Do more with your voice</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎾᏛᎦ ᎬᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can talk to the Google Assistant anytime, even when the flip is closed. Just say “Ok Google” to make calls, get the weather, and more.When the flip is closed, the Google Assistant only supports voice interactions. Open the flip for the full Google Assistant experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can talk to the Google Assistant anytime, even when the flip is closed. Just say “Ok Google” to make calls, get the weather, and more.When the flip is closed, the Google Assistant only supports voice interactions. Open the flip for the full Google Assistant experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏱᏍᏓᏜᏃᎲᎳ ᎾᏍᎩ Google ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎭᏊ ᎢᏴᎢ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏁᏍᏆᏕᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ. ᏍᎩᏋ ᏂᏫ “ᎭᏩ Google” ᎾᎢ ᏫᎨᎯᏴᏓᏏ, ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᏗ ᏙᏱᏗᏜ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏔᏅᎲᏍᎬᎢ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ.}ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏁᏍᏆᏕᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ, ᎾᏍᎩ Google ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏩᏚᏍᏓᎢ ᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᏓᏔᎳᏗᏍᎬᎢ. ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏁᏍᏆᏕᎦ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎧᎵ Google ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎤᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Immerse yourself in sound">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Immerse yourself in sound</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏓᏃᏯᏗᏍᎨᏍᏗ ᏨᏌᏊ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Enhance your sound">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Enhance your sound</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᏤᎴᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᎬᏴᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Easy screenshots">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Easy screenshots</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎯᏓ ᏓᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Now you can enjoy better power and volume interactions. To launch the Google Assistant, press and hold the power key. To open the power menu, press and hold the power and volume up keys.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Now you can enjoy better power and volume interactions. To launch the Google Assistant, press and hold the power key. To open the power menu, press and hold the power and volume up keys.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏃᏊ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᏓᏤᏢ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏓᏔᎳᏗᏍᎬᎩ. ᎾᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ Google ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ, ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎯᏂᏯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ. ᎾᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏨ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you prefer light theme during the day and dark theme at night, you can switch back and forth automatically. You can choose specific times or let the theme change based on the sunrise &amp; sunset time in your location.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you prefer light theme during the day and dark theme at night, you can switch back and forth automatically. You can choose specific times or let the theme change based on the sunrise &amp; sunset time in your location.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏟ ᏱᏁᎵ ᎤᏓᏌᎧᎢ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎵᏏᎩ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏒᏃᏱ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏱᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᏃᎴ ᏴᎯᏌᏙᏯ cᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᎯ. ᏰᎵᏊ ᏣᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏗᏙᎳᎩ ᏓᏟᎢᎵᏒ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏔᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᏓᎳᏏᏔᏅᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏅᏙ ᎢᎦ ᎡᎯ ᏨᏗᎧᎸᎪ &amp; ᎤᏓ ᎢᎦ ᎡᎯ ᏭᏕᎵᎬ ᎠᏥᏱᎵᏒ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can unlock your Razr by pressing on the fingerprint sensor or swiping up on the external display to enter a pin or pattern. Your Razr locks if it’s not used for a period of time. This time is set by default, but you can change it in Settings. You can also lock by pressing the power key.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can unlock your Razr by pressing on the fingerprint sensor or swiping up on the external display to enter a pin or pattern. Your Razr locks if it’s not used for a period of time. This time is set by default, but you can change it in Settings. You can also lock by pressing the power key.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏱᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ Razr ᎬᏗ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎤᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᏩᏘᏍᎩ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏗᏍᎬ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁd ᎾᎢ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᎭᏓ ᎠᎴᏃ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ. ᏣᏤᎵ Razr ᏍᏓᏯ ᏓᏍᏚᎭ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎥᏝ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎢᎪᎯᏛ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒᎢ. ᎯᎠ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎤᏓᏄᎸᏅᎩ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏋ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏐᎥᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Take a shortcut">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Take a shortcut</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏍᏆᎳ ᎢᎬᏁᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Connect to your PC for easy file sharing, remote phone control, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Connect to your PC for easy file sharing, remote phone control, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ PC ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᎯᏓ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎠᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ, ᎢᎾ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Do more with your voice">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Do more with your voice</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎾᏛᎦ ᎬᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Ditch the small screen and enjoy your favorite video apps on your TV or display. While you’re watching, you can continue using your phone without stopping the video.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Ditch the small screen and enjoy your favorite video apps on your TV or display. While you’re watching, you can continue using your phone without stopping the video.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏲᎯᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᎤᏍᏗᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏣᎵᎮᏍᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏫᏣᎸᏉᏛᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎥᎾ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ. ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏣᎦᏙᏍᏛᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏂᎦᏯᎢᏒ ᎲᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏠᏯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="From authentication to network security, Android gives you the best possible protection against security threats. Now you can manage your privacy preferences more easily in Settings so you always feel in control of what you share. You can also rest easy knowing that Android is providing faster security updates to send fixes as soon as they\’re available.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>From authentication to network security, Android gives you the best possible protection against security threats. Now you can manage your privacy preferences more easily in Settings so you always feel in control of what you share. You can also rest easy knowing that Android is providing faster security updates to send fixes as soon as they\’re available.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ, Android ᏣᏁᎰᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗᏉ ᎤᎾᏓᎵᏍᎦᏍᏙᏗ ᏗᎦᏘᎴᎩ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏁᏄᎵᏍᎩ. ᏃᏊ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎨᏣᏱᎸᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᎤᏟ ᎯᏰᎸᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᎯᏗᎨ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎤᏓᏛᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏱᎵᏒᎯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎯᏯᏙᎯᎲᎢ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎠᎯᏓ ᏯᏣᏪᏐᎸᏍᏗ ᏣᏅᏘᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ Android ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎬ ᎦᏣᏄᎳ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏫᎦᏅᏗ ᏧᏍᏓ ᏱᏗᎬᏁᎸᎯ ᏄᎵᏍᏛᏉ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᏃ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Now you can do even more from the power button menu. Just tap for quick access to your wallet, Google Home controls, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Now you can do even more from the power button menu. Just tap for quick access to your wallet, Google Home controls, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏃᏊ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᎩ ᎥᏍᏊ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ. ᏍᎩᏋ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏕᎳ ᏗᎦᎸᏙᏗ, Google ᏧᏪᏅᏒ ᏗᎯᎸᏍᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To adjust the keyboard height for more comfortable typing, go to Gboard settings &gt; Preferences &gt; Keyboard height. Then, drag the bar to your preferred height.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To adjust the keyboard height for more comfortable typing, go to Gboard settings &gt; Preferences &gt; Keyboard height. Then, drag the bar to your preferred height.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎢ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎦᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎤᏦᎠᏎᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏙᏗ, ᎡᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎾᎢ GᏯᏖᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ &gt; ᎤᏟ ᏕᎯᏰᎸᏍᎬᎢ &gt; ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎦᏛᎢ. ᎿᏉᏃ, ᎦᎾᏏᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᎾᎸ ᎾᎢ ᏂᏨᏅ ᎤᏟ ᎠᏰᎸᏅ ᏂᎦᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To change the wallpaper, long press on the internal display Home screen and tap on “External Wallpapers”.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To change the wallpaper, long press on the internal display Home screen and tap on “External Wallpapers”.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᎤᏓᏴᎳᏛ, ᎪᎯᏓ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎵᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎥᎿ ᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To change the wallpaper, long press on the internal display home screen and tap on “External Wallpapers”. To use one of your photos as a wallpaper, open the photo &gt; tap on the three buttons in the upper right corner &gt; tap on “Use as” &gt; choose “External Wallpapers”.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To change the wallpaper, long press on the internal display home screen and tap on “External Wallpapers”. To use one of your photos as a wallpaper, open the photo &gt; tap on the three buttons in the upper right corner &gt; tap on “Use as” &gt; choose “External Wallpapers”.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᎤᏓᏴᎳᏛ, ᎪᎯᏓ ᎠᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎵᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎥᎿ ᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏚᏓᏴᎳᏛ. ᏍᏙᏗ ᏌᏊ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎥᎩ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᎤᏓᏴᎳᏛ, ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ&gt;</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Enhance your sound">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Enhance your sound</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᏤᎴᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᎬᏴᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you're connected to your PC via USB, you can use your phone as a webcam for enhanced video chats.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you're connected to your PC via USB, you can use your phone as a webcam for enhanced video chats.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎢ ᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ PC ᎾᎿ ᎢᏗᏨ USB, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏙᏓ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᎾᏟᏃᎮᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Take selfies with a gesture">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Take selfies with a gesture</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎣᏩᏒ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏔᏓᏥᎶᏍᏓ ᎤᏬᏯᏂᏍᎩ ᎬᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To capture photos with the flip closed, twist your wrist twice to open the camera. Then, either tap on the screen or press the volume up or down key.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To capture photos with the flip closed, twist your wrist twice to open the camera. Then, either tap on the screen or press the volume up or down key.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏛᎦᏂᏴᏍᎬ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏗᏅᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᏚᎲᏍᎩ, ᏍᏕᏯᏍᏗ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎵᏰᏑᏜᏗᏍᏗ ᎯᏍᏚᎢᏍᎬ Ꮎ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ. ᎾᏉᏃ, ᎢᏳᏍᏗᏊ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸᎢ ᎥᎾᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎵᏛᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ Ꮎ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎡᎳᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Take a peek">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Take a peek</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎦᏙᏍᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Video chatting with Ready For is the next best thing to being in the room. Subject tracking on your phone’s camera keeps everyone in the field of view for more natural conversation.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Video chatting with Ready For is the next best thing to being in the room. Subject tracking on your phone’s camera keeps everyone in the field of view for more natural conversation.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏛᏝᏃᎮᏍᎬ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏄᏰᏢᏛ ᎥᎩᎾ ᏐᎢ ᎣᎯᏍᏗ ᎡᏙᎲᎩ ᎥᎾᎢ ᎦᏅᏑᎸᎢ. ᎢᏳᏍᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎥᎪᎷᏁᎬ ᎥᎾ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᎬᏅ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎤᏂᎮᏍᏗ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᏗᎧᏃᏗᏗ ᏄᏰᎸᏛ ᎤᎪᏛ ᏂᎬᏩᏍᏛ ᏓᎾᎵᏃᎮᏍᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When the external display is locked, you can control the media player, read notifications, and send quick replies. When the external display is unlocked, you can take more actions on notifications and get access to contacts &amp; app shortcuts.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When the external display is locked, you can control the media player, read notifications, and send quick replies. When the external display is unlocked, you can take more actions on notifications and get access to contacts &amp; app shortcuts.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ Ꮎ ᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏯᏍᏚᎭ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏱᎭᎷᎩ Ꮎ ᏗᎦᏃᎩᏍᏙᏗ, ᏣᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏗᎾᏓᏣᎳᏁᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᏫᎦᏅᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᏗᎦᏬᎯᎵᏴᏍᏗ. ᎾᎯᏳ Ꮎ ᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᏚᎲᎾ ᏱᎩ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏣᎦᏍᏗ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏗᎾᏓᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏃᎴ ᏣᎩᏍᏗ ᎤᎵᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᎳ ᎢᏗᎬᏁᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you’re taking a photo on the internal display, you can show an animation on the external display to get your subject’s attention. This is especially helpful when you’re taking photos of children. You can turn this on in Camera settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you’re taking a photo on the internal display, you can show an animation on the external display to get your subject’s attention. This is especially helpful when you’re taking photos of children. You can turn this on in Camera settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏕᎭᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᏅᎦ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ ᎥᎿᎢᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏣᎩᏍᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ. ᎯᎠ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏕᎭᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᏗᏂᏲᏟ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏗᎧᏃᏗ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Key touches">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Key touches</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᏗᏒᏂᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Now you can get high quality document scans from your phone. Once you capture the document photo, Camera makes necessary adjustments so you’re ready to share.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Now you can get high quality document scans from your phone. Once you capture the document photo, Camera makes necessary adjustments so you’re ready to share.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏃᏊ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎩ ᎤᏟ ᎢᏲᏍᏓ ᏃᏌᏅᏱ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᏱᎦᏂᏴᎭ Ꮎ ᎪᏪᎳᏅᎢ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ, ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏕᎪᏢᏍᎦ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏫᏗᎧᎲᎦ,ᎢᏳᏃ ᏣᏛᏅᏍᏔᏅ ᏱᎦ ᏣᏯᏙᎯᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Give your eyes and your battery a rest with Android\’s new dark theme. When you turn on dark theme, your favorite Android and Moto apps automatically show a darker design.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Give your eyes and your battery a rest with Android\’s new dark theme. When you turn on dark theme, your favorite Android and Moto apps automatically show a darker design.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏘᎯᎧᏅ ᏃᎴ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏔᏣᏪᏐᎸᏍᏓ ᎬᏗ Android\’s ᎢᏤ ᎤᎵᏏᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᏥᏍᏚᎢᏒ ᎤᎵᏏᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎧᏃᎵᏗ, ᏣᏤᎵ ᏫᏣᎸᏉᏛᎢ Android ᏃᎴ Moto ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏙᏗ ᏭᎵᏏᎬᎢ ᎪᏢᏔᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Android built for you">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Android built for you</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᏂᏙᎢᏗ ᎪᏒᏅᎯ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Bring your photos to life">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Bring your photos to life</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᏛᎦ ᏂᏗᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you start a task on the external display, you can flip open for a more detailed experience on the internal display. When you’re using the internal display, you can close the flip to end a task and start something else.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you start a task on the external display, you can flip open for a more detailed experience on the internal display. When you’re using the internal display, you can close the flip to end a task and start something else.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏗᏁᏍᏆᏕᎦ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏎᎸᎩ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ. ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎬᏂᎨᎢ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏁᏍᏆᏕᎦ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏍᏆᏗᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎭᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏄᏓᎴᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When you set a timer on the internal display, the countdown will also appear on the external display.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When you set a timer on the internal display, the countdown will also appear on the external display.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᏕᎯᎧᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏥᏱᎵᏒ ᎠᎦᏘᏯ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎭᏫᏂ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏏᏁᎦᏘ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎤᎾᏄᎪᎢᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ .</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Cinemagraph mode lets you create artistic photos in motion. Take a short video, highlight the area you want to keep in motion, and share an animated GIF with friends.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Cinemagraph mode lets you create artistic photos in motion. Take a short video, highlight the area you want to keep in motion, and share an animated GIF with friends.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏍᏆᎳ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏣᎦᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎪ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏒᏗ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ. ᎯᎩ ᏍᏆᎳ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ, ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ Ꮎ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏣᏚᎵᏍᎬ Ꭲ ᏣᎬᎵᏗᎩ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᎠᏯᏙᏢ ᎬᏃᏓᏳᏍᏗ GIF ᎬᏗ ᏦᎵᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Google Photos makes it easy to find, edit, and share your photos. All of the photos you capture are automatically saved to your gallery in Google Photos.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Google Photos makes it easy to find, edit, and share your photos. All of the photos you capture are automatically saved to your gallery in Google Photos.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎫᎦᎴ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏂᎬᏁᎲᎢ ᏩᎾᏂᎨᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏩᏛᏗᎢ, ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᎪᏪᎸ, ᏃᎴ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᏗᏣᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ. ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏂᎯ ᏗᏣᏂᏴᏓ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏔᏅᎢ ᎥᎣᎢ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏑᏰᏍᏗᏱ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎫᎦᎴ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎦ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Turn on Do Not Disturb quickly by flipping your phone face down on a flat surface.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Turn on Do Not Disturb quickly by flipping your phone face down on a flat surface.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏙᏗ ᏄᎵᏍᏛ ᎾᎢ ᎥᏍᏚᎲᏍᎬ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎥᎦᏛᎢ ᎡᎳᏗ ᏅᎬᏁᎲ ᎥᎾᎢ ᎤᏩᎾᏕᏍᎬ ᎦᏚᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make your photos pop with Spot Color. Pick a color on your photo and turn everything else black &amp; white.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make your photos pop with Spot Color. Pick a color on your photo and turn everything else black &amp; white.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏒᏗ ᏣᏤᏁ ᏓᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎠᏔᏍᎩ ᎤᏐᏯᏍᏗ ᎤᏓᏓᎸ ᎠᏑᏫᏓ. ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏑᏫᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᏃᎴ ᏘᎦᏔᎲᏍᏗ ᏄᏓᎴᏒᎢ ᏧᏓᎴᏅᏓ ᎬᎿᎨ &amp; ᎤᏁᎦ ᏂᏛᎦ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can give apps permission to open on the external display, though not all apps are designed for that screen size. To access the app tray, swipe left on the external display home screen.You can fill the app tray with a curated group of apps that work well on the external display, or add a full list of apps, including those that may not work as expected. You can manage the app tray and permissions in External display settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can give apps permission to open on the external display, though not all apps are designed for that screen size. To access the app tray, swipe left on the external display home screen.You can fill the app tray with a curated group of apps that work well on the external display, or add a full list of apps, including those that may not work as expected. You can manage the app tray and permissions in External display settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏱᎲᏎ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ, ᎤᏁᎳᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᏊᎾ ᎭᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᏅᎯ ᎢᏳᏰᎸᏗ Ꮎ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᎩᏓ ᎨᏒ. ᏣᏴᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏂᎬᏁᎲ, ᎠᎦᏍᎯᏂ ᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏙᏱᏗᏢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩᏲᎤ cᎠn fᎢll tᎮ Ꭰpp trᎠy Ꮻth Ꭰ cᎤrᎠᏖd grᎣᎤp Ꭳf ᎠppᏍ tᎭt Ꮼrk Ꮺll Ꭳn tᎮ ᎡxᏖrᎾl ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ, Ꭳr Ꭰdd Ꭰ fᎤll ᎵᏍt Ꭳf ᎠppᏍ, ᎢncᎷᏗng tᎰᏎ tᎭt Ꮉy Ꮓt Ꮼrk ᎠᏍ ᎡxpᎡcᏖd. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵ ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏓᏍᏗ app ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ in ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Get more storage">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Get more storage</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Macro photos">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Macro photos</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᎸᎢ ᏗᎧᏃᏗᎢ ᏧᏂᏍᏗ ᏂᏕᎬᎿᏅᎢ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Make your mark">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Make your mark</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎰᏒᎾ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Take your gaming to the next level with big screen performance on your TV or display. Connect a Bluetooth game controller for an enhanced experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Take your gaming to the next level with big screen performance on your TV or display. Connect a Bluetooth game controller for an enhanced experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏫᏓ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏕᎭᏁᎸᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏥᎶᏍᎩ ᎬᏗ ᎤᏔᎾ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎯ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ. ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎠᏓᎾᏙᏓ ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᏱᎴᎦ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏓᏤᏢᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Go to Photos">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Go to Photos</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎢ ᏓᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Three finger screenshot makes it easier to capture what you see on your screen. Just touch the screen with three of your fingertips anytime.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Three finger screenshot makes it easier to capture what you see on your screen. Just touch the screen with three of your fingertips anytime.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏦᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᎬᏂᏏᎠ ᎠᎯᏗᎨᎢ ᎦᏂᏴᏗᎢ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎯᎪᏩᏘᏍᎬ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩᎢ. ᎠᏒᏅᏍᏗᏊ Ꮎ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎬᏗ ᏦᎢ ᏂᏗᏣᏤᎵ ᏕᏂᏰᏌᏛᎢ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏔᏅᏊ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Optimized charging prevents overcharging and keeps your battery healthier over time.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Optimized charging prevents overcharging and keeps your battery healthier over time.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎣᏍᏓ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᏗᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᎸᎳᏗᏢ ᎬᏃᏗᎭ ᏃᎴ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏙᎯᏳᎢ ᏂᎬᏁᎰᎢ ᎢᏴᏛ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Find My Device helps you locate your phone remotely. It also helps you protect your information if your phone is lost.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Find My Device helps you locate your phone remotely. It also helps you protect your information if your phone is lost.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>"ᎯᏩᏔ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏆᏤᎵ" ᎠᏍᏕᎵᏍᎪᎢ ᎠᏩᏛᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎦᎸᏙᎳᎨᏍᏗ. ᎾᏍᏋ ᎠᏍᏕᎵᏍᎪᎢ ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎦᏃᎮᏢᎥᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗᎢ ᏱᏣᏲᏎᎳ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Never miss a moment you want to capture. Just hold your Razr and quickly twist your wrist twice to open the camera.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Never miss a moment you want to capture. Just hold your Razr and quickly twist your wrist twice to open the camera.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎥᏝ ᎢᎸᎯᏳᎢ ᎦᏅᏗᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏔᏅᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏣᏚᎵᏍᎬ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ. ᏍᎩᏋ ᏣᏂᏴᏎᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ Razr ᏃᎴ ᏄᏟᏍᏛ ᎠᏓᏄᏖᏲᎸ ᏂᏨᏅᎩ ᎧᏯᏌᏝ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏳᏩᎦᏔ ᎾᎢ ᎯᏍᏚᎢᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Portrait lighting lets you take even more captivating photos. While you're in Portrait mode, try out different light settings to capture the right mood.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Portrait lighting lets you take even more captivating photos. While you're in Portrait mode, try out different light settings to capture the right mood.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎠᏨᏍᏛᎢ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏂᎯ ᎯᏫᏓ ᎥᏍᏊ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎣᏍᏛ ᎠᏓᏅᏓᏗᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ. ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎬᏙᏗᎭ, ᎭᏁᎵᏓ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᏧᏓᎴᎿᎢ ᎠᏨᏍᏛ ᏕᎦᎸᎲᎢ ᎾᎢ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎤᏓᏅᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Mobile desktop turns your phone into a convenient workstation. When you connect to a display, mouse, and keyboard, you’re ready for easy remote work, e-learning, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Mobile desktop turns your phone into a convenient workstation. When you connect to a display, mouse, and keyboard, you’re ready for easy remote work, e-learning, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏱᏂᎬᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎯᏗᎨᏍᏗ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎠᏴᏍᏘᏱ. ᏂᎯ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎱᏓᎸᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗᎢ, ᏥᏍᏕᏥ, ᏃᎴ ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏙᏗ, ᏂᎯᏃ ᏣᎴᏅᏓ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᎯᏓ ᎢᎾ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ, Ꭲ-ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᎬ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Know your way around?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Know your way around?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏅᏔᏍ ᏫᎦᎶᎯᏍᏗ ᎬᏩᏕᏱᏓ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Finding your favorites">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Finding your favorites</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏩᏛᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏫᏣᎸᏉᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Do more with your voice">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Do more with your voice</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎾᏛᎦ ᎬᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Use Recorder to capture crisp &amp; clear audio notes anytime.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Use Recorder to capture crisp &amp; clear audio notes anytime.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏂᏴᏙᏗ ᎲᏓ ᎥᎾᎢ ᎦᏂᏴᏗ ᏧᏃᏚᎯ ᏚᏃᏴᎬᎢ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏴᏊ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn how to take the best photos &amp; videos">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn how to take the best photos &amp; videos</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎭᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏙᏗ &amp; ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It's easy to find the people you contact most. Just open the Phone app, tap on Favorites, and see the people you talk to frequently. You can also manually add contacts to this list.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>It's easy to find the people you contact most. Just open the Phone app, tap on Favorites, and see the people you talk to frequently. You can also manually add contacts to this list.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᎾᏃ ᎠᎯᏓ ᎠᏩᏛᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᏕᎭᎵᏃᎮᏙᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᎪᏗᏗ. ᏍᎩᏋ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏙᏗ, ᎭᏐᎥᏍᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏗᏑᏰᏛ, ᎠᎴ ᎯᎪᏩᏔ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏂᏴᏫ ᏂᎯ ᏕᎭᎵᏃᎮᏗᏍᎬ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎣᏩᏌ ᎠᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎯᎠ ᏕᎦᏅᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Accessibility settings help everyone enjoy an engaging Android experience. Change the font &amp; display size, adjust color or motion, or hear audio that lets you use your device without looking at the screen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Accessibility settings help everyone enjoy an engaging Android experience. Change the font &amp; display size, adjust color or motion, or hear audio that lets you use your device without looking at the screen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᏓᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏁᏤᎮᏍᏗ Android ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ. ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏙᏪᎵᏍᎩ &amp; ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎢᎩᏓ, ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎠᏑᏫᏓ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎲᎢ, ᎠᎴᏃ ᎠᏛᎪᏗ ᎤᏃᏴᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎬᏙᏓ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏅᏐᏯᏍᏗᏍᎬᎾ ᎠᎦᏖᏃᎲᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Point &amp; scan">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Point &amp; scan</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏓᏓᎵ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏗᏥᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Tired of your photos turning out too dark? With Night Vision, you can capture detailed photos in any low light condition.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tired of your photos turning out too dark? With Night Vision, you can capture detailed photos in any low light condition.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏕᏣᏯᏫᎦ ᏗᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎤᎶᏒᏔᏅ ᎫᎳᏏᎩ ᏂᏕᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ. ᎬᏗ ᏒᏃᏱ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗᎢ, ᏰᎵᏊ ᏂᎯ ᏱᏂᏯ ᎤᏎᎸᎩ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬᎫ ᎡᎳᏗ ᎠᏨᏍᏛ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When parents put the latest technologies in the children\’s hands, they want to make sure they\’re developing healthy digital habits. Family Link lets you connect your child\’s device to yours. Use the control panel to set daily screen time limits, view app activity, manage content restrictions, and more.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When parents put the latest technologies in the children\’s hands, they want to make sure they\’re developing healthy digital habits. Family Link lets you connect your child\’s device to yours. Use the control panel to set daily screen time limits, view app activity, manage content restrictions, and more.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎯᏳ ᏧᎾᏓᎦᏴᎵᎨᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏱᏚᏂᏠᎾ ᎩᎳ ᏣᎾᏄᎪᏨᎯ ᎢᏤ ᏗᎦᏙᎲᏒᎩ ᏗᏂᏲᏟ\’s ᏧᏃᏰᏂ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᏚᎵᏍᎬ ᏙᏳᎢ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏂᎯᏊ ᎠᏙᎷᏩᏘᏍᎬ ᏙᎯᏊ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᎳᏅᏔᏅ ᎢᏳᎾᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗᎢ. ᏏᏓᏁᎸᎯ ᏚᏂᏢᏔᏅᏒᎢ ᏗᏣᎵᏍᎪᏛᏓᏁᎯ ᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ ᏱᏕᎭᏠᎯᏍᏓ ᏤᏥ ᎠᏲᏟ\’s ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ. ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎠᏯᏔᎾᎸ ᎾᎢ ᏧᎩᏨᏅᏓ ᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛ ᎠᏟᏰᎵᏒ ᏓᏎᎸᎯ, ᎯᎪᎵᏯ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎵᏖᎸᎲᏍᎬᎢ, ᎠᏓᏅᏖᎵᏙᎯ ᎦᎸᏛᎢ ᏗᏓᏲᏍᏓᏁᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏥ ᎢᎦᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Add a splash of color">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Add a splash of color</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎸᎢ ᎠᏑᏫᏓ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
