            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="I agree to receive push notifications from Motorola about promotions and offers to my device. I understand that my consent is not required and is not a condition of any purchase. Standard data rates may apply. I may unsubscribe to push notifications by selecting &quot;Unsubscribe&quot; in the notifications I receive. ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>I agree to receive push notifications from Motorola about promotions and offers to my device. I understand that my consent is not required and is not a condition of any purchase. Standard data rates may apply. I may unsubscribe to push notifications by selecting "Unsubscribe" in the notifications I receive. </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᎵᏍᎪᎵᏗ ᏗᎩᎩᏍᏗ ᎦᏌᏙᏴ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ Ꮎ Motorola ᏗᏓᏌᎳᏗᏍᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏂᏍᎪᏢᏛ ᎠᏯ ᎠᏩᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᏩᏅᏔ ᎭᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎠᏩᎵᏍᎪᎵᏔᏅ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎭᏗ ᎠᏎ ᎠᎩᏩᎯᏍᏗᏱᎩ ᎢᎬᏩᏍᏗᎭ ᎦᏟᏌᏅ ᏗᎪᏣᎴᏒᏗ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎭᏗ ᎠᏎ ᏗᎩᏁᏍᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎦᏌᏙᏴ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏴᎬᏑᏰᏏ “ᏗᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏅᏒᎢ” Ꮎ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏕᏥᏁᏍᎬᎢ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To continue, let us know which SIM card to use for data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To continue, let us know which SIM card to use for data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎦᏯᎢᏎᏍᏗ, ᎢᏍᎩᏃᏎᎸᎢ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ SIM ᎠᏆᏂᏲᏍᏗ ᏱᎨᎬᏙᏗ ᏄᏰᎸᏛ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="I understand that my consent is not required and is not a condition of purchase. Standard data rates may apply. I can unsubscribe from push notifications by tapping &quot;Unsubscribe&quot; in the notifications I receive.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>I understand that my consent is not required and is not a condition of purchase. Standard data rates may apply. I can unsubscribe from push notifications by tapping "Unsubscribe" in the notifications I receive.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᎵᎦ ᎦᎵᏍᎪᏗᎭ ᎭᏗ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎠᏎ ᎠᎩᏩᎯᏍᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎢᎬᏩᏍᏗᎭ ᎦᏟᏌᏅ ᏗᎪᏣᎴᏒᏗ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏯ ᏗᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏅᏒᎢ ᎦᏒᏙᏯ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᏱᏥᏐᏍᏗ “ᏗᏲᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏅᏒᎢ” Ꮎ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁ ᏕᏥᏁᏍᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Add your email so we can communicate with you via email and in device about services and benefits like the following. Don’t worry — we’ll keep your info safe. ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Add your email so we can communicate with you via email and in device about services and benefits like the following. Don’t worry — we’ll keep your info safe. </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᏕᏓᏛᎪᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎥᏍᎩ ᏗᏜ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᏃᎴ ᎾᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏄᏰᎸᏛ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᎵᏓᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎭᎵᏍᏕᎸᏙᏗ ᎤᏠᏱ Ꮎ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏓ. ᏤᏍᏗ ᏱᏣᏓᏅᏕᏗᏍᎨᏍᏗ — ᏲᎩᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗ ᎦᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᏂᎦᎾᏰᎬᎾ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We collect and report usage information to keep your software up-to-date, provide personalized support and help us improve our products and services.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We collect and report usage information to keep your software up-to-date, provide personalized support and help us improve our products and services.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏙᎩᏟᏎᏏᎪᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏥᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏂᏣᏤᎵ ᏩᏂᎨ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏔᏅᎢ- ᎾᎢ-ᎢᎦ, ᎠᏓᏁᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏤᎵ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎦᎫᏍᏛᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎢᎩᏍᏕᎵᏍᎬ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᏗᎦᏤᎵ ᏗᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏗᏓᏛᏁᏗᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="For your safety: Even if this feature is off, critical updates may download &amp; install automatically after a certain number of days if you haven't manually installed them.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>For your safety: Even if this feature is off, critical updates may download &amp; install automatically after a certain number of days if you haven't manually installed them.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏨᎦᏎᏍᏕᏍᏗ: ᏍᏊ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᏱᎩ, ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏓ ᎦᏟᏌᏅ ᎭᎵᏭ ᎡᎳᏗᏝᎦᎸᏍᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏩᏌ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᏱᏕᎦᏛᏅᏛᎦ ᏅᏛᏁᎲᎾ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏨᏌ ᏂᏘᎦᏛᏅᏛᏌᎾ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Data collected will be transferred to Motorola servers in the USA.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Data collected will be transferred to Motorola servers in the USA.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᏂᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏭᏚᏓᏲᎯᏎᎸ Motorola ᏗᏯᏙᎯᎯ ᎥᎾᎢ USA</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Based on current settings, device usage information will be shared to help improve our products.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Based on current settings, device usage information will be shared to help improve our products.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎳᏏᏔᏅᎩ ᎥᎾᎢ ᏃᏊᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎬᏙᏗᎢ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᏯᏙᏢ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎸᏗ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏎᏗ ᏗᎦᏤᎵ ᏗᎪᏢᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Wait, there’s more!">
