            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Waiting for Wi-Fi or Zero Rated network to resume background download and installation…">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Waiting for Wi-Fi or Zero Rated network to resume background download and installation…</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎦᏘᏯ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Wi-Fi ᏃᎴ ᎧᏂᎩᏗ ᎠᏟᎶᏓ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎴᏂᏐᏗᏍᎩ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎦᏢᏍᎬᎢ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏘᏅᏛᏍᏗ...</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Use mobile data">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Use mobile data</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="There's not enough space on the SD Card to complete the download. Please free up  space and go to Settings &gt; System updates to try the download again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>There's not enough space on the SD Card to complete the download. Please free up  space and go to Settings &gt; System updates to try the download again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎭᎢ ᎥᏝ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ SD ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎧᎵᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎦᏢᏍᎬᎢ ᎰᏩᏊ ᏚᏓᎴᎩ ᎢᎦᏓ ᎤᏜᏅᏛ ᏃᎴ Ꭷ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ &gt; ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏗᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎦᏢᏍᎬᎢ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
