            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Enable mobile data for apps and services such as email, web browsing, AT&amp;T Video Call, and push notifications over the cellular network.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Enable mobile data for apps and services such as email, web browsing, AT&amp;T Video Call, and push notifications over the cellular network.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏗᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ, ᎤᏂᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎦᏖᎾᏍᏗ, AT&amp;TᎢᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏴᎾ, ᏃᎴ ᎦᏌᏙᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎦᏬᎯᎸᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Enable mobile data for apps and services such as email, web browsing, AT&amp;T Video Call, and push notifications over the cellular network when roaming outside the U.S., Puerto Rico and USVI. International roaming data charges may apply.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Enable mobile data for apps and services such as email, web browsing, AT&amp;T Video Call, and push notifications over the cellular network when roaming outside the U.S., Puerto Rico and USVI. International roaming data charges may apply.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏗᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ, ᎤᏂᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎦᏖᎾᏍᏗ , AT&amp;T ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎪᏎᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᎦᏌᏙᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎦᏬᎯᎸᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎡᏙᎵᏙᎲ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎾᏍᎩ U.S., ᏇᎡᏙ ᎵᎢᎪ ᏃᎴ USVI. ᎠᏰᎵ ᏚᏓᏂᏴᏛ ᎡᏙᎵᏙᎲ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏛ ᏰᎵᏉ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
