            <termEntry id="Enable mobile data for apps and services such as email, web browsing, AT&amp;T Video Call, and push notifications over the cellular network when roaming outside the U.S., Puerto Rico and USVI. International roaming data charges may apply.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Enable mobile data for apps and services such as email, web browsing, AT&amp;T Video Call, and push notifications over the cellular network when roaming outside the U.S., Puerto Rico and USVI. International roaming data charges may apply.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎢᏗᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᏯ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ, ᎤᏂᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎦᏖᎾᏍᏗ, AT&amp;T ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎪᏎᏗ, ᏃᎴ ᎦᏌᏙᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎦᏬᎯᎸᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎡᏙᎵᏙᎲ ᏙᏯᏗᏨ ᎾᏍᎩ U.S., ᏇᎡᏙ ᎵᎢᎪ ᏃᎴ USVI. ᎠᏰᎵ ᏚᏙᏢᏒ ᎮᏙᎮᏍᏗ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎡᏙᎵᏙᎲ ᎡᏍᏚᎨᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Data usage is measured by your phone. Your carrier may account for usage differently. Set the dates to match the period on your bill.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Data usage is measured by your phone. Your carrier may account for usage differently. Set the dates to match the period on your bill.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏨᎶᏛ ᎬᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎯᏙᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏅᏓᎴᎢ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᏧᏒᎯᏓ ᏫᏓᏎᎸᎢ ᏗᏙᎵᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏥᏱᎵᏒ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎡᏍᏚᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Unless you use Wi-Fi, you won't be able to use the Internet, Email or other apps that require a data connection.Turn off the mobile data connection?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Unless you use Wi-Fi, you won't be able to use the Internet, Email or other apps that require a data connection.Turn off the mobile data connection?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏍᎩᏂ ᏂᎯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Wi-Fi, ᏂᎯ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ, ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏃᎴ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏎᏯᏛᏁᏗ a ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ.ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Data usage is measured by your phone. Your carrier may account for usage differently. Set the dates to match the period on your bill.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Data usage is measured by your phone. Your carrier may account for usage differently. Set the dates to match the period on your bill.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏨᎶᏛ ᎬᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎯᏙᎯ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏅᏓᎴᎢ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᎯᎧᎲᎦ ᏧᏒᎯᏓ ᏫᏓᏎᎸᎢ ᏗᏙᎵᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᎢ ᎠᏥᏱᎵᏒ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎡᏍᏚᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Touch the sensor below the screen">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Touch the sensor below the screen</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏒᏂᏍᏗ ᎠᏩᏘᏍᎩ ᎡᎳᏗᏨ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Locate the fingerprint sensor on the bottom front of your phone. You\’ll need to touch the sensor several times to record your fingerprint.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Locate the fingerprint sensor on the bottom front of your phone. You\’ll need to touch the sensor several times to record your fingerprint.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏩᏛᏗ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᏩᏘᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎡᎳᏗᏨ ᎠᎬᏱᏗᏨ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ. ᏂᎯᏊᏃ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏒᏂᏍᏗ ᎠᏩᏘᏍᎩ ᎢᎸᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏩᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏕᎦᏅᏅᏛᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏅᏙᏪᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Device Data Collection">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Device Data Collection</term></tig></langSet>
