            <termEntry id="This is the first time this number called you. If this call was spam, you can block this number and report it.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>This is the first time this number called you. If this call was spam, you can block this number and report it.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᎠ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎬᏱ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᏯᎾᎲ ᏂᎯ. ᎨᎡᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎤᏲᎢ ᎪᏪᎵ, ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᏃᎴ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
