            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We all love to hear that familiar voice at the end of the line, but talking face-to-face is so much better! Here’s what you should know to get your real-time connections going:">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We all love to hear that familiar voice at the end of the line, but talking face-to-face is so much better! Here’s what you should know to get your real-time connections going:</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏧᎳ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎠᏓᎨᏳᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏛᎩ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᎩᏌᏛ ᎤᏁᎬ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎵᏍᏆᏓ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏅᏅ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎦᏬᏂᏍᎬ ᏓᎾᏓᎧᏅ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᏣᏘ ᏓᏤᎳ! ᎠᎭᏂ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎦᏙ ᏂᎯ ᎾᎢᏳᏃ ᎢᏣᏅᏖᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏓᏰᏏ:</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
