                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Tap to report as not spam or block it</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎤᏲᎢ ᎪᏪᎵ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏐᎭᎾᎳ ᎨᎡᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Show warning every time">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Show warning every time</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᏕᏯᏔᎲᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᏂᎢᏛᏉ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Video calls made over the mobile network use both data and voice minutes. Charges may apply.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Video calls made over the mobile network use both data and voice minutes. Charges may apply.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ ᎦᏬᎯᎸᏙᏗ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎢᏧᎳᏃ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏃᎴ ᎤᏁᎬ ᎢᏗᏔᏬᏍᏔᏅᎯ. ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎲᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Video calls use your high speed data">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Video calls use your high speed data</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎦᏣᏄᎳ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Select new photo">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Select new photo</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎢᏤ ᏗᏓᏥᎶᏍᏔᏅᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Real Time Text calling ^1">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Real Time Text calling ^1</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒᎢ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏫᏗᎬᏗᏍᎩ ^1</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="\t• To use AT&amp;T Video Call, all parties must have Video Call-capable devices, located in HD Voice coverage, with a rate plan eligible to use Video Call. \t• Each Video Call uses both voice and data. The voice portion of the call counts as voice minutes, and the video portion counts as data under your wireless rate plan. \t• Once you have started a Video Call, it will seamlessly switch to Wi-Fi if your device has access to the Internet through its Wi-Fi connection. To continue a video call on Wi-Fi you must also remain connected to the AT&amp;T wireless network. No voice or data charges apply to Video Call over Wi-Fi. \t• The Video Call icon tells you when you are able to make a video call. Other AT&amp;T subscribers can see if you are capable of receiving video calls. This capability indication may not function with subscribers on other carriers. \t• You can disable AT&amp;T Video Call in Call Settings on your device. \t• For more information and restrictions, visit www.att.com/videocall.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>\t• To use AT&amp;T Video Call, all parties must have Video Call-capable devices, located in HD Voice coverage, with a rate plan eligible to use Video Call. \t• Each Video Call uses both voice and data. The voice portion of the call counts as voice minutes, and the video portion counts as data under your wireless rate plan. \t• Once you have started a Video Call, it will seamlessly switch to Wi-Fi if your device has access to the Internet through its Wi-Fi connection. To continue a video call on Wi-Fi you must also remain connected to the AT&amp;T wireless network. No voice or data charges apply to Video Call over Wi-Fi. \t• The Video Call icon tells you when you are able to make a video call. Other AT&amp;T subscribers can see if you are capable of receiving video calls. This capability indication may not function with subscribers on other carriers. \t• You can disable AT&amp;T Video Call in Call Settings on your device. \t• For more information and restrictions, visit www.att.com/videocall.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>\t• ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ AT&amp;T ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ, ᏂᎦᏓ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎨᏍᎬ ᎠᏎ ᎤᎭ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ-ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎢᎬᎾᏕᏅ ᎾᎿ HD ᎤᏁᎬ ᎫᏝᎢ, ᎬᏗ Ꭰ ᎠᎦᏈᏴᎡᎲᎢ ᏗᎫᎪᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏣᎦᏓᏂᎸᏨᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ. \t• ᎢᏧᎳ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎢᏧᎳᏃ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ. ᏥᎩ ᎤᏁᎬ ᎢᎦᏛ ᎤᎿ ᏥᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎤᏁᎬ ᎢᏗᏔᏬᏍᏔᏅᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᏛ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᏓᏄᏴᏛᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛ ᎠᎦᏈᏴᎡᎲᎢ ᏗᎫᎪᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ. \t• ᏌᏊᏊ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏔᏅᎩ Ꭰ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ, ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎦᏰᏫᏒ ᎬᎾᎨᏒ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᎥᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Wi-Fi ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᎭ ᎠᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎠᎦᏛᎴᏍᎩ ᎨᎡᎢ Wi-Fi ᎫᏓᎸᎢ. ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ Ꭰ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎤᎿᎢ Wi-Fi ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎤᎷᎴᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ AT&amp;T ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ. ᎭᏗ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬ ᎲᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎦᏬᎯᎸᏙᏗ Wi-Fi. \t• ᏥᎩ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎤᏂᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏒᏗ Ꭰ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ. ᏐᎢ AT&amp;T ᏔᏓᏅᎵ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎨᎡᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᎤᎿ ᎠᎩᏍᎬᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂ. ᎯᎠ ᎢᎬᏩᏛᏁᏗ ᏗᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᏰᎴᏯ ᎥᏝ ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗᏱ ᎬᏗ ᏗᏓᏅᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᎿ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏂᎯᏙᎯ. \t• ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎦᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ AT&amp;T ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎾᎿ ᏪᏯᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. \t• ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᎪᏗᏊ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᏃᎴ ᏚᏅᏍᏓᏕᎲ, ᎠᏩᏛᎯᏓᏍᏗ www.att.com/videocall.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
