            <termEntry id="Enriched calling lets you add a subject, photo, and location to your calls. You can also let your recipient know when a call is important.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Enriched calling lets you add a subject, photo, and location to your calls. You can also let your recipient know when a call is important.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏤᎳᏔᏅ ᏫᏗᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏩᏂᎩ ᏂᎯ ᏗᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ Ꭰ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ, ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ, ᏃᎴ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏓᏯᏂ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎾᏍᏊ ᏩᏂᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎦᏁᏍᎩ ᎤᏔ ᎢᏳᏃ Ꭰ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
