            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The call can't switch to Video when Mobile Data is turned off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The call can't switch to Video when Mobile Data is turned off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎥᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏭᎪᎸᏍᏔᏁᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The call can't switch to Video when Data Usage reaches its limit.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The call can't switch to Video when Data Usage reaches its limit.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎥᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏙᏯᏅᎯᏗᎠ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏎᎸᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Can't Switch to Wi-Fi">
