            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We tried, but we can't switch your video call to Wi-Fi at this time. Your video call is still running on the mobile network. Data usage applies if you choose to continue.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We tried, but we can't switch your video call to Wi-Fi at this time. Your video call is still running on the mobile network. Data usage applies if you choose to continue.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏧᎳ ᎠᏁᎶᏔᏅ, ᏥᎪᏃ ᎢᏧᎳ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎥᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ Wi-Fi ᎾᏊᎨᏒ. ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎠᏏᏉ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ. ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏂᎬᎾᏗᏍᎪ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏣᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎯᎸᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You turned off Mobile Data. Do you want to continue with current Video call or End it? ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You turned off Mobile Data. Do you want to continue with current Video call or End it? </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏭᎪᎸᏍᏔᏁᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ. ᏣᏚᎵᎭᏍ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᎦᏯᎢᏒ ᎬᏗ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᏃᎴ ᎠᎵᏍᏆᏓ it? </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The call can't switch to Video when Video calling is turned off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The call can't switch to Video when Video calling is turned off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎨᏍᏗ ᏰᎵ ᎥᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏭᎪᎸᏍᏔᏁᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The call can't switch to Video when TTY is set to on.">
