            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="We’ve partnered with Branch to provide a better device and app navigation experience by using industry-leading privacy technology and data security standards. By continuing, you give Branch permission to access and analyze your data to power this enhanced experience.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>We’ve partnered with Branch to provide a better device and app navigation experience by using industry-leading privacy technology and data security standards. By continuing, you give Branch permission to access and analyze your data to power this enhanced experience.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏴ ᎤᎭ ᎤᎾᎵᎪᏒ ᎬᏗ Branch ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ Ꭰ ᏓᏤᎳ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏃᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏱᎴᎩ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏂᏙᎸᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎬᏗᎭ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ-ᎠᏘᏁᎦ ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᎢᏤ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎩ ᏃᎴ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏧᎾᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᏂᏗᎬᏩᏍᏗᎭ. ᎬᏗ ᏫᎬᎵᏱᎴᎬ, ᏂᎯ ᏧᏁᏗᏱ Branch ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏩᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᏃᎴ ᏗᎫᎪᏙᏗ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᎯᎠ ᏗᏤᏞᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your IT admin has the ability to monitor and manage settings, corporate access, apps, permissions, and data associated with this profile, including your network activity, as well as your device's location, call history, and contact search history.Contact your IT admin for more information, including your organization's privacy policies.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your IT admin has the ability to monitor and manage settings, corporate access, apps, permissions, and data associated with this profile, including your network activity, as well as your device's location, call history, and contact search history.Contact your IT admin for more information, including your organization's privacy policies.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎾᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ ᎠᏅᎦᏎᏍᏗᎰ ᏃᎴ ᏓᏄᎪᏔᏂᏙᎰᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎤᎾᏙᏢᏒ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ, ᏗᎪᏙᏗ, ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏁᎯ, ᏃᎴ ᎦᏟᏌᏅ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎾᏍᏊ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎾᏛᏁᎲ, ᎠᎴᏍᏊ ᏥᏂᎦᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎢᎦᏅᏕᎾ, ᏫᏗᏨᏠᏃᎮᏢ, ᏃᎴ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏕᎯᎲᎸ.ᏫᏛᏢᏃᎮᏗ ᎤᎾᎦᏎᏍᏗᏕᎩ ᎧᏃᎸᎥᏍᎩ, Ꮎ ᏍᏇ ᎤᎾᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎠᏗᏍᎦᎸᏗ ᏧᎾᎳᏏᏙᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Contact your IT admin for more information, including your organization's privacy policies.">
