            <termEntry id="The password you entered is correct, but unfortunately your data is corrupt. To resume using your phone, you need to perform a factory reset. When you set up your phone after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The password you entered is correct, but unfortunately your data is corrupt. To resume using your phone, you need to perform a factory reset. When you set up your phone after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᎢ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎡᏍᎦ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏓᏁᎸ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎤᏲ.  ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎴᏂᏐᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏂᎬᏁᏗ Ꭰ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ᏥᎩ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ, ᏂᎯ\u2019ll ᎠᏎ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎤᎾᏜᏅᏓᏕᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Virtual SIM 1 ON">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Virtual SIM 1 ON</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏅᏙ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ SIM 1 ᎤᎾᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
