            <termEntry id="For storing anything on this device only, including apps and photos. Requires formatting that prevents it from working with other devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>For storing anything on this device only, including apps and photos. Requires formatting that prevents it from working with other devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎬ ᏂᎦᎥᏉ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏩᏌ, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ. ᎠᏎᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎪᏢᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᎢ ᏗᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗᎢ ᎬᏗ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The password you entered is correct, but unfortunately your data is corrupt. To resume using your tablet, you need to perform a factory reset. When you set up your tablet after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The password you entered is correct, but unfortunately your data is corrupt. To resume using your tablet, you need to perform a factory reset. When you set up your tablet after the reset, you\u2019ll have an opportunity to restore any data that was backed up to your Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᎩ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᎢ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎡᏍᎦ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏓᏁᎸ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎤᏲ.  ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎴᏂᏐᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ, ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎵᏂᎬᏁᏗ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᏗ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᎬᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ᏥᎩ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᎲᏍᏗ, ᏂᎯ\u2019ll ᎠᏎ ᎠᎴᏃ ᎤᎾᏜᏅᏓᏕᎲᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᎨᏎᎢ ᎠᏨᏍᏗ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Google Account.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Use hotspot and tethering to provide internet to other devices through your Wi\u2011Fi or mobile data connection. Apps can also create a hotspot to share content with nearby devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Use hotspot and tethering to provide internet to other devices through your Wi\u2011Fi or mobile data connection. Apps can also create a hotspot to share content with nearby devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᏗᎴᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ ᏃᎴ ᏗᎵᎪᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᎳᏁᏗ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏐᎢ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎦᏛᎴᏍᎩ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Wi\u2011Fi ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎦᏘᏍᎩᏌᏅᎯ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ. ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏰᎴᏯ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎪᏒᏗ ᎤᏗᎴᎩ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎡᏍᎦᏂ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Add another language for a better Moto experience">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Add another language for a better Moto experience</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏗ ᏓᏤᏢ Moto ᎤᎦᏙᎲᏒ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Background less than a minute for ^1">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Background less than a minute for ^1</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎣᏂ ᏗᏜ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᏩᎦᏲᏢ ᎢᏯᏛᏬᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ^1</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Model">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Model</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎪᏒᏅ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Not connected">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Not connected</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᏍᏗ ᏱᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="CA certificates are used by websites, apps, and VPNs for encryption. Only install CA certificates from organizations you trust. If you install a CA certificate, the certificate owner could access your data, such as passwords or credit card details, from websites you visit or apps you use – even if your data is encrypted.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>CA certificates are used by websites, apps, and VPNs for encryption. Only install CA certificates from organizations you trust. If you install a CA certificate, the certificate owner could access your data, such as passwords or credit card details, from websites you visit or apps you use – even if your data is encrypted.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>CA ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎤᏂᎳᏛᎢ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ VPNs ᎬᏔᏅᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ, ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏙᏗ. ᎤᏅᏒ ᎦᏘᏅᏔᏅ CᎠ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏧᎾᏙᏢᎯ you ᎨᎪᎯᏳᎯ. Ꭲf ᏲᎤ ᎢnᏍᏔll Ꭰ CᎠ cᎡrᏘfᎢcᎠᏖ, tᎮ cᎡrᏘfᎢcᎠᏖ ᎣwᏁr cᎣᎤld ᎠccᎡᏍᏍ ᏲᎤr ᏓᏔ, Ꮡch ᎠᏍ pᎠᏍᏍᏬrdᏍ Ꭳr crᎡᏗt cᎠrd ᏕᏔᎢlᏍ, frᎣm ᏪbᏏᏖᏍ ᏲᎤ ᎥᎢᏏt Ꭳr ᎠppᏍ ᏲᎤ ᎤᏎ – ᎡᎥᎡn Ꭲf ᏲᎤr ᏓᏔ ᎢᏍ ᎡncrypᏖd.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id=" after timeout, except when kept unlocked by ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term> after timeout, except when kept unlocked by </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term> ᎣᏂᏗᏨ ᏙᏖᏙᎵ, ᎢᏳᏍᎩᏂᏃᏅ ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎠᏂᏐᎭᎾᎳᎩ ᎬᏗ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
