                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>PUK2 ᏂᏚᏳᎪᏛᎾ ᏏᏊ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="PIN2s don't match. Try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>PIN2s don't match. Try again.</term></tig></langSet>
