            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Phone too hotCan't complete this call. Try again when your phone cools down.You can still make emergency calls.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Phone too hotCan't complete this call. Try again when your phone cools down.You can still make emergency calls.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎶᏒᏍᏔᎾ ᎤᏗᏞᎩ ᏗᏓᏃᎮᏗᏝ ᎧᎵᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏯᏅᏛ ᏏᏊ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ wᎮn ᏲᎤr pᎰᏁ cᎣᎣlᏍ Ꮩwn.ᏲᎤ cᎠn ᏍᏘll ᎹkᎡ ᎡᎺrᎨncy cᎠllᏍ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Calling via ">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Calling via </term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎾᎿ ᎢᏗᏨ </term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The PINs you typed don't match. Try again.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The PINs you typed don't match. Try again.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏍᎩ PINs ᏂᎯ ᏗᏐᏅᏍᏔᏅᎩ ᏤᏍᏗ ᎤᎵᎪᎯ ᏱᎩ. ᏏᏊ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎸᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby Atmos provides a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeakers and connected devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Atmos provides a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeakers and connected devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Atmos ᏙᏓᎨᏥᏁᎵ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏗᏛᏓᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby Atmos delivers a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeaker and connected devices. This feature is always on when you're listening through the loudspeaker, and you can adjust the settings for headphones and connected speakers.To disable this feature when you’re listening through the loudspeaker, tap the screen 3 times.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Atmos delivers a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeaker and connected devices. This feature is always on when you're listening through the loudspeaker, and you can adjust the settings for headphones and connected speakers.To disable this feature when you’re listening through the loudspeaker, tap the screen 3 times.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Atmos ᏙᏓᎨᏥᏁᎵ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏗᏛᏓᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎯᎠ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ  ᎾᎢ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ, ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ 3 ᏓᏟᎢᎵᏒ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Smart audio">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Smart audio</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="There are no saved settings for this device, so smart audio effects are enabled. You can customize the audio for this device in Dolby Audio settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>There are no saved settings for this device, so smart audio effects are enabled. You can customize the audio for this device in Dolby Audio settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ Ꮭ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏗᎵᏏᏅᏔᏅ ᏱᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎾᏃ ᎠᏌᎹᏗ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ ᎨᏒᎢ ᎡᎵᏊ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ. ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏯᏤᎲᏍᏙᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ Dolby Audio ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Learn more">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Learn more</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby - active on  profile.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby - active on  profile.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby - ᎠᎵᏖᎸᎲᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ  ᎤᎧᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby Audio is always on when you’re listening through the loudspeaker.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Audio is always on when you’re listening through the loudspeaker.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Audio ᏄᏍᏛ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Welcome to Dolby Audio">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Welcome to Dolby Audio</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏕᏨᏓᏂᎸᎩ ᎾᎾᎢ Dolby Audio</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby Audio delivers a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeaker and connected devices. This feature is always on when you're listening through the loudspeaker, and you can adjust the settings for headphones and connected speakers.To disable this feature when you’re listening through the loudspeaker, tap the screen 3 times.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Audio delivers a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeaker and connected devices. This feature is always on when you're listening through the loudspeaker, and you can adjust the settings for headphones and connected speakers.To disable this feature when you’re listening through the loudspeaker, tap the screen 3 times.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Audio ᏙᏓᎨᏥᏁᎵ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏗᏛᏓᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎯᎠ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏗᏟᏳᏙᎾᏗᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᏍᏙᏗ.  ᎾᎢ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ, ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ 3 ᎢᏳᏩᎫᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby Audio doesn’t work with devices connected by an auxiliary cable.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Audio doesn’t work with devices connected by an auxiliary cable.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Audio ᏤᏍᏗ ᏱᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎢ ᎬᏗ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏄᏩᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏔᎷᎩᏍᎩ ᏍᏕᏱᏛ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby Audio has a refreshed design. When you’re streaming a movie, listening to music, or playing a game, Dolby Audio helps you enjoy rich and engaging sound.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Audio has a refreshed design. When you’re streaming a movie, listening to music, or playing a game, Dolby Audio helps you enjoy rich and engaging sound.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Audio ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏔᏅ ᎪᏢᏒᎢ. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏃᏊᏥᎩ ᎠᏥᎢᎵᏒᎢ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎬᎢ, ᎤᎾᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎾᎢ ᏗᎧᏃᎩᏍᏛ, ᎠᎴᏃ ᏓᏁᎶᎲᏍᎬ ᏗᏁᎶᏙᏗ, Dolby Audio ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᎧᎲᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᏥᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᎮᎵᏍᏗ ᎤᏣᏘ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎵᎶᎯ ᎠᏛᎪᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can create custom profiles for Bluetooth and USB-C audio devices. Each time you connect a device, Dolby Audio will remember the last settings you used.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can create custom profiles for Bluetooth and USB-C audio devices. Each time you connect a device, Dolby Audio will remember the last settings you used.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏲᏢᎾ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎢᏳᎾᏛᏁᏗ ᏚᎧᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎠᏓᎾᏙᏓ ᎠᎴ USB-C ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᏂᏓᏟᏱᎵᏒᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎱᏓᎸᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, Dolby Audio ᎠᏎ ᏛᏓᏗᏍᏔᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎣᏂ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏨᏔᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Turn on Dolby game audio enhancements while you're gaming">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Turn on Dolby game audio enhancements while you're gaming</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏍᏚᎢ Dolby ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎤᏃᏴᎬ ᎠᏔᏃᎯᏍᏔᏅᎩ ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎭᏁᎸᏗᏍᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby Audio is always on when you’re listening through the loudspeakers.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Audio is always on when you’re listening through the loudspeakers.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Audio ᏄᏍᏛ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dolby Audio delivers a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeakers and connected devices. This feature is always on when you're listening through the loudspeakers, and you can adjust the settings for headphones and connected speakers.To disable this feature when you’re listening through the loudspeakers, tap the screen 3 times.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Audio delivers a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeakers and connected devices. This feature is always on when you're listening through the loudspeakers, and you can adjust the settings for headphones and connected speakers.To disable this feature when you’re listening through the loudspeakers, tap the screen 3 times.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Audio ᏙᏓᎨᏥᏁᎵ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏗᏛᏓᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ. ᎯᎠ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏗᏟᏳᏙᎾᏗᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᏍᏙᏗ.  ᎾᎢ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᏣᏛᏓᏍᏛ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ, ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ 3 ᎢᏳᏩᎫᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
