            <termEntry id="Dolby Audio provides a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeakers and connected devices.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dolby Audio provides a premium listening experience through your phone's loudspeakers and connected devices.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dolby Audio ᏙᏓᎨᏥᏁᎵ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏫᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏗᏛᏓᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ ᎤᎶᏒᎯ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
