                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᏗᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏢᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏂᎳᏛᎢ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᏅᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ.ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎾᏍᏊ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᏗᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏢᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏂᎳᏛᎢ. Ꭰ Google ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎯᎠ ᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your phone can't manage battery normally because  is keeping your phone awake.To try to fix this issue, you can stop the app.If this keeps happening, you may need to uninstall the app to improve battery performance.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your phone can't manage battery normally because  is keeping your phone awake.To try to fix this issue, you can stop the app.If this keeps happening, you may need to uninstall the app to improve battery performance.</term></tig></langSet>
