                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᏤᏅᏍᏗ ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛ &amp; ᏚᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ Wi-Fi ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏔᏅᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="With Wi-Fi calling you can send and receive calls and messages over a Wi-Fi network using your existing T-Mobile plan.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>With Wi-Fi calling you can send and receive calls and messages over a Wi-Fi network using your existing T-Mobile plan.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏫᎦᏅᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎢᏴᏛ Wi-Fi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ T-Mobile ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="What is Wi-Fi Calling\?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>What is Wi-Fi Calling\?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏙᎤᏍᏗ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ\?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="THIN GREY LINETo enable Wi-Fi, use the wireless control section of your Android settings menu.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>THIN GREY LINETo enable Wi-Fi, use the wireless control section of your Android settings menu.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏌᎨ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎤᏍᎪᎸ ᏚᏓᏅᏅᎢᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ Wi-Fi, ᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛ ᎤᏓᎯᏢᎢ ᎾᎿ Android ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="How do I enable Wi-Fi Calling\?">
