                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="To allow your devices to share location data, granting the permission on the following screen.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>To allow your devices to share location data, granting the permission on the following screen.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏴᎵᏍᎪᎵᏗ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏅᏗᏓᏅ ᎤᏃᎮᏗ ᎮᏙᎲᎦᏟᏌᏅ, ᎠᎵᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᏐᏍᏗ ᎠᏴᏙᎸᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="(This app requires this level of access to work).">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>(This app requires this level of access to work).</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>(ᎯᎠ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏎᏱᏗᏛᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎤᏩᎾᏕᏍᎩ ᎥᎿᎢ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ).</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Note: Your carrier can access your device's location when you dial or text an emergency number and for a limited time afterward, even if you turn off the location setting and deny location permission for this app.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Note: Your carrier can access your device's location when you dial or text an emergency number and for a limited time afterward, even if you turn off the location setting and deny location permission for this app.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᏅᏓᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᎪᏪᎵ: ᎠᎯᏙᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ ᏗᏐᎥᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎢᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏎᎸᎯ ᎢᎪᎯᏛ ᎣᏂ, ᎥᏍᏊ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏆᏓᏱᎸᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎬᏙᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="2. On the Carrier Location app screen, tap Allow all the time.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>2. On the Carrier Location app screen, tap Allow all the time.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>2. ᎤᎾᎢ ᏥᎩ ᎠᎯᏙᎯ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ, ᎤᏟᏍᏓ ᎠᏒᏂᎸ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
