            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="For more information,please check the contract for the provided services and/or financing.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>For more information,please check the contract for the provided services and/or financing.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎪᏕᏍᏗᏃ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᎥᏍᎩ,ᎰᏩᏊ ᎯᎪᎵᏯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏓᏓᏁᏤᎸ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ ᎤᎾᎵᏍᏕᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ / ᎠᎴ ᎠᏕᎸ ᏓᏅᏗᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="It disables the device in case of defaulted payment for the monthly installments of the device and / or for the financing.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>It disables the device in case of defaulted payment for the monthly installments of the device and / or for the financing.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏂᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎫᏈᏗᏱᏃ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏏᏅᏓ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏔᏂᏒ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎠᎫᏴᎲᏓ ᎠᎴ / ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏕᎸ ᏓᏅᏗᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
