            <termEntry id="In a case the WiFi connection is getting weak or you get out of the WiFi coverage your mobile phone would switch to mobile network.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In a case the WiFi connection is getting weak or you get out of the WiFi coverage your mobile phone would switch to mobile network.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ Ꭰ ᏗᎪᏪᎵ ᏥᎩ WiFi ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᎬᎢ ᎤᏩᎾᎦᎳᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎤᎾᏙᏣᎴᏍᏗ ᏥᎩ WiFi ᎫᏢᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏯᏓᎯᏗᏏ ᎥᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Unfortunately, in such cases we will not know your precise location and therefore your emergency call may be routed to the not to the closest emergency centre, regarding your actual location.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Unfortunately, in such cases we will not know your precise location and therefore your emergency call may be routed to the not to the closest emergency centre, regarding your actual location.</term></tig></langSet>
