            <termEntry id="Once you see the Wi-Fi calling icon in the status bar, your phone is ready for Wi-Fi calling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Once you see the Wi-Fi calling icon in the status bar, your phone is ready for Wi-Fi calling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏌᏊᏊ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏄᏛᎿᏕᎬ ᎦᎾᎸᎢ, ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Eyes">
