            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Change Network mode?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Change Network mode?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎤᏚᏓᎵ ᎬᏙᏗ?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You'll get an audible beep and a screen message letting you know when a call has dropped because you have moved out of range.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You'll get an audible beep and a screen message letting you know when a call has dropped because you have moved out of range.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᎤᏃᏴᎦ ᏂᎯᏊᏃ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎯ ᎠᎾᎵᏍᎪᎸᏘᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᎯᎦᏔᎭᏍ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎪᎰᏲᏅᏔᏅ ᏅᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎯᎤᏓᏅᏒᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏍᏓᏅᏅ Ꮕ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Important NoticeYour SIM card needs to be updated for Wi-Fi Calling service compatibility.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Important NoticeYour SIM card needs to be updated for Wi-Fi Calling service compatibility.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎤᎵᏍᎨᏓ ᎠᏓᏃᎯᏎᎯᏣᏤᎵ SIM ᏆᎾᏲᏍᏗ ᎤᏚᎸᏗ ᏄᎾᏛᏅ to be ᎪᏢᎯᏌᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏗᏙᎸᎩ ᎨᏒ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please visit a T-Mobile store or dial 611 from your phone to reach Customer Care.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Please visit a T-Mobile store or dial 611 from your phone to reach Customer Care.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏩᏛᎯᏓᏍᏗ T-Mobile ᎠᏓᎾᏅ ᎠᎴ ᏗᏐᏂᎭ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ 611 ᎾᎯᏳ ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏙᏯᏅᎯᏗᏍᏗ ᎤᏩᏍᎩ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Insufficient bandwidth, downgrade to voice call">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Insufficient bandwidth, downgrade to voice call</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏲᏟᎢ ᎾᏯᏛᎢᏴ ᎠᏓᏠᏍᏗ, ᎡᎳᏗᏟ ᎠᏲᏓᏅ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎧᏁᎬ ᏫᎬᏗᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="LEARN ALL ABOUT WI-FI CALLINGTHIN GREY LINEOnce you see the Wi-Fi calling icon in the status bar, your phone is ready for Wi-Fi calling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>LEARN ALL ABOUT WI-FI CALLINGTHIN GREY LINEOnce you see the Wi-Fi calling icon in the status bar, your phone is ready for Wi-Fi calling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>LEARN ALL ABOUT WI-FI CALLINGᏧᏌᎨ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎤᏍᎪᎸ ᏚᏓᏅᏅᎢᏌᏊᏊ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏄᏛᎿᏕᎬ ᎦᎾᎸᎢ, ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="LEARN ALL ABOUT WI-FI CALLINGTHIN GREY LINEWi-Fi calling lets you say goodbye to spotty coverage.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>LEARN ALL ABOUT WI-FI CALLINGTHIN GREY LINEWi-Fi calling lets you say goodbye to spotty coverage.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᎥ ᎢᎸᏢ WI-FI ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬᏧᏌᎨ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎤᏍᎪᎸ ᏚᏓᏅᏅᎢWi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏩᏂᎩ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏛᏅ ᏛᏓᏲᎵᎲ ᏛᎦᎴᏂᏍᎬ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ ᏣᏚᏓᎸᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Green WFC iconTo stay on a Wi-Fi call, remain in the range of the Wi-Fi network.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Green WFC iconTo stay on a Wi-Fi call, remain in the range of the Wi-Fi network.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗ WFC ᎠᎢᎧᏂᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎤᎾᎢ Wi-Fi ᏪᏯᎾ, ᎾᎿ ᎠᏍᏓᏅᏅ ᏅᏩᏍᏗᏉ ᎾᎿ Wi-Fi ᎤᏚᏓᎵ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You'll get an audible beep and a screen message letting you know when a call has dropped because you have moved out of range.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You'll get an audible beep and a screen message letting you know when a call has dropped because you have moved out of range.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏓᏯ ᎤᏃᏴᎦ ᏂᎯᏊᏃ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎯ ᎠᎾᎵᏍᎪᎸᏘᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᎯᎦᏔᎭᏍ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎪᎰᏲᏅᏔᏅ ᏅᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᎯᎤᏓᏅᏒᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏍᏓᏅᏅ Ꮕ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="THIN GREY LINEBy default, your phone is enabled for Wi-Fi Calling as soon as you enable the Wi-Fi radio.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>THIN GREY LINEBy default, your phone is enabled for Wi-Fi Calling as soon as you enable the Wi-Fi radio.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏌᎨ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎤᏍᎪᎸ ᏚᏓᏅᏅᎢᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎨᏒ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ, ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏄᎵᏍᏛᏉ ᏂᎯ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ Wi-Fi ᎦᏬᏂᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Wi-Fi Calling can be controlled from the Wi-Fi Calling Settings.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wi-Fi Calling can be controlled from the Wi-Fi Calling Settings.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎬᏱᎸᏍᏗ ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Once the registration has successfully completed you will see the Wi-Fi Calling icon in the Status Bar.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Once the registration has successfully completed you will see the Wi-Fi Calling icon in the Status Bar.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏌᏊᏊ ᏄᏓᏄᎸᏅᎾᏊ ᎠᏍᏆᏙᎾ ᎨᎪᏪᎳᏅᎯ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏄᏛᎿᏕᎬ ᎦᎾᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Dual SIM always on">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Dual SIM always on</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Dual SIM ᏂᎪᎯᎸᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You will also see the Wi-Fi Calling icon displayed in the dialer (in place of your regular calling icon) and you will briefly see a message at the top of the screen saying, &quot;Calls will be made over Wi-Fi.&quot;">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You will also see the Wi-Fi Calling icon displayed in the dialer (in place of your regular calling icon) and you will briefly see a message at the top of the screen saying, "Calls will be made over Wi-Fi."</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎾᏍᏊ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏔᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏗᏐᏂᎭ ᏗᏎᏍᏗ (ᎾᎿ ᎤᏙᏢᏒ ᎾᎿ ᎤᏠᏱᎭᏊ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ) ᎠᎴ ᏂᎯ ᏍᏆᎳᎯᎨᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎠᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎦᏚᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎧᏁᎬᎢ, "ᏓᏯᏂ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏅᎯ ᎢᏴᏛ Wi-Fi."</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="LTE/WCDMA/GSM (Auto)">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>LTE/WCDMA/GSM (Auto)</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>LTE/WCDMA/GSM (ᎤᏩᏒ)</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you change the network mode LTE services will be lost, To continue click Ok">
