            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You have selected a security option that allows any device to connect to your Wi-Fi hotspot and use your mobile data connection.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You have selected a security option that allows any device to connect to your Wi-Fi hotspot and use your mobile data connection.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏑᏰᏒᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᏂᎦᎥ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Wi-Fi hotspot ᎠᎴ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Smooth and save power.">
