            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In regard to your use of WiFi Calling we (ie.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In regard to your use of WiFi Calling we (ie.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᎤᎬᏩᎵ ᎾᎿ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎬᏙᏗ WiFi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᏴ (ie.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Orange Polska SA, acting as your personal data controller) will process your data on the number and model of the device, on which you use WiFi Calling, the software used on the device, the endpoint of the network used to connect with WiFi Calling (including the IP address and the country, to which this IP address is attributed), and the time and duration of each call, in order to perform and settle the service, answer the complaints, and to perform statutory obligation.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Orange Polska SA, acting as your personal data controller) will process your data on the number and model of the device, on which you use WiFi Calling, the software used on the device, the endpoint of the network used to connect with WiFi Calling (including the IP address and the country, to which this IP address is attributed), and the time and duration of each call, in order to perform and settle the service, answer the complaints, and to perform statutory obligation.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Orange Polska SA, ᎠᏤᎸᏍᎦ ᎯᎢᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏏᏴᏫ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᏗᏱᎴᎩ) ᎠᏎᏃ ᎠᏂᎯᎵᏒ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎤᎾᎢ ᎠᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎣᏍᏛ ᎪᏢᏅ ᎾᎿ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎤᎾᎢ ᏙᎤᏍᏗ ᏂᎯ ᎬᏙᏗ WiFi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ, ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᏭᎵᏍᏆᏛ ᎪᏪᎸ ᎾᎿ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎬᏔᏅᎯ ᎾᎿ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎬᏗ WiFi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ (ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏗᏍᎩ IP ᎪᏪᎵ ᏫᏗᎦᏅᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏰᏟ, ᎯᎠ IP ᎪᏪᎵ ᏫᏗᎦᏅᏗ ᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᎦᏅᏛ), ᎠᎴ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒ ᎠᎴ ᎢᏳᏓᏅᎯᏓ ᎾᎿ ᏌᏊᎭ ᏪᏯᎾ, ᎾᎿ ᎠᏓᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎠᎵᏂᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏗᏓᏙᎵᏤᏗ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ, ᎦᏬᎯᎵᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᏗᎵᏍᎦᏃᏍᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᎠᎵᏂᎬᏁᏗ ᏗᎬᏃᏛ ᎠᏓᏚᏓᎸᏁᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
