            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You are currently roaming on another carrier's network.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You are currently roaming on another carrier's network.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᎡᏙᎵᏙᎲ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏄᏓᎴ ᎠᏂᎯᏙᎯ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ.</term></tig></langSet>
