                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿᎢ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ Ꭷ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ— Wi-Fi — ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ Wi-Fi.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In the future if you want to use Wi-Fi for Voice Calling, you can turn on Wi-Fi Calling by going to Advanced Calling Settings menu.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In the future if you want to use Wi-Fi for Voice Calling, you can turn on Wi-Fi Calling by going to Advanced Calling Settings menu.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏩᎫᏗᏗᏒ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Wi-Fi ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏰᏏ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎢᏴᏛ ᎠᏱᎸᏛ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When using the Verizon Wireless 4G LTE network, the voice portion of a video call will appear on your bill as mobile\u2011to\u2011mobile voice usage, and the video portion will be billed as data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When using the Verizon Wireless 4G LTE network, the voice portion of a video call will appear on your bill as mobile\u2011to\u2011mobile voice usage, and the video portion will be billed as data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏥᎩ Verizon Wireless 4G LTE ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ, ᏥᎩ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎢᎦᏛ ᎾᎿ Ꭰ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎬᏂᎨᏒᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏓᏚᎬᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ-ᎾᎿᎢ-ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ, ᎠᎴ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᏛ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏎᎯᎯ ᎢᎦ ᎠᏓᏚᏅᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
