            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your camera hardware isn't working right now. Please contact customer support.Error code: 8X">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your camera hardware isn't working right now. Please contact customer support.Error code: 8X</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᏝᏰᏃ ᏚᏳᎪᏛ ᏱᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎢ ᏃᏊ ᎨᏒᎢ. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᎤᏩᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎫᏍᏛᏁᎭ.ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏙᏗ: 8X</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Disable Subject tracking to switch camera lens manually">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Disable Subject tracking to switch camera lens manually</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏓ ᎧᏃᎮᏗ ᎪᎷᏁᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᎨᏗ ᎣᏩᏌ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Allow 2G service could increase the success of some apps and features working in locations with limited cellular coverage.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Allow 2G service could increase the success of some apps and features working in locations with limited cellular coverage.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ 2G ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎤᏁᏉᏨᎢ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏙᏅᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏚᏂᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎾᎿ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎠᏎᎸᎯ ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬ ᏣᏚᏓᎸᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
