            <termEntry id="RTT assists callers who are deaf, hard of hearing, have a speech disability, or need more than voice alone. &lt;a href=http://support.google.com/mobile?p=telephony_rtt&gt;Learn more  - RTT calls are saved as a message transcript  - RTT is not available for video calls">
