            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Temperature is too low, phone will stop charging">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Temperature is too low, phone will stop charging</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᎦᎾᏮᎢ ᎠᏎᎯᎯ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎡᎳᏗ,ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎠᏎᏒᏗ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Please close all running apps and turn off the screen.If you continue to use it as it is, the power may be turned off automatically after about 3 minutes.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Please close all running apps and turn off the screen.If you continue to use it as it is, the power may be turned off automatically after about 3 minutes.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎰᏩᏊ ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏍᏚᏗ ᎠᏴᏙᎳᏛᎢ.ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎬᎵᏱᎵᏒ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏥᏄᏍᏓᏊ, ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᏅᎢ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎤᎶᏐᏅ ᎢᎸᏢ 3 ᎢᏯᏔᏬᏍᏔᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Device will be overheating while charging with charger or powerbank.The charging current will be limited to protect device.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Device will be overheating while charging with charger or powerbank.The charging current will be limited to protect device.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎢᏴᏛ ᎠᎦᎾᏩᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏏᏉ ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏟᏂᎩᏓ.ᏓᎬᏩᎶᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏩᏎᏢᏊ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏓᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Battery temperature is too high,your device will be shut down.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Battery temperature is too high,your device will be shut down.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᎦᎾᏮᎢ ᎠᏎᎯᎯ ᎾᏍᏉ ᎦᎸᎳᏗ,ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏍᏓᏱᏍᏚᎲᎦ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Higher battery temperature">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Higher battery temperature</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᎸᎳᏗᎨᏍᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏄᎦᎾᏮᎢ ᎠᏎᎯᎯ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Disable torches to prevent flash from overheating.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Disable torches to prevent flash from overheating.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏓ ᎠᏨᏍᏓᏙᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎢᏴᏛ ᎠᎦᎾᏩᏗᏍᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your phone has been connected to the charger for a long time, the battery has entered the protection state.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your phone has been connected to the charger for a long time, the battery has entered the protection state.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᎳᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏓ ᎫᏓᎸᏅᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎪᎯᎩ, ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You can re-plug the charger to recover.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You can re-plug the charger to recover.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᏍᏚᏛᎢ ᎬᏂᏗᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᏩᏛᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="The battery level displayed during this period may be inaccurate and will recover later.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>The battery level displayed during this period may be inaccurate and will recover later.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᎤᏩᎾᏕᏍᎩ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏁᎬᏅᎢ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏓᏓᎴᏛ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎠᏩᏛᏗ ᎪᎯᏴᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
