            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Gametime needs to be turned on before you can customize settings. You can turn it on in .">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Gametime needs to be turned on before you can customize settings. You can turn it on in .</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏁᎸᏙᏗ ᎠᏣᎢᎵᏒ ᏧᏚᎸᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏓ ᎤᏓᎷᎸ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᏤᎲᏍᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏯᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎾᎿ .</term></tig></langSet>
