            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When using the Verizon Wireless 4G LTE network, the voice portion of a video call will appear on your bill as mobile\u2011to\u2011mobile voice usage, and the video portion will be billed as data.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When using the Verizon Wireless 4G LTE network, the voice portion of a video call will appear on your bill as mobile\u2011to\u2011mobile voice usage, and the video portion will be billed as data.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏥᎩ Verizon Wireless 4G LTE ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ, ᏥᎩ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎢᎦᏛ ᎾᎿ Ꭰ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎬᏂᎨᏒᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎠᏓᏚᎬᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ\u2011to\u2011ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎩ ᎧᏁᎬ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ, ᎠᎴ ᏥᎩ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᏛ ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏎᎯᎯ ᎢᎦ ᎠᏓᏚᏅᎢ ᎤᎿᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When Video calling is turned on, others can see that your phone has video calling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When Video calling is turned on, others can see that your phone has video calling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎤᎦᏔᎲᏒᏃ ᎠᎢ, ᏐᎢ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᎪᏩᏔ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏂᏚᏩᎿ ᎠᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="This address will be used by emergency services as your location if you make an emergency(E911) call over Wi-Fi from this phone within the US.">
