            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In the future if you want to use Wi-Fi for Voice Calling, you can turn on Wi-Fi Calling by going to Advanced Calling Settings menu.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In the future if you want to use Wi-Fi for Voice Calling, you can turn on Wi-Fi Calling by going to Advanced Calling Settings menu.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎤᏩᎫᏗᏗᏒ ᎾᎿ ᏂᎯ ᎤᏚᎵᎭ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ Wi-Fi ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏯ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎬᏗ ᏓᏰᏏ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᎾᎵᏱᎸᎡᎸᎯ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᏫᎬᏙᏗ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="In order to improve your Wi-Fi Calling experience, your Wi-Fi settings has been changed so that Wi-Fi will not switch off when the screen is off.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>In order to improve your Wi-Fi Calling experience, your Wi-Fi settings has been changed so that Wi-Fi will not switch off when the screen is off.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎾᎿ ᎠᏓᏅᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏦᎦᏤᎳᏍᏙᏗ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎠᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ Wi-Fi ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏓ ᎤᏓᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᏓᏛ ᎥᏍᎩᎾ Wi-Fi ᎠᏎ ᎥᏝ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏥᎩ ᎠᏰᏙᎳᏛᎢ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎭ.</term></tig></langSet>
