            <termEntry id="LEARN ALL ABOUT WI-FI CALLING">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>LEARN ALL ABOUT WI-FI CALLING</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎢᎸᏨ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Wi-Fi calling lets you say goodbye to spotty coverage.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Wi-Fi calling lets you say goodbye to spotty coverage.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏩᏂᎩ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏛᏅ ᏛᏓᏲᎵᎲ ᏛᎦᎴᏂᏍᎬ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏓᏓᏢ ᏣᏚᏓᎸᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Set roaming alerts">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Set roaming alerts</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᎧᎲᎦ ᎡᏙᎵᏙᎲ ᏗᏓᏕᏯᏔᎲᏍᎩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="With Wi-Fi calling you can send and receive calls and messages over a Wi-Fi network using your existing T-Mobile plan.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>With Wi-Fi calling you can send and receive calls and messages over a Wi-Fi network using your existing T-Mobile plan.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏂᎯ ᏰᎵᏊ ᏫᎦᏅᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎢᏴᏛ Wi-Fi ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎬᏗᎭ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ T-Mobile ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="There's no special setup needed for Wi-Fi calling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>There's no special setup needed for Wi-Fi calling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᎭᎢ Ꮭ ᎤᏓᏤᏟᏓ ᏘᎧᎲᎦ ᎤᏚᎸᏛ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="From the settings menu, go to Wireless and Networks and connect to a Wi-Fi network to get started.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>From the settings menu, go to Wireless and Networks and connect to a Wi-Fi network to get started.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏅᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎪᏪᎳᎾᎥᎢ, ᏤᏅᏍᏗ ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛ &amp; ᏚᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᎴ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ Wi-Fi ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏔᏅᎩ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="THIN GREY LINEWi-Fi Calling lets you make and receive voice calls and text\/text/multimedia messages over Wi-Fi when your phone is connected to a Wi-Fi network and registered with the T-Mobile network for Wi-Fi Calling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>THIN GREY LINEWi-Fi Calling lets you make and receive voice calls and text\/text/multimedia messages over Wi-Fi when your phone is connected to a Wi-Fi network and registered with the T-Mobile network for Wi-Fi Calling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏧᏌᎨ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎤᏍᎪᎸ ᏚᏓᏅᏅᎢWi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᏩᏂᎩ ᏂᎯ ᎪᏢᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏁᏍᏗ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎠᎴ ᎯᏪᏗ\/ᎯᏪᏗ/ᎢᎸᏍᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᎸᏍᎩ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᎢᏴᏛ Wi-Fi ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ Ꭰ Wi-Fi ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎪᏪᎳᏅᎯ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="How do I enable Wi-Fi\?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>How do I enable Wi-Fi\?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏰᎵ ᎿᏛᎦ I ᎡᎵᏊ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ\?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="THIN GREY LINEWhen your phone associates with a Wi-Fi network, it will automatically try to register with the T-Mobile network for Wi-Fi Calling.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>THIN GREY LINEWhen your phone associates with a Wi-Fi network, it will automatically try to register with the T-Mobile network for Wi-Fi Calling.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏌᎨ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎤᏍᎪᎸ ᏚᏓᏅᏅᎢᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗ ᎤᎾᎵᎪᎯ ᎬᏗ Ꭰ Wi-Fi ᎫᏓᎸᎢ, ᎨᎡᎢ ᎠᏎ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎠᎪᏪᎶᏗ ᎬᏗ ᏥᎩ T-Mobile ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="THIN GREY LINEThe primary benefit of Wi-Fi Calling is to increase your coverage in locations with Wi-Fi.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>THIN GREY LINEThe primary benefit of Wi-Fi Calling is to increase your coverage in locations with Wi-Fi.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏌᎨ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎤᏍᎪᎸ ᏚᏓᏅᏅᎢᏥᎩ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏒ ᎤᎾᎵᏍᏕᎸᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎤᎿ Wi-Fi ᏓᏯᏂᏍᎬ ᎨᎡᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎤᏁᏉᏨᎢ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᎫᏢᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎬᏗ Wi-Fi.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Calls and messages made over Wi-Fi will be charged like cellular calls for certain plans.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Calls and messages made over Wi-Fi will be charged like cellular calls for certain plans.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏓᏯᏂ ᎠᎴ ᏗᎪᎵᏰᏗ ᏄᎵᏍᏔᏅ ᎢᏴᏛ Wi-Fi ᎠᏎ ᎨᎡᎢ ᏗᎬᏩᎶᏔᏅ ᎯᎸᏉᏗ ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬᎢ ᏓᏯᏂ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏑᏓᎴᎩ ᏗᎫᎪᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="What happens if I lose Wi-Fi coverage\?">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>What happens if I lose Wi-Fi coverage\?</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎦᏙ ᏂᏚᎵᏍᏔᏅ ᎨᎡᎢ I ᎤᏓᏲᎱᏎᏗ Wi-Fi ᎫᏢᏗ\?</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="THIN GREY LINEIf you have access to the LTE network and your device is VoLTE enabled, your call will seamlessly transition the TMobile LTE network.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>THIN GREY LINEIf you have access to the LTE network and your device is VoLTE enabled, your call will seamlessly transition the TMobile LTE network.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏌᎨ ᏌᎪᏂᎨ ᎤᏍᎪᎸ ᏚᏓᏅᏅᎢᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎤᎭ ᏩᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ LTE ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎨᎡᎢ VoLTE, ᏂᏨᎤᎢ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎦᏰᏫᏒ ᎬᎾᎨᏒ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᎠᏁᏟᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᎿᎢ ᏥᎩ T-Mobile LTE ᎫᏓᎸᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="However, if you do not have LTE or other cellular network access, any active call will drop.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>However, if you do not have LTE or other cellular network access, any active call will drop.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏍᏎᏃ, ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎮᏍᏗ ᎤᎭ LTE ᎠᎴ ᏐᎢ ᏫᏚᏍᏗᎬᎢ ᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏩᏴᏍᏗᎢ, ᎾᏂᎥᏉ ᎬᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎠᏎ ᎰᎰᏅᏓ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="You will receive a notification if your call drops due to a loss of Wi-Fi coverage.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>You will receive a notification if your call drops due to a loss of Wi-Fi coverage.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎠᏎᎢ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᏓᏃᏣᎳᏁᎯ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏪᏯᎾ ᎰᎰᏅᏓ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᏗᏍᏗ ᎢᏴᎢ ᎤᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᎾᎿ Wi-Fi ᏣᏚᏓᎸᏛᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="If you change the network mode LTE services will be lost on SIM 1, To continue click Ok">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>If you change the network mode LTE services will be lost on SIM 1, To continue click Ok</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎨᎡᎢ ᏂᎯ ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎤᏚᏓᎵ ᎬᏙᏗ LTE ᎢᏳᎾᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎤᏂᏲᎱᏎᎸ ᎤᎾᎢ SIM 1, ᎬᎵᏱᎵᏒ ᎭᏐᏅᏍᏓ ᎭᏩ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="With some service providers , this function may not work properly or you may be charged.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>With some service providers , this function may not work properly or you may be charged.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎬᏗ ᎢᎦᏓ ᎢᏯᏓᏛᏁᏗ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎩ , ᏧᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗᏱ ᏰᎵᏊ Ꮭ ᏗᎦᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏗᏙᎳᏤᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎫᏍᏗ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Smart Call Forwarding">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Smart Call Forwarding</term></tig></langSet>
