            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Face unlock is less secure than a PIN, pattern or password.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Face unlock is less secure than a PIN, pattern or password.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎤᏂᏐᎭᎾᎸᏗ Ꮭ ᏄᎾᏰᎯᏍᏛᎾ ᏱᎩᏏᏃ ᎤᎾᏠᎢᏓ, PIN, ᎠᎴ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
