            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="When motion photo is on, each photo you take could include a short video before and after the shot.The video may be included when you share the photo.">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>When motion photo is on, each photo you take could include a short video before and after the shot.The video may be included when you share the photo.</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎲᎢ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᎤᎾᎢ, ᏌᏊᎭ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ ᏂᎯ ᎠᎩᏍᏗ ᎤᏍᏆᎳ ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏊ ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎠᏏᏅ ᎠᎴ ᎤᎶᏐᏅ ᎠᏓᏣᏲᏍᏗ. ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᏉ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏔᏅ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᎯ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅᎯ.</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
            <termEntry id="Your video should be at least  seconds">
                <langSet xml:lang="en-US"><tig><term>Your video should be at least  seconds</term></tig></langSet>
                <langSet xml:lang="chr"><tig><term>ᏗᏓᏴᎳᏛᏍᎩ ᎠᏎᏗᏃ ᎨᏒ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎦᎢ  ᏓᏓᎾᏩᏍᎬ</term></tig></langSet>
            </termEntry>
